-- en: "Check whether you or your pet know this exact spell ID. An unlearned spell is a valid condition that returns false, so the same rotation can adapt as you learn abilities. This does not check cooldown, resources, range, or whether the spell can currently be cast. Missing or restricted learned-state data stays unavailable under NOT."
L["Check whether you or your pet know this exact spell ID. An unlearned spell is a valid condition that returns false, so the same rotation can adapt as you learn abilities. This does not check cooldown, resources, range, or whether the spell can currently be cast. Missing or restricted learned-state data stays unavailable under NOT."] = "檢查你或你的寵物是否學會了這個確切的法術 ID。未學會的法術是有效條件，結果為假，因此同一個循環可以隨著你學會技能而自動調整。它不檢查冷卻、資源、距離或該法術目前能否施放。缺少或受限的已學狀態資料在 NOT 下仍為無法使用。"
-- en: "Only consider auras that you applied yourself."
L["Only consider auras that you applied yourself."] = "僅考慮你自己施加的光環。"
-- en: "Remaining aura time is measured in seconds. Permanent auras have no expiration and do not satisfy a finite refresh threshold. An absent aura does not satisfy this condition. Restricted or unknown timing is unavailable, including under NOT."
L["Remaining aura time is measured in seconds. Permanent auras have no expiration and do not satisfy a finite refresh threshold. An absent aura does not satisfy this condition. Restricted or unknown timing is unavailable, including under NOT."] = "光環剩餘時間以秒為單位。永久光環沒有到期時間，不符合有限的刷新門檻。不存在的光環不符合此條件。受限或未知的時間為無法使用，在 NOT 下同樣如此。"
-- en: "Compare the application count of a matching aura, including charges such as Earth Shield. An absent aura does not satisfy this condition; an unreadable count is unavailable."
