L["Actions automatically require a learned spell or carried item, usable resources, cooldown readiness and valid range. Conditions can additionally test other actions."] = "動作會自動要求已學會的法術或攜帶的物品、足夠的資源、冷卻就緒以及有效距離。條件還可以額外檢測其他動作。"
