-- en: "When no priority action is ready, auto-attack (Attack or Shoot) is the implicit final fallback against a living hostile target in combat: Attack in melee range; beyond it, Auto Shot or wand Shoot while the target is in range and that button is on your action bars. Nothing is recommended while that auto-attack is already running. It uses the normal rotation highlight and never presses a button."
L["When no priority action is ready, auto-attack (Attack or Shoot) is the implicit final fallback against a living hostile target in combat: Attack in melee range; beyond it, Auto Shot or wand Shoot while the target is in range and that button is on your action bars. Nothing is recommended while that auto-attack is already running. It uses the normal rotation highlight and never presses a button."] = "當沒有任何優先動作就緒時，自動攻擊（「攻擊」或「射擊」）會作為隱含的最終備用，用於戰鬥中存活的敵對目標：在近戰範圍內為「攻擊」；超出近戰範圍時，只要目標在射程內且該按鈕在你的快捷列上，則為「自動射擊」或魔杖「射擊」。該自動攻擊已在進行時不建議任何內容。它使用一般的循環醒目提示，從不按下任何按鈕。"
