L["Built In and custom rotations use the same cards. Built In rotations are read-only; enable or disable them, inspect their conditions, or Duplicate to edit."] = "內建循環與自訂循環使用相同的卡片。內建循環為唯讀；你可以啟用或停用它們、檢查其條件，或按「複製」進行編輯。"
-- en: "Custom edits stay in a private draft. Apply saves; Discard restores the saved rotation. Undo and Redo include card deletion, movement, fields and conditions. Apply before reloading or logging out."
L["Custom edits stay in a private draft. Apply saves; Discard restores the saved rotation. Undo and Redo include card deletion, movement, fields and conditions. Apply before reloading or logging out."] = "自訂編輯保存在私人草稿中。「套用」會儲存；「捨棄」會還原已儲存的循環。復原與重做涵蓋卡片的刪除、移動、欄位與條件。重新載入或登出前請先套用。"
-- en: "Closing the window retains drafts for this session. Switching rotations or opening comparison or transfer asks whether to Apply, Discard or Cancel when changes are pending."
L["Closing the window retains drafts for this session. Switching rotations or opening comparison or transfer asks whether to Apply, Discard or Cancel when changes are pending."] = "關閉視窗會在本次工作階段中保留草稿。有待處理的變更時，切換循環或開啟比較或傳輸介面會詢問要套用、捨棄還是取消。"
-- en: "The switch condition selects the rotation automatically. Edit changes its condition tree. The fallback rotation is selected when no other rotation matches."
L["The switch condition selects the rotation automatically. Edit changes its condition tree. The fallback rotation is selected when no other rotation matches."] = "切換條件會自動選擇循環。「編輯」可變更其條件樹。沒有其他循環符合時會選擇備用循環。"
-- en: "Cooldown cards have their own scrolling workspace and highlight independently of the sequence. Add cooldown creates a reminder; clicking its action shows local highlight settings."
L["Cooldown cards have their own scrolling workspace and highlight independently of the sequence. Add cooldown creates a reminder; clicking its action shows local highlight settings."] = "冷卻卡片有自己可捲動的工作區，並獨立於序列進行醒目提示。「新增冷卻」會建立一個提醒；點擊其動作會顯示該項目的醒目提示設定。"
-- en: "Add action appends a priority action. Drag an Add control into a gap to insert there. Click a card name to rename it, expand for action fields, or click its condition text to edit the guard."
L["Add action appends a priority action. Drag an Add control into a gap to insert there. Click a card name to rename it, expand for action fields, or click its condition text to edit the guard."] = "「新增動作」會附加一個優先動作。將「新增」控制項拖入空隙即可在該處插入。點擊卡片名稱可重新命名，展開可編輯動作欄位，點擊其條件文字可編輯防護條件。"
-- en: "Adding a branch moves following steps into its True arm. False is on the left in red; True is on the right in green. The mode pill cycles Evaluate condition, Always true and Always false. Unreachable cards are gray."
L["Adding a branch moves following steps into its True arm. False is on the left in red; True is on the right in green. The mode pill cycles Evaluate condition, Always true and Always false. Unreachable cards are gray."] = "新增分支會把後續步驟移入其「真」分支。「假」在左側，顯示為紅色；「真」在右側，顯示為綠色。模式按鈕會在「評估條件」「總是為真」與「總是為假」之間循環切換。無法到達的卡片顯示為灰色。"
-- en: "Ordinary dragging moves one card and its own subtree. Hold Ctrl when starting a drag to carry that card and every following sibling, including their branch subtrees. Drop into a branch arm gap to move there. Up / Down always moves one card. A group cannot be dropped into itself or a carried descendant."
L["Ordinary dragging moves one card and its own subtree. Hold Ctrl when starting a drag to carry that card and every following sibling, including their branch subtrees. Drop into a branch arm gap to move there. Up / Down always moves one card. A group cannot be dropped into itself or a carried descendant."] = "一般拖曳只移動一張卡片及其自身的子樹。開始拖曳時按住 Ctrl，可帶上該卡片及其後所有同層卡片，包括它們的分支子樹。拖入某個分支的空隙即可移動到那裡。「上移 / 下移」始終只移動一張卡片。群組不能被拖入自身或其被攜帶的子項中。"
-- en: "An evaluated branch follows one arm, then rejoins later siblings. Stop ends the sequence. Independent cooldowns still apply; implicit auto-attack (Attack or Shoot) remains available unless the Stop suppresses it."
L["An evaluated branch follows one arm, then rejoins later siblings. Stop ends the sequence. Independent cooldowns still apply; implicit auto-attack (Attack or Shoot) remains available unless the Stop suppresses it."] = "被評估的分支只走其中一條路徑，然後回到後續的同層卡片。「停止」會結束序列。獨立的冷卻仍然生效；除非「停止」將其抑制，否則隱含的自動攻擊（「攻擊」或「射擊」）仍然可用。"
-- en: "Invalid or incomplete cards remain editable. Apply validates both branch arms without running custom condition code. Deleting a whole custom rotation requires confirmation and cannot be undone."
L["Invalid or incomplete cards remain editable. Apply validates both branch arms without running custom condition code. Deleting a whole custom rotation requires confirmation and cannot be undone."] = "無效或不完整的卡片仍可編輯。「套用」會驗證兩個分支，但不會執行自訂條件程式碼。刪除整個自訂循環需要確認，且無法復原。"
-- en: "List and Cooldowns use flat scrollbars or the mouse wheel. Diagram uses wheel zoom and dragging empty space to pan. Window scaling applies when the slider is released and also affects RM child windows."
L["List and Cooldowns use flat scrollbars or the mouse wheel. Diagram uses wheel zoom and dragging empty space to pan. Window scaling applies when the slider is released and also affects RM child windows."] = "清單與冷卻檢視使用扁平捲軸或滑鼠滾輪。圖表檢視使用滾輪縮放，拖曳空白處可平移。視窗縮放會在放開滑桿時生效，也會影響 RM 的子視窗。"
