L["Choose a category and search for a condition. Hidden removes it from pickers without deleting its definition. Switch Condition controls its availability for automatic rotation switching. Move To changes its category; order arrows arrange category entries. Custom conditions can be edited, duplicated or deleted."] = "選擇一個分類並搜尋條件。「隱藏」會將其從選擇器中移除，但不刪除其定義。「切換條件」控制它能否用於自動切換循環。「移動到」會變更其分類；排序箭頭可調整分類中各項目的順序。自訂條件可以編輯、複製或刪除。"
