L["Categories"] = "分類"
-- en: "Choose a category and search for a condition. Hidden removes it from pickers without deleting its definition. Switch Condition controls its availability for automatic rotation switching. Move To stages a category destination; its Apply button confirms the move. The assigned category opens category management. Sidebar arrows and dragging order entries. Page Apply saves the draft; Cancel discards it. Custom conditions can be edited, duplicated or deleted."
L["Choose a category and search for a condition. Hidden removes it from pickers without deleting its definition. Switch Condition controls its availability for automatic rotation switching. Move To stages a category destination; its Apply button confirms the move. The assigned category opens category management. Sidebar arrows and dragging order entries. Page Apply saves the draft; Cancel discards it. Custom conditions can be edited, duplicated or deleted."] = "選擇一個分類並搜尋條件。「隱藏」會將其從選擇器中移除，但不刪除其定義。「切換條件」控制它能否用於自動切換循環。「移動到」會暫存一個目標分類；其「套用」按鈕會確認移動。點擊已指派的分類會開啟分類管理。側邊欄箭頭與拖曳可調整項目順序。頁面上的「套用」會儲存草稿；「取消」會捨棄它。自訂條件可以編輯、複製或刪除。"
-- en: "Choose a named category or Other, then use Apply beside the destination to stage the move. Page Apply saves all pending changes. Use Switch Condition separately for automatic-switch availability."
L["Choose a named category or Other, then use Apply beside the destination to stage the move. Page Apply saves all pending changes. Use Switch Condition separately for automatic-switch availability."] = "選擇一個命名分類或「其他」，然後使用目標旁邊的「套用」來暫存移動。頁面上的「套用」會儲存所有待處理的變更。是否可用於自動切換請另外使用「切換條件」設定。"
-- en: "Choose an item set and edit its priority list. Global shares the set across profiles. Move arrows change item priority. Bind item set picks up an available item for placement on an action bar; The binding pill removes matching bound bar actions when unbinding, outside combat. Reset restores a packaged set. Search or drag items into reference fields. Apply saves settings; Cancel discards them. Binding changes are explicit action-bar operations."
L["Choose an item set and edit its priority list. Global shares the set across profiles. Move arrows change item priority. Bind item set picks up an available item for placement on an action bar; The binding pill removes matching bound bar actions when unbinding, outside combat. Reset restores a packaged set. Search or drag items into reference fields. Apply saves settings; Cancel discards them. Binding changes are explicit action-bar operations."] = "選擇一個物品組並編輯其優先順序清單。「全域」會在所有設定檔間共用該物品組。移動箭頭可變更物品優先順序。「綁定物品組」會拿起一件可用物品以放置到快捷列上；解除綁定時，綁定標籤會在非戰鬥狀態下移除快捷列上相符的已綁定動作。「重設」會還原內建的物品組。在參照欄位中搜尋或拖入物品。「套用」會儲存設定；「取消」會捨棄它們。綁定的變更是明確的快捷列操作。"
