-- en: "Ctrl-click cards to add or remove them from the selection; Shift-click selects the siblings between it and the last clicked card. Shift-drag on empty canvas draws a box that selects every card it touches (Ctrl+Shift-drag adds). With several cards selected, the strip above the canvas groups them as All or Any, and Duplicate, Enable, Disable and Delete act on every selected card; one Undo reverses each. Drag any selected card to move the selection."
L["Ctrl-click cards to add or remove them from the selection; Shift-click selects the siblings between it and the last clicked card. Shift-drag on empty canvas draws a box that selects every card it touches (Ctrl+Shift-drag adds). With several cards selected, the strip above the canvas groups them as All or Any, and Duplicate, Enable, Disable and Delete act on every selected card; one Undo reverses each. Drag any selected card to move the selection."] = "Ctrl+點擊卡片可將其加入或移出選取範圍；Shift+點擊會選取它與上次點擊的卡片之間的同層卡片。在空白畫布上按住 Shift 拖曳可畫出一個框，選取所有被框觸及的卡片（Ctrl+Shift 拖曳為追加選取）。選取多張卡片時，畫布上方的工具列可將它們組合為「全部」或「任一」，「複製」「啟用」「停用」與「刪除」會作用於每一張選取的卡片；一次復原即可還原每項操作。拖曳任一張選取的卡片即可移動整個選取範圍。"
-- en: "Ctrl-click cards to add or remove them from the selection; Shift-click a title or condition to select the siblings between it and the last clicked card. Shift-drag on empty canvas draws a box that selects every card it touches (Ctrl+Shift-drag adds). Drag any selected card to move the whole selection to one gap. Beside Apply, Duplicate, Enable, Disable and Delete act on every selected card, and one Undo reverses each. Branches keep their Evaluate / Always mode. Click empty canvas to clear the selection."
L["Ctrl-click cards to add or remove them from the selection; Shift-click a title or condition to select the siblings between it and the last clicked card. Shift-drag on empty canvas draws a box that selects every card it touches (Ctrl+Shift-drag adds). Drag any selected card to move the whole selection to one gap. Beside Apply, Duplicate, Enable, Disable and Delete act on every selected card, and one Undo reverses each. Branches keep their Evaluate / Always mode. Click empty canvas to clear the selection."] = "Ctrl+點擊卡片可將其加入或移出選取範圍；Shift+點擊標題或條件會選取它與上次點擊的卡片之間的同層卡片。在空白畫布上按住 Shift 拖曳可畫出一個框，選取所有被框觸及的卡片（Ctrl+Shift 拖曳為追加選取）。拖曳任一張選取的卡片可將整個選取範圍移動到一個空隙。「套用」旁邊的「複製」「啟用」「停用」與「刪除」會作用於每一張選取的卡片，一次復原即可還原每項操作。分支會保留其「評估 / 總是」模式。點擊空白畫布可清除選取。"
