L["The condition ordering controls are arrows and draggable rows in the sidebar of the selected category. In Manage categories, the same controls order the categories themselves."] = "條件排序控制項是所選分類側邊欄中的箭頭與可拖曳的列。在「管理分類」中，相同的控制項用於排列分類本身的順序。"
