L["Choose the editor for custom Lua conditions. Built In syntax highlighting and Plain text work without another addon. Automatic uses a registered optional provider when available and falls back safely. Apply saves the choice; an open editor keeps its current provider until reopened. LuaWorkbench and WowLua loading status is shown separately from integration availability."] = "選擇自訂 Lua 條件所用的編輯器。「內建語法突顯」與「純文字」不需其他插件即可使用。「自動」會在可用時使用已註冊的選用提供者，並安全地改用備用方案。「套用」會儲存選擇；已開啟的編輯器在重新開啟前會保持目前的提供者。LuaWorkbench 與 WowLua 的載入狀態與整合可用性分開顯示。"
