L["DBM-Core for Retail, Forever, Classic Era, TBC and Mists Classic. Encounter timers need the matching raid or dungeon module download, such as DBM-Raids-BC for TBC raids."] = "適用於正式版、永久、經典時代、TBC 與潘達利亞之謎經典版的 DBM-Core。首領戰計時條需要下載對應的團隊副本或地城模組，例如 TBC 團隊副本所需的 DBM-Raids-BC。"
