-- en: "BigWigs (Boss Timers & Tools) for Retail, Forever, Classic and Classic progression. Its TOC also declares TBC Anniversary."
L["BigWigs (Boss Timers & Tools) for Retail, Forever, Classic and Classic progression. Its TOC also declares TBC Anniversary."] = "適用於正式版、永久、經典版與經典進程的 BigWigs（Boss Timers & Tools）。其 TOC 還宣告支援 TBC 週年版。"
-- en: "Official project page. Publisher lists Retail, Classic Era, TBC, Wrath and Cataclysm Classic. Choose the matching file; exact patch and RM integration behavior may be unverified."
L["Official project page. Publisher lists Retail, Classic Era, TBC, Wrath and Cataclysm Classic. Choose the matching file; exact patch and RM integration behavior may be unverified."] = "官方專案頁面。發布者列出了正式版、經典時代、TBC、巫妖王之怒與浩劫與重生經典版。請選擇相應的檔案；確切的修補版本與 RM 整合行為可能未經驗證。"
-- en: "Titan Panel for Retail, Forever, Mists Classic, Classic and Classic TBC."
L["Titan Panel for Retail, Forever, Mists Classic, Classic and Classic TBC."] = "適用於正式版、永久、潘達利亞之謎經典版、經典版與經典 TBC 的 Titan Panel。"
-- en: "Official project page. Publisher lists Retail and Classic Era. Choose the matching file; exact patch and RM integration behavior may be unverified."
L["Official project page. Publisher lists Retail and Classic Era. Choose the matching file; exact patch and RM integration behavior may be unverified."] = "官方專案頁面。發布者列出了正式版與經典時代。請選擇相應的檔案；確切的修補版本與 RM 整合行為可能未經驗證。"
-- en: "Enable DBM or BigWigs to feed the Boss Mod conditions (encounter, stage and ability timers), then Apply. Only one boss mod can be enabled; enabling one disables the other. RM listens to the boss mod's own callbacks and never polls it or changes its settings. With none enabled, or the enabled addon not loaded, Boss Mod conditions are unavailable. Supported on Classic Era, TBC and Classic progression clients."
L["Help.Integrations.encounter_provider"] = "啟用 DBM 或 BigWigs 為首領模組條件（首領戰、階段與技能計時條）提供資料，然後按「套用」。只能啟用一個首領模組；啟用其中一個會停用另一個。RM 監聽首領模組自身的回呼，從不輪詢它或變更其設定。未啟用任何首領模組，或已啟用的插件未載入時，首領模組條件為無法使用。在經典時代、TBC 與經典進程用戶端上受支援。"
-- en: "Rotation Master publishes a LibDataBroker data source with the active rotation, a tooltip and click menus. Titan Panel and other LibDataBroker displays show it without further setup: in Titan, add Rotation Master from the plugin menu. Panel absence has no effect on rotation selection."
L["Help.Integrations.top_panels"] = "Rotation Master 會發布一個 LibDataBroker 資料來源，包含目前循環、滑鼠提示與點擊選單。Titan Panel 與其他 LibDataBroker 顯示插件不需額外設定即可顯示它：在 Titan 中，從插件選單新增 Rotation Master。沒有面板不會影響循環選擇。"
