L["{unit} {{!are|are not}} in a raid"] = "{unit}{{!在|不在}}團隊中"
-- en: "{unit} {{!is|is not}} in a party or raid"
L["{unit} {{!is|is not}} in a party or raid"] = "{unit}{{!在|不在}}隊伍或團隊中"
-- en: "{unit} {{!are|are not}} in a party or raid"
L["{unit} {{!are|are not}} in a party or raid"] = "{unit}{{!在|不在}}隊伍或團隊中"
-- en: "Choose a unit for this condition."
L["Choose a unit for this condition."] = "請為此條件選擇一個單位。"
-- en: "Group membership option is invalid."
L["Group membership option is invalid."] = "隊伍成員身分選項無效。"
-- en: "For %s"
L["For %s"] = "針對 %s"
-- en: "Saved settings"
L["Saved settings"] = "已儲存的設定"
-- en: "Forever Rogue: melee DPS"
L["Default.Forever.Rogue.DPS.Name"] = "盜賊：近戰 DPS（永久）"
-- en: "Melee damage for every Rogue specialization from level 1 to 60, built from Icy Veins, Wowhead and Warcraft Tavern. The builder follows what you know: Mutilate (Sinister Strike for the fifth point), Hemorrhage, Backstab when the target is not facing you, else Sinister Strike. From Stealth it opens with Premeditation, Cheap Shot when solo, Garrote for Subtlety on group elites, else Ambush or Garrote. It keeps Slice and Dice and Venom up, uses Expose Armor in groups on elites when no warrior has five Sunders, then spends five points on Rupture (Subtlety, long fights) or Eviscerate, and never builds past five. Reminders: poisons on each weapon, Kick, Blade Flurry and Adrenaline Rush on packs and elites, Cold Blood, Evasion, Feint, Thistle Tea and Preparation. Left to you: Vanish, Sprint, Kidney Shot, Blind, Sap and positioning. Forever restricts combat data, so Rotation Master lists this premade for reference and does not select it automatically yet."
L["Default.Forever.Rogue.DPS.Description"] = "適用於所有盜賊專精 1 至 60 級的近戰傷害，綜合 Icy Veins、Wowhead 與 Warcraft Tavern。累積連擊點技能取決於你已學會的技能：截肢（第五個連擊點用邪惡攻擊）、出血、目標未面向你時使用背刺，否則使用邪惡攻擊。潛行時以預謀起手，單人時偷襲，隊伍中面對精英時敏銳使用絞喉，否則使用伏擊或絞喉。維持切割與毒液，隊伍中對精英且沒有戰士疊滿五層破甲攻擊時使用破甲，然後把五個連擊點用於割裂（敏銳，長時間戰鬥）或剔骨，且絕不累積超過五點。提醒：每把武器上的毒藥、腳踢、對怪群與精英使用劍刃亂舞與能量刺激、冷血、閃避、佯攻、菊花茶與伺機待發。由你自行處理：消失、疾跑、腎擊、致盲、悶棍與站位。永久限制了戰鬥資料，因此 Rotation Master 只將此內建循環列出供參考，目前還不會自動選用。"
-- en: "Forever Rogue: Subtlety, Ambush build (Warcraft Tavern)"
L["Default.Forever.Rogue.Subtlety.WarcraftTavern.Name"] = "盜賊：敏銳，伏擊流（永久，Warcraft Tavern）"
-- en: "Warcraft Tavern's Ambush/Cutthroat Subtlety build: Premeditation and Ambush on every opener, Ambush again whenever Cutthroat allows it, Backstab from behind as the builder (Hemorrhage when the target is facing you), Ghostly Strike on cooldown, and Slice and Dice then Eviscerate at five points with no Rupture. Reminds you to Vanish for another Ambush on a tanked boss. Choose it instead of the recommended Rogue premade if you took the Cutthroat talents; Rotation Master cannot see passive talents to tell. Same poison and cooldown reminders as the recommended premade. Listed for reference on Forever."
L["Default.Forever.Rogue.Subtlety.WarcraftTavern.Description"] = "Warcraft Tavern 的伏擊/割喉敏銳流派：每次起手都用預謀與伏擊，割喉允許時再次伏擊，以背後的背刺作為累積連擊點技能（目標面向你時用出血），鬼魅攻擊冷卻結束即使用，切割，然後在五個連擊點時使用剔骨，不使用割裂。會提醒你在首領被坦克拉住時消失以再次伏擊。如果你點了割喉天賦，請選擇它而非推薦的盜賊內建循環；Rotation Master 無法看到被動天賦來判斷。毒藥與冷卻技能提醒與推薦的內建循環相同。在永久版本中僅列出供參考。"
-- en: "Forever Rogue: Subtlety, Garrote build (Wowhead)"
L["Default.Forever.Rogue.Subtlety.Wowhead.Name"] = "盜賊：敏銳，絞喉流（永久，Wowhead）"
-- en: "Wowhead's Subtlety: Premeditation and Garrote on every opener, and Vanish (then Preparation) used in the rotation to open with Garrote again once the last one has run out. Slice and Dice kept up, Expose Armor in groups, Rupture as the five-point finisher, Hemorrhage as the only builder. This spends Vanish, your escape, on damage: choose it deliberately. Same poison and cooldown reminders as the recommended premade. Listed for reference on Forever."
L["Default.Forever.Rogue.Subtlety.Wowhead.Description"] = "Wowhead 的敏銳：每次起手都用預謀與絞喉，並在循環中使用消失（接著伺機待發），在上一次絞喉結束後再次以絞喉起手。維持切割，隊伍中使用破甲，割裂作為五連擊點終結技，出血是唯一的累積連擊點技能。這會把你的逃生技能消失用在輸出上：請審慎選擇。毒藥與冷卻技能提醒與推薦的內建循環相同。在永久版本中僅列出供參考。"
-- en: "Forever Shaman: Restoration"
L["Default.Forever.Shaman.Restoration.Name"] = "薩滿：恢復（永久）"
-- en: "Healing once you know Mana Tide Totem, after Icy Veins. With a friendly target: Nature's Swiftness and an instant Healing Wave when the target drops below 30%, Cure Poison and Cure Disease, Riptide on a hurt target without it, Chain Heal when three nearby group members are hurt, Lesser Healing Wave below 40%, Healing Wave below 90%. You pick who to heal by targeting them. With a hostile target and nothing to heal: Fire Nova and Chain Lightning on packs, Stormstrike and Earth Shock if you know Stormstrike, Flame Shock on targets that will live, Lightning Bolt, then melee. Reminders: Water Shield, the Earth Shock interrupt, Mana Tide and group buff totems. Left to you: downranking, other totems, Purge and Ghost Wolf. Listed for reference on Forever."
L["Default.Forever.Shaman.Restoration.Description"] = "學會法力之潮圖騰後的治療，依據 Icy Veins。友方目標時：目標生命力低於 30% 時使用自然迅捷與瞬發治療波、消毒術與祛病術、對受傷且沒有激流的目標使用激流，附近有三名隊友受傷時使用治療鍊，低於 40% 時使用次級治療波，低於 90% 時使用治療波。透過選取目標來決定要治療誰。目標為敵對且無人需要治療時：怪群使用火焰新星與閃電鏈，若學會風暴打擊則使用風暴打擊與地震術，對會存活較久的目標使用烈焰震擊、閃電箭，然後近戰。提醒：水之盾、地震術中斷、法力之潮圖騰與隊伍增益圖騰。由你自行處理：降級施法、其他圖騰、淨化術與幽魂之狼。在永久版本中僅列出供參考。"
-- en: "Forever Shaman: Elemental"
L["Default.Forever.Shaman.Elemental.Name"] = "薩滿：元素（永久）"
-- en: "Ranged Elemental once you know Lava Burst, after Icy Veins (before Lava Burst the Enhancement premade plays the melee hybrid every guide recommends). Pulls with Lightning Bolt (Chain Lightning on a pack), casts only instants while moving, uses Fire Nova and Chain Lightning on three or more enemies, keeps Flame Shock on targets that will live, Lava Burst on cooldown, Stormstrike and Earth Shock if you know Stormstrike, Fire Nova on Clearcasting in groups, then Lightning Bolt. Below 30% mana in melee it lets auto-attack refill mana. Reminders: shield, weapon imbue, Searing or Magma Totem, group totems, Elemental Mastery, interrupt and heals when solo. Left to you: Earthbind kiting, Frost Shock, Purge and other totems. Listed for reference on Forever."
L["Default.Forever.Shaman.Elemental.Description"] = "學會熔岩爆發後的遠程元素，依據 Icy Veins（學會熔岩爆發之前，由增強內建循環執行所有指南都推薦的近戰混合打法）。以閃電箭拉怪（怪群時用閃電鏈），移動時只施放瞬發法術，三個以上敵人時使用火焰新星與閃電鏈，對會存活較久的目標維持烈焰震擊，熔岩爆發冷卻結束即使用，若學會風暴打擊則使用風暴打擊與地震術，隊伍中節能施法觸發時使用火焰新星，然後是閃電箭。法力低於 30% 且處於近戰時，交由自動攻擊來回復法力。提醒：護盾、武器灌注、灼熱圖騰或熔岩圖騰、隊伍圖騰、精通元素、中斷施法以及單人時的治療。由你自行處理：以地縛圖騰放風箏、冰霜震擊、淨化術與其他圖騰。在永久版本中僅列出供參考。"
-- en: "Forever Shaman: Enhancement (Icy Veins)"
L["Default.Forever.Shaman.Enhancement.Name"] = "薩滿：增強（永久，Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Melee Enhancement from level 1 to 60, and the default for any Shaman before Lava Burst or Mana Tide Totem. Pulls with Lightning Bolt from range, then Stormstrike on cooldown, an instant Lightning Bolt at five Maelstrom Weapon stacks, Fire Nova (with a Fire totem down) and Flame Shock on three or more enemies, Earth Shock into the Stormstrike debuff, Flame Shock in groups on targets that will live, and Earth Shock on cooldown. Below 40% mana with Stormstrike it stops casting and lets auto-attack refill mana; Lightning Bolt fills the gap while the target is out of reach. Reminders: weapon imbue (Windfury, else Flametongue, else Rockbiter), Water or Lightning Shield, the Earth Shock interrupt, Searing or Magma Totem, group totems, Rage of the Farseer, Stoneclaw Totem and solo heals. Left to you: totem presets, Frost Shock, Purge and other totems. Listed for reference on Forever."
L["Default.Forever.Shaman.Enhancement.Description"] = "增強近戰，適用於 1 至 60 級，也是學會熔岩爆發或法力之潮圖騰之前所有薩滿的預設循環。從遠處以閃電箭拉怪，接著風暴打擊冷卻結束即使用，氣漩武器疊滿五層時施放瞬發閃電箭，三個以上敵人時使用火焰新星（需已放下火焰圖騰）與烈焰震擊，在風暴打擊減益效果期間使用地震術，隊伍中對會存活較久的目標使用烈焰震擊，以及地震術冷卻結束即使用。擁有風暴打擊且法力低於 40% 時停止施法，交由自動攻擊來回復法力；目標不在攻擊範圍內時以閃電箭填補空檔。提醒：武器灌注（風怒武器，否則火舌武器，再否則石化武器）、水之盾或閃電之盾、地震術中斷、灼熱圖騰或熔岩圖騰、隊伍圖騰、先知之怒、石爪圖騰以及單人時的治療。由你自行處理：圖騰預設組合、冰霜震擊、淨化術與其他圖騰。在永久版本中僅列出供參考。"
-- en: "Forever Shaman: Enhancement, mana-efficient (Wowhead)"
L["Default.Forever.Shaman.Enhancement.Wowhead.Name"] = "薩滿：增強，節省法力（永久，Wowhead）"
-- en: "Wowhead's and Mobalytics' mana-saving Enhancement: auto-attack does the work, Stormstrike only while Improved Stormstrike's mana regeneration is down, no Earth Shock in the rotation (shocks pull and interrupt), and in groups or on packs Searing Totem with Fire Nova on cooldown. Same imbue, shield and interrupt reminders as the Icy Veins premade. Choose it instead of that premade if mana runs out. Listed for reference on Forever."
L["Default.Forever.Shaman.Enhancement.Wowhead.Description"] = "Wowhead 與 Mobalytics 的節省法力增強：主要靠自動攻擊輸出，只在強化風暴打擊的法力回復效果不在時使用風暴打擊，循環中不使用地震術（震擊用於拉怪與中斷），隊伍中或面對怪群時使用灼熱圖騰，並在冷卻結束時使用火焰新星。武器灌注、護盾與中斷提醒與 Icy Veins 內建循環相同。如果你的法力不夠用，請選擇它而非那個內建循環。在永久版本中僅列出供參考。"
-- en: "Forever Warlock: all trees"
L["Default.Forever.Warlock.DPS.Name"] = "術士：所有天賦樹（永久）"
-- en: "Every Warlock talent tree from level 1 to 60, merged from Icy Veins, Wowhead and Method; the steps for a tree appear once you know its talent spells. Pulls with Immolate and Bane of Agony (Destruction precasts Shadow Bolt), uses Nightfall and Decimation procs, keeps Demonic Brand up with Searing Pain, and below 20% target health stops adding DoTs (Drain Soul for shards, Shadowburn, Conflagrate, or the wand). While moving it casts only instants. On packs: Hellfire in a group, Rain of Fire, Corruption and Agony. Then Bane of Doom on elites and bosses or Bane of Agony, Curse of the Elements in groups and on elites, Immolate, Corruption, Siphon Life on targets that will live, Conflagrate and Shadowburn; solo it Life Taps, drains when hurt and fills with Wrack, Drain Life or the wand; otherwise Incinerate or Shadow Bolt. Reminders: armor, a demon (Succubus, else Voidwalker, else Imp), Fel Domination, Demonic Sacrifice with Demonic Pact, Soul Link, Health Funnel, weapon stones, Amplify Curse and Bane of Havoc for a second enemy. Left to you: sending the pet in, other curses, Fear, Healthstones and other targets. Listed for reference on Forever."
L["Default.Forever.Warlock.DPS.Description"] = "適用於 1 至 60 級的所有術士天賦樹，綜合 Icy Veins、Wowhead 與 Method；某個天賦樹的步驟會在你學會它的天賦法術後出現。以獻祭與痛苦災厄拉怪（毀滅預先施放暗影箭），利用夜幕與屠虐的觸發，以灼熱之痛維持惡魔烙印，目標生命力低於 20% 時不再補上持續傷害效果（以吸取靈魂取得靈魂碎片、暗影灼燒、焚燒或魔杖）。移動時只施放瞬發法術。怪群時：隊伍中地獄烈焰、火焰之雨、腐蝕術與痛苦災厄。接著對精英與首領使用末日災厄，否則使用痛苦災厄，隊伍中與對精英使用元素詛咒，獻祭、腐蝕術、對會存活較久的目標使用生命虹吸、焚燒與暗影灼燒；單人時使用生命分流，受傷時吸取，並以毀壞、吸取生命或魔杖填充；否則使用燒盡或暗影箭。提醒：護甲、一隻惡魔（魅魔，否則虛空行者，再否則小鬼）、惡魔支配、搭配惡魔契印的惡魔犧牲、靈魂鏈結、生命通道、武器石、詛咒增幅以及對第二個敵人使用浩劫之禍。由你自行處理：派寵物攻擊、其他詛咒、恐懼術、治療石與其他目標。在永久版本中僅列出供參考。"
-- en: "Forever Warlock: all trees (Icy Veins)"
L["Default.Forever.Warlock.DPS.IcyVeins.Name"] = "術士：所有天賦樹（永久，Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Icy Veins' Warlock leveling: the wand is the solo filler (Drain Life only when hurt), Voidwalker is the default demon, Affliction and Destruction sacrifice their demon and play without one (from 41 and 55), Demonology keeps Demonic Brand up and uses Immolate only as a filler, Agony and Corruption go only on targets that will live, and Destruction puts Bane of Havoc on the durable enemy of a pack and Conflagrates on cooldown once Incinerate is known. Choose it instead of the recommended Warlock premade if you follow Icy Veins. Listed for reference on Forever."
L["Default.Forever.Warlock.DPS.IcyVeins.Description"] = "Icy Veins 的術士升級打法：魔杖是單人時的填充（只在受傷時吸取生命），虛空行者是預設惡魔，痛苦與毀滅會犧牲惡魔並在沒有惡魔的情況下作戰（分別從 41 級與 55 級起），惡魔學識維持惡魔烙印，且只把獻祭當作填充，痛苦災厄與腐蝕術只用於會存活較久的目標，毀滅在學會燒盡後，會對怪群中最耐打的敵人施放浩劫之禍，並在冷卻結束時使用焚燒。如果你遵循 Icy Veins，請選擇它而非推薦的術士內建循環。在永久版本中僅列出供參考。"
-- en: "Forever Warlock: all trees (Wowhead)"
L["Default.Forever.Warlock.DPS.Wowhead.Name"] = "術士：所有天賦樹（永久，Wowhead）"
-- en: "Wowhead's level-30 Warlock: Affliction and Demonology drain-tank with the Succubus (Corruption and Agony, no Immolate, then Drain Life for the rest of the fight, Life Tap when mana is low), Demonology keeps Demonic Brand up and Agonies only big targets, Destruction puts Agony, Corruption and Immolate on every mob, Conflagrates just before Immolate ends, saves Shadowburn for the killing blow and wands with the Voidwalker. Amplify Curse on every cooldown; Curse of the Elements and Bane of Doom only on elites and bosses; no pack section. Wowhead's guides stop at level 30. Listed for reference on Forever."
L["Default.Forever.Warlock.DPS.Wowhead.Description"] = "Wowhead 的 30 級術士：痛苦與惡魔學識帶著魅魔進行吸血坦打法（腐蝕術與痛苦災厄，不用獻祭，接著在剩餘戰鬥中使用吸取生命，法力低時使用生命分流），惡魔學識維持惡魔烙印，且只對高血量目標施放痛苦災厄，毀滅對每隻怪物施放痛苦災厄、腐蝕術與獻祭，在獻祭結束前使用焚燒，把暗影灼燒留作最後一擊，並帶著虛空行者使用魔杖。詛咒增幅每次冷卻結束即使用；元素詛咒與末日災厄只用於精英與首領；沒有怪群部分。Wowhead 的指南只寫到 30 級。在永久版本中僅列出供參考。"
-- en: "Forever Warrior: Protection (Icy Veins)"
L["Default.Forever.Warrior.Protection.Name"] = "戰士：防護（永久，Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Tanking whenever you are in Defensive Stance, from level 10 to 60. Charges to pull (in Defensive Stance once you have Vanguard), Victory Rush, and on two or more enemies Thunder Clap on cooldown, Demoralizing Shout, Shield Slam, Revenge and Rend. On one target: Revenge first when rage is low, Shield Slam, Revenge, Demoralizing Shout against melee enemies, Rend, Sunder Armor (five on elites) and Thunder Clap on dangerous targets. Reminders: Battle Shout, Bloodrage, Shield Bash, Shield Block against melee hits, Heroic Strike or Cleave with spare rage and Last Stand when low; Taunt and Shield Wall are listed but off. Left to you: swapping to Battle Stance to Charge before Vanguard, taunting other enemies and picking up loose ones. Listed for reference on Forever."
L["Default.Forever.Warrior.Protection.Description"] = "10 至 60 級，只要你處於防禦姿態就作為坦克循環。以衝鋒拉怪（擁有守禦先鋒後可在防禦姿態下衝鋒）、勝利衝擊，兩個以上敵人時雷霆一擊冷卻結束即使用、挫志怒吼、盾牌猛擊、復仇與撕裂。單一目標時：怒氣低時先用復仇、盾牌猛擊、復仇、對近戰敵人使用挫志怒吼、撕裂、破甲攻擊（對精英疊五層），以及對危險目標使用雷霆一擊。提醒：戰鬥怒吼、血性狂暴、盾擊、面對近戰攻擊時的盾牌格擋、怒氣有餘時的英勇打擊或順劈斬，以及生命力低時的破釜沉舟；嘲諷與盾牆已列出但預設關閉。由你自行處理：學會守禦先鋒之前切換到戰鬥姿態衝鋒、嘲諷其他敵人以及拉回跑掉的敵人。在永久版本中僅列出供參考。"
-- en: "Forever Warrior: Protection, debuff upkeep (Warcraft Tavern)"
L["Default.Forever.Warrior.Protection.WarcraftTavern.Name"] = "戰士：防護，維持減益（永久，Warcraft Tavern）"
-- en: "Warcraft Tavern's tanking order: Thunder Clap, Demoralizing Shout and five Sunder Armors kept on every target first, then Revenge, Rend and Shield Slam last, with Heroic Strike or Cleave from 60 rage. No Shield Block or defensive reminders. Choose it instead of the Icy Veins tank premade if you prefer to keep the debuffs up first. Listed for reference on Forever."
L["Default.Forever.Warrior.Protection.WarcraftTavern.Description"] = "Warcraft Tavern 的坦克順序：先在每個目標上維持雷霆一擊、挫志怒吼與五層破甲攻擊，然後是復仇、撕裂，最後是盾牌猛擊，怒氣達到 60 起使用英勇打擊或順劈斬。沒有盾牌格擋或防禦提醒。如果你偏好先維持減益效果，請選擇它而非 Icy Veins 坦克內建循環。在永久版本中僅列出供參考。"
-- en: "Forever Warrior: Arms and Fury (Icy Veins)"
L["Default.Forever.Warrior.DPS.Name"] = "戰士：武器與狂怒（永久，Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Melee Arms and Fury from level 1 to 60, and the default for any warrior outside Defensive Stance. Forever rage is scarce, so it pools: Charge to pull, Victory Rush when hurt, Intercept, Execute only on elites, bosses or in a group (solo on a normal mob it lets white hits finish), Whirlwind or Thunder Clap, Demoralizing Shout and Slam on packs, Spearing Strike on Giants and Dragonkin, Rend until Bloodthirst, Overpower, Mortal Strike, Bloodthirst, Whirlwind with rage to spare, Slam while standing, two Sunder Armors (five on elites). Reminders: Battle Shout, Bloodrage, the interrupt, Heroic Strike from 80 rage, Cleave from 60, Sweeping Strikes, Death Wish and Berserker Rage; Recklessness and Retaliation are listed but off. Left to you: stance dancing, Hamstring and consumables. Listed for reference on Forever."
L["Default.Forever.Warrior.DPS.Description"] = "武器與狂怒近戰，適用於 1 至 60 級，也是所有不在防禦姿態的戰士的預設循環。永久中怒氣稀少，因此會累積怒氣：以衝鋒拉怪、受傷時勝利衝擊、攔截，斬殺只用於精英、首領或隊伍中（單人對付普通怪物時讓普通攻擊收尾），旋風斬或雷霆一擊，怪群時挫志怒吼與猛擊，對巨人與龍類使用穿刺打擊，學會嗜血前使用撕裂、壓制、致死打擊、嗜血，怒氣有餘時旋風斬，站著不動時猛擊，兩層破甲攻擊（對精英疊五層）。提醒：戰鬥怒吼、血性狂暴、中斷施法、怒氣達到 80 起英勇打擊、60 起順劈斬、橫掃攻擊、死亡之願與狂暴之怒；魯莽與反擊風暴已列出但預設關閉。由你自行處理：姿態切換、斷筋與消耗品。在永久版本中僅列出供參考。"
-- en: "Forever Warrior: Arms and Fury, spend rage (Warcraft Tavern)"
L["Default.Forever.Warrior.DPS.WarcraftTavern.Name"] = "戰士：武器與狂怒，傾瀉怒氣（永久，Warcraft Tavern）"
-- en: "Warcraft Tavern's always-spend list for groups and raids: five Sunder Armors first, Execute above everything below 20%, Overpower, Rend until Bloodthirst, Mortal Strike, Bloodthirst, Whirlwind, Spearing Strike on cooldown, Slam once Improved Slam is taken and Hamstring with spare rage; Heroic Strike or Cleave from 60 rage, Recklessness on cooldown with Death Wish beside it. Choose it instead of the Icy Veins premade if you play in groups and do not need to save rage between pulls. Listed for reference on Forever."
L["Default.Forever.Warrior.DPS.WarcraftTavern.Description"] = "Warcraft Tavern 用於隊伍與團隊的持續傾瀉怒氣清單：先疊五層破甲攻擊，目標低於 20% 時斬殺優先於一切，壓制，學會嗜血前使用撕裂，致死打擊、嗜血、旋風斬，穿刺打擊冷卻結束即使用，點了強化猛擊後使用猛擊，怒氣有餘時使用斷筋；怒氣達到 60 起使用英勇打擊或順劈斬，魯莽冷卻結束即使用並同時使用死亡之願。如果你在隊伍中遊戲，不需要在兩次拉怪之間保留怒氣，請選擇它而非 Icy Veins 內建循環。在永久版本中僅列出供參考。"
-- en: "Druid: Balance (Forever)"
L["Default.Forever.Druid.Balance.Name"] = "德魯伊：平衡（永久）"
-- en: "Balance from level 1 to 60, and the default for any Forever Druid no other premade fits (levels 1–9, untalented casters, solo Restoration). Pulls with Wrath; while moving, refreshes Moonfire, Insect Swarm and, in a group, Faerie Fire. Hurricane when three or more enemies are fighting you, then your own Moonfire and Insect Swarm on a target that is not nearly dead, Starfire while Eclipse charges or Clearcasting are up, and Wrath. Regrowth on yourself below half health while solo; out of mana it lets you melee. Reminders: Mark of the Wild, Thorns while solo, Moonkin Form, a pre-pull Rejuvenation while solo, Nature's Grasp when a mob is on you, Innervate. Form changes, crowd control, Barkskin and target choice stay with you. Built from level-30 beta guides; level 31–60 steps follow the class design and are untested."
L["Default.Forever.Druid.Balance.Description"] = "平衡，適用於 1 至 60 級，也是沒有其他內建循環適用時所有永久德魯伊的預設循環（1–9 級、未點天賦的施法者、單人的恢復德魯伊）。以憤怒拉怪；移動時刷新月火術、蟲群，隊伍中還有精靈之火。三個以上敵人與你交戰時使用颶風，接著對並非快死的目標施放你自己的月火術與蟲群，蝕星蔽月充能或節能施法期間使用星火術，以及憤怒。單人時生命力低於一半對自己使用癒合；法力耗盡時讓你進行近戰。提醒：野性印記、單人時的荊棘術、梟獸形態、單人時拉怪前的回春術、怪物貼身時的自然之握、啟動。形態切換、控場、樹皮術與目標選擇由你自行處理。依據 30 級測試版指南製作；31–60 級的步驟依循職業設計，尚未經過測試。"
-- en: "Druid: Balance, Multi-DoT (Forever, Warcraft Tavern)"
L["Default.Forever.Druid.BalanceTavern.Name"] = "德魯伊：平衡，多目標持續傷害（永久，Warcraft Tavern）"
-- en: "Warcraft Tavern's Multi-DoT leveling style, an alternative to the Balance premade: enable it and disable that one, or raise its priority. Pulls with Wrath, keeps your Moonfire and Insect Swarm on the target, roots it with Entangling Roots once both are running while another enemy is fighting you, then Wrath. No Starfire (the build skips Eclipse). Switching to the next enemy is up to you. Reminders: Mark of the Wild, Thorns while solo."
L["Default.Forever.Druid.BalanceTavern.Description"] = "Warcraft Tavern 的多目標持續傷害升級打法，作為平衡內建循環的替代：啟用它並停用那個，或提高它的優先順序。以憤怒拉怪，維持目標身上你自己的月火術與蟲群，兩者都生效且另有敵人與你交戰時以糾纏根鬚定住它，然後是憤怒。不使用星火術（此流派不點蝕星蔽月）。切換到下一個敵人由你決定。提醒：野性印記、單人時的荊棘術。"
-- en: "Druid: Feral, Cat and Bear (Forever)"
L["Default.Forever.Druid.Feral.Name"] = "德魯伊：野性，獵豹與熊（永久）"
-- en: "Cat and Bear in one premade, chosen by your form; it takes over once you know a Feral talent spell or shift into Cat or Bear Form. Cat: Ravage or Shred from Prowl, Faerie Fire, Shifting Power below 60 energy, Rip at four combo points on a target that will live, Ferocious Bite once Rip runs, Rake, then Shred when the target is not facing you (Claw otherwise). Bear: Faerie Fire and Feral Charge at range, Demoralizing Roar in a group or on two enemies, Primal Bite, Swipe on three or more, Lacerate, Swipe. In caster form it suggests Cat Form (Bear before you have Cat) and Regrowth when hurt out of combat. Reminders: Maul with spare rage, Enrage, Berserk on big pulls or elites, Frenzied Regeneration, Innervate, Mark of the Wild, Thorns. Taunts, interrupts and positioning stay with you."
L["Default.Forever.Druid.Feral.Description"] = "獵豹與熊合併為一個內建循環，依你的形態選擇；一旦你學會野性天賦法術或變為獵豹或熊形態，就由它接手。獵豹：潛伏狀態下使用毀滅或撕碎、精靈之火、能量低於 60 時使用能量流轉、對會存活較久的目標在四個連擊點時使用撕扯、撕扯生效後使用兇猛撕咬、掃擊，然後在目標未面向你時使用撕碎（否則使用爪擊）。熊：遠距離使用精靈之火與野性衝鋒，隊伍中或面對兩個敵人時使用挫志咆哮、原始撕咬，三個以上敵人時使用揮擊、割裂、揮擊。人形態下會建議獵豹形態（學會獵豹前為熊形態），脫離戰鬥且受傷時建議癒合。提醒：怒氣有餘時的槌擊、狂怒、大規模拉怪或面對精英時的狂暴、狂暴回復、啟動、野性印記、荊棘術。嘲諷、中斷施法與站位由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Druid: Restoration (Forever)"
L["Default.Forever.Druid.Restoration.Name"] = "德魯伊：恢復（永久）"
-- en: "Group healing after Warcraft Tavern, from your first Restoration talent spell (Swiftmend or Wild Growth). Heals your current friendly target: Swiftmend on a hurt target with your HoT, Wild Growth when three or more allies are hurt, Regrowth, Rejuvenation on your focus or anyone hurt, Healing Touch on a badly hurt target. On a hostile target: Moonfire, Insect Swarm, Wrath. Reminders: Innervate below 30% mana, Nature's Swiftness on a dying target, Tranquility, Remove Curse and Abolish Poison, Mark of the Wild. You pick who to heal and the spell rank; solo Restoration uses the Balance premade."
L["Default.Forever.Druid.Restoration.Description"] = "依據 Warcraft Tavern 的隊伍治療，從你的第一個恢復天賦法術（迅癒或野性痊癒）開始生效。治療你目前的友方目標：對帶有你的持續治療效果的受傷目標使用迅癒，三個以上盟友受傷時使用野性痊癒、癒合，對你的專注目標或任何受傷者使用回春術，對重傷目標使用治療之觸。目標為敵對時：月火術、蟲群、憤怒。提醒：法力低於 30% 時啟動、對瀕死目標使用自然迅捷、寧靜、解除詛咒與驅毒術、野性印記。要治療誰與法術等級由你決定；單人的恢復德魯伊使用平衡內建循環。"
-- en: "Druid: Restoration, HoTs first (Forever, Icy Veins)"
L["Default.Forever.Druid.RestorationIcyVeins.Name"] = "德魯伊：恢復，持續治療優先（永久，Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Icy Veins' HoT-first healing, an alternative to the Restoration premade: enable it and disable that one, or raise its priority. Rejuvenation on your focus and anyone hurt, Regrowth for stronger heals, Healing Touch only with both HoTs running, Swiftmend when a HoT target drops low, then Wild Growth. Innervate on cooldown. Otherwise the same reminders and hostile-target list as the Restoration premade."
L["Default.Forever.Druid.RestorationIcyVeins.Description"] = "Icy Veins 的持續治療優先治療法，作為恢復內建循環的替代：啟用它並停用那個，或提高它的優先順序。對你的專注目標與任何受傷者使用回春術，以癒合進行較強的治療，只在兩種持續治療效果都生效時使用治療之觸，持續治療目標生命力過低時使用迅癒，然後是野性痊癒。啟動冷卻結束即使用。其餘提醒與敵對目標清單與恢復內建循環相同。"
-- en: "Hunter: ranged (Forever, Wowhead)"
L["Default.Forever.Hunter.Ranged.Name"] = "獵人：遠程（永久，Wowhead）"
-- en: "Every ranged Hunter from level 1 to 60 (Beast Mastery, Marksmanship, and Survival until Strider Kick), and the Forever Hunter default. Pull: Hunter's Mark, Sniper Shot while Rapid Killing lasts, Auto Shot. Then your own Serpent Sting, Summon Hawk twice and Arcane Shot once on their shared cooldown (Arcane Shot on cooldown before Summon Hawk), Sniper Shot under Rapid Killing or on elites, Aimed Shot. Two or more enemies fighting you: Multi-Shot instead of Aimed Shot, Explosive Trap with three near you, Volley on five. Moving: instant shots only. A mob in melee range gets Raptor Strike and Mongoose Bite. Reminders: Aspect of the Hawk (Monkey before it), Trueshot Aura, pet calling, reviving and Mend Pet, Rapid Fire, Bestial Wrath and Blood Fury on elites or in dungeons, Intimidation when a mob is on you. Pet commands, feeding, kiting and Feign Death stay with you; disable the pet reminders if you play Lone Wolf. It never reads your mana, which Forever is reported to hide in combat."
L["Default.Forever.Hunter.Ranged.Description"] = "適用於 1 至 60 級的所有遠程獵人（野獸控制、射擊，以及學會陸行鳥腳踢之前的生存），也是永久獵人的預設循環。拉怪：獵人印記、急速殺戮持續期間使用狙擊射擊、自動射擊。接著是你自己的毒蛇釘刺，在共用冷卻中兩次召喚獵鷹與一次秘法射擊（學會召喚獵鷹之前秘法射擊冷卻結束即使用），急速殺戮期間或對精英使用狙擊射擊、瞄準射擊。兩個以上敵人與你交戰時：以多重射擊取代瞄準射擊，附近有三個敵人時使用爆炸陷阱，五個時使用亂射。移動時：只使用瞬發射擊。近戰範圍內的怪物會吃到猛禽一擊與貓鼬撕咬。提醒：雄鷹守護（學會前為靈猴守護）、強擊光環、召喚與復活寵物以及治療寵物、急速射擊、對精英或在地城中使用狂野怒火與血性狂暴、怪物貼身時使用脅迫。寵物指令、餵食、放風箏與假死由你自行處理；如果你使用孤狼，請停用寵物提醒。它從不讀取你的法力，據報永久會在戰鬥中隱藏法力。"
-- en: "Hunter: ranged, mana-saving (Forever, Mobalytics)"
L["Default.Forever.Hunter.RangedMobalytics.Name"] = "獵人：遠程，節省法力（永久，Mobalytics）"
-- en: "Mobalytics' mana-saving leveling style, an alternative to the Wowhead ranged premade: enable it and disable that one, or raise its priority. Keeps your Serpent Sting up, one Summon Hawk out, Aimed Shot (Multi-Shot on two or more enemies), a second Hawk only on a healthy target, and never Arcane Shot once Summon Hawk is known. Same pull, melee, movement and reminders as the Wowhead premade."
L["Default.Forever.Hunter.RangedMobalytics.Description"] = "Mobalytics 的節省法力升級打法，作為 Wowhead 遠程內建循環的替代：啟用它並停用那個，或提高它的優先順序。維持你自己的毒蛇釘刺，維持一隻召喚出的獵鷹，瞄準射擊（兩個以上敵人時用多重射擊），只對血量充足的目標召喚第二隻獵鷹，學會召喚獵鷹後不再使用秘法射擊。拉怪、近戰、移動與提醒都與 Wowhead 內建循環相同。"
-- en: "Hunter: Survival melee (Forever, Wowhead)"
L["Default.Forever.Hunter.Survival.Name"] = "獵人：生存近戰（永久，Wowhead）"
-- en: "Dual-wield melee Survival once you know Strider Kick (until then the ranged premade levels you, as the guides advise). Pull with Hunter's Mark and Serpent Sting, then Mongoose Bite, Strider Kick, Raptor Strike and Counterattack, with Explosive Trap on three or more enemies. Out of melee it shoots: Serpent Sting, Arcane Shot, Aimed Shot, Auto Shot. Reminders: Aspect of the Beast, Hunter's Mark (Expose Prey needs it), Rapid Fire and Blood Fury on elites or in dungeons, Deterrence, pet care. An optional Immolation Trap step is off by default."
L["Default.Forever.Hunter.Survival.Description"] = "學會陸行鳥腳踢後的雙持近戰生存（在此之前依指南建議由遠程內建循環帶你升級）。以獵人印記與毒蛇釘刺拉怪，接著是貓鼬撕咬、陸行鳥腳踢、猛禽一擊與反擊，三個以上敵人時使用爆炸陷阱。不在近戰範圍時進行射擊：毒蛇釘刺、秘法射擊、瞄準射擊、自動射擊。提醒：野獸守護、獵人印記（暴露獵物需要它）、對精英或在地城中使用急速射擊與血性狂暴、威懾、寵物照料。選擇性的獻祭陷阱步驟預設關閉。"
-- en: "Hunter: Survival two-hand weave (Forever, Wowhead)"
L["Default.Forever.Hunter.SurvivalWeave.Name"] = "獵人：生存雙手穿插（永久，Wowhead）"
-- en: "Wowhead's in-and-out weave for a two-handed Survival Hunter, an alternative to the Survival melee premade: enable it and disable that one, or raise its priority. In melee: Mongoose Bite and Raptor Strike; when Raptor Strike is more than 2.5 seconds away, Strider Kick and step out. Out of melee: Serpent Sting, Arcane Shot, Aimed Shot and Auto Shot until Raptor Strike is nearly ready, then back in. You do the moving; RM follows your range."
L["Default.Forever.Hunter.SurvivalWeave.Description"] = "Wowhead 針對雙手武器生存獵人的進出穿插打法，作為生存近戰內建循環的替代：啟用它並停用那個，或提高它的優先順序。近戰時：貓鼬撕咬與猛禽一擊；當猛禽一擊還需 2.5 秒以上才就緒時，使用陸行鳥腳踢並退出近戰。不在近戰時：毒蛇釘刺、秘法射擊、瞄準射擊與自動射擊，直到猛禽一擊即將就緒，然後回到近戰。移動由你負責；RM 會依你的距離調整。"
-- en: "Mage: Frost (Forever)"
L["Default.Forever.Mage.Frost.Name"] = "法師：冰霜（永久）"
-- en: "Frost from level 1 to 60, and the Forever Mage default before talent spells (Fireball until Frostbolt at level 4). Pulls with Frostbolt; then Ice Lance on Fingers of Frost or a frozen target (also while Frostbolt is still casting, to cancel or batch), Cone of Cold at five Winter's Chill stacks, Arcane Missiles on Missile Barrage, Fire Blast to finish, Frostbolt, and a wand when solo and nearly out of mana. Moving: Ice Lance, else Fire Blast. Three or more enemies fighting you: Cone of Cold; five or more: Blizzard, or Arcane Explosion with a mob on you. Warcraft Tavern's Flamestrike and Arcane Explosion AoE is included but off. Reminders: Arcane Intellect, armor (Ice or Frost solo, Mage Armor in a group, never replacing one you chose), Ice Barrier, Evocation, Counterspell, Remove Lesser Curse, Frost Nova when a mob reaches you, Cold Snap, Ice Block. Blink, kiting, Polymorph and mana gems stay with you."
L["Default.Forever.Mage.Frost.Description"] = "冰霜，適用於 1 至 60 級，也是永久法師在學會天賦法術前的預設循環（4 級學會寒冰箭之前為火球術）。以寒冰箭拉怪；接著在冰霜之指觸發或目標被冰凍時使用冰霜長矛（寒冰箭仍在施放時也可使用，以取消或合併施法），深冬之寒疊滿五層時使用冰錐術，飛彈彈幕觸發時使用秘法飛彈，以火焰衝擊收尾、寒冰箭，單人且法力幾乎耗盡時使用魔杖。移動時：冰霜長矛，否則火焰衝擊。三個以上敵人與你交戰時：冰錐術；五個以上時：暴風雪，或在有怪物貼身時使用魔爆術。包含 Warcraft Tavern 的烈焰風暴與魔爆術範圍傷害打法，但預設關閉。提醒：秘法智慧、護甲（單人用冰甲術或霜甲術，隊伍中用魔甲術，絕不取代你已選擇的護甲）、寒冰護體、喚醒、法術反制、解除次級詛咒、怪物貼身時的冰霜新星、急速冷卻、寒冰屏障。閃現術、放風箏、變形術與法力寶石由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Mage: Fire (Forever)"
L["Default.Forever.Mage.Fire.Name"] = "法師：火焰（永久）"
-- en: "Fire once you know Pyroblast. Pulls with Pyroblast on elites, else Frostfire Bolt or Fireball; then Pyroblast at three Heating Up stacks, Ice Lance on Fingers of Frost or a frozen target (Fire/Frost hybrids), Fire Blast on cooldown, Scorch to keep your five Fire Vulnerability stacks on elites, Frostfire Bolt (from 40) or Fireball, wand when nearly out of mana solo. Moving: Fire Blast or Ice Lance. Four or more enemies fighting you: Flamestrike, Blast Wave, Arcane Explosion. RM cannot see Improved Scorch, so the step that starts Scorch stacks (and a close-range Scorch) is off until you enable it. Reminders: Combustion and Presence of Mind on elites, plus the Mage upkeep reminders."
L["Default.Forever.Mage.Fire.Description"] = "學會炎爆術後的火焰。對精英以炎爆術拉怪，否則用霜火箭或火球術；接著在升溫疊滿三層時使用炎爆術，冰霜之指觸發或目標被冰凍時使用冰霜長矛（火焰/冰霜混合流派），火焰衝擊冷卻結束即使用，對精英使用灼燒維持五層火焰易傷，霜火箭（40 級起）或火球術，單人且法力幾乎耗盡時使用魔杖。移動時：火焰衝擊或冰霜長矛。四個以上敵人與你交戰時：烈焰風暴、衝擊波、魔爆術。RM 無法看到強化灼燒，因此開始疊加灼燒的步驟（以及近距離灼燒）在你啟用之前維持關閉。提醒：對精英使用燃燒與氣定神閒，以及法師的常規維持提醒。"
-- en: "Mage: Fire leveling (Forever, Icy Veins)"
L["Default.Forever.Mage.FireIcyVeins.Name"] = "法師：火焰升級（永久，Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Icy Veins' Fire leveling build without Improved Scorch, an alternative to the Fire premade: enable it and disable that one, or raise its priority. Pulls with Pyroblast, uses Fire Blast to finish low targets and to spend Wake of Fire, Scorch as the mob closes or dies, then Frostfire Bolt (from 40) or Fireball. Same AoE, movement, wand and reminders as the Fire premade, without Combustion and Presence of Mind."
L["Default.Forever.Mage.FireIcyVeins.Description"] = "Icy Veins 不點強化灼燒的火焰升級天賦配置，作為火焰內建循環的替代：啟用它並停用那個，或提高它的優先順序。以炎爆術拉怪，以火焰衝擊收掉低血量目標並消耗火焰甦醒，怪物靠近或即將死亡時使用灼燒，然後是霜火箭（40 級起）或火球術。範圍傷害、移動、魔杖與提醒都與火焰內建循環相同，但不含燃燒與氣定神閒。"
-- en: "Mage: Arcane (Forever)"
L["Default.Forever.Mage.Arcane.Name"] = "法師：秘法（永久）"
-- en: "Arcane once you know Arcane Blast and not Ice Lance. Pulls with Frostbolt solo or Arcane Blast in a group; then Arcane Missiles on Missile Barrage, Arcane Blast on Clearcasting, Arcane Wrath at three Arcane Blast stacks, Arcane Blast up to four stacks on elites and two on other targets while you have over 35% mana, then Frostfire Bolt, Frostbolt or Fireball to fish for Missile Barrage, and a wand when nearly out of mana solo. Without Arcane Wrath (the older beta design) Fire Blast spends the stacks. Moving: Fire Blast. Three or more enemies fighting you: Arcane Explosion. Reminders: Presence of Mind and Arcane Power on elites, plus the Mage upkeep reminders."
L["Default.Forever.Mage.Arcane.Description"] = "學會秘法衝擊且未學會冰霜長矛時的秘法。單人時以寒冰箭拉怪，隊伍中以秘法衝擊拉怪；接著飛彈彈幕觸發時使用秘法飛彈，節能施法時使用秘法衝擊，秘法衝擊疊滿三層時使用秘法懲戒，法力高於 35% 時對精英疊加秘法衝擊至四層、對其他目標疊加至兩層，然後以霜火箭、寒冰箭或火球術來觸發飛彈彈幕，單人且法力幾乎耗盡時使用魔杖。沒有秘法懲戒時（較早的測試版設計）由火焰衝擊消耗層數。移動時：火焰衝擊。三個以上敵人與你交戰時：魔爆術。提醒：對精英使用氣定神閒與秘法強化，以及法師的常規維持提醒。"
-- en: "Paladin: Retribution (Forever)"
L["Default.Forever.Paladin.Retribution.Name"] = "聖騎士：懲戒（永久）"
-- en: "Retribution and every melee Paladin from level 1 to 60, and the Forever Paladin default. Keeps a damage seal up, refreshed only when it runs low: Seal of the Crusader judged once on a healthy or elite target, then Seal of Command with a slow (3.0 s) weapon, else Seal of Righteousness. Then Holy Strike on cooldown, Holy Shock and Light's Vigil for a Shockadin, Exorcism on Undead and Demons, Consecration on three or more enemies or with mana to spare, Hammer of Wrath with mana to spare, and melee. Judgement is off the global cooldown, so it is a reminder whenever a seal is up and you have mana. Other reminders: your aura and Blessing (Retribution Aura and Kings once learned; yours are kept), healing when hurt out of combat, Lay on Hands. Optional steps, off by default: Hammer of Justice before a Seal of Command Judgement, and Twist of Light seal swapping for a 31-point Retribution build. Built from level-30 beta guides."
L["Default.Forever.Paladin.Retribution.Description"] = "適用於 1 至 60 級的懲戒及所有近戰聖騎士，也是永久聖騎士的預設循環。維持一個傷害聖印，只在即將消失時刷新：對血量充足或精英目標審判一次十字軍聖印，接著使用慢速（3.0 秒）武器時用命令聖印，否則用正義聖印。然後神聖打擊冷卻結束即使用，震擊騎（Shockadin）使用神聖震擊與聖光戒備，對不死族與惡魔使用驅邪術，三個以上敵人或法力有餘時使用奉獻，法力有餘時使用憤怒之錘，以及近戰。審判不受共用冷卻影響，因此只要有聖印且你有法力，它就會以提醒出現。其他提醒：你的光環與祝福（學會後為懲戒光環與王者祝福；會保留你自己選擇的）、脫離戰鬥且受傷時的治療、聖療術。預設關閉的選擇性步驟：命令聖印審判前使用制裁之錘，以及適用於 31 點懲戒天賦配置的聖光折射聖印切換。依據 30 級測試版指南製作。"
-- en: "Paladin: Protection (Forever, Wowhead)"
L["Default.Forever.Paladin.Protection.Name"] = "聖騎士：防護（永久，Wowhead）"
-- en: "Tanking, once you know Swift Judgement or Templar's Bulwark or turn on Righteous Fury. When the target is fighting someone else: Judgement with Seal of Fury (the taunt), Swift Judgement to reset it. Two or more enemies engaged: Consecration, Exorcism and Holy Wrath on Undead and Demons, Holy Strike. One enemy: Exorcism on Undead and Demons, Holy Strike, Consecration with mana to spare. Reminders: Righteous Fury, Seal of Fury, Judgement on cooldown, Templar's Bulwark when low, Holy Shield while tanking, Lay on Hands, your aura and Blessing. Pulling, positioning and other taunts stay with you."
L["Default.Forever.Paladin.Protection.Description"] = "學會迅捷審判或聖殿騎士之壁壘，或開啟正義之怒後的坦克循環。目標正在攻擊其他人時：搭配憤怒聖印使用審判（嘲諷），以迅捷審判重置它。與兩個以上敵人交戰時：奉獻、對不死族與惡魔使用驅邪術與神聖憤怒、神聖打擊。單一敵人時：對不死族與惡魔使用驅邪術、神聖打擊、法力有餘時使用奉獻。提醒：正義之怒、憤怒聖印、審判冷卻結束即使用、生命力低時的聖殿騎士之壁壘、坦克時的神聖之盾、聖療術、你的光環與祝福。拉怪、站位與其他嘲諷由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Paladin: Protection, Consecration first (Forever, Icy Veins)"
L["Default.Forever.Paladin.ProtectionIcyVeins.Name"] = "聖騎士：防護，奉獻優先（永久，Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Icy Veins' tanking style, an alternative to the Wowhead Protection premade: enable it and disable that one, or raise its priority. Consecration first whenever you have mana, on one enemy too; Judgement is kept for taunts (no on-cooldown reminder), with Swift Judgement to reset it; then Holy Strike and Exorcism on Undead and Demons. Same tank reminders otherwise."
L["Default.Forever.Paladin.ProtectionIcyVeins.Description"] = "Icy Veins 的坦克打法，作為 Wowhead 防護內建循環的替代：啟用它並停用那個，或提高它的優先順序。只要有法力就優先奉獻，單一敵人時也一樣；審判留作嘲諷使用（沒有冷卻結束即使用的提醒），以迅捷審判重置它；然後是神聖打擊，對不死族與惡魔使用驅邪術。其餘坦克提醒相同。"
-- en: "Paladin: Holy (Forever)"
L["Default.Forever.Paladin.Holy.Name"] = "聖騎士：神聖（永久）"
-- en: "Group healing once you know Holy Shock, while Righteous Fury is off (a grouped Shockadin lands here too). Heals your current friendly target: Holy Shock in an emergency or while moving, Holy Shock on a target with your Light's Vigil and Light's Vigil when three or more allies are hurt, Cleanse or Purify, Holy Light (faster with Infusion of Light) for big deficits, Flash of Light as the main heal. On an enemy: Judgement of Light when Seal of Light is up, Holy Shock and Light's Vigil with mana to spare, Holy Strike, Exorcism. Reminders: Seal of Light when you have no seal, Divine Favor, Lay on Hands on a dying target, your aura and Blessing. You pick who to heal."
L["Default.Forever.Paladin.Holy.Description"] = "學會神聖震擊且正義之怒未開啟時的隊伍治療（隊伍中的震擊騎也會使用這裡）。治療你目前的友方目標：緊急時或移動時使用神聖震擊，對帶有你的聖光戒備的目標使用神聖震擊，三個以上盟友受傷時使用聖光戒備，清潔術或純淨術，損失較多時使用聖光術（聖光灌注時更快），聖光閃現作為主要治療。目標為敵人時：有光明聖印時使用聖光審判，法力有餘時使用神聖震擊與聖光戒備、神聖打擊、驅邪術。提醒：沒有聖印時使用光明聖印、神恩術、對瀕死目標使用聖療術、你的光環與祝福。要治療誰由你決定。"
-- en: "Paladin: Holy, Holy Shock on cooldown (Forever, Wowhead)"
L["Default.Forever.Paladin.HolyWowhead.Name"] = "聖騎士：神聖，神聖震擊冷卻結束即使用（永久，Wowhead）"
-- en: "Wowhead's healing style, an alternative to the Holy premade: enable it and disable that one, or raise its priority. Holy Shock as a routine heal on cooldown, dispels, Holy Light for big deficits, Flash of Light. On an enemy it keeps your Judgement of Light up by swapping to Seal of Light, judging and swapping back to Seal of Righteousness, then Holy Strike, Exorcism on Undead and Demons, Holy Shock and Consecration. Same reminders as the Holy premade."
L["Default.Forever.Paladin.HolyWowhead.Description"] = "Wowhead 的治療打法，作為神聖內建循環的替代：啟用它並停用那個，或提高它的優先順序。神聖震擊作為常規治療冷卻結束即使用、驅散、損失較多時使用聖光術、聖光閃現。目標為敵人時，它會透過切換到光明聖印、審判，再切換回正義聖印來維持你的聖光審判，然後是神聖打擊、對不死族與惡魔使用驅邪術、神聖震擊與奉獻。提醒與神聖內建循環相同。"
-- en: "Priest: Shadow and solo damage (Forever)"
L["Default.Forever.Priest.Dps.Name"] = "牧師：暗影與單人傷害（永久）"
-- en: "Shadow, and every Priest's solo play, from level 1 to 60; the Forever Priest default. Pulls with Power Word: Shield (solo) and Mind Blast (Holy Fire for Holy and Discipline, Smite before Mind Blast). Then Shadowform once learned, your own Shadow Word: Pain and Devouring Plague, Mind Blast while the target is healthy (always in Shadowform or a group), Shadow Word: Death to execute, Holy Fire into Penance for Discipline, Mind Flay in Shadowform; solo before Shadowform, Holy Nova on three enemies with Holy Purpose, Mind Flay with mana to spare, then the wand (Smite without one). Moving: Pain, Plague, Death. Below 35% health while solo: Shield, Desperate Prayer and a heal (not in Shadowform). Reminders: Inner Fire, Fortitude, Divine Spirit, racial buffs, Vampiric Embrace, Inner Focus, Silence, Dark Sacrifice, Elune's Light; Psychic Scream is off by default. Built from level-30 beta guides; Shadowform play follows Mobalytics."
L["Default.Forever.Priest.Dps.Description"] = "適用於 1 至 60 級的暗影以及所有牧師的單人打法；永久牧師的預設循環。以真言術：盾（單人）與心靈震爆拉怪（神聖與戒律用神聖之火，學會心靈震爆前用懲擊）。接著學會後使用暗影形態，你自己的暗言術：痛與噬靈瘟疫，目標血量充足時使用心靈震爆（暗影形態或隊伍中一律使用），以暗言術：死斬殺，戒律以神聖之火接懺悟，暗影形態下使用精神鞭笞；學會暗影形態前單人時，神聖意圖觸發且有三個敵人時使用神聖新星，法力有餘時使用精神鞭笞，然後是魔杖（沒有魔杖時用懲擊）。移動時：痛、瘟疫、死。單人時生命力低於 35%：真言術：盾、絕望禱言與治療（暗影形態下除外）。提醒：心靈之火、真言術：韌、神聖之靈、種族增益、吸血鬼的擁抱、心靈專注、沉默、黑暗獻祭、伊露恩之光；心靈尖嘯預設關閉。依據 30 級測試版指南製作；暗影形態打法依循 Mobalytics。"
-- en: "Priest: DoT and wand leveling (Forever, Mobalytics)"
L["Default.Forever.Priest.DpsMobalytics.Name"] = "牧師：持續傷害與魔杖升級（永久，Mobalytics）"
-- en: "Mobalytics' leveling style, an alternative to the Shadow premade: enable it and disable that one, or raise its priority. Mind Blast and Holy Fire only on tough mobs (elites, or two levels above you), your own Shadow Word: Pain and Devouring Plague on a target that will live, then the wand (Smite without one). From Shadowform: Mind Blast, Pain, Plague, Mind Flay. Shield and Renew on yourself between pulls with mana to spare, Cure Disease on yourself. Below 35% health while solo: Shield, Renew, a heal. Spreading Pain across several mobs is up to you."
L["Default.Forever.Priest.DpsMobalytics.Description"] = "Mobalytics 的升級打法，作為暗影內建循環的替代：啟用它並停用那個，或提高它的優先順序。心靈震爆與神聖之火只用於難纏的怪物（精英，或比你高兩級），對會存活較久的目標施放你自己的暗言術：痛與噬靈瘟疫，然後是魔杖（沒有魔杖時用懲擊）。學會暗影形態後：心靈震爆、痛、瘟疫、精神鞭笞。兩次拉怪之間法力有餘時對自己使用真言術：盾與恢復，對自己使用祛病術。單人時生命力低於 35%：真言術：盾、恢復、治療。在多隻怪物之間擴散散播之痛由你決定。"
-- en: "Priest: Discipline and Holy healing (Forever)"
L["Default.Forever.Priest.Healer.Name"] = "牧師：戒律與神聖治療（永久）"
-- en: "Group healing once you know a healing talent spell (Holy Nova, Binding Heal, Penance or Prayer of Mending) and not Shadowform. Heals your current friendly target: before the pull Power Word: Shield, Prayer of Mending and Renew; below 35% Shield, Penance and Flash Heal; Dispel Magic and Abolish or Cure Disease; Prayer of Mending; Prayer of Healing (and Holy Nova on Holy Purpose) when three allies are hurt; Binding Heal when you are both hurt; Penance; Renew; Greater Heal, Heal or Lesser Heal. On an enemy: Shadow Word: Pain, Holy Fire, Penance, Smite, wand. Reminders: Inner Fire, Fortitude, Divine Spirit, Power Infusion on another player, Inner Focus, Desperate Prayer and the racial spells. You pick who to heal and the rank; a Discipline healer before Penance (20–29) selects it by hand."
L["Default.Forever.Priest.Healer.Description"] = "學會治療天賦法術（神聖新星、束縛治療、懺悟或癒合禱言）且未學會暗影形態後的隊伍治療。治療你目前的友方目標：拉怪前使用真言術：盾、癒合禱言與恢復；低於 35% 時使用真言術：盾、懺悟與快速治療；驅散魔法以及驅除疾病或祛病術；癒合禱言；三名盟友受傷時使用治療禱言（神聖意圖觸發時還有神聖新星）；你與目標都受傷時使用束縛治療；懺悟；恢復；強效治療術、治療術或次級治療術。目標為敵人時：暗言術：痛、神聖之火、懺悟、懲擊、魔杖。提醒：心靈之火、真言術：韌、神聖之靈、對其他玩家使用注入能量、心靈專注、絕望禱言與種族法術。要治療誰與法術等級由你決定；學會懺悟前的戒律治療者（20–29 級）需要手動選擇它。"
-- en: "Death Knight: Blood (Retail, Blizzard Assisted)"
L["Default.Retail.DeathKnight.Blood.Name"] = "死亡騎士：血魄（正式版，暴雪戰鬥助手）"
-- en: "Recommended for Blood. Highlights the spell Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggests next, the one rotation advice the game still lets an addon read in Midnight combat; it waits while you cast or channel. Alongside it, reminders for what Assisted Combat leaves to you: Vampiric Blood and Raise Dead in combat, Mind Freeze on an interruptible cast, Icebound Fortitude below 35% health, and your racial cooldown. Enemy casts and your health are hidden in combat, so those two light only where the game shows them. Active mitigation timing, Anti-Magic Shell, taunts and trinkets stay with you."
L["Default.Retail.DeathKnight.Blood.Description"] = "推薦血魄專精使用。醒目提示暴雪戰鬥助手建議的下一個法術，這是在至暗之夜的戰鬥中，遊戲仍允許插件讀取的唯一循環建議；你施法或引導時它會等待。同時提醒戰鬥助手留給你處理的部分：戰鬥中的血族之裔與死者復生、對可中斷的施法使用心智冰封、生命力低於 35% 時使用冰錮堅韌，以及你的種族冷卻技能。敵人的施法與你的生命力在戰鬥中會被隱藏，因此這兩項只會在遊戲顯示它們的場合亮起。主動減傷的時機、反魔法護罩、嘲諷與飾品由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Death Knight: Blood reference (Retail, Icy Veins and Wowhead)"
L["Default.Retail.DeathKnight.BloodGuide.Name"] = "死亡騎士：血魄參考（正式版，Icy Veins 與 Wowhead）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: the guides' Blood priority. In Midnight combat your buffs, the target's debuffs, runic power and health are hidden from addons, so this list cannot run there; read it, or clone it to experiment. Pulls with Death's Caress. Death Strike below half health or at 75 runic power; Marrowrend (Death's Caress out of melee) when Bone Shield is missing, under five charges, about to expire, or Exterminate is up; during Gift of the San'layn, Death Strike above 70 runic power, one Blood Boil, Death and Decay on Crimson Scourge and Heart Strike; Death and Decay on Crimson Scourge or four enemies; Vampiric Strike; Consumption; Blood Boil on Boiling Point, a missing Blood Plague or full charges; Heart Strike. Reminders: Raise Dead, Vampiric Blood, Reaper's Mark, Dancing Rune Weapon after Reaper's Mark, plus the Assisted premade's utility reminders."
L["Default.Retail.DeathKnight.BloodGuide.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：指南中的血魄優先順序。在至暗之夜的戰鬥中，你的增益效果、目標的減益效果、符能與生命力都對插件隱藏，因此這份清單無法在戰鬥中運作；可以閱讀它，或複製後自行實驗。以死亡的撫慰拉怪。生命力低於一半或符能達到 75 時使用死亡打擊；骸骨之盾消失、少於五層、即將結束或消滅生效時使用撕骨裂髓（不在近戰範圍時改用死亡的撫慰）；煞婪贈禮期間，符能高於 70 時使用死亡打擊，使用一次沸血術，赤血災禍觸發時使用死亡凋零，以及碎心打擊；赤血災禍觸發或面對四個敵人時使用死亡凋零；吸血打擊；吞噬；沸點觸發、血魄瘟疫消失或充能已滿時使用沸血術；碎心打擊。提醒：死者復生、血族之裔、奪魂印記、在奪魂印記之後使用符文武器幻舞，以及戰鬥助手內建循環中的功能性提醒。"
-- en: "Death Knight: Blood Deathbringer reference (Retail, SimulationCraft)"
L["Default.Retail.DeathKnight.BloodSimc.Name"] = "死亡騎士：血魄死亡召喚者參考（正式版，SimulationCraft）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: SimulationCraft's Deathbringer list, which spends runic power on Death Strike for damage. Hidden combat data keeps it from running in Midnight combat. Death Strike near the runic power cap, Death and Decay whenever it is down, Reaper's Mark, Marrowrend on Exterminate, Death's Caress for Bone Shield while runes are short (else Marrowrend), Death Strike, Blood Boil, Consumption outside Dancing Rune Weapon, Heart Strike. Reminders: Raise Dead, Dancing Rune Weapon, Vampiric Blood and the utility reminders."
L["Default.Retail.DeathKnight.BloodSimc.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：SimulationCraft 的死亡召喚者清單，會把符能花在死亡打擊上來造成傷害。由於戰鬥資料被隱藏，它無法在至暗之夜的戰鬥中運作。符能接近上限時使用死亡打擊，死亡凋零未生效時隨時使用，奪魂印記，消滅生效時使用撕骨裂髓，符文不足時以死亡的撫慰維持骸骨之盾（否則使用撕骨裂髓），死亡打擊，沸血術，符文武器幻舞以外的時間使用吞噬，碎心打擊。提醒：死者復生、符文武器幻舞、血族之裔以及功能性提醒。"
-- en: "Death Knight: Frost (Retail, Blizzard Assisted)"
L["Default.Retail.DeathKnight.Frost.Name"] = "死亡騎士：冰霜（正式版，暴雪戰鬥助手）"
-- en: "Recommended for Frost. Highlights the spell Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggests next, the one rotation advice the game still lets an addon read in Midnight combat; it waits while you cast or channel. Alongside it, reminders for what Assisted Combat leaves to you: Breath of Sindragosa and Raise Dead in combat, Mind Freeze on an interruptible cast, Icebound Fortitude below 35% health, and your racial cooldown. Enemy casts and your health are hidden in combat, so those two light only where the game shows them."
L["Default.Retail.DeathKnight.Frost.Description"] = "推薦冰霜專精使用。醒目提示暴雪戰鬥助手建議的下一個法術，這是在至暗之夜的戰鬥中，遊戲仍允許插件讀取的唯一循環建議；你施法或引導時它會等待。同時提醒戰鬥助手留給你處理的部分：戰鬥中的辛德拉苟莎之息與死者復生、對可中斷的施法使用心智冰封、生命力低於 35% 時使用冰錮堅韌，以及你的種族冷卻技能。敵人的施法與你的生命力在戰鬥中會被隱藏，因此這兩項只會在遊戲顯示它們的場合亮起。"
-- en: "Death Knight: Frost reference (Retail, Icy Veins and SimulationCraft)"
L["Default.Retail.DeathKnight.FrostGuide.Name"] = "死亡騎士：冰霜參考（正式版，Icy Veins 與 SimulationCraft）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: the guides' Frost priority. Killing Machine, Rime, Razorice and runic power are hidden in Midnight combat, so it cannot run there. Obliterate on two Killing Machines or one with three runes, Frost Strike into five Razorice with Shattering Blade, Howling Blast on Rime, Frost Strike before runic power caps, Obliterate on Killing Machine, Frost Strike, Obliterate; three or more enemies swap in Frostscythe and Glacial Advance; Howling Blast out of melee. Reminders: Remorseless Winter, Pillar of Frost, Breath of Sindragosa and Frostwyrm's Fury in Pillar, Reaper's Mark, Raise Dead, Empower Rune Weapon at two charges or when out of Killing Machine and runic power, plus the utility reminders."
L["Default.Retail.DeathKnight.FrostGuide.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：指南中的冰霜優先順序。殺戮酷刑、凝霜、冰剃與符能在至暗之夜的戰鬥中會被隱藏，因此它無法在戰鬥中運作。擁有兩層殺戮酷刑，或一層殺戮酷刑且有三個符文時使用滅寂，有粉碎之刃時在冰剃疊滿五層時使用冰霜打擊，凝霜觸發時使用凜風衝擊，符能溢出前使用冰霜打擊，殺戮酷刑觸發時使用滅寂，冰霜打擊，滅寂；三個以上敵人時改用冰霜鐮刀與冰川突進；不在近戰範圍時使用凜風衝擊。提醒：冷酷凜冬、冰霜之柱、在冰霜之柱期間使用辛德拉苟莎之息與冰霜巨龍之怒、奪魂印記、死者復生、在兩層充能時或殺戮酷刑與符能都耗盡時使用強力符文武器，以及功能性提醒。"
-- en: "Death Knight: Frost reference (Retail, Wowhead)"
L["Default.Retail.DeathKnight.FrostWowhead.Name"] = "死亡騎士：冰霜參考（正式版，Wowhead）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: Wowhead's Frost order, which puts its cooldowns in the rotation. Hidden combat data keeps it from running in Midnight combat. Empower Rune Weapon at two charges, Reaper's Mark, Pillar of Frost, Breath of Sindragosa, Frostwyrm's Fury; then Obliterate on two Killing Machines or one with Exterminate, Howling Blast on Rime, Frost Strike before runic power caps, Obliterate on Killing Machine, Empower Rune Weapon for a new one, Frost Strike, Obliterate, Howling Blast. Three or more enemies swap in Frostscythe and Glacial Advance."
L["Default.Retail.DeathKnight.FrostWowhead.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：Wowhead 的冰霜施放順序，把冷卻技能也排進了循環。由於戰鬥資料被隱藏，它無法在至暗之夜的戰鬥中運作。兩層充能時使用強力符文武器，奪魂印記，冰霜之柱，辛德拉苟莎之息，冰霜巨龍之怒；接著擁有兩層殺戮酷刑，或一層殺戮酷刑且消滅生效時使用滅寂，凝霜觸發時使用凜風衝擊，符能溢出前使用冰霜打擊，殺戮酷刑觸發時使用滅寂，使用強力符文武器獲得新的殺戮酷刑，冰霜打擊，滅寂，凜風衝擊。三個以上敵人時改用冰霜鐮刀與冰川突進。"
-- en: "Death Knight: Unholy (Retail, Blizzard Assisted)"
L["Default.Retail.DeathKnight.Unholy.Name"] = "死亡騎士：穢邪（正式版，暴雪戰鬥助手）"
-- en: "Recommended for Unholy. Highlights the spell Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggests next, the one rotation advice the game still lets an addon read in Midnight combat (it raises your ghoul and uses Army of the Dead and Dark Transformation itself); it waits while you cast or channel. Alongside it: Mind Freeze on an interruptible cast, Icebound Fortitude below 35% health and your racial cooldown. Enemy casts and your health are hidden in combat, so those two light only where the game shows them."
L["Default.Retail.DeathKnight.Unholy.Description"] = "推薦穢邪專精使用。醒目提示暴雪戰鬥助手建議的下一個法術，這是在至暗之夜的戰鬥中，遊戲仍允許插件讀取的唯一循環建議（它會自行召喚食屍鬼，並自行使用亡靈大軍與黑暗變身）；你施法或引導時它會等待。同時提醒：對可中斷的施法使用心智冰封、生命力低於 35% 時使用冰錮堅韌，以及你的種族冷卻技能。敵人的施法與你的生命力在戰鬥中會被隱藏，因此這兩項只會在遊戲顯示它們的場合亮起。"
-- en: "Death Knight: Unholy reference (Retail, Icy Veins and Wowhead)"
L["Default.Retail.DeathKnight.UnholyGuide.Name"] = "死亡騎士：穢邪參考（正式版，Icy Veins 與 Wowhead）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: the guides' Unholy priority. Procs, plagues, runic power and the target's health are hidden in Midnight combat, so it cannot run there. Raise Dead without a ghoul; Festering Scythe to keep its plague haste up; Soul Reaper below 35% or on Reaping; Putrefy during Dark Transformation; Death Coil (Epidemic on four or more enemies) on Sudden Doom, Forbidden Knowledge or, for San'layn, above 50 runic power; Festering Strike with no Lesser Ghoul charges, Scourge Strike with them; Death Coil. Reminders: Army of the Dead, Dark Transformation, Outbreak when your plagues are missing, plus the utility reminders."
L["Default.Retail.DeathKnight.UnholyGuide.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：指南中的穢邪優先順序。觸發效果、疫病、符能與目標的生命力在至暗之夜的戰鬥中會被隱藏，因此它無法在戰鬥中運作。沒有食屍鬼時使用死者復生；使用膿瘡鐮刀維持其疫病帶來的加速；目標生命力低於 35% 或奪魂觸發時使用靈魂收割者；黑暗變身期間使用敗壞；厄運驟臨或禁忌知識觸發時，或煞婪英雄天賦下符能高於 50 時，使用死亡纏繞（四個以上敵人時改用疫情蔓延）；沒有低階食屍鬼充能時使用膿瘡潰擊，有充能時使用天譴打擊；死亡纏繞。提醒：亡靈大軍、黑暗變身、疫病消失時使用疫病爆發，以及功能性提醒。"
-- en: "Death Knight: Unholy reference (Retail, SimulationCraft)"
L["Default.Retail.DeathKnight.UnholySimc.Name"] = "死亡騎士：穢邪參考（正式版，SimulationCraft）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: SimulationCraft's Unholy list, which spends Death Coil far more often. Hidden combat data keeps it from running in Midnight combat. Festering Scythe upkeep, Soul Reaper in Dark Transformation or execute, Putrefy in Dark Transformation with runic power to spare, Death Coil on Sudden Doom or near the cap, Putrefy, Death Coil in Dark Transformation or Forbidden Knowledge and whenever Army of the Dead is over 5 seconds away, Scourge Strike with Lesser Ghoul charges, Festering Strike. Three or more enemies: Epidemic for Death Coil and Festering Strike below three charges. Reminders: Outbreak, Death and Decay on packs, Army of the Dead, Dark Transformation."
L["Default.Retail.DeathKnight.UnholySimc.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：SimulationCraft 的穢邪清單，使用死亡纏繞的頻率要高得多。由於戰鬥資料被隱藏，它無法在至暗之夜的戰鬥中運作。維持膿瘡鐮刀，黑暗變身期間或斬殺階段使用靈魂收割者，黑暗變身期間且符能有餘裕時使用敗壞，厄運驟臨觸發或符能接近上限時使用死亡纏繞，敗壞，黑暗變身或禁忌知識期間，以及亡靈大軍還有 5 秒以上才就緒時使用死亡纏繞，有低階食屍鬼充能時使用天譴打擊，膿瘡潰擊。三個以上敵人時：以疫情蔓延取代死亡纏繞，低階食屍鬼充能少於三層時使用膿瘡潰擊。提醒：疫病爆發、對成群敵人使用死亡凋零、亡靈大軍、黑暗變身。"
-- en: "Demon Hunter: Havoc (Retail, Blizzard Assisted)"
L["Default.Retail.DemonHunter.Havoc.Name"] = "惡魔獵人：災虐（正式版，暴雪戰鬥助手）"
-- en: "Recommended for Havoc. Highlights the spell Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggests next, the one rotation advice the game still lets an addon read in Midnight combat; it waits while you cast or channel. Alongside it, reminders for what the game's assistant leaves to you: Metamorphosis and The Hunt in combat, Vengeful Retreat if you have Inertia or Exergy, Disrupt on an interruptible cast and Blur below 35% health. Enemy casts and your health are hidden in combat, so those two light only where the game shows them. Movement, Darkness and trinkets stay with you."
L["Default.Retail.DemonHunter.Havoc.Description"] = "推薦災虐專精使用。醒目提示暴雪戰鬥助手建議的下一個法術，這是在至暗之夜的戰鬥中，遊戲仍允許插件讀取的唯一循環建議；你施法或引導時它會等待。同時提醒戰鬥助手留給你處理的部分：戰鬥中的惡魔化身與獵殺追擊、擁有慣性或能量全開時使用蠻恨撤離、對可中斷的施法使用干擾，以及生命力低於 35% 時使用殘影。敵人的施法與你的生命力在戰鬥中會被隱藏，因此這兩項只會在遊戲顯示它們的場合亮起。移動、黑暗與飾品由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Demon Hunter: Havoc reference (Retail, Icy Veins, SimulationCraft and Wowhead)"
L["Default.Retail.DemonHunter.HavocGuide.Name"] = "惡魔獵人：災虐參考（正式版，Icy Veins、SimulationCraft 與 Wowhead）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: the guides' Havoc priority. Fury, your procs, Metamorphosis and Essence Break are hidden from addons in Midnight combat, so this list cannot run there; read it, or clone it to experiment. Aldrachi Reaver: Reaver's Glaive when neither Rending Strike nor Glaive Flurry is up, Chaos Strike on Rending Strike. Fel-Scarred: Essence Break, Blade Dance and Chaos Strike in Metamorphosis. Then Blade Dance and Chaos Strike inside Essence Break, Immolation Aura at two charges, Eye Beam, Felblade for Inertia, Essence Break when Eye Beam is over 4 seconds away, Blade Dance, Immolation Aura on two enemies, Chaos Strike, Felblade, Immolation Aura, Throw Glaive, Fel Rush. Reminders: Metamorphosis once Eye Beam and Blade Dance are spent, The Hunt, Vengeful Retreat, plus Disrupt and Blur."
L["Default.Retail.DemonHunter.HavocGuide.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：指南中的災虐優先順序。在至暗之夜的戰鬥中，狂怒值、你的觸發效果、惡魔化身與精華破斬都對插件隱藏，因此這份清單無法在戰鬥中運作；可以閱讀它，或複製後自行實驗。奧達奇劫奪者：撕裂打擊與戰刃亂舞都未生效時使用斬掠戰刃，撕裂打擊生效時使用混沌之擊。魔痕：惡魔化身期間使用精華破斬、劍刃之舞與混沌之擊。接著在精華破斬期間使用劍刃之舞與混沌之擊，兩層充能時使用獻祭光環，魔眼光束，使用魔刃觸發慣性，魔眼光束還有 4 秒以上才就緒時使用精華破斬，劍刃之舞，面對兩個敵人時使用獻祭光環，混沌之擊，魔刃，獻祭光環，投擲戰刃，魔化衝刺。提醒：魔眼光束與劍刃之舞都用完後使用惡魔化身、獵殺追擊、蠻恨撤離，以及干擾與殘影。"
-- en: "Demon Hunter: Vengeance (Retail, Blizzard Assisted)"
L["Default.Retail.DemonHunter.Vengeance.Name"] = "惡魔獵人：復仇（正式版，暴雪戰鬥助手）"
-- en: "Recommended for Vengeance. Highlights the spell Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggests next, the one rotation advice the game still lets an addon read in Midnight combat; it waits while you cast or channel. Alongside it, reminders for what the assistant leaves to you: Demon Spikes, Fiery Brand, Fel Devastation and Metamorphosis whenever they are ready in combat, Disrupt on an interruptible cast and Blur below 35% health. Enemy casts and your health are hidden in combat, so those two light only where the game shows them. Infernal Strike, Darkness, taunts and trinkets stay with you."
L["Default.Retail.DemonHunter.Vengeance.Description"] = "推薦復仇專精使用。醒目提示暴雪戰鬥助手建議的下一個法術，這是在至暗之夜的戰鬥中，遊戲仍允許插件讀取的唯一循環建議；你施法或引導時它會等待。同時提醒戰鬥助手留給你處理的部分：戰鬥中一旦就緒就使用的惡魔尖刺、熾炎烙印、魔化破滅與惡魔化身、對可中斷的施法使用干擾，以及生命力低於 35% 時使用殘影。敵人的施法與你的生命力在戰鬥中會被隱藏，因此這兩項只會在遊戲顯示它們的場合亮起。煉獄轟擊、黑暗、嘲諷與飾品由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Demon Hunter: Vengeance reference (Retail, Wowhead and Icy Veins)"
L["Default.Retail.DemonHunter.VengeanceGuide.Name"] = "惡魔獵人：復仇參考（正式版，Wowhead 與 Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: Wowhead's Vengeance order with Icy Veins' hero-tree goals. Fury and your buffs are hidden in Midnight combat, so it cannot run there. Aldrachi Reaver: Reaver's Glaive, Fracture on Rending Strike, Soul Cleave on Glaive Flurry. Then Fracture at full charges, Spirit Bomb on three or more enemies, Immolation Aura, Sigil of Flame, Soul Cleave against one target, Fel Devastation at 50 Fury, Soul Cleave, Fracture and Felblade without capping Fury, Throw Glaive. Rotation Master cannot count Soul Fragments, so Spirit Bomb follows the enemy count. Reminders: Demon Spikes when it is down, Metamorphosis, Fiery Brand, Sigil of Spite, Soul Carver (Infernal Strike at two charges is off), plus Disrupt and Blur."
L["Default.Retail.DemonHunter.VengeanceGuide.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：Wowhead 的復仇施放順序，並採用 Icy Veins 的英雄天賦目標。狂怒值與你的增益效果在至暗之夜的戰鬥中會被隱藏，因此它無法在戰鬥中運作。奧達奇劫奪者：斬掠戰刃，撕裂打擊生效時使用切裂，戰刃亂舞生效時使用破魂斬。接著充能已滿時使用切裂，三個以上敵人時使用靈魂炸彈，獻祭光環，火焰符印，單一目標時使用破魂斬，狂怒值達到 50 時使用魔化破滅，破魂斬，在不溢出狂怒值的前提下使用切裂與魔刃，投擲戰刃。Rotation Master 無法計算靈魂碎片的數量，因此靈魂炸彈依敵人數量判斷。提醒：惡魔尖刺未生效時使用惡魔尖刺、惡魔化身、熾炎烙印、忿恨符印、靈魂屠夫（兩層充能時的煉獄轟擊提醒為關閉狀態），以及干擾與殘影。"
-- en: "Demon Hunter: Vengeance reference (Retail, SimulationCraft)"
L["Default.Retail.DemonHunter.VengeanceSimc.Name"] = "惡魔獵人：復仇參考（正式版，SimulationCraft）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: SimulationCraft's Vengeance lists. Hidden combat data keeps it from running in Midnight combat. Aldrachi Reaver: Sigil of Flame and Immolation Aura first, Metamorphosis, the Reaver's Glaive cycle with Felblade, Fiery Brand, Sigil of Spite, Spirit Bomb on packs, Fel Devastation above 85 Fury, Soul Carver in Fiery Demise, then Fracture, Soul Cleave, Felblade, Fel Devastation. Annihilator: spend a ready Voidfall with Spirit Bomb or Soul Cleave, Fracture at two Voidfall stacks, Metamorphosis, Spirit Bomb, Sigil of Spite, Fracture at full charges, Immolation Aura, Sigil of Flame, Fracture under 40 Fury, Soul Cleave, Felblade, Throw Glaive. Reminders: Demon Spikes, Disrupt, Blur."
L["Default.Retail.DemonHunter.VengeanceSimc.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：SimulationCraft 的復仇清單。由於戰鬥資料被隱藏，它無法在至暗之夜的戰鬥中運作。奧達奇劫奪者：先使用火焰符印與獻祭光環，惡魔化身，搭配魔刃的斬掠戰刃循環，熾炎烙印，忿恨符印，對成群敵人使用靈魂炸彈，狂怒值高於 85 時使用魔化破滅，熾炎焚身期間使用靈魂屠夫，然後是切裂、破魂斬、魔刃、魔化破滅。殲滅者：虛墜就緒時以靈魂炸彈或破魂斬消耗它，虛墜達到兩層時使用切裂，惡魔化身，靈魂炸彈，忿恨符印，充能已滿時使用切裂，獻祭光環，火焰符印，狂怒值低於 40 時使用切裂，破魂斬，魔刃，投擲戰刃。提醒：惡魔尖刺、干擾、殘影。"
-- en: "Demon Hunter: Devourer (Retail, Blizzard Assisted)"
L["Default.Retail.DemonHunter.Devourer.Name"] = "惡魔獵人：噬滅（正式版，暴雪戰鬥助手）"
-- en: "Recommended for Devourer. Highlights the spell Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggests next, the one rotation advice the game still lets an addon read in Midnight combat; it waits while you cast or channel Void Ray. Alongside it, reminders for what the assistant leaves to you: Void Metamorphosis, The Hunt and Voidblade whenever they are ready in combat, Disrupt on an interruptible cast and Blur below 35% health. Enemy casts and your health are hidden in combat, so those two light only where the game shows them."
L["Default.Retail.DemonHunter.Devourer.Description"] = "推薦噬滅專精使用。醒目提示暴雪戰鬥助手建議的下一個法術，這是在至暗之夜的戰鬥中，遊戲仍允許插件讀取的唯一循環建議；你施法或引導虛無射線時它會等待。同時提醒戰鬥助手留給你處理的部分：戰鬥中一旦就緒就使用的虛無惡魔化身、獵殺追擊與虛無之刃、對可中斷的施法使用干擾，以及生命力低於 35% 時使用殘影。敵人的施法與你的生命力在戰鬥中會被隱藏，因此這兩項只會在遊戲顯示它們的場合亮起。"
-- en: "Demon Hunter: Devourer reference (Retail, Icy Veins)"
L["Default.Retail.DemonHunter.DevourerGuide.Name"] = "惡魔獵人：噬滅參考（正式版，Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: Icy Veins' Annihilator priority. Fury and most of your buffs are hidden in Midnight combat, so it cannot run there. Outside Void Metamorphosis: Consume on Soulburst, Reap, Soul Immolation when it is not burning, Voidblade and The Hunt once Void Metamorphosis is ready, Void Metamorphosis, Hungering Slash, Void Ray at 100 Fury, Consume. Inside it: Devour on Soulburst, Void Ray, the Void-Scarred strikes if you have them, Collapsing Star, Cull, Devour, Soul Immolation. Rotation Master cannot count Soul Fragments, so Reap and Cull go on cooldown. Reminders: Disrupt and Blur."
L["Default.Retail.DemonHunter.DevourerGuide.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：Icy Veins 的殲滅者優先順序。狂怒值與你大部分的增益效果在至暗之夜的戰鬥中會被隱藏，因此它無法在戰鬥中運作。虛無惡魔化身以外：靈魂驟發觸發時使用吞噬，收割，靈魂獻祭未在燃燒時使用靈魂獻祭，虛無惡魔化身就緒後使用虛無之刃與獵殺追擊，虛無惡魔化身，飢渴斬擊，狂怒值達到 100 時使用虛無射線，吞噬。虛無惡魔化身期間：靈魂驟發觸發時使用吞滅，虛無射線，若你有虛無之痕的打擊技能就使用它們，崩陷之星，天擇，吞滅，靈魂獻祭。Rotation Master 無法計算靈魂碎片的數量，因此收割與天擇冷卻結束就使用。提醒：干擾與殘影。"
-- en: "Demon Hunter: Devourer reference (Retail, SimulationCraft)"
L["Default.Retail.DemonHunter.DevourerSimc.Name"] = "惡魔獵人：噬滅參考（正式版，SimulationCraft）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: SimulationCraft's Annihilator list, which enters Void Metamorphosis as soon as it is ready. Hidden combat data keeps it from running in Midnight combat. Outside: Voidblade with Devourer's Bite on up to three enemies and a full Void Metamorphosis, Void Metamorphosis, Consume on Soulburst, Reap, Void Ray, Soul Immolation on packs, Consume. Inside: Devour on Soulburst against one target, The Hunt and Voidblade with Devourer's Bite, Void Ray on packs, Collapsing Star, Cull, Void Ray, Soul Immolation, Devour. Reminders: Disrupt and Blur."
L["Default.Retail.DemonHunter.DevourerSimc.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：SimulationCraft 的殲滅者清單，虛無惡魔化身一就緒就進入。由於戰鬥資料被隱藏，它無法在至暗之夜的戰鬥中運作。變身以外：敵人不超過三個且虛無惡魔化身已蓄滿時，搭配噬滅之咬使用虛無之刃，虛無惡魔化身，靈魂驟發觸發時使用吞噬，收割，虛無射線，對成群敵人使用靈魂獻祭，吞噬。變身期間：單一目標時靈魂驟發觸發則使用吞滅，搭配噬滅之咬使用獵殺追擊與虛無之刃，對成群敵人使用虛無射線，崩陷之星，天擇，虛無射線，靈魂獻祭，吞滅。提醒：干擾與殘影。"
-- en: "Druid: Balance (Retail, Blizzard Assisted)"
L["Default.Retail.Druid.Balance.Name"] = "德魯伊：平衡（正式版，暴雪戰鬥助手）"
-- en: "Recommended for Balance. Highlights the spell Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggests next, the one rotation advice the game still lets an addon read in Midnight combat; it waits while you cast or channel. Alongside it, reminders for what Assisted Combat leaves to you: Celestial Alignment (or Incarnation) in combat, Solar Beam on an interruptible cast, Moonkin Form and Mark of the Wild between pulls, Barkskin below 35% health, and your racial cooldown. Enemy casts and your health are hidden in combat, so Solar Beam and Barkskin light only where the game shows them."
L["Default.Retail.Druid.Balance.Description"] = "推薦平衡專精使用。醒目提示暴雪戰鬥助手建議的下一個法術，這是在至暗之夜的戰鬥中，遊戲仍允許插件讀取的唯一循環建議；你施法或引導時它會等待。同時提醒戰鬥助手留給你處理的部分：戰鬥中的星穹連線（或化身）、對可中斷的施法使用太陽光束、兩波拉怪之間的梟獸形態與野性印記、生命力低於 35% 時使用樹皮術，以及你的種族冷卻技能。敵人的施法與你的生命力在戰鬥中會被隱藏，因此太陽光束與樹皮術只會在遊戲顯示它們的場合亮起。"
-- en: "Druid: Balance reference (Retail, Icy Veins, SimulationCraft and Wowhead)"
L["Default.Retail.Druid.BalanceGuide.Name"] = "德魯伊：平衡參考（正式版，Icy Veins、SimulationCraft 與 Wowhead）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: the guides' Balance priority. Your DoTs, Eclipse, procs and Astral Power are hidden from addons in Midnight combat, so it cannot run there; read it, or clone it to experiment. Pulls with Moonkin Form and Wrath. Sunfire and Moonfire when missing or about to fall off; Eclipse when neither is active (Lunar on three or more enemies, Solar otherwise); Starfall on Starweaver's Warp, Touch the Cosmos or packs; Starsurge before Astral Power caps or on Starweaver's Weft; New, Half and Full Moon; Wild Mushroom in an Eclipse; Starfire in a Lunar Eclipse or on packs, else Wrath. Reminders: Celestial Alignment or Incarnation, Fury of Elune and Force of Nature before an Eclipse, Convoke in Celestial Alignment under 40 Astral Power, Solar Beam, plus the utility reminders."
L["Default.Retail.Druid.BalanceGuide.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：指南中的平衡優先順序。在至暗之夜的戰鬥中，你的持續傷害效果、蝕星蔽月、觸發效果與星能都對插件隱藏，因此它無法在戰鬥中運作；可以閱讀它，或複製後自行實驗。以梟獸形態與憤怒拉怪。日炎術與月火術消失或即將消失時補上；兩種蝕星蔽月都未生效時觸發蝕星蔽月（三個以上敵人時觸發月蝕，否則觸發日蝕）；織星者的經線、觸及寰宇觸發或面對成群敵人時使用星殞術；星能溢出前或織星者的緯線觸發時使用星湧術；新月、半月與滿月；蝕星蔽月期間使用狂野蘑菇；月蝕期間或面對成群敵人時使用星火術，否則使用憤怒。提醒：星穹連線或化身、在蝕星蔽月之前使用伊露恩之怒與自然之力、星穹連線期間星能低於 40 時使用召集魂靈、太陽光束，以及功能性提醒。"
-- en: "Druid: Feral (Retail, Blizzard Assisted)"
L["Default.Retail.Druid.Feral.Name"] = "德魯伊：野性戰鬥（正式版，暴雪戰鬥助手）"
-- en: "Recommended for Feral. Highlights the spell Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggests next, the one rotation advice the game still lets an addon read in Midnight combat; it waits while you cast or channel. Alongside it, reminders for what Assisted Combat leaves to you: Berserk (or Incarnation) in combat, Skull Bash on an interruptible cast, Survival Instincts and Barkskin below 35% health, Cat Form and Mark of the Wild between pulls, and your racial cooldown. Enemy casts and your health are hidden in combat, so the interrupt and defensives light only where the game shows them."
L["Default.Retail.Druid.Feral.Description"] = "推薦野性戰鬥專精使用。醒目提示暴雪戰鬥助手建議的下一個法術，這是在至暗之夜的戰鬥中，遊戲仍允許插件讀取的唯一循環建議；你施法或引導時它會等待。同時提醒戰鬥助手留給你處理的部分：戰鬥中的狂暴（或化身）、對可中斷的施法使用碎顱猛擊、生命力低於 35% 時使用求生本能與樹皮術、兩波拉怪之間的獵豹形態與野性印記，以及你的種族冷卻技能。敵人的施法與你的生命力在戰鬥中會被隱藏，因此中斷與防禦技能的提醒只會在遊戲顯示它們的場合亮起。"
-- en: "Druid: Feral reference (Retail, Icy Veins and SimulationCraft)"
L["Default.Retail.Druid.FeralGuide.Name"] = "德魯伊：野性戰鬥參考（正式版，Icy Veins 與 SimulationCraft）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: the guides' Feral priority. Bleeds, procs and energy are hidden in Midnight combat (combo points are not), so it cannot run there. Opens with Cat Form, Prowl and Rake. Chomp; Ferocious Bite on Apex Predator's Craving; at five combo points Primal Wrath on two or more enemies, Rip when missing or in its last seconds, else Ferocious Bite, waiting for energy rather than building past five; below five, Rake when missing or about to fall off, Lunar Inspiration Moonfire, Swipe on three or more enemies, Shred. Reminders: Tiger's Fury at five points or 50 energy below the cap, Berserk or Incarnation and Feral or Frantic Frenzy (at two points or fewer) in Tiger's Fury, Convoke in Tiger's Fury and Berserk with Rip up, Skull Bash, Survival Instincts, plus the utility reminders. Snapshotting is left to you."
L["Default.Retail.Druid.FeralGuide.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：指南中的野性戰鬥優先順序。流血效果、觸發效果與能量在至暗之夜的戰鬥中會被隱藏（連擊點數不會），因此它無法在戰鬥中運作。以獵豹形態、潛行與掃擊開場。咬嚼；至尊掠食者的渴望觸發時使用兇猛撕咬；五個連擊點數時：兩個以上敵人使用原始憤怒，撕扯消失或只剩最後幾秒時使用撕扯，否則使用兇猛撕咬，寧可等待能量也不要累積超過五點；不足五點時：掃擊消失或即將消失時使用掃擊，月之鼓舞的月火術，三個以上敵人時使用揮擊，撕碎。提醒：五個連擊點數或能量低於上限 50 點時使用猛虎之怒、猛虎之怒期間使用狂暴或化身以及野性狂亂或狂上加狂（連擊點數不超過兩點時）、猛虎之怒與狂暴期間且撕扯生效時使用召集魂靈、碎顱猛擊、求生本能，以及功能性提醒。流血效果的快照時機由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Druid: Guardian (Retail, Blizzard Assisted)"
L["Default.Retail.Druid.Guardian.Name"] = "德魯伊：守護者（正式版，暴雪戰鬥助手）"
-- en: "Recommended for Guardian. Highlights the spell Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggests next, the one rotation advice the game still lets an addon read in Midnight combat; Assisted Combat plays for damage only. Alongside it, reminders for what it leaves to you: Berserk (or Incarnation) and Convoke the Spirits in combat, Ironfur whenever it is ready in combat, Frenzied Regeneration below half health, Survival Instincts and Barkskin below 35%, Skull Bash on an interruptible cast, Bear Form and Mark of the Wild between pulls, and your racial cooldown. Your health and enemy casts are hidden in combat, so those reminders light only where the game shows them; rage is hidden too, so Ironfur cannot wait for a rage threshold."
L["Default.Retail.Druid.Guardian.Description"] = "推薦守護者專精使用。醒目提示暴雪戰鬥助手建議的下一個法術，這是在至暗之夜的戰鬥中，遊戲仍允許插件讀取的唯一循環建議；戰鬥助手只考慮傷害輸出。同時提醒它留給你處理的部分：戰鬥中的狂暴（或化身）與召集魂靈、戰鬥中一旦就緒就使用鋼鐵毛皮、生命力低於一半時使用狂暴恢復、低於 35% 時使用求生本能與樹皮術、對可中斷的施法使用碎顱猛擊、兩波拉怪之間的熊形態與野性印記，以及你的種族冷卻技能。你的生命力與敵人的施法在戰鬥中會被隱藏，因此這些提醒只會在遊戲顯示它們的場合亮起；怒氣同樣會被隱藏，因此鋼鐵毛皮無法等待怒氣達到門檻。"
-- en: "Druid: Guardian reference (Retail, Icy Veins and Wowhead)"
L["Default.Retail.Druid.GuardianGuide.Name"] = "德魯伊：守護者參考（正式版，Icy Veins 與 Wowhead）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: the guides' Guardian priority. Rage, debuffs, procs and health are hidden in Midnight combat, so it cannot run there. Thrash and Mangle on cooldown, Red Moon on a single target, Moonfire when missing or on Galactic Guardian, Raze or Maul above 80 rage, Swipe. Reminders: Bear Form, Ironfur at 40 rage, Frenzied Regeneration, Survival Instincts, Berserk or Incarnation, Lunar Beam, Convoke, Heart of the Wild, Skull Bash, plus the utility reminders."
L["Default.Retail.Druid.GuardianGuide.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：指南中的守護者優先順序。怒氣、減益效果、觸發效果與生命力在至暗之夜的戰鬥中會被隱藏，因此它無法在戰鬥中運作。痛擊與割碎冷卻結束就使用，單一目標時使用紅月，月火術消失或星河守護者觸發時使用月火術，怒氣高於 80 時使用抹除或槌擊，揮擊。提醒：熊形態、怒氣達到 40 時使用鋼鐵毛皮、狂暴恢復、求生本能、狂暴或化身、月之光、召集魂靈、野性之心、碎顱猛擊，以及功能性提醒。"
-- en: "Druid: Guardian defensive reference (Retail, SimulationCraft)"
L["Default.Retail.Druid.GuardianSimc.Name"] = "德魯伊：守護者防禦型參考（正式版，SimulationCraft）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: SimulationCraft's Guardian list, which spends rage on Ironfur first. Hidden combat data keeps it from running in Midnight combat. Ironfur at 40 rage or in Berserk; Thrash when missing, about to fall off or under three stacks; Maul on Gory Fur; Thrash on three or more enemies; Mangle while Red Moon ticks; Red Moon; Maul at 90 rage; Mangle below the rage cap; Thrash; Moonfire; Swipe. Its cat-form weaving is left out. Reminders: Bear Form, Frenzied Regeneration, Survival Instincts, Berserk or Incarnation, Lunar Beam, Convoke, Skull Bash, plus the utility reminders."
L["Default.Retail.Druid.GuardianSimc.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：SimulationCraft 的守護者清單，優先把怒氣花在鋼鐵毛皮上。由於戰鬥資料被隱藏，它無法在至暗之夜的戰鬥中運作。怒氣達到 40 或狂暴期間使用鋼鐵毛皮；痛擊消失、即將消失或少於三層時使用痛擊；瀝血毛皮觸發時使用槌擊；三個以上敵人時使用痛擊；紅月造成傷害期間使用割碎；紅月；怒氣達到 90 時使用槌擊；怒氣未滿時使用割碎；痛擊；月火術；揮擊。其中穿插獵豹形態的部分未包含在內。提醒：熊形態、狂暴恢復、求生本能、狂暴或化身、月之光、召集魂靈、碎顱猛擊，以及功能性提醒。"
-- en: "Druid: Restoration (Retail)"
L["Default.Retail.Druid.Restoration.Name"] = "德魯伊：恢復（正式版）"
-- en: "Recommended for Restoration. With an enemy targeted it highlights Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggestion, Blizzard's Restoration damage list in cat or caster form. Otherwise it suggests Icy Veins' maintenance casts on your friendly target (or yourself): Lifebloom, Efflorescence in combat, Swiftmend on a Rejuvenation below 70% health, Wild Growth when three allies nearby are below 85%, Regrowth on Clearcasting or five Abundance stacks, Rejuvenation. Ally health and your heals over time are hidden from addons in Midnight combat, so in combat those healing steps stay dark; whom to heal, and every healing cooldown, is yours. Reminders: Innervate below 75% mana, Mark of the Wild, Barkskin and your racial cooldown."
L["Default.Retail.Druid.Restoration.Description"] = "推薦恢復專精使用。選取敵人時，它會醒目提示暴雪戰鬥助手的建議，也就是暴雪為恢復專精設計的獵豹形態或人形傷害清單。否則，它會對你的友方目標（或你自己）建議 Icy Veins 的維持性施法：生命之花、戰鬥中使用生命綻放、對生命力低於 70% 且有回春術的目標使用迅癒、附近有三名盟友生命力低於 85% 時使用野性痊癒、節能施法觸發或豐足達到五層時使用癒合、回春術。在至暗之夜的戰鬥中，盟友的生命力與你的持續治療效果都對插件隱藏，因此戰鬥中這些治療步驟不會亮起；要治療誰以及所有治療冷卻技能都由你決定。提醒：法力低於 75% 時使用啟動、野性印記、樹皮術以及你的種族冷卻技能。"
-- en: "Evoker: Devastation (Retail, Blizzard Assisted)"
L["Default.Retail.Evoker.Devastation.Name"] = "喚能師：破滅（正式版，暴雪戰鬥助手）"
-- en: "Recommended for Devastation. Highlights the spell Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggests next, the one rotation advice the game still lets an addon read in Midnight combat; it waits while you cast, channel Disintegrate or hold an empowered spell. Choosing the empower rank is up to you. Alongside it, reminders in combat for Dragonrage, Deep Breath and Tip the Scales, Quell on an interruptible cast and Obsidian Scales below 35% health, and out of combat Blessing of the Bronze when it is missing and Source of Magic on a friendly target in your group. Enemy casts and your health are hidden in combat, so Quell and Obsidian Scales light only where the game shows them."
L["Default.Retail.Evoker.Devastation.Description"] = "推薦破滅專精使用。醒目提示暴雪戰鬥助手建議的下一個法術，這是在至暗之夜的戰鬥中，遊戲仍允許插件讀取的唯一循環建議；你施法、引導崩解或按住蓄力法術時它會等待。蓄力等級由你自行選擇。同時，戰鬥中會提醒龍之怒、深層吐息與攪亂均勢，對可中斷的施法使用壓制，生命力低於 35% 時使用黑曜鱗片；脫戰時會在缺少青銅龍的祝福時提醒施放，並提醒對隊伍中的友方目標施放魔力之源。敵人的施法與你的生命力在戰鬥中會被隱藏，因此壓制與黑曜鱗片只會在遊戲顯示它們的場合亮起。"
-- en: "Evoker: Devastation reference (Retail, SimulationCraft and Icy Veins)"
L["Default.Retail.Evoker.DevastationGuide.Name"] = "喚能師：破滅參考（正式版，SimulationCraft 與 Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: the optimal Devastation priority. Procs, cooldowns and the target's burn are hidden in Midnight combat, so it cannot run there; read it, or clone it to experiment. Pulls with Living Flame. Scalecommander (Mass Disintegrate known): Eternity Surge, Fire Breath, Deep Breath on two or more enemies, Disintegrate with Mass Disintegrate charges, Pyre on five or more, Disintegrate, Living Flame on Burnout with Leaping Flames, Unbound Flame below two Essence Bursts, Azure Sweep. Flameshaper: Eternity Surge, Fire Breath when its burn is missing or ending, Pyre on five or more, Disintegrate, Deep Breath on four or more, Unbound Flame, Living Flame on Burnout with Leaping Flames, Azure Sweep. Then Azure Strike while moving, Living Flame, Azure Strike. Use empowers at rank 1 on one target (Icy Veins). Reminders: Dragonrage, Tip the Scales in Dragonrage or with Fire Breath ready, Deep Breath for Scalecommander, plus the utility reminders."
L["Default.Retail.Evoker.DevastationGuide.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：最佳的破滅優先順序。觸發效果、冷卻與目標身上的燃燒效果在至暗之夜的戰鬥中會被隱藏，因此它無法在戰鬥中運作；可以閱讀它，或複製後自行實驗。以生命烈焰拉怪。龍隊指揮官（已學會集體崩解）：永恆奔騰，火焰之息，兩個以上敵人時使用深層吐息，有集體崩解充能時使用崩解，五個以上敵人時使用龍焰，崩解，有跳躍火焰時在燃盡觸發時使用生命烈焰，龍能爆發少於兩層時使用無縛烈焰，蒼藍掃擊。塑火者：永恆奔騰，火焰之息的燃燒效果消失或即將結束時使用火焰之息，五個以上敵人時使用龍焰，崩解，四個以上敵人時使用深層吐息，無縛烈焰，有跳躍火焰時在燃盡觸發時使用生命烈焰，蒼藍掃擊。接著移動中使用蒼藍打擊，生命烈焰，蒼藍打擊。單一目標時蓄力法術使用 1 級（Icy Veins）。提醒：龍之怒、在龍之怒期間或火焰之息就緒時使用攪亂均勢、龍隊指揮官使用深層吐息，以及功能性提醒。"
-- en: "Evoker: Augmentation (Retail, Icy Veins)"
L["Default.Retail.Evoker.Augmentation.Name"] = "喚能師：強化（正式版，Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Recommended for Augmentation: Icy Veins' Ebon Might priority. Ebon Might is one of the few buffs the game still shows addons in Midnight combat, so its upkeep works there. Out of combat: Blistering Scales on a friendly group target without it, Living Flame on an enemy. Then Ebon Might when missing or under 4 seconds, and on cooldown unless Breath of Eons is ready; Prescience; Fire Breath; Upheaval; Eruption in Ebon Might or with two Essence Bursts; Azure Strike; Living Flame. Hidden buffs only skip their own step in combat. Reminders: Breath of Eons and Deep Breath (you aim them), Tip the Scales with Fire Breath ready, Time Skip with Fire Breath and Upheaval both cooling, plus the utility reminders. Prescience and Blistering Scales go on your target: choosing the ally, and the empower rank, is up to you."
L["Default.Retail.Evoker.Augmentation.Description"] = "推薦強化專精使用：Icy Veins 的黯黑力量優先順序。黯黑力量是至暗之夜戰鬥中遊戲仍向插件顯示的少數增益效果之一，因此在戰鬥中也能維持它。脫戰時：對沒有極熾鱗片的友方隊伍目標施放極熾鱗片，對敵人使用生命烈焰。接著黯黑力量消失或剩餘不到 4 秒時使用黯黑力量，除非亙古吐息已就緒，否則冷卻結束就使用；先見；火焰之息；地裂崩引；黯黑力量期間或有兩層龍能爆發時使用爆發；蒼藍打擊；生命烈焰。被隱藏的增益效果在戰鬥中只會跳過各自的步驟。提醒：亙古吐息與深層吐息（由你瞄準）、火焰之息就緒時使用攪亂均勢、火焰之息與地裂崩引都在冷卻時使用時間跳躍，以及功能性提醒。先見與極熾鱗片會施放在你的目標上：要選擇哪位盟友以及蓄力等級都由你決定。"
-- en: "Evoker: Augmentation (Retail, Blizzard Assisted)"
L["Default.Retail.Evoker.AugmentationAssisted.Name"] = "喚能師：強化（正式版，暴雪戰鬥助手）"
-- en: "An alternative to the Icy Veins Augmentation premade: enable or prefer it to follow Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggestion instead, which recasts Ebon Might only after it has fallen off. It waits while you cast or hold an empowered spell. Reminders in combat for Breath of Eons, Deep Breath, Tip the Scales and Time Skip, plus Quell, Obsidian Scales, Blessing of the Bronze and Source of Magic as in the other Evoker premades."
L["Default.Retail.Evoker.AugmentationAssisted.Description"] = "Icy Veins 強化內建循環的替代方案：啟用它或將它設為優先，即可改為遵循暴雪戰鬥助手的建議；後者只會在黯黑力量消失後才重新施放。你施法或按住蓄力法術時它會等待。戰鬥中提醒亙古吐息、深層吐息、攪亂均勢與時間跳躍，以及與其他喚能師內建循環相同的壓制、黑曜鱗片、青銅龍的祝福與魔力之源。"
-- en: "Evoker: Preservation reference (Retail, Icy Veins)"
L["Default.Retail.Evoker.Preservation.Name"] = "喚能師：護存參考（正式版，Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default. Ally health, Echo, Reversion, Essence Burst and every cooldown are hidden from addons in Midnight combat, Rotation Master cannot choose whom to heal, and Blizzard has no Assisted Combat rotation for healers, so this premade does not heal. It reminds you of Blessing of the Bronze and Source of Magic out of combat, and when your target is an enemy it suggests damage: Fire Breath, Disintegrate, Living Flame, and Azure Strike while moving. Quell and Obsidian Scales reminders as in the other Evoker premades. Healing stays with you."
L["Default.Retail.Evoker.Preservation.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉。在至暗之夜的戰鬥中，盟友的生命力、回音、逆轉、龍能爆發與所有冷卻都對插件隱藏，Rotation Master 無法決定要治療誰，而暴雪也沒有為治療者提供戰鬥助手循環，因此這個內建循環不會進行治療。它會在脫戰時提醒你青銅龍的祝福與魔力之源；當你的目標是敵人時，它會建議傷害技能：火焰之息、崩解、生命烈焰，以及移動中使用蒼藍打擊。壓制與黑曜鱗片的提醒與其他喚能師內建循環相同。治療由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Hunter: Beast Mastery (Retail, Blizzard Assisted)"
L["Default.Retail.Hunter.BeastMastery.Name"] = "獵人：野獸控制（正式版，暴雪戰鬥助手）"
-- en: "Recommended for Beast Mastery. Highlights the spell Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggests next, the one rotation advice the game still lets an addon read in Midnight combat (it calls your pet itself); it waits while you cast or channel. Alongside it, reminders for what Assisted Combat leaves to you: Bloodshed and your racial cooldown in combat, Counter Shot on an interruptible cast, Survival of the Fittest below 50% health, Exhilaration below 35% and Aspect of the Turtle below 20%. Enemy casts and your health are hidden in combat, so the interrupt and defensives light only where the game shows them. Trinkets, Misdirection and pet care stay with you."
L["Default.Retail.Hunter.BeastMastery.Description"] = "推薦野獸控制專精使用。醒目提示暴雪戰鬥助手建議的下一個法術，這是在至暗之夜的戰鬥中，遊戲仍允許插件讀取的唯一循環建議（它會自行召喚寵物）；你施法或引導時它會等待。同時提醒戰鬥助手留給你處理的部分：戰鬥中的濺血與你的種族冷卻技能、對可中斷的施法使用駁火反擊、生命力低於 50% 時使用適者生存、低於 35% 時使用心曠神怡、低於 20% 時使用巨龜守護。敵人的施法與你的生命力在戰鬥中會被隱藏，因此中斷與防禦技能的提醒只會在遊戲顯示它們的場合亮起。飾品、誤導與寵物照料由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Hunter: Beast Mastery reference (Retail, SimulationCraft and Icy Veins)"
L["Default.Retail.Hunter.BeastMasteryGuide.Name"] = "獵人：野獸控制參考（正式版，SimulationCraft 與 Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: the optimized Beast Mastery priority. Charges, cooldowns and procs are hidden from addons in Midnight combat, so it cannot run there; read it, or clone it to experiment. Focus is hidden on Retail. Calls your pet, marks the target before the pull. Barbed Shot just before Bestial Wrath or before it caps; Bestial Wrath; Kill Command on Howl of the Pack Leader or Nature's Ally, or freely while Bestial Wrath is far off; Cobra Shot on Cobra Fang; Cobra Shot; Barbed Shot when Cobra Shot is unaffordable. Dark Ranger: Black Arrow during Withering Fire and Wailing Arrow as it ends. Three or more enemies (two with Beast Cleave): Wild Thrash to start Beast Cleave, then Kill Command, Barbed Shot and Cobra Shot while it lasts. Reminders: Bloodshed and the Assisted premade's utility reminders."
L["Default.Retail.Hunter.BeastMasteryGuide.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：最佳化的野獸控制優先順序。在至暗之夜的戰鬥中，充能、冷卻與觸發效果都對插件隱藏，因此它無法在戰鬥中運作；可以閱讀它，或複製後自行實驗。正式版中集中值是隱藏的。拉怪前召喚寵物並以獵人印記標記目標。狂野怒火即將就緒前或鋒銳射擊充能將滿前使用鋒銳射擊；狂野怒火；獸群領袖狂嚎或自然盟友觸發時使用擊殺命令，狂野怒火離就緒還久時也可隨意使用；眼鏡蛇尖牙觸發時使用眼鏡蛇射擊；眼鏡蛇射擊；集中值不足以施放眼鏡蛇射擊時使用鋒銳射擊。黑暗遊俠：凋萎射擊期間使用黑蝕箭，凋萎射擊結束時使用悲鳴箭。三個以上敵人（有獸劈斬時為兩個）：使用狂野痛擊觸發獸劈斬，然後在其持續期間使用擊殺命令、鋒銳射擊與眼鏡蛇射擊。提醒：濺血以及戰鬥助手內建循環中的功能性提醒。"
-- en: "Hunter: Marksmanship (Retail, Blizzard Assisted)"
L["Default.Retail.Hunter.Marksmanship.Name"] = "獵人：射擊（正式版，暴雪戰鬥助手）"
-- en: "Recommended for Marksmanship. Highlights the spell Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggests next, the one rotation advice the game still lets an addon read in Midnight combat; it waits while you cast or channel. Alongside it, reminders for what Assisted Combat leaves to you: Trueshot and your racial cooldown in combat, Counter Shot on an interruptible cast, Survival of the Fittest below 50% health, Exhilaration below 35% and Aspect of the Turtle below 20%. Enemy casts and your health are hidden in combat, so the interrupt and defensives light only where the game shows them."
L["Default.Retail.Hunter.Marksmanship.Description"] = "推薦射擊專精使用。醒目提示暴雪戰鬥助手建議的下一個法術，這是在至暗之夜的戰鬥中，遊戲仍允許插件讀取的唯一循環建議；你施法或引導時它會等待。同時提醒戰鬥助手留給你處理的部分：戰鬥中的強擊與你的種族冷卻技能、對可中斷的施法使用駁火反擊、生命力低於 50% 時使用適者生存、低於 35% 時使用心曠神怡、低於 20% 時使用巨龜守護。敵人的施法與你的生命力在戰鬥中會被隱藏，因此中斷與防禦技能的提醒只會在遊戲顯示它們的場合亮起。"
-- en: "Hunter: Marksmanship reference (Retail, SimulationCraft and Icy Veins)"
L["Default.Retail.Hunter.MarksmanshipGuide.Name"] = "獵人：射擊參考（正式版，SimulationCraft 與 Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: the optimized Marksmanship priority, which spends Precise Shots before the next Aimed Shot. Procs and charges are hidden in Midnight combat, so it cannot run there; Focus is hidden on Retail, so the 70-Focus Multi-Shot dump on packs is left out. Marks the target and opens with Aimed Shot. Sentinel: Explosive Shot, Volley, Trueshot, Moonlight Chakram before its window ends, Aimed Shot in Trueshot without Precise Shots, Rapid Fire, Kill Shot, Multi-Shot (two enemies with Aspect of the Hydra) or Arcane Shot on Precise Shots, Aimed Shot, Moonlight Chakram, Steady Shot. Dark Ranger: Black Arrow on Precise Shots first, no Explosive Shot during Lock and Load, Aimed Shot before it caps, Wailing Arrow. Three or more enemies with Trick Shots: Explosive Shot, Volley, Multi-Shot to apply Trick Shots, Trueshot, then Rapid Fire and Aimed Shot while it lasts. Calling Trueshot for 30 Bullseye stacks or an unmarked target stays with you."
L["Default.Retail.Hunter.MarksmanshipGuide.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：最佳化的射擊優先順序，會在下一次瞄準射擊前用掉精準射擊。觸發效果與充能在至暗之夜的戰鬥中會被隱藏，因此它無法在戰鬥中運作；正式版中集中值是隱藏的，因此省略了面對成群敵人時 70 集中值的多重射擊。標記目標並以瞄準射擊開場。哨兵：爆裂射擊，箭雨，強擊，在窗口期結束前使用月光戰輪，強擊期間沒有精準射擊時使用瞄準射擊，急速射擊，擊殺射擊，精準射擊觸發時使用多重射擊（有多頭蛇守護時兩個敵人即可）或秘法射擊，瞄準射擊，月光戰輪，穩固射擊。黑暗遊俠：精準射擊觸發時優先使用黑蝕箭，蓄勢待發期間不使用爆裂射擊，瞄準射擊充能溢出前使用瞄準射擊，悲鳴箭。三個以上敵人且有花式射擊時：爆裂射擊，箭雨，使用多重射擊觸發花式射擊，強擊，然後在其持續期間使用急速射擊與瞄準射擊。為了疊滿 30 層百步穿楊或面對未標記的目標而使用強擊的時機由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Hunter: Survival (Retail, Blizzard Assisted)"
L["Default.Retail.Hunter.Survival.Name"] = "獵人：生存（正式版，暴雪戰鬥助手）"
-- en: "Recommended for Survival. Highlights the spell Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggests next, the one rotation advice the game still lets an addon read in Midnight combat (it calls your pet itself); it waits while you cast or channel. Alongside it, reminders for what Assisted Combat leaves to you: Takedown and your racial cooldown in combat, Muzzle on an interruptible cast, Survival of the Fittest below 50% health, Exhilaration below 35% and Aspect of the Turtle below 20%. Enemy casts and your health are hidden in combat, so the interrupt and defensives light only where the game shows them."
L["Default.Retail.Hunter.Survival.Description"] = "推薦生存專精使用。醒目提示暴雪戰鬥助手建議的下一個法術，這是在至暗之夜的戰鬥中，遊戲仍允許插件讀取的唯一循環建議（它會自行召喚寵物）；你施法或引導時它會等待。同時提醒戰鬥助手留給你處理的部分：戰鬥中的擊倒與你的種族冷卻技能、對可中斷的施法使用封口、生命力低於 50% 時使用適者生存、低於 35% 時使用心曠神怡、低於 20% 時使用巨龜守護。敵人的施法與你的生命力在戰鬥中會被隱藏，因此中斷與防禦技能的提醒只會在遊戲顯示它們的場合亮起。"
-- en: "Hunter: Survival reference (Retail, SimulationCraft)"
L["Default.Retail.Hunter.SurvivalGuide.Name"] = "獵人：生存參考（正式版，SimulationCraft）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: SimulationCraft's Survival priority, where Kill Command builds Tip of the Spear and Takedown, Boomstick, Wildfire Bomb and Raptor Strike spend it. Tip of the Spear, charges and Focus are hidden in Midnight combat, so it cannot run there. Calls your pet, marks the target and opens with Wildfire Bomb. Sentinel: Kill Command without Tip of the Spear, Boomstick, Wildfire Bomb on Sentinel's Mark, Kill Command before a ready Takedown, Takedown, Moonlight Chakram, Raptor Strike, then Kill Command, Wildfire Bomb and Takedown. Pack Leader: Kill Command on Howl of the Pack Leader, then Takedown, Wildfire Bomb, Boomstick and Raptor Strike with Tip of the Spear. Three or more enemies: Boomstick and Wildfire Bomb before Takedown, Raptor Swipe. Reminders: Aspect of the Eagle out of melee and the utility reminders."
L["Default.Retail.Hunter.SurvivalGuide.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：SimulationCraft 的生存優先順序：擊殺命令累積長矛之尖，擊倒、火槍、野火炸彈與猛禽一擊消耗它。長矛之尖、充能與集中值在至暗之夜的戰鬥中會被隱藏，因此它無法在戰鬥中運作。召喚寵物，以獵人印記標記目標，並以野火炸彈開場。哨兵：沒有長矛之尖時使用擊殺命令，火槍，哨兵印記觸發時使用野火炸彈，擊倒就緒前先使用擊殺命令，擊倒，月光戰輪，猛禽一擊，然後是擊殺命令、野火炸彈與擊倒。獸群領袖：獸群領袖狂嚎觸發時使用擊殺命令，然後在有長矛之尖時使用擊倒、野火炸彈、火槍與猛禽一擊。三個以上敵人時：在擊倒之前使用火槍與野火炸彈，猛禽揮擊。提醒：不在近戰範圍時使用神鷹守護以及功能性提醒。"
-- en: "Mage: Arcane (Retail, Blizzard Assisted)"
L["Default.Retail.Mage.Arcane.Name"] = "法師：秘法（正式版，暴雪戰鬥助手）"
-- en: "Recommended for Arcane. Highlights the spell Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggests next, the one rotation advice the game still lets an addon read in Midnight combat; it waits while you cast or channel. Alongside it, reminders for what Assisted Combat leaves to you: Arcane Surge in combat, Arcane Intellect out of combat, Counterspell on an interruptible cast, Prismatic Barrier below half health, Ice Block below 20% health, and your racial cooldown in combat. Enemy casts and your health are hidden in combat, so Counterspell, the barrier and Ice Block light only where the game shows them. Mirror Image, Alter Time, Blink and trinkets stay with you."
L["Default.Retail.Mage.Arcane.Description"] = "推薦秘法專精使用。醒目提示暴雪戰鬥助手建議的下一個法術，這是在至暗之夜的戰鬥中，遊戲仍允許插件讀取的唯一循環建議；你施法或引導時它會等待。同時提醒戰鬥助手留給你處理的部分：戰鬥中的秘法奔騰、脫戰時的秘法智力、對可中斷的施法使用法術反制、生命力低於一半時使用稜彩屏障、生命力低於 20% 時使用寒冰屏障，以及戰鬥中你的種族冷卻技能。敵人的施法與你的生命力在戰鬥中會被隱藏，因此法術反制、護盾與寒冰屏障只會在遊戲顯示它們的場合亮起。鏡像、時光倒轉、閃現術與飾品由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Mage: Arcane reference (Retail, Icy Veins and SimulationCraft)"
L["Default.Retail.Mage.ArcaneGuide.Name"] = "法師：秘法參考（正式版，Icy Veins 與 SimulationCraft）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: the guides' Arcane priority. Arcane Salvo, Clearcasting and mana are hidden from addons in Midnight combat (only Arcane Charges stay visible), so it cannot run there; read it, or clone it to experiment. Pulls with Arcane Blast. Sunfury: Arcane Missiles on Clearcasting below 12 Salvo, Prismatic Bolt outside Arcane Soul, Arcane Barrage at four charges with 12 Salvo and Clearcasting or 25 Salvo, or with Arcane Soul at any charge count, Prismatic Bolt, Arcane Orb below three charges, Arcane Pulse on three enemies or at no charges, Arcane Blast. Spellslinger (Splintering Sorcery known): Prismatic Bolt, Orb on packs, Barrage at 20 Salvo (only at four charges against two or more enemies), Missiles on Clearcasting below 15 Salvo, Orb and Pulse below three charges (no Pulse in Arcane Surge), Arcane Blast. Arcane Barrage when Blast cannot be cast. Reminders: Arcane Surge, Touch of the Magi after a Barrage or Prismatic Bolt in or well before Surge, Evocation below 10% mana outside Surge and Touch, Presence of Mind at no charges after a Barrage, plus the Assisted premade's reminders."
L["Default.Retail.Mage.ArcaneGuide.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：指南中的秘法優先順序。在至暗之夜的戰鬥中，秘法齊射、節能施法與法力都對插件隱藏（只有秘法充能仍然可見），因此它無法在戰鬥中運作；可以閱讀它，或複製後自行實驗。以秘法衝擊拉怪。日怒：秘法齊射低於 12 層且節能施法觸發時使用秘法飛彈，秘法靈魂以外使用稜光箭，四層秘法充能且秘法齊射達到 12 層並有節能施法或秘法齊射達到 25 層時，或秘法靈魂期間不論充能層數，使用秘法彈幕，稜光箭，秘法充能少於三層時使用秘法光球，面對三個敵人或沒有秘法充能時使用秘法脈衝，秘法衝擊。拋法者（已學會分裂魔法）：稜光箭，面對成群敵人時使用秘法光球，秘法齊射達到 20 層時使用秘法彈幕（面對兩個以上敵人時只在四層秘法充能時使用），秘法齊射低於 15 層且節能施法觸發時使用秘法飛彈，秘法充能少於三層時使用秘法光球與秘法脈衝（秘法奔騰期間不用秘法脈衝），秘法衝擊。無法施放秘法衝擊時使用秘法彈幕。提醒：秘法奔騰、在秘法奔騰期間或離秘法奔騰還久時，於秘法彈幕或稜光箭之後使用魔導師之觸、在秘法奔騰與魔導師之觸以外法力低於 10% 時使用喚醒、沒有秘法充能時在秘法彈幕之後使用氣定神閒，以及戰鬥助手內建循環中的提醒。"
-- en: "Mage: Fire (Retail, Blizzard Assisted)"
L["Default.Retail.Mage.Fire.Name"] = "法師：火焰（正式版，暴雪戰鬥助手）"
-- en: "Recommended for Fire. Highlights the spell Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggests next, the one rotation advice the game still lets an addon read in Midnight combat; it waits while you cast or channel. Alongside it, reminders for what Assisted Combat leaves to you: Combustion in combat, Arcane Intellect out of combat, Counterspell on an interruptible cast, Blazing Barrier below half health, Ice Block below 20% health, and your racial cooldown in combat. Enemy casts and your health are hidden in combat, so Counterspell, the barrier and Ice Block light only where the game shows them."
L["Default.Retail.Mage.Fire.Description"] = "推薦火焰專精使用。醒目提示暴雪戰鬥助手建議的下一個法術，這是在至暗之夜的戰鬥中，遊戲仍允許插件讀取的唯一循環建議；你施法或引導時它會等待。同時提醒戰鬥助手留給你處理的部分：戰鬥中的燃灼、脫戰時的秘法智力、對可中斷的施法使用法術反制、生命力低於一半時使用熾炎屏障、生命力低於 20% 時使用寒冰屏障，以及戰鬥中你的種族冷卻技能。敵人的施法與你的生命力在戰鬥中會被隱藏，因此法術反制、護盾與寒冰屏障只會在遊戲顯示它們的場合亮起。"
-- en: "Mage: Fire reference (Retail, Icy Veins, Wowhead and SimulationCraft)"
L["Default.Retail.Mage.FireGuide.Name"] = "法師：火焰參考（正式版，Icy Veins、Wowhead 與 SimulationCraft）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: the guides' Fire priority. Hot Streak, Heating Up, Pyroclasm and Fire Blast charges are hidden in Midnight combat, so it cannot run there. Fire Blast while a cast is finishing to turn Heating Up into Hot Streak; pulls with Pyroblast. Pyroblast (Flamestrike on four or more enemies) on Hyperthermia, Meteor, Pyroblast on Hot Streak, Fire Blast on Heating Up inside Combustion, Pyroblast on Pyroclasm, Scorch on Heat Shimmer or while moving, Fire Blast on Heating Up, then Frostfire Bolt or Fireball. Reminders: Combustion as a hard cast finishes, Blazing Barrier and the utility reminders. Waiting for Firestarter and timing Meteor into Combustion stay with you."
L["Default.Retail.Mage.FireGuide.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：指南中的火焰優先順序。焦炎之痕、升溫、終極炎爆術與火焰衝擊的充能在至暗之夜的戰鬥中會被隱藏，因此它無法在戰鬥中運作。在施法即將完成時使用火焰衝擊，把升溫轉為焦炎之痕；以炎爆術拉怪。高熱觸發時使用炎爆術（四個以上敵人時改用烈焰風暴），隕石，焦炎之痕觸發時使用炎爆術，燃灼期間升溫觸發時使用火焰衝擊，終極炎爆術觸發時使用炎爆術，搖曳火光觸發或移動中使用灼燒，升溫觸發時使用火焰衝擊，然後是霜火箭或火球術。提醒：詠唱法術即將完成時使用燃灼、熾炎屏障以及功能性提醒。等待縱火狂階段結束，以及讓隕石落在燃灼期間的時機由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Mage: Frost (Retail, Blizzard Assisted)"
L["Default.Retail.Mage.Frost.Name"] = "法師：冰霜（正式版，暴雪戰鬥助手）"
-- en: "Recommended for Frost. Highlights the spell Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggests next, the one rotation advice the game still lets an addon read in Midnight combat; it waits while you cast or channel. Alongside it, reminders for what Assisted Combat leaves to you: Summon Water Elemental when you have the talent and no elemental, Arcane Intellect out of combat, Counterspell on an interruptible cast, Ice Barrier below half health, Ice Block below 20% health, and your racial cooldown in combat. Enemy casts and your health are hidden in combat, so Counterspell, the barrier and Ice Block light only where the game shows them."
L["Default.Retail.Mage.Frost.Description"] = "推薦冰霜專精使用。醒目提示暴雪戰鬥助手建議的下一個法術，這是在至暗之夜的戰鬥中，遊戲仍允許插件讀取的唯一循環建議；你施法或引導時它會等待。同時提醒戰鬥助手留給你處理的部分：已學會天賦但沒有水元素時使用召喚水元素、脫戰時的秘法智力、對可中斷的施法使用法術反制、生命力低於一半時使用寒冰護體、生命力低於 20% 時使用寒冰屏障，以及戰鬥中你的種族冷卻技能。敵人的施法與你的生命力在戰鬥中會被隱藏，因此法術反制、護盾與寒冰屏障只會在遊戲顯示它們的場合亮起。"
-- en: "Mage: Frost reference (Retail, Icy Veins and SimulationCraft)"
L["Default.Retail.Mage.FrostGuide.Name"] = "法師：冰霜參考（正式版，Icy Veins 與 SimulationCraft）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: the guides' Frost priority for each hero tree. Procs, Freezing stacks and cooldowns are hidden in Midnight combat, so it cannot run there. Pulls with Frostfire Bolt or Frostbolt. Frostfire (Frostfire Bolt known): Glacial Spike when ready, Comet Storm on one or two enemies, Flurry on Brain Freeze without Thermal Void, Ice Lance on two Fingers of Frost, Ray of Frost, Frozen Orb, Blizzard on Freezing Rain with three enemies, Ice Lance on Fingers of Frost with Thermal Void or at twelve Freezing, Flurry, Ice Nova or Cone of Cold on five, then Glacial Spike or Frostfire Bolt. Spellslinger: Comet Storm, Flurry on Brain Freeze, Ice Lance on two Fingers, Frozen Orb, Glacial Spike when ready, Blizzard on Freezing Rain, Ice Lance on Fingers of Frost or six Freezing, Ray of Frost, Flurry, Ice Nova or Cone of Cold on four, Blizzard on seven, then Glacial Spike or Frostbolt. Ice Lance while moving. Reminders: Summon Water Elemental, Ice Barrier and the utility reminders."
L["Default.Retail.Mage.FrostGuide.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：指南中針對各英雄天賦的冰霜優先順序。觸發效果、凍結層數與冷卻在至暗之夜的戰鬥中會被隱藏，因此它無法在戰鬥中運作。以霜火箭或寒冰箭拉怪。霜火（已學會霜火箭）：冰川長槍就緒即用，一到兩個敵人時使用彗星風暴，腦部凍結觸發且沒有熱能虛空時使用冰雪紛飛，兩層冰霜之指時使用冰霜長矛，冰霜射線，冰霜之球，三個敵人且凍結之雨觸發時使用暴風雪，有熱能虛空時冰霜之指觸發或凍結達到十二層時使用冰霜長矛，冰雪紛飛，五個敵人時使用寒冰新星或冰錐術，然後是冰川長槍或霜火箭。拋法者：彗星風暴，腦部凍結觸發時使用冰雪紛飛，兩層冰霜之指時使用冰霜長矛，冰霜之球，冰川長槍就緒即用，凍結之雨觸發時使用暴風雪，冰霜之指觸發或凍結達到六層時使用冰霜長矛，冰霜射線，冰雪紛飛，四個敵人時使用寒冰新星或冰錐術，七個敵人時使用暴風雪，然後是冰川長槍或寒冰箭。移動中使用冰霜長矛。提醒：召喚水元素、寒冰護體以及功能性提醒。"
-- en: "Monk: Brewmaster (Retail, Blizzard Assisted with brews)"
L["Default.Retail.Monk.Brewmaster.Name"] = "武僧：釀酒（正式版，暴雪戰鬥助手，含絕釀技能）"
-- en: "Recommended for Brewmaster. Highlights the spell Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggests next, the one rotation advice the game still lets an addon read in Midnight combat; it waits while you cast or channel. Assisted Combat presses no brews, so, as Icy Veins advises, the brews are reminders beside it: Black Ox Brew, Invoke Niuzao, Purifying Brew, Celestial Brew or Celestial Infusion and Touch of Death light whenever they are ready in combat (Rotation Master cannot read Stagger yet, so how heavy it is stays your call). Also Spear Hand Strike on an interruptible cast, Fortifying Brew below 35% health and your racial cooldown; enemy casts and your health are hidden in combat, so those two light only where the game shows them."
L["Default.Retail.Monk.Brewmaster.Description"] = "推薦釀酒專精使用。醒目提示暴雪戰鬥助手建議的下一個法術，這是在至暗之夜的戰鬥中，遊戲仍允許插件讀取的唯一循環建議；你施法或引導時它會等待。戰鬥助手不會使用任何絕釀技能，因此依照 Icy Veins 的建議，絕釀技能以提醒的形式顯示在它旁邊：玄牛絕釀、召喚玄牛怒兆、清心絕釀、天尊絕釀或星界灌注以及幽冥掌會在戰鬥中一旦就緒就亮起（Rotation Master 目前還無法讀取醉仙緩勁，因此醉仙緩勁有多重仍由你判斷）。另外還有對可中斷的施法使用天矛鎖喉手、生命力低於 35% 時使用石形絕釀，以及你的種族冷卻技能；敵人的施法與你的生命力在戰鬥中會被隱藏，因此這兩項只會在遊戲顯示它們的場合亮起。"
-- en: "Monk: Brewmaster reference (Retail, Icy Veins)"
L["Default.Retail.Monk.BrewmasterGuide.Name"] = "武僧：釀酒參考（正式版，Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: Icy Veins' Brewmaster priority (SimulationCraft agrees in shape). Blackout Combo, Empty Barrel and charges are hidden in Midnight combat, so it cannot run there. Pulls with Keg Smash. Blackout Kick; Chi Burst (Master of Harmony); Tiger Palm on Blackout Combo; Keg Smash at full charges or with Empty Barrel; Breath of Fire; Rushing Jade Wind before Exploding Keg; Chi Burst (Shado-Pan); Keg Smash; Rushing Jade Wind and Spinning Crane Kick on three or more enemies; Tiger Palm; Expel Harm. Reminders: Black Ox Brew once Purifying and Celestial Brew are spent, Invoke Niuzao, Purifying Brew, Celestial Brew or Infusion, Touch of Death, plus the utility reminders."
L["Default.Retail.Monk.BrewmasterGuide.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：Icy Veins 的釀酒優先順序（SimulationCraft 的思路大致相同）。滅寂連打、空酒桶與充能在至暗之夜的戰鬥中會被隱藏，因此它無法在戰鬥中運作。以酒罈破拉怪。滅寂腿；真氣爆裂（和諧大師）；滅寂連打觸發時使用虎掌；充能已滿或有空酒桶時使用酒罈破；火焰吐息；在爆炸酒桶之前使用飛玉疾風；真氣爆裂（影潘）；酒罈破；三個以上敵人時使用飛玉疾風與鶴旋踢；虎掌；斗轉星移。提醒：清心絕釀與天尊絕釀都用完後使用玄牛絕釀、召喚玄牛怒兆、清心絕釀、天尊絕釀或星界灌注、幽冥掌以及功能性提醒。"
-- en: "Monk: Windwalker (Retail, Blizzard Assisted)"
L["Default.Retail.Monk.Windwalker.Name"] = "武僧：御風（正式版，暴雪戰鬥助手）"
-- en: "Recommended for Windwalker. Highlights the spell Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggests next, the one rotation advice the game still lets an addon read in Midnight combat (it already keeps Combo Strikes); it waits while you cast or channel. Alongside it, reminders for what Assisted Combat leaves to you: Zenith, Celestial Conduit, Invoke Xuen and Touch of Karma in combat, Spear Hand Strike on an interruptible cast, Fortifying Brew below 35% health and your racial cooldown. Enemy casts and your health are hidden in combat, so those two light only where the game shows them."
L["Default.Retail.Monk.Windwalker.Description"] = "推薦御風專精使用。醒目提示暴雪戰鬥助手建議的下一個法術，這是在至暗之夜的戰鬥中，遊戲仍允許插件讀取的唯一循環建議（它本身就會維持精通：連環打）；你施法或引導時它會等待。同時提醒戰鬥助手留給你處理的部分：戰鬥中的登峰造極、天尊導體、召喚白虎雪怒與乾坤挪移、對可中斷的施法使用天矛鎖喉手、生命力低於 35% 時使用石形絕釀，以及你的種族冷卻技能。敵人的施法與你的生命力在戰鬥中會被隱藏，因此這兩項只會在遊戲顯示它們的場合亮起。"
-- en: "Monk: Windwalker reference (Retail, Icy Veins and SimulationCraft)"
L["Default.Retail.Monk.WindwalkerGuide.Name"] = "武僧：御風參考（正式版，Icy Veins 與 SimulationCraft）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: Icy Veins' Conduit of the Celestials priority. Every step keeps Combo Strikes (never the spell you cast last); Chi and your own casts stay readable, but Heart of the Jade Serpent, Zenith, Blackout Kick! and Dance of Chi-Ji are hidden in Midnight combat, so it cannot run there. Whirling Dragon Punch with Xuen over 10 seconds away; Zenith Stomp when low on Chi or as Zenith ends; Celestial Conduit without Heart; Fists of Fury as Heart ends; Tiger Palm before energy caps (under four Chi, outside Zenith); Celestial Conduit, Invoke Xuen, Fists of Fury, Whirling Dragon Punch, Strike of the Windlord; Blackout Kick when short of Chi for Fists; Rushing Wind Kick, Rising Sun Kick; Blackout Kick on two Blackout Kick! charges or in Zenith; Spinning Crane Kick in Zenith or on Dance of Chi-Ji; Touch of Death; Tiger Palm, Blackout Kick, Slicing Winds as fillers. Reminder: Touch of Karma, plus the utility reminders."
L["Default.Retail.Monk.WindwalkerGuide.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：Icy Veins 的天尊引導者優先順序。每一步都會維持精通：連環打（從不重複上一個施放的法術）；真氣與你自己的施法仍可讀取，但玉蛟之心、登峰造極、滅寂腿！與赤吉之舞在至暗之夜的戰鬥中會被隱藏，因此它無法在戰鬥中運作。召喚白虎雪怒還有 10 秒以上才就緒時使用迴龍升天破；真氣不足或登峰造極即將結束時使用蒼穹踐踏；沒有玉蛟之心時使用天尊導體；玉蛟之心即將結束時使用狂拳連打；能量溢出前使用虎掌（真氣少於四點且不在登峰造極期間）；天尊導體、召喚白虎雪怒、狂拳連打、迴龍升天破、馭風打擊；真氣不夠施放狂拳連打時使用滅寂腿；疾風踢、翔陽腳；有兩層滅寂腿！充能或在登峰造極期間使用滅寂腿；登峰造極期間或赤吉之舞觸發時使用鶴旋踢；幽冥掌；虎掌、滅寂腿、風刃斬作為填充。提醒：乾坤挪移以及功能性提醒。"
-- en: "Monk: Mistweaver reference (Retail, Icy Veins)"
L["Default.Retail.Monk.Mistweaver.Name"] = "武僧：織霧參考（正式版，Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default. Blizzard offers no Assisted Combat list for healers, and in Midnight combat your allies' health, Renewing Mist charges, Mana Tea stacks and procs are hidden from addons, so healing advice is not possible; choose your heals yourself. On a hostile target it suggests the fistweaving filler, Rising Sun Kick, Blackout Kick and Tiger Palm; on a friendly target or none it suggests nothing. Reminders: Spear Hand Strike, Fortifying Brew below 35% health and your racial cooldown."
L["Default.Retail.Monk.Mistweaver.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉。暴雪沒有為治療者提供戰鬥助手清單，而且在至暗之夜的戰鬥中，盟友的生命力、回生迷霧的充能、法力茶的層數與觸發效果都對插件隱藏，因此無法給出治療建議；請自行選擇治療技能。對敵對目標時，它會建議拳療的填充技能：翔陽腳、滅寂腿與虎掌；對友方目標或沒有目標時不建議任何技能。提醒：天矛鎖喉手、生命力低於 35% 時使用石形絕釀以及你的種族冷卻技能。"
-- en: "Paladin: Retribution, Blizzard Assisted (Retail)"
L["Default.Retail.Paladin.Retribution.Name"] = "聖騎士：懲戒，暴雪戰鬥助手（正式版）"
-- en: "Recommended for Retribution in Midnight. In combat the game now hides buffs, debuffs, cooldown times and health from addons, so this shows Blizzard's own Assisted Combat suggestion (the one-button rotation) on your action bars, and stops while you cast or have no enemy targeted. It also reminds you of what that suggestion never covers: an aura between pulls, Rebuke on an interruptible cast, Divine Protection and Lay on Hands when low (these two only light where the game lets health be read). Trinkets and racials stay with you."
L["Default.Retail.Paladin.Retribution.Description"] = "推薦至暗之夜的懲戒專精使用。在戰鬥中，遊戲現在會對插件隱藏增益效果、減益效果、冷卻時間與生命力，因此它會在你的快捷列上顯示暴雪自己的戰鬥助手建議（一鍵循環），並在你施法或沒有選取敵人時停止。它還會提醒你那些建議從不涵蓋的內容：兩波拉怪之間的光環、對可中斷的施法使用責難、生命力偏低時使用聖佑術與聖療術（這兩項只會在遊戲允許讀取生命力的場合亮起）。飾品與種族技能由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Paladin: Retribution (Retail, Icy Veins reference)"
L["Default.Retail.Paladin.Retribution.IcyVeins.Name"] = "聖騎士：懲戒（正式版，Icy Veins 參考）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: the Icy Veins and SimulationCraft order reads buffs, charges and enemy counts that Midnight hides in combat, so it cannot run reliably there. Hammer of Light; a free Divine Purpose spender; at 5 Holy Power while Wake of Ashes is cooling, the spender; Wake of Ashes; Divine Toll; Blade of Justice on Art of War; Hammer of Wrath before it caps; at 3 or more Holy Power, Divine Storm on two or more enemies (or with Empyrean Power), else Final Verdict; Hammer of Wrath; Blade of Justice; Judgment; Templar Strike or Crusader Strike. Holy Power stays visible in combat, so its spending points work there. Reminders: Avenging Wrath, Execution Sentence with Wake of Ashes ready, aura, Rebuke, defensives."
L["Default.Retail.Paladin.Retribution.IcyVeins.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：Icy Veins 與 SimulationCraft 的施放順序需要讀取增益效果、充能與敵人數量，而至暗之夜會在戰鬥中隱藏這些資訊，因此它無法在戰鬥中可靠地運作。聖光之錘；神聖意圖觸發的免費聖能消耗技能；灰燼甦醒冷卻中且聖能達到 5 點時使用聖能消耗技能；灰燼甦醒；神聖鳴響；戰爭藝術觸發時使用正義之刃；憤怒之錘充能溢出前使用憤怒之錘；聖能達到 3 點以上時，兩個以上敵人（或有蒼穹能量）時使用神性風暴，否則使用最終裁決；憤怒之錘；正義之刃；審判；聖殿騎士打擊或十字軍聖擊。聖能在戰鬥中仍然可見，因此這些消耗聖能的時機在戰鬥中可以運作。提醒：復仇之怒、灰燼甦醒就緒時使用死刑宣判、光環、責難、防禦技能。"
-- en: "Paladin: Protection, Blizzard Assisted (Retail)"
L["Default.Retail.Paladin.Protection.Name"] = "聖騎士：防護，暴雪戰鬥助手（正式版）"
-- en: "Recommended for Protection in Midnight. Shows Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggestion, which already includes Shield of the Righteous, Avenging Wrath and Sentinel, and stops while you cast or have no enemy targeted. Reminders for what it leaves out: an aura between pulls, Rebuke on an interruptible cast, Ardent Defender below half health, Guardian of Ancient Kings below a third, Lay on Hands (the health reminders light only where the game lets health be read). Taunting and positioning stay with you."
L["Default.Retail.Paladin.Protection.Description"] = "推薦至暗之夜的防護專精使用。顯示暴雪的戰鬥助手建議（已包含公正之盾、復仇之怒與哨兵），並在你施法或沒有選取敵人時停止。提醒它未包含的內容：兩波拉怪之間的光環、對可中斷的施法使用責難、生命力低於一半時使用忠誠防衛者、低於三分之一時使用遠古諸王守護者、聖療術（生命力相關的提醒只會在遊戲允許讀取生命力的場合亮起）。嘲諷與站位由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Paladin: Protection (Retail, Icy Veins reference)"
L["Default.Retail.Paladin.Protection.IcyVeins.Name"] = "聖騎士：防護（正式版，Icy Veins 參考）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: the Icy Veins and SimulationCraft order needs the Consecration, Vanguard and Shining Light buffs, which Midnight hides in combat. Consecration before the pull; then Divine Toll, Hammer of Light, Consecration when you are not standing in it, Avenger's Shield with Vanguard, Shield of the Righteous at 3 or more Holy Power, Hammer of Wrath, Judgment, Blessed Hammer or Hammer of the Righteous, Avenger's Shield, Word of Glory with Shining Light, Consecration. Reminders: Avenging Wrath or Sentinel, Holy Bulwark, Sacred Weapon outside Avenging Wrath, defensives, aura, Rebuke."
L["Default.Retail.Paladin.Protection.IcyVeins.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：Icy Veins 與 SimulationCraft 的施放順序需要奉獻、守禦先鋒與聖光籠罩的增益效果，而至暗之夜會在戰鬥中隱藏它們。拉怪前使用奉獻；接著是神聖鳴響，聖光之錘，沒有站在奉獻中時使用奉獻，有守禦先鋒時使用復仇之盾，聖能達到 3 點以上時使用公正之盾，憤怒之錘，審判，祝福之錘或公正之錘，復仇之盾，有聖光籠罩時使用榮耀聖言，奉獻。提醒：復仇之怒或哨兵、神聖堅盾、復仇之怒以外使用神聖武器、防禦技能、光環、責難。"
-- en: "Paladin: Protection, Consecration filler (Retail, Wowhead reference)"
L["Default.Retail.Paladin.Protection.Wowhead.Name"] = "聖騎士：防護，奉獻填充（正式版，Wowhead 參考）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: Wowhead's tank order. Judgment on cooldown, Shield of the Righteous, Avenger's Shield, Divine Toll at 0 Holy Power, Blessed Hammer or Hammer of the Righteous, Word of Glory below half health, and Consecration only as the filler. Same reminders as the Icy Veins reference."
L["Default.Retail.Paladin.Protection.Wowhead.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：Wowhead 的坦克施放順序。審判冷卻結束就使用，公正之盾，復仇之盾，聖能為 0 時使用神聖鳴響，祝福之錘或公正之錘，生命力低於一半時使用榮耀聖言，奉獻只作為填充。提醒與 Icy Veins 參考循環相同。"
-- en: "Paladin: Holy (Retail, Icy Veins)"
L["Default.Retail.Paladin.Holy.Name"] = "聖騎士：神聖（正式版，Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Holy in Midnight, for reference: Rotation Master picks a spell, not a target, and the game hides everyone's health in combat, so this keeps your Holy Power and cooldowns turning over on whatever you target and leaves deciding who needs healing to you. Holy Power stays visible in combat, so it is spent at 5 first and at 3 or more after your other heals. On a friendly target: Eternal Flame or Word of Glory at 5 Holy Power, Flash of Light on Infusion of Light, Holy Shock, Eternal Flame or Word of Glory at 3 or more, Holy Light, Flash of Light; Light of Dawn is left to you. On an enemy: Shield of the Righteous at 5 Holy Power, Holy Shock, Shield of the Righteous at 3 or more, Judgment, Crusader Strike, Consecration. Reminders in combat: Divine Toll, Holy Prism, Holy Bulwark or Sacred Weapon, Beacon of Virtue on a friendly target, Divine Protection; an aura between pulls; Rebuke; Lay on Hands. Avenging Wrath and Aura Mastery are left to you."
L["Default.Retail.Paladin.Holy.Description"] = "至暗之夜的神聖專精，僅供參考：Rotation Master 選擇的是法術而不是目標，而且遊戲在戰鬥中會隱藏所有人的生命力，因此它會針對你目前的目標讓聖能與冷卻技能持續運轉，決定誰需要治療則交給你。聖能在戰鬥中仍然可見，因此會先在 5 點時消耗，並在其他治療之後於 3 點以上時消耗。友方目標：聖能達到 5 點時使用永恆之火或榮耀聖言，聖光灌注觸發時使用聖光閃現，神聖震擊，3 點以上時使用永恆之火或榮耀聖言，聖光術，聖光閃現；黎明曙光由你自行處理。敵人：聖能達到 5 點時使用公正之盾，神聖震擊，3 點以上時使用公正之盾，審判，十字軍聖擊，奉獻。戰鬥中的提醒：神聖鳴響、神聖稜石、神聖堅盾或神聖武器、對友方目標使用美德信標、聖佑術；兩波拉怪之間的光環；責難；聖療術。復仇之怒與精通光環由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Priest: Shadow, Blizzard Assisted (Retail)"
L["Default.Retail.Priest.Shadow.Name"] = "牧師：暗影，暴雪戰鬥助手（正式版）"
-- en: "Recommended for Shadow in Midnight. In combat the game now hides your DoTs, buffs, cooldown times and health from addons, so this shows Blizzard's own Assisted Combat suggestion (the one-button rotation, which keeps your DoTs, Shadowform and Voidform going and lets Mind Flay finish), and stops while you cast or have no enemy targeted. Reminders for what it leaves out: Power Infusion in the 20 seconds after you cast Voidform, Shadowform and Power Word: Fortitude between pulls, Silence on an interruptible cast, Desperate Prayer when low (the last two light only where the game lets them be read)."
L["Default.Retail.Priest.Shadow.Description"] = "推薦至暗之夜的暗影專精使用。在戰鬥中，遊戲現在會對插件隱藏你的持續傷害效果、增益效果、冷卻時間與生命力，因此它會顯示暴雪自己的戰鬥助手建議（一鍵循環，它會維持你的持續傷害效果、暗影形態與虛無形態，並讓精神鞭笞引導完畢），並在你施法或沒有選取敵人時停止。提醒它未包含的內容：施放虛無形態後的 20 秒內使用注入能量、兩波拉怪之間的暗影形態與真言術：韌、對可中斷的施法使用沉默、生命力偏低時使用絕望禱言（最後兩項只會在遊戲允許讀取相關資訊的場合亮起）。"
-- en: "Priest: Shadow (Retail, Icy Veins reference)"
L["Default.Retail.Priest.Shadow.IcyVeins.Name"] = "牧師：暗影（正式版，Icy Veins 參考）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: the Icy Veins and SimulationCraft order reads DoT timers, Madness, Voidform and Insanity, which Midnight hides in combat. Vampiric Touch before the pull; Tentacle Slam to apply Vampiric Touch; Vampiric Touch and Shadow Word: Pain refreshed in their last 30%; Shadow Word: Madness when it is ending, 35 Insanity from full or in Voidform; Void Blast during Madness; Tentacle Slam at two charges; Void Torrent; Mind Blast; Tentacle Slam; Mind Flay: Insanity during Madness; Shadow Word: Death below 20%; Void Volley; Death and Pain while moving; Mind Flay, clipped for a ready Mind Blast. Reminders: Halo, Voidform with both DoTs up, Power Infusion in Voidform, Desperate Prayer below 75%."
L["Default.Retail.Priest.Shadow.IcyVeins.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：Icy Veins 與 SimulationCraft 的施放順序需要讀取持續傷害效果的計時、暗言術：瘋的瘋狂效果、虛無形態與瘋狂，而至暗之夜會在戰鬥中隱藏它們。拉怪前使用吸血之觸；以觸手猛擊施加吸血之觸；吸血之觸與暗言術：痛在剩餘最後 30% 時刷新；暗言術：瘋即將結束、瘋狂距離上限 35 點或在虛無形態期間時使用暗言術：瘋；瘋狂效果期間使用虛無衝擊；兩層充能時使用觸手猛擊；虛無洪流；心靈震爆；觸手猛擊；瘋狂效果期間使用精神鞭笞：瘋狂；目標生命力低於 20% 時使用暗言術：死；虛無箭雨；移動中使用暗言術：死與暗言術：痛；精神鞭笞，心靈震爆就緒時中斷引導。提醒：輝環、兩個持續傷害效果都生效時使用虛無形態、虛無形態期間使用注入能量、生命力低於 75% 時使用絕望禱言。"
-- en: "Priest: Discipline, Atonement (Retail, Icy Veins)"
L["Default.Retail.Priest.Discipline.Name"] = "牧師：戒律，贖罪（正式版，Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Discipline in Midnight, for reference: Blizzard's Assisted Combat does not cover healers, the game hides everyone's health in combat and Rotation Master picks a spell, not a target, so this runs the damage that heals through Atonement and leaves deciding who to heal to you. On a friendly target: Power Word: Shield (Void Shield), Penance, Flash Heal. On an enemy: Shadow Word: Pain when you have not cast it for 12 seconds, Mind Blast, Penance, Shield, Shadow Word: Death, Void Blast, Smite. Reminders in combat: Power Word: Radiance, Evangelism, Ultimate Penitence, Pain Suppression on a friendly target; Fortitude between pulls; Desperate Prayer. Raid ramps before big damage are yours to time."
L["Default.Retail.Priest.Discipline.Description"] = "至暗之夜的戒律專精，僅供參考：暴雪的戰鬥助手不涵蓋治療者，遊戲在戰鬥中會隱藏所有人的生命力，而 Rotation Master 選擇的是法術而不是目標，因此它會打出透過贖罪轉化為治療的傷害，決定要治療誰則交給你。友方目標：真言術：盾（虛無之盾），懺悟，快速治療。敵人：12 秒內未施放過暗言術：痛時使用暗言術：痛，心靈震爆，懺悟，真言術：盾，暗言術：死，虛無衝擊，懲擊。戰鬥中的提醒：真言術：輝、佈道、終極懺罪、對友方目標使用痛苦鎮壓；兩波拉怪之間的真言術：韌；絕望禱言。大量傷害來臨前為團隊預鋪贖罪的時機由你自行掌握。"
-- en: "Priest: Discipline, Death first (Retail, Wowhead reference)"
L["Default.Retail.Priest.Discipline.Wowhead.Name"] = "牧師：戒律，暗言術：死優先（正式版，Wowhead 參考）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: Wowhead's Season 1 Oracle order, which keeps Shadow Word: Pain up by reading the debuff that Midnight hides in combat. Shadow Word: Pain, Shadow Word: Death on cooldown, Penance, Mind Blast, Smite; Penance first on a friendly target. Same reminders as the Icy Veins premade."
L["Default.Retail.Priest.Discipline.Wowhead.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：Wowhead 的第 1 季神諭者施放順序，透過讀取減益效果來維持暗言術：痛，而至暗之夜會在戰鬥中隱藏該減益效果。暗言術：痛，暗言術：死冷卻結束就使用，懺悟，心靈震爆，懲擊；友方目標時優先使用懺悟。提醒與 Icy Veins 內建循環相同。"
-- en: "Priest: Holy (Retail, Icy Veins)"
L["Default.Retail.Priest.Holy.Name"] = "牧師：神聖（正式版，Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Holy in Midnight, for reference: the game hides everyone's health in combat and Rotation Master picks a spell, not a target, so this keeps your Holy Words, Prayer of Mending and procs moving on whatever you target and leaves triage to you. On a friendly target: Holy Word: Sanctify, Holy Word: Serenity, Prayer of Mending, Prayer of Healing with Surge of Light, Benediction, Prayer of Healing with Lightweaver, Flash Heal with Surge of Light, Prayer of Healing in a group, Holy Nova while moving, Flash Heal. On an enemy: Holy Word: Chastise, Holy Fire, Holy Nova while moving, Smite. Reminders: Apotheosis, Divine Hymn and Halo in combat, Guardian Spirit on a friendly target about to die, Fortitude, Desperate Prayer."
L["Default.Retail.Priest.Holy.Description"] = "至暗之夜的神聖專精，僅供參考：遊戲在戰鬥中會隱藏所有人的生命力，而 Rotation Master 選擇的是法術而不是目標，因此它會針對你目前的目標讓聖言術、癒合禱言與觸發效果持續運轉，治療分配則交給你。友方目標：聖言術：庇，聖言術：寧，癒合禱言，光之澎湃觸發時使用治療禱言，祈福，織光師觸發時使用治療禱言，光之澎湃觸發時使用快速治療，在隊伍中使用治療禱言，移動中使用神聖新星，快速治療。敵人：聖言術：譴，神聖之火，移動中使用神聖新星，懲擊。提醒：戰鬥中的神化、神聖禮頌與輝環、對瀕死的友方目標使用守護聖靈、真言術：韌、絕望禱言。"
-- en: "Rogue: Assassination, Blizzard Assisted (Retail)"
L["Default.Retail.Rogue.Assassination.Name"] = "盜賊：刺殺，暴雪戰鬥助手（正式版）"
-- en: "Recommended for Assassination in Midnight. In combat the game now hides your bleeds, buffs, energy, cooldown times and health from addons, so this shows Blizzard's own Assisted Combat suggestion (the one-button rotation, which handles the stealth opener, Garrote, Rupture, Envenom, Deathmark and Kingsbane), and stops while you cast or have no enemy targeted. Reminders for what it leaves out: a lethal and a non-lethal poison and Stealth between pulls, Vanish when you are out of stealth in combat, Kick on an interruptible cast, Crimson Vial below half health (the last two light only where the game lets them be read)."
L["Default.Retail.Rogue.Assassination.Description"] = "推薦至暗之夜的刺殺專精使用。在戰鬥中，遊戲現在會對插件隱藏你的流血效果、增益效果、能量、冷卻時間與生命力，因此它會顯示暴雪自己的戰鬥助手建議（一鍵循環，它會處理潛行起手、絞喉、割裂、毒化、死亡印記與王禍），並在你施法或沒有選取敵人時停止。提醒它未包含的內容：兩波拉怪之間的一種致命毒藥、一種非致命毒藥與潛行、戰鬥中不在潛行狀態時使用消失、對可中斷的施法使用腳踢、生命力低於一半時使用赤紅藥瓶（最後兩項只會在遊戲允許讀取相關資訊的場合亮起）。"
-- en: "Rogue: Assassination (Retail, Icy Veins reference)"
L["Default.Retail.Rogue.Assassination.IcyVeins.Name"] = "盜賊：刺殺（正式版，Icy Veins 參考）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: the Icy Veins and SimulationCraft order keeps bleeds up by their timers and pools energy, which Midnight hides in combat. From stealth Garrote, then Ambush. Garrote in its last 30% while you are not at full combo points, Rupture at 5+ in its last 30%; at 5+ combo points Coup de Grace or Envenom; below, Crimson Tempest on three or more enemies, Fan of Knives on two or more close by, Ambush, Mutilate. Reminders: Deathmark with both bleeds up, Kingsbane alongside it, Vanish with Deathmark ready, Shiv on a Deathstalker's Mark target, Thistle Tea when low on energy, plus the shared poison, Stealth, Kick and Crimson Vial reminders."
L["Default.Retail.Rogue.Assassination.IcyVeins.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：Icy Veins 與 SimulationCraft 的施放順序依計時維持流血效果並囤積能量，而至暗之夜會在戰鬥中隱藏這些資訊。潛行中先使用絞喉，然後使用伏擊。連擊點數未滿時在絞喉剩餘最後 30% 時刷新絞喉，5 點以上連擊點數時在割裂剩餘最後 30% 時刷新割裂；5 點以上連擊點數時使用憐憫之擊或毒化；不足 5 點時：三個以上敵人使用赤紅風暴，近處有兩個以上敵人時使用飛舞刀刃，伏擊，截肢。提醒：兩種流血效果都生效時使用死亡印記、同時使用王禍、死亡印記就緒時使用消失、對帶有亡靈哨兵印記的目標使用毒襲、能量偏低時使用菊花茶，以及共用的毒藥、潛行、腳踢與赤紅藥瓶提醒。"
-- en: "Rogue: Outlaw, Blizzard Assisted (Retail)"
L["Default.Retail.Rogue.Outlaw.Name"] = "盜賊：暴徒，暴雪戰鬥助手（正式版）"
-- en: "Recommended for Outlaw in Midnight. Shows Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggestion (it handles the stealth opener, Roll the Bones, Blade Flurry, Adrenaline Rush, Between the Eyes and the finishers), and stops while you cast or have no enemy targeted. Reminders for what it leaves out: poisons and Stealth between pulls, Vanish when you are out of stealth in combat, Kick, Crimson Vial. Keep It Rolling stays with you: the game hides how many Roll the Bones buffs you have."
L["Default.Retail.Rogue.Outlaw.Description"] = "推薦至暗之夜的暴徒專精使用。顯示暴雪的戰鬥助手建議（它會處理潛行起手、命運之骰、劍刃亂舞、能量刺激、正中眉心與終結技），並在你施法或沒有選取敵人時停止。提醒它未包含的內容：兩波拉怪之間的毒藥與潛行、戰鬥中不在潛行狀態時使用消失、腳踢、赤紅藥瓶。骰個不停由你自行處理：遊戲會隱藏你擁有幾個命運之骰增益效果。"
-- en: "Rogue: Outlaw (Retail, Icy Veins reference)"
L["Default.Retail.Rogue.Outlaw.IcyVeins.Name"] = "盜賊：暴徒（正式版，Icy Veins 參考）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: the Icy Veins, SimulationCraft and Wowhead order reads Roll the Bones buffs, Opportunity stacks and energy, which Midnight hides in combat. From stealth Ambush. One combo point short of full or more: Between the Eyes, Killing Spree, Coup de Grace, Dispatch. Otherwise Ambush with Audacity, Pistol Shot at six Opportunity stacks (three when low on combo points), Ambush, Sinister Strike. Reminders: Roll the Bones with no roll up, Adrenaline Rush at two or fewer combo points, Blade Flurry kept up on two or more enemies, Blade Rush, Preparation when Adrenaline Rush, Between the Eyes and Blade Rush are all cooling. Keep It Rolling stays manual."
L["Default.Retail.Rogue.Outlaw.IcyVeins.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：Icy Veins、SimulationCraft 與 Wowhead 的施放順序需要讀取命運之骰增益效果、大好機會層數與能量，而至暗之夜會在戰鬥中隱藏它們。潛行中使用伏擊。連擊點數距離滿值只差一點或已滿時：正中眉心，狂舞殘殺，憐憫之擊，抹殺。否則無畏觸發時使用伏擊，大好機會達到六層時使用手槍射擊（連擊點數偏低時三層即可），伏擊，邪惡攻擊。提醒：沒有骰子增益時使用命運之骰、連擊點數不超過兩點時使用能量刺激、兩個以上敵人時維持劍刃亂舞、劍刃猛攻、能量刺激、正中眉心與劍刃猛攻都在冷卻時使用備戰。骰個不停需要手動使用。"
-- en: "Rogue: Subtlety, Blizzard Assisted (Retail)"
L["Default.Retail.Rogue.Subtlety.Name"] = "盜賊：敏銳，暴雪戰鬥助手（正式版）"
-- en: "Recommended for Subtlety in Midnight. Shows Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggestion (it handles the stealth opener, Shadow Blades, Goremaw's Bite, Shadow Dance, Secret Technique and the finishers), and stops while you cast or have no enemy targeted. Reminders for what it leaves out: poisons and Stealth between pulls, Kick on an interruptible cast, Crimson Vial below half health."
L["Default.Retail.Rogue.Subtlety.Description"] = "推薦至暗之夜的敏銳專精使用。顯示暴雪的戰鬥助手建議（它會處理潛行起手、暗影之刃、破喉之咬、暗影之舞、幻影秘技與終結技），並在你施法或沒有選取敵人時停止。提醒它未包含的內容：兩波拉怪之間的毒藥與潛行、對可中斷的施法使用腳踢、生命力低於一半時使用赤紅藥瓶。"
-- en: "Rogue: Subtlety (Retail, Icy Veins reference)"
L["Default.Retail.Rogue.Subtlety.IcyVeins.Name"] = "盜賊：敏銳（正式版，Icy Veins 參考）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: the Icy Veins and SimulationCraft order holds Shadow Dance for Secret Technique and reads Shadow Dance, Darkest Night and energy, which Midnight hides in combat. Stealthed before the pull: Shadowstrike. One combo point short of full or more: Eviscerate with Darkest Night, Secret Technique in Shadow Dance, Coup de Grace, Black Powder on three or more enemies, Eviscerate. Otherwise Shadowstrike, Shuriken Storm on two or more, Gloomblade or Backstab. Reminders: Goremaw's Bite in Shadow Dance, Shadow Blades with Shadow Dance ready, Shadow Dance at two or fewer (or six or more) combo points when Secret Technique is ready or Shadow Blades is up, Vanish out of stealth at two or fewer combo points."
L["Default.Retail.Rogue.Subtlety.IcyVeins.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：Icy Veins 與 SimulationCraft 的施放順序會為幻影秘技保留暗影之舞，並需要讀取暗影之舞、深沉暗夜與能量，而至暗之夜會在戰鬥中隱藏它們。拉怪前處於潛行狀態：暗影打擊。連擊點數距離滿值只差一點或已滿時：有深沉暗夜時使用剔骨，暗影之舞期間使用幻影秘技，憐憫之擊，三個以上敵人時使用黑火藥，剔骨。否則使用暗影打擊，兩個以上敵人時使用手裏劍風暴，幽暗刃或背刺。提醒：暗影之舞期間使用破喉之咬、暗影之舞就緒時使用暗影之刃、幻影秘技就緒或暗影之刃生效時，在連擊點數不超過兩點（或達到六點以上）時使用暗影之舞、不在潛行狀態且連擊點數不超過兩點時使用消失。"
-- en: "Shaman: Elemental, Blizzard Assisted (Retail)"
L["Default.Retail.Shaman.Elemental.Name"] = "薩滿：元素，暴雪戰鬥助手（正式版）"
-- en: "Recommended for Elemental in Midnight. In combat the game now hides Flame Shock, your buffs, Maelstrom, cooldown times and health from addons, so this shows Blizzard's own Assisted Combat suggestion (the one-button rotation), and stops while you cast or have no enemy targeted. Reminders for what it leaves out: Ascendance, Fire or Storm Elemental and Nature's Swiftness in combat, Spiritwalker's Grace while moving, Lightning Shield and Skyfury between pulls (Blizzard's suggestion keeps your weapon and shield imbues), Wind Shear on an interruptible cast, Astral Shift when low (the last two light only where the game lets them be read)."
L["Default.Retail.Shaman.Elemental.Description"] = "推薦至暗之夜的元素專精使用。在戰鬥中，遊戲現在會對插件隱藏烈焰震擊、你的增益效果、元能、冷卻時間與生命力，因此它會顯示暴雪自己的戰鬥助手建議（一鍵循環），並在你施法或沒有選取敵人時停止。提醒它未包含的內容：戰鬥中的卓越術、火元素或風暴元素以及自然迅捷、移動中使用靈行者之賜、兩波拉怪之間的閃電之盾與天怒（暴雪的建議會維持你的武器與護盾灌注）、對可中斷的施法使用削風術、生命力偏低時使用星界轉移（最後兩項只會在遊戲允許讀取相關資訊的場合亮起）。"
-- en: "Shaman: Elemental (Retail, Icy Veins reference)"
L["Default.Retail.Shaman.Elemental.IcyVeins.Name"] = "薩滿：元素（正式版，Icy Veins 參考）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: the Icy Veins and SimulationCraft order reads Flame Shock, Master of the Elements, Stormkeeper and Maelstrom, which Midnight hides in combat. Stormkeeper and Lava Burst before the pull. On three or more engaged enemies: Stormkeeper, Ancestral Swiftness, Flame Shock, Chain Lightning with Stormkeeper, Elemental Blast, Earthquake, Lava Burst on Lava Surge, Tempest, Chain Lightning. Otherwise Stormkeeper, Ancestral Swiftness, Flame Shock and Voltaic Blaze in their last 30% outside Master of the Elements, Lava Burst to start it, Tempest and Stormkeeper's Lightning Bolt inside it, Elemental Blast or Earth Shock inside it or near full Maelstrom, Voltaic Blaze, Tempest, Flame Shock or Frost Shock while moving, Lightning Bolt. Reminders: Ascendance once Stormkeeper is used, elementals, Spiritwalker's Grace, and the shared ones."
L["Default.Retail.Shaman.Elemental.IcyVeins.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：Icy Veins 與 SimulationCraft 的施放順序需要讀取烈焰震擊、元素大師、風暴守護者與元能，而至暗之夜會在戰鬥中隱藏它們。拉怪前使用風暴守護者與熔岩爆發。面對三個以上交戰中的敵人時：風暴守護者，先祖迅捷，烈焰震擊，風暴守護者生效時使用閃電鏈，元素衝擊，地震術，熔岩奔騰觸發時使用熔岩爆發，暴風雨，閃電鏈。否則：風暴守護者，先祖迅捷，元素大師以外在剩餘最後 30% 時刷新烈焰震擊與電流燃炎，使用熔岩爆發觸發元素大師，元素大師期間使用暴風雨與風暴守護者強化的閃電箭，元素大師期間或元能接近滿值時使用元素衝擊或大地震擊，電流燃炎，暴風雨，移動中使用烈焰震擊或冰霜震擊，閃電箭。提醒：風暴守護者用掉後使用卓越術、火元素或風暴元素、靈行者之賜，以及共用提醒。"
-- en: "Shaman: Enhancement, Blizzard Assisted (Retail)"
L["Default.Retail.Shaman.Enhancement.Name"] = "薩滿：增強，暴雪戰鬥助手（正式版）"
-- en: "Recommended for Enhancement in Midnight. Shows Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggestion (it spends Maelstrom Weapon, keeps Flame Shock and handles Surging Totem and Sundering), and stops while you cast or have no enemy targeted. Reminders for what it leaves out: Ascendance, Doom Winds and Feral Spirit in combat, Lightning Shield and Skyfury between pulls (Blizzard's suggestion keeps Windfury Weapon), Wind Shear, Astral Shift."
L["Default.Retail.Shaman.Enhancement.Description"] = "推薦至暗之夜的增強專精使用。顯示暴雪的戰鬥助手建議（它會消耗氣漩武器、維持烈焰震擊，並處理翻湧圖騰與裂地浩劫），並在你施法或沒有選取敵人時停止。提醒它未包含的內容：戰鬥中的卓越術、末日之風與野性之魂、兩波拉怪之間的閃電之盾與天怒（暴雪的建議會維持風怒武器）、削風術、星界轉移。"
-- en: "Shaman: Enhancement, Stormbringer (Retail, SimulationCraft reference)"
L["Default.Retail.Shaman.Enhancement.Stormbringer.Name"] = "薩滿：增強，風暴使者（正式版，SimulationCraft 參考）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: SimulationCraft's Stormbringer list (Icy Veins and Wowhead agree) reads Flame Shock, Crash Lightning, Lashing Flames and cooldown timers, which Midnight hides in combat. On three or more engaged enemies: Crash Lightning for its buff, Tempest at 10 Maelstrom Weapon, Chain Lightning at 9, Crash Lightning, Lava Lash, Sundering. Then Primordial Storm at 9, Voltaic Blaze or Flame Shock when Flame Shock is missing, Sundering, Crash Lightning for its buff, Lava Lash for Lashing Flames, Windstrike, Tempest or Lightning Bolt at 10 (8 with Voltaic Blaze or Crash Lightning about ready), Stormstrike at two charges, Lava Lash, Stormstrike, Voltaic Blaze, Crash Lightning, Lightning Bolt at 5, Flame Shock. Reminders: Doom Winds, Ascendance outside Doom Winds, Feral Spirit, and the shared ones."
L["Default.Retail.Shaman.Enhancement.Stormbringer.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：SimulationCraft 的風暴使者清單（Icy Veins 與 Wowhead 的看法一致）需要讀取烈焰震擊、閃電轟擊、暴擊烈焰與冷卻計時，而至暗之夜會在戰鬥中隱藏它們。面對三個以上交戰中的敵人時：為取得增益效果使用閃電轟擊，氣漩武器達到 10 層時使用暴風雨，達到 9 層時使用閃電鏈，閃電轟擊，熔岩暴擊，裂地浩劫。接著氣漩武器達到 9 層時使用原初風暴，烈焰震擊消失時使用電流燃炎或烈焰震擊，裂地浩劫，為取得增益效果使用閃電轟擊，為暴擊烈焰使用熔岩暴擊，風暴衝擊，達到 10 層時使用暴風雨或閃電箭（電流燃炎或閃電轟擊即將就緒時為 8 層），兩層充能時使用風暴打擊，熔岩暴擊，風暴打擊，電流燃炎，閃電轟擊，達到 5 層時使用閃電箭，烈焰震擊。提醒：末日之風、末日之風以外使用卓越術、野性之魂，以及共用提醒。"
-- en: "Shaman: Enhancement, Totemic (Retail, SimulationCraft reference)"
L["Default.Retail.Shaman.Enhancement.Totemic.Name"] = "薩滿：增強，圖騰師（正式版，SimulationCraft 參考）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: SimulationCraft's Totemic list reads Flame Shock, Hot Hand, Whirling Fire, Crash Lightning and Doom Winds, which Midnight hides in combat. On three or more engaged enemies: Crash Lightning, Chain Lightning at 5 Maelstrom Weapon. Then Voltaic Blaze or Flame Shock when Flame Shock is missing, Surging Totem, Sundering, Lava Lash with Hot Hand or Whirling Fire, Crash Lightning for its buff, Primordial Storm at 10, Windstrike, Crash Lightning and Stormstrike in Doom Winds, Lightning Bolt at 5, Crash Lightning, Lava Lash, Stormstrike, Voltaic Blaze, Flame Shock. Same reminders as the Stormbringer reference."
L["Default.Retail.Shaman.Enhancement.Totemic.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：SimulationCraft 的圖騰師清單需要讀取烈焰震擊、炙手、環繞之火、閃電轟擊與末日之風，而至暗之夜會在戰鬥中隱藏它們。面對三個以上交戰中的敵人時：閃電轟擊，氣漩武器達到 5 層時使用閃電鏈。接著烈焰震擊消失時使用電流燃炎或烈焰震擊，翻湧圖騰，裂地浩劫，有炙手或環繞之火時使用熔岩暴擊，為取得增益效果使用閃電轟擊，達到 10 層時使用原初風暴，風暴衝擊，末日之風期間使用閃電轟擊與風暴打擊，達到 5 層時使用閃電箭，閃電轟擊，熔岩暴擊，風暴打擊，電流燃炎，烈焰震擊。提醒與風暴使者參考循環相同。"
-- en: "Shaman: Restoration (Retail, Icy Veins)"
L["Default.Retail.Shaman.Restoration.Name"] = "薩滿：恢復（正式版，Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Restoration in Midnight, for reference: Blizzard's Assisted Combat does not cover healers, the game hides everyone's health in combat and Rotation Master picks a spell, not a target, so this orders your healing tools by readiness on whatever you target and leaves deciding who to heal to you. On a friendly target: Healing Stream Totem, Unleash Life, Healing Rain in a group, Surging Totem, Riptide, Chain Heal in a group, Healing Wave. On an enemy: Flame Shock when missing, Lava Burst, Lightning Bolt. Reminders: Water Shield, Earth Shield on a friendly target and Skyfury between pulls; Nature's Swiftness in combat; Healing Tide Totem and Spirit Link Totem in grouped combat; Wind Shear; Astral Shift."
L["Default.Retail.Shaman.Restoration.Description"] = "至暗之夜的恢復專精，僅供參考：暴雪的戰鬥助手不涵蓋治療者，遊戲在戰鬥中會隱藏所有人的生命力，而 Rotation Master 選擇的是法術而不是目標，因此它會針對你目前的目標依就緒情況排列你的治療技能，決定要治療誰則交給你。友方目標：治療之泉圖騰，生命流溢，在隊伍中使用治癒之雨，翻湧圖騰，激流，在隊伍中使用治療鍊，治療波。敵人：烈焰震擊消失時使用烈焰震擊，熔岩爆發，閃電箭。提醒：兩波拉怪之間的水之盾、對友方目標使用大地之盾與天怒；戰鬥中的自然迅捷；組隊戰鬥中的療癒之潮圖騰與靈魂連結圖騰；削風術；星界轉移。"
-- en: "Warlock: Affliction, Blizzard Assisted (Retail)"
L["Default.Retail.Warlock.Affliction.Name"] = "術士：痛苦，暴雪戰鬥助手（正式版）"
-- en: "Recommended for Affliction in Midnight. In combat the game now hides your DoTs, procs, cooldown times and health from addons, so this shows Blizzard's own Assisted Combat suggestion (the one-button rotation, which keeps Agony and Corruption, spends shards on Unstable Affliction and handles Grimoire of Sacrifice), and stops while you cast, channel or have no enemy targeted. Reminders for what it leaves out: Summon Darkglare in combat, a Felhunter between pulls unless you sacrificed your demon, Command Demon on an interruptible cast, Dark Pact and Unending Resolve when low (these light only where the game lets them be read)."
L["Default.Retail.Warlock.Affliction.Description"] = "推薦至暗之夜的痛苦專精使用。在戰鬥中，遊戲現在會對插件隱藏你的持續傷害效果、觸發效果、冷卻時間與生命力，因此它會顯示暴雪自己的戰鬥助手建議（一鍵循環，它會維持痛苦與腐蝕術、把靈魂裂片花在痛苦動盪上，並處理犧牲魔典），並在你施法、引導或沒有選取敵人時停止。提醒它未包含的內容：戰鬥中的召喚暗凝、兩波拉怪之間召喚惡魔獵犬（除非你已犧牲了惡魔）、對可中斷的施法使用惡魔號令、生命力偏低時使用黑暗契約與心志堅定（這些只會在遊戲允許讀取相關資訊的場合亮起）。"
-- en: "Warlock: Affliction (Retail, Icy Veins reference)"
L["Default.Retail.Warlock.Affliction.IcyVeins.Name"] = "術士：痛苦（正式版，Icy Veins 參考）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: the Icy Veins and SimulationCraft (Soul Harvester) order reads DoT timers, Nightfall and Shard Instability, which Midnight hides in combat. Haunt before the pull; Seed of Corruption on three or more engaged enemies without your Corruption; Haunt; Agony and Corruption or Wither under 3 seconds; Dark Harvest at two shards or fewer; Unstable Affliction at 5 shards; Malefic Grasp, else Shadow Bolt, on two Nightfall; Unstable Affliction on Shard Instability or at 4 shards; Drain Soul; Shadow Bolt. Reminders: Summon Darkglare once Dark Harvest is cooling, Malevolence, your Felhunter, and the shared ones."
L["Default.Retail.Warlock.Affliction.IcyVeins.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：Icy Veins 與 SimulationCraft（靈魂收割者）的施放順序需要讀取持續傷害效果的計時、夜暮與裂片易變，而至暗之夜會在戰鬥中隱藏它們。拉怪前使用蝕魂術；面對三個以上交戰中的敵人且沒有你的腐蝕術時使用腐蝕種子；蝕魂術；痛苦以及腐蝕術或枯萎剩餘不到 3 秒時刷新；靈魂裂片不超過兩個時使用黑暗收割；5 個靈魂裂片時使用痛苦動盪；兩層夜暮時使用惡毒之握，否則使用暗影箭；裂片易變觸發或 4 個靈魂裂片時使用痛苦動盪；吸取靈魂；暗影箭。提醒：黑暗收割進入冷卻後使用召喚暗凝、惡意、召喚惡魔獵犬，以及共用提醒。"
-- en: "Warlock: Demonology, Blizzard Assisted (Retail)"
L["Default.Retail.Warlock.Demonology.Name"] = "術士：惡魔學識，暴雪戰鬥助手（正式版）"
-- en: "Recommended for Demonology in Midnight. Shows Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggestion (Call Dreadstalkers, Hand of Gul'dan, Demonbolt, Power Siphon and Tyrant), and stops while you cast, channel or have no enemy targeted. Reminders for what it leaves out: Summon Demonic Tyrant while the Dreadstalkers you called in the last 12 seconds are out, Grimoire: Imp Lord, Grimoire: Fel Ravager and Summon Doomguard in combat, a Felguard between pulls, Command Demon, Dark Pact, Unending Resolve."
L["Default.Retail.Warlock.Demonology.Description"] = "推薦至暗之夜的惡魔學識專精使用。顯示暴雪的戰鬥助手建議（召喚恐懼潛獵犬、古爾丹之手、惡魔箭、魔能虹吸與惡魔暴君），並在你施法、引導或沒有選取敵人時停止。提醒它未包含的內容：你在最近 12 秒內召喚的恐懼潛獵犬仍在場時使用召喚惡魔暴君、戰鬥中的魔典：小鬼領主、魔典：魔化劫毀者與召喚末日守衛、兩波拉怪之間召喚惡魔守衛、惡魔號令、黑暗契約、心志堅定。"
-- en: "Warlock: Demonology (Retail, Icy Veins reference)"
L["Default.Retail.Warlock.Demonology.IcyVeins.Name"] = "術士：惡魔學識（正式版，Icy Veins 參考）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: the Icy Veins and SimulationCraft (Diabolist) order reads Demonic Core, imp counts and cooldown timers, which Midnight hides in combat. Power Siphon, Demonbolt and Shadow Bolt before the pull; then Power Siphon at one Demonic Core or none, Grimoire: Imp Lord, Grimoire: Fel Ravager, Summon Doomguard, Call Dreadstalkers, Summon Demonic Tyrant at 5 shards, Implosion on three or more engaged enemies, Ruination, Hand of Gul'dan at 3 shards or more, Infernal Bolt below 3, Demonbolt on Demonic Core below 4, Shadow Bolt."
L["Default.Retail.Warlock.Demonology.IcyVeins.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：Icy Veins 與 SimulationCraft（崇魔者）的施放順序需要讀取魔能之核、小鬼數量與冷卻計時，而至暗之夜會在戰鬥中隱藏它們。拉怪前使用魔能虹吸、惡魔箭與暗影箭；接著魔能之核不超過一層時使用魔能虹吸，魔典：小鬼領主，魔典：魔化劫毀者，召喚末日守衛，召喚恐懼潛獵犬，5 個靈魂裂片時使用召喚惡魔暴君，面對三個以上交戰中的敵人時使用小鬼爆破，禍滅，3 個以上靈魂裂片時使用古爾丹之手，少於 3 個時使用煉獄箭，魔能之核觸發且靈魂裂片少於 4 個時使用惡魔箭，暗影箭。"
-- en: "Warlock: Destruction, Blizzard Assisted (Retail)"
L["Default.Retail.Warlock.Destruction.Name"] = "術士：毀滅，暴雪戰鬥助手（正式版）"
-- en: "Recommended for Destruction in Midnight. Shows Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggestion (Immolate or Wither, Conflagrate, Chaos Bolt, Rain of Fire, Soul Fire, Malevolence), and stops while you cast, channel or have no enemy targeted. Reminders for what it leaves out: Summon Infernal in combat, an Imp between pulls unless you sacrificed your demon, Command Demon, Dark Pact, Unending Resolve. Havoc on a second target stays with you."
L["Default.Retail.Warlock.Destruction.Description"] = "推薦至暗之夜的毀滅專精使用。顯示暴雪的戰鬥助手建議（獻祭或枯萎、焚燒、混沌箭、火焰之雨、靈魂之火、惡意），並在你施法、引導或沒有選取敵人時停止。提醒它未包含的內容：戰鬥中的召喚煉獄火、兩波拉怪之間召喚小鬼（除非你已犧牲了惡魔）、惡魔號令、黑暗契約、心志堅定。對第二個目標使用浩劫由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Warlock: Destruction (Retail, SimulationCraft reference)"
L["Default.Retail.Warlock.Destruction.Simc.Name"] = "術士：毀滅（正式版，SimulationCraft 參考）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: SimulationCraft's order reads Immolate, Backdraft, charges and cooldown timers, which Midnight hides in combat. Soul Fire and Incinerate before the pull; on three or more engaged enemies Rain of Fire at 3 shards and Cataclysm; then Soul Fire at 4 shards or fewer, Chaos Bolt only at 5, Conflagrate at two charges or below 4 shards without Backdraft, Summon Infernal, Malevolence, Wither or Immolate in its last 30%, Ruination, Cataclysm, Infernal Bolt at 3 shards or fewer, Incinerate."
L["Default.Retail.Warlock.Destruction.Simc.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：SimulationCraft 的施放順序需要讀取獻祭、爆燃、充能與冷卻計時，而至暗之夜會在戰鬥中隱藏它們。拉怪前使用靈魂之火與燒盡；面對三個以上交戰中的敵人時，3 個靈魂裂片時使用火焰之雨，並使用災變；接著靈魂裂片不超過 4 個時使用靈魂之火，只在 5 個時使用混沌箭，兩層充能時或靈魂裂片少於 4 個且沒有爆燃時使用焚燒，召喚煉獄火，惡意，枯萎或獻祭剩餘最後 30% 時刷新，禍滅，災變，靈魂裂片不超過 3 個時使用煉獄箭，燒盡。"
-- en: "Warlock: Destruction, Chaos Bolt before capping (Retail, Icy Veins reference)"
L["Default.Retail.Warlock.Destruction.IcyVeins.Name"] = "術士：毀滅，溢出前使用混沌箭（正式版，Icy Veins 參考）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: Icy Veins' Hellcaller order, which spends shards on Chaos Bolt before they cap and uses Shadowburn and Channel Demonfire on cooldown. Rain of Fire on three or more engaged enemies; Wither or Immolate kept up; Summon Infernal; Malevolence; Shadowburn; Soul Fire below 4 shards; Chaos Bolt at 4 or more; Cataclysm; Infernal Bolt below 4; Channel Demonfire; Conflagrate; Incinerate."
L["Default.Retail.Warlock.Destruction.IcyVeins.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：Icy Veins 的喚魔者施放順序，會在靈魂裂片溢出前把它們花在混沌箭上，並在冷卻結束時就使用暗影灼燒與引導惡魔火焰。面對三個以上交戰中的敵人時使用火焰之雨；維持枯萎或獻祭；召喚煉獄火；惡意；暗影灼燒；靈魂裂片少於 4 個時使用靈魂之火；4 個以上時使用混沌箭；災變；少於 4 個時使用煉獄箭；引導惡魔火焰；焚燒；燒盡。"
-- en: "Warrior: Arms, Blizzard Assisted (Retail)"
L["Default.Retail.Warrior.Arms.Name"] = "戰士：武器，暴雪戰鬥助手（正式版）"
-- en: "Recommended for Arms in Midnight. In combat the game now hides rage, Rend, Colossus Smash, procs, cooldown times and health from addons, so this shows Blizzard's own Assisted Combat suggestion (the one-button rotation), and stops while you cast or have no enemy targeted. Reminders for what it leaves out: Heroic Strike (a core button the suggestion never uses), Avatar and Champion's Spear in combat, Battle Shout between pulls, Pummel on an interruptible cast, Die by the Sword when low (the last two light only where the game lets them be read)."
L["Default.Retail.Warrior.Arms.Description"] = "推薦至暗之夜的武器專精使用。在戰鬥中，遊戲現在會對插件隱藏怒氣、撕裂、千鈞潰擊、觸發效果、冷卻時間與生命力，因此它會顯示暴雪自己的戰鬥助手建議（一鍵循環），並在你施法或沒有選取敵人時停止。提醒它未包含的內容：英勇打擊（建議從不使用的核心按鍵）、戰鬥中的巨像化身與勇士之矛、兩波拉怪之間的戰鬥怒吼、對可中斷的施法使用拳擊、生命力偏低時使用劍下亡魂（最後兩項只會在遊戲允許讀取相關資訊的場合亮起）。"
-- en: "Warrior: Arms, Slayer (Retail, SimulationCraft reference)"
L["Default.Retail.Warrior.Arms.Slayer.Name"] = "戰士：武器，殺戮者（正式版，SimulationCraft 參考）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: the Slayer order from SimulationCraft, Icy Veins and Wowhead reads rage, Rend, Colossus Smash, Sudden Death and Opportunist, which Midnight hides in combat. Charge to open; Sweeping Strikes on two or more engaged enemies; Rend before Colossus Smash when it is running out; Ravager just before Colossus Smash; Execute at two Sudden Death; Colossus Smash; Bladestorm in Colossus Smash or Avatar; Heroic Strike; Overpower at two Opportunist; Mortal Strike; Execute; Overpower; Rend under 5 seconds; Slam. Reminders: Avatar with Colossus Smash ready, Die by the Sword, Battle Shout, Pummel."
L["Default.Retail.Warrior.Arms.Slayer.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：來自 SimulationCraft、Icy Veins 與 Wowhead 的殺戮者施放順序需要讀取怒氣、撕裂、千鈞潰擊、驟亡與伺機而動，而至暗之夜會在戰鬥中隱藏它們。以衝鋒開場；面對兩個以上交戰中的敵人時使用橫掃攻擊；撕裂即將結束時在千鈞潰擊之前使用撕裂；在千鈞潰擊之前使用劫毀旋刃；兩層驟亡時使用斬殺；千鈞潰擊；千鈞潰擊或巨像化身期間使用劍刃風暴；英勇打擊；兩層伺機而動時使用壓制；致死打擊；斬殺；壓制；撕裂剩餘不到 5 秒時使用撕裂；猛擊。提醒：千鈞潰擊就緒時使用巨像化身、劍下亡魂、戰鬥怒吼、拳擊。"
-- en: "Warrior: Arms, Colossus (Retail, SimulationCraft reference)"
L["Default.Retail.Warrior.Arms.Colossus.Name"] = "戰士：武器，巨像（正式版，SimulationCraft 參考）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: the Colossus order from SimulationCraft and Icy Veins builds Colossal Might with Mortal Strike and reads buffs Midnight hides in combat. Charge to open; Sweeping Strikes on two or more; Mortal Strike below five Colossal Might; Rend before Colossus Smash; Ravager; Execute at two Sudden Death; Colossus Smash; Champion's Spear; Demolish in Colossus Smash with Colossal Might; Heroic Strike; Mortal Strike; Execute; Overpower; Rend under 5 seconds; Bladestorm on two or more; Slam. Reminders: Avatar, Die by the Sword, Battle Shout, Pummel."
L["Default.Retail.Warrior.Arms.Colossus.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：來自 SimulationCraft 與 Icy Veins 的巨像施放順序以致死打擊累積巨像之力，並需要讀取至暗之夜在戰鬥中隱藏的增益效果。以衝鋒開場；兩個以上敵人時使用橫掃攻擊；巨像之力少於五層時使用致死打擊；在千鈞潰擊之前使用撕裂；劫毀旋刃；兩層驟亡時使用斬殺；千鈞潰擊；勇士之矛；千鈞潰擊期間且有巨像之力時使用毀壞；英勇打擊；致死打擊；斬殺；壓制；撕裂剩餘不到 5 秒時使用撕裂；兩個以上敵人時使用劍刃風暴；猛擊。提醒：巨像化身、劍下亡魂、戰鬥怒吼、拳擊。"
-- en: "Warrior: Fury, Blizzard Assisted (Retail)"
L["Default.Retail.Warrior.Fury.Name"] = "戰士：狂怒，暴雪戰鬥助手（正式版）"
-- en: "Recommended for Fury in Midnight. Shows Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggestion (Rampage, Bloodthirst, Raging Blow, Execute, Odyn's Fury and Bladestorm), and stops while you cast or have no enemy targeted. Reminders for what it leaves out: Recklessness, Avatar and Champion's Spear in combat, Battle Shout between pulls, Pummel, Enraged Regeneration when low."
L["Default.Retail.Warrior.Fury.Description"] = "推薦至暗之夜的狂怒專精使用。顯示暴雪的戰鬥助手建議（暴怒、嗜血、狂怒之擊、斬殺、歐丁之怒與劍刃風暴），並在你施法或沒有選取敵人時停止。提醒它未包含的內容：戰鬥中的魯莽、巨像化身與勇士之矛、兩波拉怪之間的戰鬥怒吼、拳擊、生命力偏低時使用狂怒恢復。"
-- en: "Warrior: Fury, Slayer (Retail, SimulationCraft reference)"
L["Default.Retail.Warrior.Fury.Slayer.Name"] = "戰士：狂怒，殺戮者（正式版，SimulationCraft 參考）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: SimulationCraft's Slayer order reads rage, Enrage, Recklessness and Sudden Death, which Midnight hides in combat. Charge to open; Whirlwind for its buff on two or more engaged enemies; Rampage when Enrage is ending; in Recklessness Rampage at 100 rage, Bladestorm, Execute on Sudden Death, Odyn's Fury; Crushing Blow; Bloodbath; Rampage above 100 rage; Execute; Odyn's Fury; Raging Blow; Rampage; Bloodthirst; Whirlwind. Reminders: Recklessness, Avatar, Enraged Regeneration, Battle Shout, Pummel."
L["Default.Retail.Warrior.Fury.Slayer.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：SimulationCraft 的殺戮者施放順序需要讀取怒氣、狂怒、魯莽與驟亡，而至暗之夜會在戰鬥中隱藏它們。以衝鋒開場；面對兩個以上交戰中的敵人時為取得增益效果使用旋風斬；狂怒即將結束時使用暴怒；魯莽期間：怒氣達到 100 時使用暴怒，劍刃風暴，驟亡觸發時使用斬殺，歐丁之怒；碾擊；浴血；怒氣高於 100 時使用暴怒；斬殺；歐丁之怒；狂怒之擊；暴怒；嗜血；旋風斬。提醒：魯莽、巨像化身、狂怒恢復、戰鬥怒吼、拳擊。"
-- en: "Warrior: Fury, Mountain Thane (Retail, Icy Veins reference)"
L["Default.Retail.Warrior.Fury.Thane.Name"] = "戰士：狂怒，山脈族長（正式版，Icy Veins 參考）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: the Mountain Thane order from SimulationCraft and Icy Veins weaves Thunder Blast and reads buffs Midnight hides in combat. Charge to open; Whirlwind for its buff on two or more; Rampage when Enrage is ending or at 100 rage; Bloodbath in Recklessness; Thunder Blast at two stacks; Crushing Blow; Bloodbath; Rampage in Recklessness; Thunder Blast in Avatar; Raging Blow; Thunder Blast; Rampage; Bloodthirst; Execute; Odyn's Fury; Thunder Clap; Whirlwind. Same reminders as the Slayer reference."
L["Default.Retail.Warrior.Fury.Thane.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：來自 SimulationCraft 與 Icy Veins 的山脈族長施放順序會穿插雷霆暴擊，並需要讀取至暗之夜在戰鬥中隱藏的增益效果。以衝鋒開場；兩個以上敵人時為取得增益效果使用旋風斬；狂怒即將結束或怒氣達到 100 時使用暴怒；魯莽期間使用浴血；兩層時使用雷霆暴擊；碾擊；浴血；魯莽期間使用暴怒；巨像化身期間使用雷霆暴擊；狂怒之擊；雷霆暴擊；暴怒；嗜血；斬殺；歐丁之怒；雷霆一擊；旋風斬。提醒與殺戮者參考循環相同。"
-- en: "Warrior: Protection, Blizzard Assisted (Retail)"
L["Default.Retail.Warrior.Protection.Name"] = "戰士：防護，暴雪戰鬥助手（正式版）"
-- en: "Recommended for Protection in Midnight. Shows Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggestion for your damage and threat, and stops while you cast or have no enemy targeted. The suggestion never casts Shield Block or Ignore Pain, so both are reminders whenever they are usable and your target is attacking you; the game hides rage, so Ignore Pain will light more often than you need it. Other reminders: Avatar, Demoralizing Shout and Champion's Spear in combat, Shield Wall and Last Stand when low, Taunt in a group when your target attacks someone else, Battle Shout between pulls, Pummel."
L["Default.Retail.Warrior.Protection.Description"] = "推薦至暗之夜的防護專精使用。顯示暴雪針對傷害與威脅值的戰鬥助手建議，並在你施法或沒有選取敵人時停止。該建議從不施放盾牌格擋或無視苦痛，因此只要它們可用且你的目標正在攻擊你，兩者都會作為提醒亮起；遊戲會隱藏怒氣，因此無視苦痛亮起的次數會比你實際需要的更多。其他提醒：戰鬥中的巨像化身、挫志怒吼與勇士之矛、生命力偏低時使用盾牆與破釜沉舟、在隊伍中你的目標攻擊其他人時使用嘲諷、兩波拉怪之間的戰鬥怒吼、拳擊。"
-- en: "Warrior: Protection (Retail, Icy Veins reference)"
L["Default.Retail.Warrior.Protection.IcyVeins.Name"] = "戰士：防護（正式版，Icy Veins 參考）"
-- en: "Reference only, off by default: the Icy Veins and SimulationCraft order reads rage, Shield Block, Thunder Blast and Colossal Might, which Midnight hides in combat. Charge to open; Ravager; Thunder Blast at two stacks; Demolish at five Colossal Might; Shield Charge; Thunder Blast; Shield Slam; Thunder Clap; Execute; Revenge; Devastate. Reminders: Shield Block when its buff is down and you are tanking, Ignore Pain at 65 rage or more, Avatar, Demoralizing Shout, Champion's Spear, Shield Wall and Last Stand when low, Battle Shout, Pummel."
L["Default.Retail.Warrior.Protection.IcyVeins.Description"] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：Icy Veins 與 SimulationCraft 的施放順序需要讀取怒氣、盾牌格擋、雷霆暴擊與巨像之力，而至暗之夜會在戰鬥中隱藏它們。以衝鋒開場；劫毀旋刃；兩層時使用雷霆暴擊；巨像之力達到五層時使用毀壞；盾牌衝鋒；雷霆暴擊；盾牌猛擊；雷霆一擊；斬殺；復仇；挫敗。提醒：盾牌格擋增益效果消失且你正在坦克時使用盾牌格擋、怒氣達到 65 以上時使用無視苦痛、巨像化身、挫志怒吼、勇士之矛、生命力偏低時使用盾牆與破釜沉舟、戰鬥怒吼、拳擊。"
-- en: "Druid: Balance"
L["Default.Era.Druid.Balance.Name"] = "德魯伊：平衡"
-- en: "Balance from level 1 to 60, and the Druid default before talents or when no other premade fits. Starfire as the filler once learned (Wrath before that, Starfire first on a Nature's Grace proc), Moonfire and Insect Swarm kept on targets that will live while your mana is above 30%, Hurricane when three or more enemies are on you, Faerie Fire in a group, instants while moving, melee when out of mana. In Cat or Bear Form it gives the Feral advice instead. Reminders: Mark of the Wild, Thorns when solo, Omen of Clarity, Moonkin Form, Innervate, Nature's Grasp. Downranking Starfire, roots and target choice stay with you."
L["Default.Era.Druid.Balance.Description"] = "平衡，適用於 1 至 60 級，也是德魯伊在取得天賦前或沒有其他內建循環適用時的預設循環。學會星火術後以它作為填充（之前為憤怒；自然之賜觸發時先使用星火術），法力高於 30% 時對會存活較久的目標維持月火術與蟲群，三個以上敵人與你交戰時使用颶風，隊伍中使用精靈之火，移動時使用瞬發法術，法力耗盡時近戰。獵豹或熊形態下會改為提供野性戰鬥的建議。提醒：野性印記、單人時的荊棘術、清晰預兆、梟獸形態、啟動、自然之握。星火術的降級施法、定身與目標選擇由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Druid: Balance (Icy Veins)"
L["Default.Era.Druid.Balance.IcyVeins.Name"] = "德魯伊：平衡（Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Icy Veins' raid list for realms with the 16-debuff limit: Starfire and nothing else, no Moonfire or Insect Swarm, Hurricane when three or more enemies are on you, Wrath only before Starfire is learned. Same reminders as the recommended Balance premade. Off unless you disable the recommended one or choose it."
L["Default.Era.Druid.Balance.IcyVeins.Description"] = "Icy Veins 針對有 16 個減益效果上限之伺服器的團隊清單：只使用星火術，不使用月火術或蟲群，三個以上敵人與你交戰時使用颶風，只在學會星火術之前使用憤怒。提醒與推薦的平衡內建循環相同。除非你停用推薦的內建循環或選擇它，否則不會使用。"
-- en: "Druid: Feral"
L["Default.Era.Druid.Feral.Name"] = "德魯伊：野性戰鬥"
-- en: "Feral cat and bear from level 10 when Feral is your main talent tree; your form decides which. Cat: stealth opener, Faerie Fire (Feral) kept up, Clearcasting spent on Shred, a finisher from four combo points (Rip before Ferocious Bite is learned and on long fights outside raids, Bite under 63 energy), Rake outside raids, Shred from behind or Claw when the target is on you, and a powershift (Cat Form again) when far short of energy with Furor 5/5 and mana to spare. Bear: Enrage when starved, Demoralizing Roar on packs and elites unless a warrior's Shout is up, Swipe on two or more and with spare rage, Faerie Fire (Feral) otherwise. Caster form: shift. Reminders: Maul every swing, Tiger's Fury before a pull, Manual Crowd Pummeler, Innervate, Frenzied Regeneration. Positioning stays with you."
L["Default.Era.Druid.Feral.Description"] = "野性戰鬥是你的主要天賦樹時，從 10 級起的獵豹與熊；由你的形態決定使用哪一種。獵豹：潛行起手，維持精靈之火（野性），節能施法用於撕碎，四個連擊點起使用終結技（學會兇猛撕咬之前以及團隊以外的長時間戰鬥時用撕扯，能量低於 63 時用兇猛撕咬），團隊以外使用掃擊，在目標背後使用撕碎，目標正在攻擊你時使用爪擊，能量遠遠不足、激怒 5/5 且法力有餘時變身回能（再次進入獵豹形態）。熊：缺乏怒氣時使用狂怒，除非已有戰士的挫志怒吼，否則對怪群與精英使用挫志咆哮，兩個以上敵人或怒氣有餘時使用揮擊，否則使用精靈之火（野性）。施法者形態：變身。提醒：每次揮擊都使用槌擊、拉怪前的猛虎之怒、手動群體打擊者、啟動、狂暴回復。站位由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Druid: Feral (Warcraft Tavern, Rip and Bite)"
L["Default.Era.Druid.Feral.WarcraftTavern.Name"] = "德魯伊：野性戰鬥（Warcraft Tavern，撕扯與撕咬）"
-- en: "Warcraft Tavern's powershifting list: Rip at five combo points whenever it is missing, raids included, then Ferocious Bite from four combo points under 63 energy, Shred from behind, powershift when far short of energy. Bear and reminders as the recommended Feral premade."
L["Default.Era.Druid.Feral.WarcraftTavern.Description"] = "Warcraft Tavern 的變身回能清單：五個連擊點時只要撕扯不在就施放（包括團隊中），接著能量低於 63 時從四個連擊點起使用兇猛撕咬，在目標背後使用撕碎，能量遠遠不足時變身回能。熊形態與提醒與推薦的野性戰鬥內建循環相同。"
-- en: "Druid: Feral (Warcraft Tavern, no powershifting)"
L["Default.Era.Druid.Feral.WarcraftTavernCasual.Name"] = "德魯伊：野性戰鬥（Warcraft Tavern，不變身回能）"
-- en: "Warcraft Tavern's list without powershifting: build to five combo points with Shred (Claw from the front), then Rip on a target that will live, Tiger's Fury, Ferocious Bite; otherwise wait for energy. Bear and reminders as the recommended Feral premade."
L["Default.Era.Druid.Feral.WarcraftTavernCasual.Description"] = "Warcraft Tavern 不含變身回能的清單：以撕碎累積到五個連擊點（在目標正面時用爪擊），接著對會存活的目標使用撕扯、猛虎之怒、兇猛撕咬；否則等待能量。熊形態與提醒與推薦的野性戰鬥內建循環相同。"
-- en: "Druid: Feral (Wowhead raid bear)"
L["Default.Era.Druid.Feral.Wowhead.Name"] = "德魯伊：野性戰鬥（Wowhead 團隊熊）"
-- en: "The recommended cat with Wowhead's geared raid bear: Maul every swing (tab-Maul packs yourself), Swipe only with 60 rage to spare, Faerie Fire (Feral) otherwise, no Demoralizing Roar and no Enrage in combat."
L["Default.Era.Druid.Feral.Wowhead.Description"] = "推薦的獵豹搭配 Wowhead 的團隊裝備熊：每次揮擊都使用槌擊（對怪群請自行切換目標使用槌擊），只有在有 60 點多餘怒氣時才使用揮擊，否則使用精靈之火（野性），戰鬥中不使用挫志咆哮也不使用狂怒。"
-- en: "Druid: Restoration"
L["Default.Era.Druid.Restoration.Name"] = "德魯伊：恢復"
-- en: "Restoration from level 10 when Restoration is your main talent tree. Heals your current friendly target: Healing Touch after Nature's Swiftness, Swiftmend below 40% on your own HoT, Rejuvenation and Regrowth kept rolling, Regrowth as the main heal with Improved Regrowth, full Healing Touch below 45% or on a Nature's Grace proc, rank 4 Healing Touch otherwise. On an enemy: Moonfire, Insect Swarm and Wrath. Silent in Cat or Bear Form. Reminders: Mark of the Wild, Omen of Clarity, Nature's Swiftness, Tranquility, Innervate, Rebirth, poison and curse removal. Choosing whom to heal stays with you."
L["Default.Era.Druid.Restoration.Description"] = "恢復是你的主要天賦樹時，從 10 級起的治療。治療你目前的友方目標：自然迅捷後使用治療之觸，對帶有你自己的持續治療效果且生命力低於 40% 的目標使用迅癒，持續維持回春術與癒合，有強化癒合時以癒合作為主要治療，生命力低於 45% 或自然之賜觸發時使用最高等級的治療之觸，否則使用等級 4 的治療之觸。目標為敵人時：月火術、蟲群與憤怒。獵豹或熊形態下不提供建議。提醒：野性印記、清晰預兆、自然迅捷、寧靜、啟動、復生、驅除中毒與詛咒。要治療誰由你決定。"
-- en: "Druid: Restoration (Warcraft Tavern)"
L["Default.Era.Druid.Restoration.WarcraftTavern.Name"] = "德魯伊：恢復（Warcraft Tavern）"
-- en: "Warcraft Tavern's damage tiers on your friendly target, with no HoT upkeep while damage is low: Swiftmend below 40%, rank 5 Regrowth below 50%, Rejuvenation and rank 3 Regrowth below 75%, full Healing Touch on a Nature's Grace proc, rank 3 Healing Touch below 90%. Reminders as the recommended Restoration premade."
L["Default.Era.Druid.Restoration.WarcraftTavern.Description"] = "Warcraft Tavern 依傷害程度分級的治療，作用於你的友方目標，傷害不高時不維持持續治療效果：低於 40% 時使用迅癒，低於 50% 時使用等級 5 的癒合，低於 75% 時使用回春術與等級 3 的癒合，自然之賜觸發時使用最高等級的治療之觸，低於 90% 時使用等級 3 的治療之觸。提醒與推薦的恢復內建循環相同。"
-- en: "Druid: Balance (Season of Discovery)"
L["Default.SoD.Druid.Balance.Name"] = "德魯伊：平衡（探索賽季）"
-- en: "Season of Discovery Balance from level 1 to 60, and the default for any Druid no other Season of Discovery premade fits. Starsurge whenever its buff is down, Sunfire and Moonfire on targets that will live, Starfire only when Starsurge or Lunar Eclipse empowers it, Wrath as the filler, Hurricane on six or more enemies, Insect Swarm only while moving. Runes are used as you engrave them. In Cat or Bear Form it gives the Feral advice. Reminders: Moonkin Form, Starfall, instant Healing Touch on a dying friend, curse and poison removal, Wild Growth on a hurt group, Innervate. Spreading DoTs to other targets stays with you."
L["Default.SoD.Druid.Balance.Description"] = "探索賽季的平衡，適用於 1 至 60 級，也是沒有其他探索賽季內建循環適用時所有德魯伊的預設循環。星湧術的增益效果消失時就使用星湧術，對會存活較久的目標使用日炎術與月火術，只有在星湧術或月蝕強化時才使用星火術，憤怒作為填充，六個以上敵人時使用颶風，只在移動時使用蟲群。符文會在你紋刻後納入使用。獵豹或熊形態下會提供野性戰鬥的建議。提醒：梟獸形態、星殞術、對瀕死的友方使用瞬發治療之觸、驅除詛咒與中毒、隊伍受傷時使用野性痊癒、啟動。將持續傷害效果擴散到其他目標由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Druid: Balance (Season of Discovery, Icy Veins)"
L["Default.SoD.Druid.Balance.IcyVeins.Name"] = "德魯伊：平衡（探索賽季，Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Icy Veins' Season of Discovery list: Starsurge on cooldown, Hurricane on four or more enemies (for Gale Winds), Starfire when Starsurge empowers it, Moonfire, Sunfire and Insect Swarm all kept up, Wrath as the filler. Reminders as the recommended premade."
L["Default.SoD.Druid.Balance.IcyVeins.Description"] = "Icy Veins 的探索賽季清單：星湧術冷卻結束即使用，四個以上敵人時使用颶風（為了極速強風），星湧術強化時使用星火術，維持月火術、日炎術與蟲群，憤怒作為填充。提醒與推薦的內建循環相同。"
-- en: "Druid: Balance (Season of Discovery, Wowhead)"
L["Default.SoD.Druid.Balance.Wowhead.Name"] = "德魯伊：平衡（探索賽季，Wowhead）"
-- en: "Wowhead's Phase 8 list: Wrath to open, Starsurge on cooldown, Hurricane on six or more, Insect Swarm only while moving, Sunfire and Moonfire kept up, Wrath while your Sunfire has under 5 seconds so Elune's Fires extends it, Starfire on Lunar Eclipse, Wrath otherwise. Reminders as the recommended premade."
L["Default.SoD.Druid.Balance.Wowhead.Description"] = "Wowhead 的第 8 階段清單：以憤怒開場，星湧術冷卻結束即使用，六個以上敵人時使用颶風，只在移動時使用蟲群，維持日炎術與月火術，你的日炎術剩不到 5 秒時使用憤怒，讓伊露恩之火延長它，月蝕時使用星火術，否則使用憤怒。提醒與推薦的內建循環相同。"
-- en: "Druid: Feral cat (Season of Discovery)"
L["Default.SoD.Druid.Feral.Name"] = "德魯伊：野性戰鬥獵豹（探索賽季）"
-- en: "Season of Discovery cat, chosen when Savage Roar is engraved (or Feral is your main tree without another legs rune). Faerie Fire (Feral) when none is up, Savage Roar, Swipe (Cat) on four or more enemies, the Mangle debuff, Clearcasting on Shred, Rip at five combo points while Savage Roar has 8 seconds left, Rake, Shred from behind or Mangle from the front, powershift with Furor 5/5, Faerie Fire refresh last. In Bear Form it gives the tank advice. Reminders: Tiger's Fury at 60 energy or less, Berserk with Tiger's Fury, Maul, Innervate. Positioning stays with you."
L["Default.SoD.Druid.Feral.Description"] = "探索賽季的獵豹，已紋刻兇蠻咆哮時選用（或野性戰鬥是你的主要天賦樹且沒有其他腿部符文時）。沒有精靈之火時使用精靈之火（野性），兇蠻咆哮，四個以上敵人時使用揮擊（獵豹形態），割碎減益效果，節能施法用於撕碎，五個連擊點且兇蠻咆哮剩餘 8 秒時使用撕扯，掃擊，在目標背後使用撕碎或在正面使用割碎，激怒 5/5 時變身回能，最後刷新精靈之火。熊形態下會提供坦克的建議。提醒：能量 60 以下時使用猛虎之怒、搭配猛虎之怒使用狂暴、槌擊、啟動。站位由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Druid: Bear tank (Season of Discovery)"
L["Default.SoD.Druid.Tank.Name"] = "德魯伊：熊坦克（探索賽季）"
-- en: "Season of Discovery bear tank, chosen when Lacerate is engraved. Faerie Fire (Feral) or Sunfire (Bear) to pull from range, Lacerate before it drops, Mangle on cooldown, Lacerate, Swipe; on three or more enemies Mangle under Berserk and Swipe. In Cat Form it plays the cat list for off-tanking; in caster form it shifts to Bear. Reminders: Maul with 30 rage, Berserk, Survival Instincts, Frenzied Regeneration and Barkskin when low, Enrage between pulls, Demoralizing Roar on elites. Taunting and target choice stay with you."
L["Default.SoD.Druid.Tank.Description"] = "探索賽季的熊坦克，已紋刻割裂時選用。以精靈之火（野性）或日炎術（熊形態）從遠處拉怪，割裂消失前續上，割碎冷卻結束即使用，割裂，揮擊；三個以上敵人時在狂暴期間使用割碎與揮擊。獵豹形態下會執行獵豹清單以作為副坦；施法者形態下會變身為熊形態。提醒：30 點怒氣時使用槌擊、狂暴、求生本能、生命力低時使用狂暴回復與樹皮術、兩波拉怪之間使用狂怒、對精英使用挫志咆哮。嘲諷與目標選擇由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Druid: Bear tank (Season of Discovery, wowsims cat weave)"
L["Default.SoD.Druid.Tank.Wowsims.Name"] = "德魯伊：熊坦克（探索賽季，wowsims 獵豹穿插）"
-- en: "Off by default; for experts whose gear also grants Savage Roar. The wowsims Phase 7 cat weave: leave Bear for Cat when your Rake is down, keep Savage Roar and Rake up (Tiger's Fury, Mangle to build), then return to Dire Bear and play the tank list. Reminders as the recommended tank premade."
L["Default.SoD.Druid.Tank.Wowsims.Description"] = "預設關閉；適合裝備也提供兇蠻咆哮的進階玩家。wowsims 第 7 階段的獵豹穿插：你的掃擊消失時從熊形態切換為獵豹形態，維持兇蠻咆哮與掃擊（以猛虎之怒、割碎累積連擊點），然後回到巨熊形態並執行坦克清單。提醒與推薦的坦克內建循環相同。"
-- en: "Druid: Restoration (Season of Discovery)"
L["Default.SoD.Druid.Restoration.Name"] = "德魯伊：恢復（探索賽季）"
-- en: "Season of Discovery Restoration, chosen when Lifebloom is engraved (or Restoration is your main tree without another legs rune). Heals your current friendly target: instant Healing Touch after Nature's Swiftness or Fury of Stormrage, Wild Growth when two or more nearby are hurt, Swiftmend on your HoT for Efflorescence or below 40%, three Lifebloom stacks refreshed with a second left, Rejuvenation, Regrowth below 60%, Nourish, rank 4 Healing Touch. On an enemy: Sunfire, Moonfire, Wrath. Reminders: Tree of Life and Survival Instincts in heavy moments, Nature's Swiftness, Tranquility, Innervate, Rebirth, Revive, dispels. Choosing whom to heal stays with you."
L["Default.SoD.Druid.Restoration.Description"] = "探索賽季的恢復，已紋刻生命之花時選用（或恢復是你的主要天賦樹且沒有其他腿部符文時）。治療你目前的友方目標：自然迅捷或怒風之怒後使用瞬發治療之觸，附近有兩名以上受傷時使用野性痊癒，對帶有你的持續治療效果的目標使用迅癒以觸發生命綻放，或在低於 40% 時使用，三層生命之花在剩下一秒時刷新，回春術，低於 60% 時使用癒合，滋補術，等級 4 的治療之觸。目標為敵人時：日炎術、月火術、憤怒。提醒：危急時刻的生命之樹與求生本能、自然迅捷、寧靜、啟動、復生、復活、驅散。要治療誰由你決定。"
-- en: "Hunter: Ranged"
L["Default.Era.Hunter.Ranged.Name"] = "獵人：遠程"
-- en: "Every Hunter from level 1 to 60, all talent trees. Pull with Hunter's Mark, Aimed Shot and Auto Shot. Solo, the pet tanks: your own Serpent Sting, then Aimed Shot, Arcane Shot and Multi-Shot only while mana is above half, Concussive Shot to kite before you have a pet. In a group, Aimed Shot and Multi-Shot right after an Auto Shot so it is never delayed, Serpent Sting outside raids, Arcane Shot only before Aimed Shot or on a dying target. Melee buttons when an enemy is too close, instants while moving, Multi-Shot and Volley on three or more enemies. Reminders: Hawk (Monkey before it), Trueshot Aura, pet care, Rapid Fire, Bestial Wrath and racials on elites and in instances, Intimidation and Feign Death. Traps, Wing Clip, Feed Pet, Tranquilizing Shot and positioning stay with you."
L["Default.Era.Hunter.Ranged.Description"] = "所有獵人，1 至 60 級，所有天賦樹。以獵人印記、瞄準射擊與自動射擊拉怪。單人時由寵物坦怪：先上你自己的毒蛇釘刺，接著只有在法力高於一半時才使用瞄準射擊、秘法射擊與多重射擊，還沒有寵物時以震盪射擊放風箏。隊伍中，在自動射擊後立即使用瞄準射擊與多重射擊，讓自動射擊永遠不被延遲，團隊以外使用毒蛇釘刺，秘法射擊只在學會瞄準射擊之前或對即將死亡的目標使用。敵人太近時使用近戰技能，移動時使用瞬發技能，三個以上敵人時使用多重射擊與亂射。提醒：雄鷹守護（學會前為靈猴守護）、強擊光環、寵物照料、對精英與在副本中使用急速射擊、狂野怒火與種族技能、脅迫與假死。陷阱、摔絆、餵養寵物、寧神射擊與站位由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Hunter: Ranged, clipped (Icy Veins)"
L["Default.Era.Hunter.Ranged.IcyVeins.Name"] = "獵人：遠程，延遲自動射擊（Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Off by default; enable it for a ranged weapon faster than 3.0 seconds. Like Hunter: Ranged, but in a group Aimed Shot and Multi-Shot go out as soon as they are ready, even if that delays an Auto Shot, Serpent Sting is never used, and Rapid Fire, Bestial Wrath and racials are used on every pull."
L["Default.Era.Hunter.Ranged.IcyVeins.Description"] = "預設關閉；如果你的遠程武器速度快於 3.0 秒，請啟用它。與「獵人：遠程」相同，但在隊伍中瞄準射擊與多重射擊一就緒就施放，即使會延遲自動射擊也一樣，從不使用毒蛇釘刺，並且每次拉怪都使用急速射擊、狂野怒火與種族技能。"
-- en: "Hunter: Ranged, raid Serpent Sting (wowsims)"
L["Default.Era.Hunter.Ranged.Wowsims.Name"] = "獵人：遠程，團隊毒蛇釘刺（wowsims）"
-- en: "Off by default; enable it where the raid has debuff room for your sting. Like Hunter: Ranged, but in a group Serpent Sting is kept up everywhere, raids included, refreshed under 5 seconds while Aimed Shot and Multi-Shot are both cooling, and Arcane Shot is never used."
L["Default.Era.Hunter.Ranged.Wowsims.Description"] = "預設關閉；如果團隊有空間容納你的釘刺減益效果，請啟用它。與「獵人：遠程」相同，但在隊伍中隨時維持毒蛇釘刺（包括團隊中），在瞄準射擊與多重射擊都在冷卻時，若剩不到 5 秒就刷新，並且從不使用秘法射擊。"
-- en: "Hunter: Ranged (Season of Discovery)"
L["Default.SoD.Hunter.Ranged.Name"] = "獵人：遠程（探索賽季）"
-- en: "Every ranged Hunter on a Season of Discovery realm, level 1 to 60; runes are used once engraved. Serpent Sting always up and refreshed by Chimera Shot. With the Kill Shot legs rune: Multi-Shot at four Trick Shots, Kill Shot during Rapid Fire and on targets in execute, Chimera Shot, then Explosive Trap and Arcane Shot while Multi-Shot is cooling. Without it: Chimera Shot, Aimed Shot at two Sniper Training stacks or right after an Auto Shot, traps just before Chimera Shot is ready to feed Lock and Load, Explosive Shot, Steady Shot, Multi-Shot, Arcane Shot. Melee buttons when an enemy is too close, instants while moving, traps, Multi-Shot and Volley on three or more enemies. Reminders: Hawk, Viper below 10% mana, Heart of the Lion, Trueshot Aura, pet care, Focus Fire at five Frenzy stacks, Rapid Fire, racials and Bestial Wrath on elites and in instances. The pre-pull Frost Trap, melee weaving and positioning stay with you."
L["Default.SoD.Hunter.Ranged.Description"] = "探索賽季伺服器上的所有遠程獵人，1 至 60 級；符文紋刻後即納入使用。毒蛇釘刺持續維持，並以奇美拉射擊刷新。有擊殺射擊腿部符文時：四層花式射擊時使用多重射擊，急速射擊期間以及對斬殺範圍內的目標使用擊殺射擊，奇美拉射擊，然後在多重射擊冷卻時使用爆炸陷阱與秘法射擊。沒有它時：奇美拉射擊，兩層狙擊訓練時或自動射擊後立即使用瞄準射擊，在奇美拉射擊即將就緒前放置陷阱以觸發蓄勢待發，爆裂射擊，穩固射擊，多重射擊，秘法射擊。敵人太近時使用近戰技能，移動時使用瞬發技能，三個以上敵人時使用陷阱、多重射擊與亂射。提醒：雄鷹守護、法力低於 10% 時使用蝮蛇守護、雄獅之心、強擊光環、寵物照料、五層狂亂時使用專注射擊、急速射擊、對精英與在副本中使用種族技能與狂野怒火。拉怪前的冰霜陷阱、近戰穿插與站位由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Hunter: Melee (Season of Discovery)"
L["Default.SoD.Hunter.Melee.Name"] = "獵人：近戰（探索賽季）"
-- en: "Chosen on a Season of Discovery realm once you engrave Flanking Strike, Wyvern Strike or Carve and neither Chimera Shot nor Explosive Shot. Keeps the Flanking Strike buff up, Mongoose Bite at four Raptor Fury stacks, Wyvern Strike on Clever Strikes, Raptor Strike on every reset, then Mongoose Bite, Wyvern Strike, Flanking Strike and Carve; Immolation Trap and Wing Clip only in empty moments. Carve and Explosive Trap on three or more enemies; Serpent Sting and shots while you cannot reach the target. Reminders: Aspect of the Falcon (Hawk before 60), Viper below 5% mana, pet care, Rapid Fire and racials once Flanking Strike has stacked, Bestial Wrath. Positioning and pet commands stay with you."
L["Default.SoD.Hunter.Melee.Description"] = "在探索賽季伺服器上，紋刻了側翼攻擊、蠍尾獅打擊或橫劈，且未紋刻奇美拉射擊或爆裂射擊時選用。維持側翼攻擊的增益效果，四層猛禽狂怒時使用貓鼬撕咬，機敏打擊時使用蠍尾獅打擊，每次重置時使用猛禽一擊，接著是貓鼬撕咬、蠍尾獅打擊、側翼攻擊與橫劈；獻祭陷阱與摔絆只在空檔時使用。三個以上敵人時使用橫劈與爆炸陷阱；無法接近目標時使用毒蛇釘刺與射擊。提醒：獵鷹守護（60 級前為雄鷹守護）、法力低於 5% 時使用蝮蛇守護、寵物照料、側翼攻擊疊層後使用急速射擊與種族技能、狂野怒火。站位與寵物指令由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Mage: Frost"
L["Default.Era.Mage.Frost.Name"] = "法師：冰霜"
-- en: "Frost from level 1 to 60, also for Arcane builds and the Mage default before talents. Frostbolt (Fireball before level 4); Frost Nova when a mob reaches you, except on raid bosses; Arcane Missiles once a mob reaches you if you have Improved Arcane Missiles; Cone of Cold, Arcane Explosion and Blizzard when three or more enemies are engaged; Fire Blast while moving with mana to spare; Fire Blast and the wand finish ordinary mobs when solo; wand when out of mana. Reminders: armor (Ice Armor solo, Mage Armor in a group, never replacing one you chose), Arcane Intellect, conjuring and using mana gems, Ice Barrier, Mana Shield, Evocation, Counterspell, Remove Lesser Curse, Ice Block, Cold Snap, Arcane Power and Presence of Mind. Off by default: the Shatter Flamestrike and rank-1 Frostbolt to stack Winter's Chill. Blink, Polymorph, kiting and target choice stay with you."
L["Default.Era.Mage.Frost.Description"] = "冰霜，適用於 1 至 60 級，也適用於秘法天賦配置，並且是法師在取得天賦前的預設循環。寒冰箭（4 級前為火球術）；怪物接近你時使用冰霜新星，團隊首領除外；若你有強化秘法飛彈，怪物接近你後使用秘法飛彈；三個以上敵人交戰時使用冰錐術、魔爆術與暴風雪；移動時若法力有餘則使用火焰衝擊；單人時以火焰衝擊與魔杖收掉普通怪物；法力耗盡時使用魔杖。提醒：護甲（單人時冰甲術，隊伍中魔甲術，絕不替換你自己選的護甲）、秘法智慧、製造與使用法力寶石、寒冰護體、法力護盾、喚醒、法術反制、解除次級詛咒、寒冰屏障、急速冷卻、秘法強化與氣定神閒。預設關閉：搭配碎冰的烈焰風暴，以及用等級 1 的寒冰箭疊加深冬之寒。閃現術、變形術、放風箏與目標選擇由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Mage: Frost AoE grinding (Icy Veins)"
L["Default.Era.Mage.Frost.IcyVeins.Name"] = "法師：冰霜群體練功（Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Blizzard leveling after Icy Veins' AoE grinding guide, chosen automatically when you play solo with Improved Blizzard. From two engaged enemies: Frost Nova the pack, Cone of Cold while Nova is cooling, Blizzard once nothing is next to you, Arcane Explosion when they are; Frostbolt on a single target, Fire Blast and the wand to finish. Mana Shield and Ice Barrier go up before each pull. Gathering the pack, Blink and kiting stay with you."
L["Default.Era.Mage.Frost.IcyVeins.Description"] = "依據 Icy Veins 群體練功指南的暴風雪升級法，在你單人遊玩且擁有強化暴風雪時自動選用。兩個以上敵人交戰時：對怪群使用冰霜新星，冰霜新星冷卻時使用冰錐術，身邊沒有敵人時使用暴風雪，有敵人在身邊時使用魔爆術；單一目標使用寒冰箭，以火焰衝擊與魔杖收尾。每次拉怪前施放法力護盾與寒冰護體。聚集怪群、閃現術與放風箏由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Mage: Fire"
L["Default.Era.Mage.Fire.Name"] = "法師：火焰"
-- en: "Fire from level 10 to 60, chosen when you have Fire points and none in Frost, or Fire is your main tree. Pyroblast (else Fireball) opens; Pyroblast after Presence of Mind; Scorch keeps five Fire Vulnerability stacks with Improved Scorch on targets that will live; Fire Blast and Scorch finish; Fireball fills. Three or more engaged enemies: Blast Wave, Flamestrike, Arcane Explosion, Cone of Cold, Blizzard. Reminders: Combustion at five Scorch stacks on elites and long fights, armor, Arcane Intellect, mana gems, Ice Barrier, Mana Shield, Evocation, Counterspell, Remove Lesser Curse, Ice Block, Presence of Mind. Off by default: weaving Fire Blast whenever it is ready."
L["Default.Era.Mage.Fire.Description"] = "火焰，適用於 10 至 60 級，在你有火焰天賦點數且沒有冰霜點數，或火焰是你的主要天賦樹時選用。以炎爆術開場（否則用火球術）；氣定神閒後使用炎爆術；擁有強化灼燒時，以灼燒對會存活較久的目標維持五層火焰易傷；以火焰衝擊與灼燒收尾；火球術作為填充。三個以上敵人交戰時：衝擊波、烈焰風暴、魔爆術、冰錐術、暴風雪。提醒：對精英與長時間戰鬥在灼燒疊滿五層時使用燃燒、護甲、秘法智慧、法力寶石、寒冰護體、法力護盾、喚醒、法術反制、解除次級詛咒、寒冰屏障、氣定神閒。預設關閉：火焰衝擊一就緒就穿插施放。"
-- en: "Mage: Fire (Warcraft Tavern)"
L["Default.Era.Mage.Fire.WarcraftTavern.Name"] = "法師：火焰（Warcraft Tavern）"
-- en: "Fire after Warcraft Tavern, for players who pick it over the default Fire premade. Combustion is spent at the pull on elites and bosses instead of waiting for Scorch stacks; Pyroblast opens; Scorch keeps five stacks with Improved Scorch; Fireball fills; Fire Blast only while moving. Packs: Flamestrike first, then Arcane Explosion, Cone of Cold and Blast Wave close in, Blizzard at range. Same reminders as the Fire premade."
L["Default.Era.Mage.Fire.WarcraftTavern.Description"] = "依據 Warcraft Tavern 的火焰，適合選擇它而非預設火焰內建循環的玩家。對精英與首領在拉怪時就使用燃燒，而不是等待灼燒疊層；以炎爆術開場；擁有強化灼燒時以灼燒維持五層；火球術作為填充；火焰衝擊只在移動時使用。怪群時：先烈焰風暴，然後近距離時使用魔爆術、冰錐術與衝擊波，遠距離時使用暴風雪。提醒與火焰內建循環相同。"
-- en: "Mage: Fire (Season of Discovery)"
L["Default.SoD.Mage.Fire.Name"] = "法師：火焰（探索賽季）"
-- en: "Season of Discovery Fire from level 1 to 60, and the Mage default there. Uses the runes you have engraved: Pyroblast on Hot Streak at once; Living Bomb kept on targets that will live; Scorch with Improved Scorch while Fire Vulnerability is below two stacks or about to fade; Living Flame on cooldown; Balefire Bolt at five Fire Vulnerability stacks, never at four Balefire stacks or more (the fifth kills you); Frostfire Bolt, else Fireball. Living Bomb, Living Flame and Fire Blast while moving; Living Flame, Living Bomb, Blast Wave, Cone of Cold, Flamestrike and Blizzard on packs. Reminders: Fire Blast with Overheat, Combustion, Icy Veins and Cold Snap, Molten or other armor, Arcane Intellect, mana gems, Ice Barrier, Mana Shield, Evocation, Counterspell, curse removal, Ice Block. Spreading Living Bomb across targets stays with you."
L["Default.SoD.Mage.Fire.Description"] = "探索賽季的火焰，適用於 1 至 60 級，也是探索賽季中法師的預設循環。使用你已紋刻的符文：焦炎之痕觸發時立即使用炎爆術；對會存活較久的目標維持活體爆彈；擁有強化灼燒時，在火焰易傷少於兩層或即將消失時使用灼燒；活化烈焰冷卻結束即使用；火焰易傷五層時使用野火箭，但野火箭已疊到四層以上時絕不使用（第五層會殺死你）；霜火箭，否則火球術。移動時使用活體爆彈、活化烈焰與火焰衝擊；怪群時使用活化烈焰、活體爆彈、衝擊波、冰錐術、烈焰風暴與暴風雪。提醒：過熱時使用火焰衝擊、燃燒、冰寒脈動與急速冷卻、炎甲術或其他護甲、秘法智慧、法力寶石、寒冰護體、法力護盾、喚醒、法術反制、解除詛咒、寒冰屏障。將活體爆彈擴散到多個目標由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Mage: Frost (Season of Discovery)"
L["Default.SoD.Mage.Frost.Name"] = "法師：冰霜（探索賽季）"
-- en: "Season of Discovery Frost from level 10, chosen when Frost is your main tree. Fingers of Frost goes into Ice Lance at three or more of your Glaciate stacks, otherwise into Deep Freeze; Balefire Bolt on a Brain Freeze proc and otherwise when safe, never at four Balefire stacks or more; Living Bomb and Living Flame when engraved; Spellfrost Bolt, else Frostfire Bolt, else Frostbolt. Ice Lance, Frozen Orb, Living Bomb and Fire Blast while moving; Frozen Orb, Living Flame, Living Bomb, Blizzard and Cone of Cold on packs. Reminders: Frozen Orb, Icy Veins, Cold Snap, armor, mana gems and the other Mage reminders. Queuing a spell as a bolt lands stays with you."
L["Default.SoD.Mage.Frost.Description"] = "探索賽季的冰霜，從 10 級起，冰霜是你的主要天賦樹時選用。冰霜之指在你的結冰達到三層以上時用於冰霜長矛，否則用於極度冰凍；腦部凍結觸發時使用野火箭，其他情況在安全時使用，但野火箭已疊到四層以上時絕不使用；已紋刻時使用活體爆彈與活化烈焰；法霜箭，否則霜火箭，再否則寒冰箭。移動時使用冰霜長矛、冰霜之球、活體爆彈與火焰衝擊；怪群時使用冰霜之球、活化烈焰、活體爆彈、暴風雪與冰錐術。提醒：冰霜之球、冰寒脈動、急速冷卻、護甲、法力寶石以及其他法師提醒。在箭類法術即將命中時排入下一個法術由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Mage: Frost, Fire runes (Season of Discovery, Warcraft Tavern)"
L["Default.SoD.Mage.Frost.WarcraftTavern.Name"] = "法師：冰霜，火焰符文（探索賽季，Warcraft Tavern）"
-- en: "Warcraft Tavern's Phase 4 Frost build on Fire runes, for players who pick it over the default SoD Frost premade. Pyroblast opens; Pyroblast on Hot Streak; Living Bomb kept up; Scorch to five stacks with Improved Scorch; Balefire Bolt only on a Brain Freeze proc and never at four Balefire stacks or more; Frostfire Bolt fills. Living Bomb and Fire Blast while moving; Living Bomb, Cone of Cold and Blizzard on packs. Reminders: Fire Blast with Overheat, Frozen Orb during Icy Veins, Icy Veins, Cold Snap and the other Mage reminders."
L["Default.SoD.Mage.Frost.WarcraftTavern.Description"] = "Warcraft Tavern 第 4 階段使用火焰符文的冰霜配置，適合選擇它而非預設探索賽季冰霜內建循環的玩家。以炎爆術開場；焦炎之痕觸發時使用炎爆術；維持活體爆彈；擁有強化灼燒時以灼燒疊到五層；野火箭只在腦部凍結觸發時使用，且野火箭已疊到四層以上時絕不使用；霜火箭作為填充。移動時使用活體爆彈與火焰衝擊；怪群時使用活體爆彈、冰錐術與暴風雪。提醒：過熱時使用火焰衝擊、冰寒脈動期間使用冰霜之球、冰寒脈動、急速冷卻以及其他法師提醒。"
-- en: "Mage: Arcane (Season of Discovery)"
L["Default.SoD.Mage.Arcane.Name"] = "法師：秘法（探索賽季）"
-- en: "Season of Discovery Arcane damage, chosen when Arcane is your main tree and Arcane Blast is engraved. Arcane Missiles on Missile Barrage; Arcane Barrage at four Arcane Blast stacks; Balefire Bolt when safe, never at four Balefire stacks or more; Living Flame on cooldown; Arcane Blast fills. Arcane Barrage and Fire Blast while moving; Living Flame and Arcane Explosion on packs. Reminders: Arcane Power on elites and long fights, Presence of Mind with Arcane Power or while moving, Icy Veins, Cold Snap and the other Mage reminders."
L["Default.SoD.Mage.Arcane.Description"] = "探索賽季的秘法傷害，秘法是你的主要天賦樹且已紋刻秘法衝擊時選用。飛彈彈幕觸發時使用秘法飛彈；四層秘法衝擊時使用秘法彈幕；安全時使用野火箭，但野火箭已疊到四層以上時絕不使用；活化烈焰冷卻結束即使用；秘法衝擊作為填充。移動時使用秘法彈幕與火焰衝擊；怪群時使用活化烈焰與魔爆術。提醒：對精英與長時間戰鬥使用秘法強化、搭配秘法強化或移動時使用氣定神閒、冰寒脈動、急速冷卻以及其他法師提醒。"
-- en: "Mage: Healer (Season of Discovery)"
L["Default.SoD.Mage.Healer.Name"] = "法師：治療（探索賽季）"
-- en: "Season of Discovery Mage healing, chosen when Regeneration or Mass Regeneration is engraved. With a friendly target: Rewind Time and Chronostatic Preservation below half health, Regeneration when your Temporal Beacon is missing, Mass Regeneration, Temporal Anomaly. With an enemy target, damage that heals your beacons: Spellfrost Bolt for Frost healers, otherwise Arcane Missiles on Missile Barrage, Arcane Barrage at two Arcane Blast stacks, Balefire Bolt when safe (never at four Balefire stacks or more) and Arcane Blast. Reminders: Arcane Power, Presence of Mind, Frozen Orb and the other Mage reminders. Off by default: Arcane Explosion on packs, and Ice Lance and Deep Freeze for Frost healers. Choosing whom to heal, and cancelling Mass Regeneration early, stay with you."
L["Default.SoD.Mage.Healer.Description"] = "探索賽季的法師治療，已紋刻再生或群體恢復時選用。友方目標時：生命力低於一半時使用時光倒流與時滯存護，你的時空信標不在時使用再生，群體恢復，時空異象。敵方目標時，使用能治療你信標目標的傷害技能：冰霜治療者使用法霜箭，否則飛彈彈幕觸發時使用秘法飛彈，兩層秘法衝擊時使用秘法彈幕，安全時使用野火箭（野火箭已疊到四層以上時絕不使用）以及秘法衝擊。提醒：秘法強化、氣定神閒、冰霜之球以及其他法師提醒。預設關閉：怪群時使用魔爆術，以及冰霜治療者的冰霜長矛與極度冰凍。要治療誰以及提早取消群體恢復由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Paladin: Retribution"
L["Default.Era.Paladin.Retribution.Name"] = "聖騎士：懲戒"
-- en: "Melee Retribution from level 1 to 60, and the default for any Paladin no other premade fits. On elites and long fights outside raids, puts up Seal of the Crusader and judges it once; otherwise keeps a seal up (Command with a weapon of 3.5 seconds or slower, else Righteousness), Exorcism and Holy Wrath on Undead and Demons, Hammer of Wrath, Judgement on cooldown, Consecration while Vengeance is up or on two or more close enemies. Reminders: Sanctity, Retribution or Devotion Aura, Blessing of Wisdom solo or Might in a group, a heal between fights, Divine Shield, Divine Protection or Lay on Hands when you are about to die. Seal twisting is a separate premade; target choice and positioning stay with you."
L["Default.Era.Paladin.Retribution.Description"] = "懲戒近戰，適用於 1 至 60 級，也是沒有其他內建循環適用時所有聖騎士的預設循環。在團隊以外對精英與長時間戰鬥施放十字軍聖印並審判一次；否則維持一個聖印（武器速度 3.5 秒或更慢時用命令聖印，否則用正義聖印），對不死族與惡魔使用驅邪術與神聖憤怒，憤怒之錘，審判冷卻結束即使用，復仇生效時或附近有兩個以上敵人時使用奉獻。提醒：聖潔光環、懲戒光環或虔誠光環、單人時智慧祝福或隊伍中力量祝福、戰鬥之間治療、即將死亡時使用聖盾術、聖佑術或聖療術。聖印輪替是另一個內建循環；目標選擇與站位由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Paladin: Retribution, seal twisting"
L["Default.Era.Paladin.Retribution.Twist.Name"] = "聖騎士：懲戒，聖印輪替"
-- en: "Off by default; enable it if you twist seals. For a Retribution Paladin with Seal of Command: keeps Seal of Righteousness up, swaps to rank-1 Seal of Command in the last 0.4 seconds before a swing and back again, Judgement whenever it is ready, Exorcism and Holy Wrath on Undead and Demons, Hammer of Wrath, Consecration with Vengeance. Needs a lot of mana and good timing. Same reminders as the Retribution premade."
L["Default.Era.Paladin.Retribution.Twist.Description"] = "預設關閉；如果你會輪替聖印，請啟用它。適用於擁有命令聖印的懲戒聖騎士：維持正義聖印，在揮擊前的最後 0.4 秒切換為等級 1 的命令聖印，然後再換回來，審判一就緒就使用，對不死族與惡魔使用驅邪術與神聖憤怒，憤怒之錘，復仇生效時使用奉獻。需要大量法力與良好的時機掌握。提醒與懲戒內建循環相同。"
-- en: "Paladin: Protection"
L["Default.Era.Paladin.Protection.Name"] = "聖騎士：防護"
-- en: "Tanking from level 1 to 60, chosen by Righteous Fury or the Protection tree. Seal of Righteousness (Seal of Wisdom when mana drops below 40%), Holy Shield and Judgement to pull, Holy Shield kept up, Consecration and Holy Wrath (Undead and Demons) when two or more enemies are on you, otherwise Judgement of the Crusader once, then Judgement and Consecration with mana to spare, Exorcism on Undead and Demons. Reminders: Righteous Fury, Devotion Aura, Sanctuary, Kings or Might, Lay on Hands when nearly dead. Taunting, Blessing of Kings spam and spell ranks stay with you."
L["Default.Era.Paladin.Protection.Description"] = "1 至 60 級的坦克，開啟正義之怒或使用防護天賦樹時選用。以正義聖印（法力低於 40% 時用智慧聖印）、神聖之盾與審判拉怪，維持神聖之盾，兩個以上敵人與你交戰時使用奉獻與神聖憤怒（不死族與惡魔），否則施放一次十字軍審判，然後在法力有餘時使用審判與奉獻，對不死族與惡魔使用驅邪術。提醒：正義之怒、虔誠光環、庇護祝福、王者祝福或力量祝福、瀕死時使用聖療術。嘲諷、連續施放王者祝福與法術等級由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Paladin: Protection, Seal of Wisdom (Icy Veins)"
L["Default.Era.Paladin.Protection.IcyVeins.Name"] = "聖騎士：防護，智慧聖印（Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Icy Veins' raid tanking with Wowhead's Wisdom rotation: keeps Seal of Wisdom up and judges it whenever the target lacks Judgement of Wisdom, otherwise judges only to pull; Holy Shield, Consecration every cooldown, Holy Wrath on Undead and Demon packs, Exorcism, and Greater Blessing of Kings as the threat filler in a raid. Same reminders as the Protection premade."
L["Default.Era.Paladin.Protection.IcyVeins.Description"] = "Icy Veins 的團隊坦克搭配 Wowhead 的智慧循環：維持智慧聖印，目標身上沒有智慧審判時就審判，否則只在拉怪時審判；神聖之盾、奉獻冷卻結束即使用、對不死族與惡魔怪群使用神聖憤怒、驅邪術，並在團隊中以強效王者祝福作為威脅值填充。提醒與防護內建循環相同。"
-- en: "Paladin: Holy"
L["Default.Era.Paladin.Holy.Name"] = "聖騎士：神聖"
-- en: "Healing in a group with the Holy tree, from level 10. Acts on your friendly target and picks the heal by missing health: Cleanse or Purify, Holy Shock while you move, maximum-rank Holy Light below 40%, rank-6 Holy Light below 65%, maximum-rank Flash of Light below 85%, rank-4 Flash of Light below 95%. With an enemy in melee range: Seal of Wisdom and, outside raids, Judgement. Reminders: Concentration or Devotion Aura, Blessing of Wisdom, Divine Favor and Lay on Hands for a target that is very low. Choosing whom to heal stays with you; soloing Holy Paladins get the Retribution premade."
L["Default.Era.Paladin.Holy.Description"] = "神聖天賦樹在隊伍中的治療，從 10 級起。作用於你的友方目標，並依損失的生命力選擇治療法術：清潔術或純淨術，移動時使用神聖震擊，低於 40% 時使用最高等級的聖光術，低於 65% 時使用等級 6 的聖光術，低於 85% 時使用最高等級的聖光閃現，低於 95% 時使用等級 4 的聖光閃現。敵人位於近戰範圍內時：智慧聖印，以及團隊以外的審判。提醒：專注光環或虔誠光環、智慧祝福、對生命力極低的目標使用神恩術與聖療術。要治療誰由你決定；單人練功的神聖聖騎士會使用懲戒內建循環。"
-- en: "Paladin: Retribution (Season of Discovery)"
L["Default.SoD.Paladin.Retribution.Name"] = "聖騎士：懲戒（探索賽季）"
-- en: "Season of Discovery melee from level 1 to 60, and the default for any Paladin there. Keeps Seal of Martyrdom up (Righteousness until you have it), opens with Exorcism, casts Divine Storm at three Holy Power, then by weapon speed: with a two-hander of 3.3 seconds or slower, Crusader Strike, Exorcism, Divine Storm and Judgement; with a faster one, Judgement only as the seal runs out, then Exorcism, Crusader Strike and Divine Storm. Consecration with mana or three close enemies, Holy Wrath on Undead and Demons, Hammer of Wrath. Runes are used as you engrave them. Reminders: Sanctity Aura, a Blessing, Avenging Wrath with Aura Mastery, a heal between fights, Divine Shield when about to die."
L["Default.SoD.Paladin.Retribution.Description"] = "探索賽季的近戰，適用於 1 至 60 級，也是探索賽季中所有聖騎士的預設循環。維持殉難聖印（學會前用正義聖印），以驅邪術開場，三點聖能時施放神性風暴，然後依武器速度決定：使用 3.3 秒或更慢的雙手武器時，十字軍聖擊、驅邪術、神性風暴與審判；使用較快的武器時，只在聖印即將結束時審判，然後是驅邪術、十字軍聖擊與神性風暴。法力充足或附近有三個敵人時使用奉獻，對不死族與惡魔使用神聖憤怒，憤怒之錘。符文會在你紋刻後納入使用。提醒：聖潔光環、一個祝福、搭配精通光環使用復仇之怒、戰鬥之間治療、即將死亡時使用聖盾術。"
-- en: "Paladin: Retribution (Season of Discovery, Icy Veins Phase 4)"
L["Default.SoD.Paladin.Retribution.IcyVeins.Name"] = "聖騎士：懲戒（探索賽季，Icy Veins 第 4 階段）"
-- en: "The older Phase 4 list from Icy Veins and Warcraft Tavern, also fine for leveling, an alternative to the recommended Season of Discovery Retribution premade, off by default: enable it and disable that one, or raise its priority. Judgement of the Crusader once on elites and long fights, Seal of Martyrdom, Exorcism, Crusader Strike, Divine Storm and Judgement on cooldown, Consecration with mana or three close enemies, Hammer of Wrath. Same reminders as the recommended premade."
L["Default.SoD.Paladin.Retribution.IcyVeins.Description"] = "Icy Veins 與 Warcraft Tavern 較舊的第 4 階段清單，也適合升級時使用，是推薦的探索賽季懲戒內建循環的替代方案，預設關閉：啟用它並停用推薦的循環，或提高它的優先順序。對精英與長時間戰鬥施放一次十字軍審判，殉難聖印，驅邪術、十字軍聖擊、神性風暴與審判冷卻結束即使用，法力充足或附近有三個敵人時使用奉獻，憤怒之錘。提醒與推薦的循環相同。"
-- en: "Paladin: Retribution, seal twisting (Season of Discovery)"
L["Default.SoD.Paladin.Retribution.Twist.Name"] = "聖騎士：懲戒，聖印輪替（探索賽季）"
-- en: "Off by default; enable it if you twist with a slow two-hander. Swaps between Seal of Martyrdom and Seal of Command in the last 0.4 seconds before each swing, suggests nothing on the global cooldown in the 1.9 seconds before it, judges while both seals linger, and uses one filler per swing: Divine Storm at three Holy Power, Crusader Strike, Exorcism. Needs a swing timer and practice."
L["Default.SoD.Paladin.Retribution.Twist.Description"] = "預設關閉；如果你會用慢速雙手武器輪替聖印，請啟用它。在每次揮擊前的最後 0.4 秒於殉難聖印與命令聖印之間切換，揮擊前 1.9 秒內不建議任何會觸發共用冷卻的技能，兩個聖印同時存在時審判，每次揮擊使用一個填充技能：三點聖能時使用神性風暴、十字軍聖擊、驅邪術。需要攻擊計時器與練習。"
-- en: "Paladin: Retribution, seal stacking (Season of Discovery)"
L["Default.SoD.Paladin.Retribution.Stacking.Name"] = "聖騎士：懲戒，聖印疊加（探索賽季）"
-- en: "Off by default; enable it with the Soul of the Sealbearer rune or the six-piece set that makes seals linger (Rotation Master cannot see either). Keeps both Seal of Command and Seal of Martyrdom up, Divine Storm at three Holy Power, Crusader Strike, Exorcism, Holy Wrath on Undead and Demons, Consecration, and Judgement while both seals are up."
L["Default.SoD.Paladin.Retribution.Stacking.Description"] = "預設關閉；如果你有守秘者之魂符文或讓聖印延續的六件套裝，請啟用它（Rotation Master 無法看到這兩者）。同時維持命令聖印與殉難聖印，三點聖能時使用神性風暴、十字軍聖擊、驅邪術、對不死族與惡魔使用神聖憤怒、奉獻，並在兩個聖印都存在時審判。"
-- en: "Paladin: Shockadin (Season of Discovery, wowsims)"
L["Default.SoD.Paladin.Shockadin.Name"] = "聖騎士：震擊聖騎（探索賽季，wowsims）"
-- en: "Off by default; enable it if you deal damage with the Holy tree. Seal of Martyrdom (else Righteousness), judged as it runs out, Holy Shock to keep Sunlight up or at three Holy Power, Exorcism and Crusader Strike. Same reminders as the Season of Discovery Retribution premade."
L["Default.SoD.Paladin.Shockadin.Description"] = "預設關閉；如果你用神聖天賦樹造成傷害，請啟用它。殉難聖印（否則用正義聖印），在即將結束時審判，以神聖震擊維持日光或在三點聖能時使用，驅邪術與十字軍聖擊。提醒與探索賽季懲戒內建循環相同。"
-- en: "Paladin: Protection (Season of Discovery)"
L["Default.SoD.Paladin.Protection.Name"] = "聖騎士：防護（探索賽季）"
-- en: "Season of Discovery tanking, chosen by Righteous Fury, an engraved Hammer of the Righteous or Shield of Righteousness, or the Protection tree. Seal of Martyrdom, a pull with Holy Shield, Avenger's Shield and Exorcism, Holy Shield kept up; on one target Hammer of the Righteous, Shield of Righteousness, Exorcism, Avenger's Shield, Judgement, Divine Storm, Consecration; with three or more enemies on you Hammer of the Righteous, Avenger's Shield, Consecration, Shield of Righteousness, Exorcism. Reminders: Righteous Fury, Holy Shield before a pull, Devotion Aura, Sanctuary or Kings, Avenging Wrath, Divine Protection below 40%, Lay on Hands, Hand of Reckoning in a group when your target attacks someone else."
L["Default.SoD.Paladin.Protection.Description"] = "探索賽季的坦克，開啟正義之怒、已紋刻公正之錘或公正之盾，或使用防護天賦樹時選用。殉難聖印，以神聖之盾、復仇之盾與驅邪術拉怪，維持神聖之盾；單一目標時：公正之錘、公正之盾、驅邪術、復仇之盾、審判、神性風暴、奉獻；三個以上敵人與你交戰時：公正之錘、復仇之盾、奉獻、公正之盾、驅邪術。提醒：正義之怒、拉怪前的神聖之盾、虔誠光環、庇護祝福或王者祝福、復仇之怒、低於 40% 時使用聖佑術、聖療術、隊伍中你的目標攻擊其他人時使用清算聖禦。"
-- en: "Paladin: Protection (Season of Discovery, wowsims)"
L["Default.SoD.Paladin.Protection.Wowsims.Name"] = "聖騎士：防護（探索賽季，wowsims）"
-- en: "The wowsims tank list: Judgement whenever a seal is up, the seal renewed just before it runs out, Holy Shield, Avenger's Shield, Hammer of the Righteous, Exorcism, Shield of Righteousness last. Same reminders as the recommended Season of Discovery Protection premade."
L["Default.SoD.Paladin.Protection.Wowsims.Description"] = "wowsims 的坦克清單：有聖印時就審判，在聖印即將結束前更新，神聖之盾、復仇之盾、公正之錘、驅邪術，最後是公正之盾。提醒與推薦的探索賽季防護內建循環相同。"
-- en: "Paladin: Holy (Season of Discovery)"
L["Default.SoD.Paladin.Holy.Name"] = "聖騎士：神聖（探索賽季）"
-- en: "Season of Discovery healing in a group, chosen by an engraved Beacon of Light, Divine Light or Sacred Shield, or the Holy tree without Crusader Strike. Acts on your friendly target: Cleanse, Holy Shock while moving or below 30%, Divine Light (Holy Light when mana is under half) below 60%, Flash of Light below 90%. With an enemy in melee range it only keeps a seal up. Reminders: Beacon of Light and Sacred Shield on the target that lacks them, Concentration or Devotion Aura, Blessing of Wisdom, Divine Favor and Lay on Hands for a target that is very low. The guides behind it are from Phase 4; choosing whom to heal stays with you."
L["Default.SoD.Paladin.Holy.Description"] = "探索賽季的隊伍治療，已紋刻聖光信標、神聖之光或崇聖護盾，或使用神聖天賦樹且沒有十字軍聖擊時選用。作用於你的友方目標：清潔術，移動時或低於 30% 時使用神聖震擊，低於 60% 時使用神聖之光（法力低於一半時用聖光術），低於 90% 時使用聖光閃現。敵人位於近戰範圍內時只維持聖印。提醒：對缺少聖光信標與崇聖護盾的目標施放它們、專注光環或虔誠光環、智慧祝福、對生命力極低的目標使用神恩術與聖療術。其依據的指南來自第 4 階段；要治療誰由你決定。"
-- en: "Paladin: Holy, Holy Light first (Season of Discovery, Wowhead)"
L["Default.SoD.Paladin.Holy.Wowhead.Name"] = "聖騎士：神聖，聖光術優先（探索賽季，Wowhead）"
-- en: "Wowhead's Phase 4 healing order for crit-heavy gear: Divine Light or Holy Light below 75%, then Cleanse, Holy Shock for small deficits or while moving, Flash of Light below 95%. Same reminders as the recommended Season of Discovery Holy premade."
L["Default.SoD.Paladin.Holy.Wowhead.Description"] = "Wowhead 第 4 階段針對高暴擊裝備的治療順序：低於 75% 時使用神聖之光或聖光術，然後是清潔術，損失少量生命力或移動時使用神聖震擊，低於 95% 時使用聖光閃現。提醒與推薦的探索賽季神聖內建循環相同。"
-- en: "Priest: Damage"
L["Default.Era.Priest.Dps.Name"] = "牧師：傷害"
-- en: "Damage from level 1 to 60, and the Priest default whenever the healer premade does not apply (solo, Shadow, or no talents yet). Shadowform when learned; before a pull a shield when solo, then Holy Fire (without Shadowform), Mind Blast or Smite. Shadow Word: Pain once per target that will live, Mind Blast on cooldown, Mind Flay as the filler (Smite and Holy Nova before you have it), and the wand on a dying target or when your mana runs low while solo. Vampiric Embrace and Devouring Plague on long fights, never in raids. Reminders: Inner Fire, Fortitude, racial buffs, Inner Focus with Mind Blast, Psychic Scream when two enemies reach you at half health, Fade when your target turns on you, Desperate Prayer. Target choice, multi-dotting and downranking stay with you."
L["Default.Era.Priest.Dps.Description"] = "1 至 60 級的傷害輸出，也是治療內建循環不適用時（單人、暗影或尚未取得天賦）牧師的預設循環。學會後使用暗影形態；拉怪前單人時先上護盾，然後是神聖之火（沒有暗影形態時）、心靈震爆或懲擊。對每個會存活較久的目標施放一次暗言術：痛，心靈震爆冷卻結束即使用，精神鞭笞作為填充（學會前用懲擊與神聖新星），單人時對瀕死目標或法力不足時使用魔杖。長時間戰鬥時使用吸血鬼的擁抱與噬靈瘟疫，團隊中絕不使用。提醒：心靈之火、真言術：韌、種族增益、搭配心靈震爆使用心靈專注、生命力剩一半且有兩個敵人接近你時使用心靈尖嘯、目標轉向你時使用漸隱術、絕望禱言。目標選擇、多目標持續傷害與降級施法由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Priest: Damage (Warcraft Tavern wand economy)"
L["Default.Era.Priest.Dps.WarcraftTavern.Name"] = "牧師：傷害（Warcraft Tavern 魔杖節約）"
-- en: "Warcraft Tavern's low-downtime leveling style; pick it by turning off the default damage premade. Solo: Mind Blast to pull, Shadow Word: Pain once, Mind Blast again only while the target is above 30%, and your wand between Mind Blasts instead of Smite or Mind Flay. No automatic shield before pulls. In a group: Shadow Word: Pain, Mind Blast, Mind Flay. Same reminders as the default."
L["Default.Era.Priest.Dps.WarcraftTavern.Description"] = "Warcraft Tavern 減少休息時間的升級打法；關閉預設傷害內建循環即可選用。單人時：以心靈震爆拉怪，施放一次暗言術：痛，只有在目標生命力高於 30% 時才再次使用心靈震爆，兩次心靈震爆之間使用魔杖，而不是懲擊或精神鞭笞。拉怪前不自動上護盾。隊伍中：暗言術：痛、心靈震爆、精神鞭笞。提醒與預設內建循環相同。"
-- en: "Priest: Damage (wowsims Undead raid)"
L["Default.Era.Priest.Dps.Wowsims.Name"] = "牧師：傷害（wowsims 不死族團隊）"
-- en: "The default damage priority with wowsims' raid choice for Undead priests: Inner Focus is spent on Devouring Plague instead of Mind Blast, and Devouring Plague is cast in raids too, so use it only where your raid has debuff slots to spare. No Vampiric Embrace. Pick it by turning off the default damage premade."
L["Default.Era.Priest.Dps.Wowsims.Description"] = "預設傷害優先順序，搭配 wowsims 為不死族牧師提供的團隊選擇：心靈專注用於噬靈瘟疫而非心靈震爆，團隊中也會施放噬靈瘟疫，因此只在你的團隊還有空餘減益效果欄位時使用。不使用吸血鬼的擁抱。關閉預設傷害內建循環即可選用。"
-- en: "Priest: Healer"
L["Default.Era.Priest.Healer.Name"] = "牧師：治療"
-- en: "Chosen in a group when Holy or Discipline is your main talent tree. Heals the friendly unit you target: Power Word: Shield below 30%, Flash Heal below 40%, dispels, Prayer of Healing when three of your party are hurt, Greater Heal (Heal or Lesser Heal before you learn it) below half health, Renew while moving or on light damage, then Heal rank 3 as the efficient top-up. Out of combat it offers Fortitude on your target. Targeting an enemy gives Shadow Word: Pain and Smite. Reminders: Inner Fire, Fortitude, Divine Spirit, Inner Focus, Desperate Prayer; Power Infusion is off by default. Choosing whom to heal and downranking stay with you."
L["Default.Era.Priest.Healer.Description"] = "神聖或戒律是你的主要天賦樹時，在隊伍中選用。治療你選取的友方單位：低於 30% 時使用真言術：盾，低於 40% 時使用快速治療，驅散，隊伍中三人受傷時使用治療禱言，生命力低於一半時使用強效治療術（學會前用治療術或次級治療術），移動時或傷害輕微時使用恢復，然後以等級 3 的治療術作為高效補血。戰鬥外會對你的目標提供真言術：韌。選取敵人時提供暗言術：痛與懲擊。提醒：心靈之火、真言術：韌、神聖之靈、心靈專注、絕望禱言；注入能量預設關閉。要治療誰與降級施法由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Priest: Damage (Season of Discovery)"
L["Default.SoD.Priest.Dps.Name"] = "牧師：傷害（探索賽季）"
-- en: "Damage on Season of Discovery realms, from level 1 to 60, using the runes you have engraved. Shadowform; Vampiric Touch or Mind Blast to pull (Penance, Holy Fire or Smite before Shadowform). Void Plague, Shadow Word: Pain and Vampiric Touch kept up, Mind Blast on cooldown, Mind Flay on Melting Faces, Shadow Word: Death while you are above half health, then Mind Spike as the filler, or Mind Flay with the Phase 8 six-piece set. Void Zone and Mind Sear on four or more enemies. The wand on a dying solo target. Reminders: Inner Fire, Fortitude, Homunculi, Shadowfiend, Eye of the Void and Dispersion, Inner Focus, Psychic Scream, Fade, Desperate Prayer."
L["Default.SoD.Priest.Dps.Description"] = "探索賽季伺服器上的傷害輸出，適用於 1 至 60 級，使用你已紋刻的符文。暗影形態；以吸血之觸或心靈震爆拉怪（暗影形態之前用懺悟、神聖之火或懲擊）。維持虛無瘟疫、暗言術：痛與吸血之觸，心靈震爆冷卻結束即使用，熔解臉龐時使用精神鞭笞，生命力高於一半時使用暗言術：死，然後以心靈鑽刺作為填充，若有第 8 階段六件套裝則改用精神鞭笞。四個以上敵人時使用虛無區域與心靈烙印。單人時對瀕死目標使用魔杖。提醒：心靈之火、真言術：韌、魔胎、暗影惡魔、虛無之眼與影散、心靈專注、心靈尖嘯、漸隱術、絕望禱言。"
-- en: "Priest: Damage (Season of Discovery, Wowhead Mind Spike stacks)"
L["Default.SoD.Priest.Dps.Wowhead.Name"] = "牧師：傷害（探索賽季，Wowhead 心靈鑽刺疊層）"
-- en: "The Wowhead and Warcraft Tavern way for Season of Discovery: Mind Blast waits for three of your Mind Spike stacks on the target (it is cast normally until you engrave Mind Spike), Mind Flay only on Melting Faces, Mind Spike as the filler. Everything else matches the default. Pick it by turning off the default Season of Discovery damage premade."
L["Default.SoD.Priest.Dps.Wowhead.Description"] = "Wowhead 與 Warcraft Tavern 的探索賽季打法：心靈震爆會等待目標身上有三層你的心靈鑽刺（在你紋刻心靈鑽刺之前正常施放），精神鞭笞只在熔解臉龐時使用，心靈鑽刺作為填充。其餘與預設內建循環相同。關閉預設的探索賽季傷害內建循環即可選用。"
-- en: "Priest: Healer (Season of Discovery)"
L["Default.SoD.Priest.Healer.Name"] = "牧師：治療（探索賽季）"
-- en: "Chosen on Season of Discovery realms in a group when Holy or Discipline is your main talent tree; follows Icy Veins. Heals the friendly unit you target: Prayer of Mending before the pull and whenever ready, Shield below half health, Penance, instant Flash Heal on Surge of Light, emergency Flash Heal, dispels, Circle of Healing and Prayer of Healing when three of your party are hurt, Greater Heal below half health, Renew while moving or on light damage, then Heal. Targeting an enemy gives Pain, Void Plague, Penance, Holy Fire and Smite. Reminders include Shadowfiend, Pain Suppression on a dying target, Power Word: Barrier and Spirit of the Redeemer when the party is hurt."
L["Default.SoD.Priest.Healer.Description"] = "在探索賽季伺服器上，神聖或戒律是你的主要天賦樹時，在隊伍中選用；依據 Icy Veins。治療你選取的友方單位：拉怪前以及就緒時使用癒合禱言，生命力低於一半時使用真言術：盾，懺悟，光之澎湃觸發時使用瞬發快速治療，緊急時使用快速治療，驅散，隊伍中三人受傷時使用治療之環與治療禱言，生命力低於一半時使用強效治療術，移動時或傷害輕微時使用恢復，然後使用治療術。選取敵人時提供暗言術：痛、虛無瘟疫、懺悟、神聖之火與懲擊。提醒包括暗影惡魔、對瀕死目標使用痛苦鎮壓、隊伍受傷時使用真言術：壁與救星之靈。"
-- en: "Priest: Healer (Season of Discovery, Warcraft Tavern)"
L["Default.SoD.Priest.Healer.WarcraftTavern.Name"] = "牧師：治療（探索賽季，Warcraft Tavern）"
-- en: "Warcraft Tavern's Serendipity loop, best with Serendipity and Soul Warding engraved: Prayer of Mending on cooldown, Shield on your target whenever it can take one, Penance on heavy damage, Circle of Healing for three hurt, Greater Heal or Prayer of Healing at three Serendipity stacks, Renew on minor damage, and Flash Heal on minor injuries to build the stacks. Pick it by turning off the default Season of Discovery healer."
L["Default.SoD.Priest.Healer.WarcraftTavern.Description"] = "Warcraft Tavern 的機緣回復循環，最適合已紋刻機緣回復與靈魂結界時使用：癒合禱言冷卻結束即使用，只要你的目標可以接受就施放真言術：盾，承受大量傷害時使用懺悟，三人受傷時使用治療之環，三層機緣回復時使用強效治療術或治療禱言，輕微傷害時使用恢復，並對輕傷使用快速治療來累積層數。關閉預設的探索賽季治療內建循環即可選用。"
-- en: "Rogue: melee DPS"
L["Default.Era.Rogue.DPS.Name"] = "盜賊：近戰 DPS"
-- en: "Levels 1–60, every spec, also on Hardcore and Self-Found realms; built from wowsims, Icy Veins and Wowhead. From Stealth: Premeditation, Ambush when the target is not facing you, Cheap Shot solo, Garrote outside raids. In combat: Riposte, Slice and Dice from one combo point when it is missing on an elite or a healthy target (renewed at five points in its last three seconds), Expose Armor at five points in a group when you have Improved Expose Armor 2/2 and nobody Sunders, a two-point Eviscerate on a target about to die, otherwise Eviscerate at five and no builder past five. The builder follows what you know: Ghostly Strike and Hemorrhage outside raids, Backstab when the target is not facing you, else Sinister Strike. Reminders: poisons on each weapon (Deadly on the off hand when carried), Kick, Thistle Tea, Blade Flurry and Adrenaline Rush on elites or two enemies with Slice and Dice up, Cold Blood at five, Evasion solo when hurt. Vanish, Gouge, Preparation, Kidney Shot and racials are listed off; Feint, Sprint, Blind, Sap and positioning stay with you."
L["Default.Era.Rogue.DPS.Description"] = "1–60 級，所有專精，也適用於專家模式與獨行模式伺服器；綜合 wowsims、Icy Veins 與 Wowhead。潛行時：預謀，目標未面向你時伏擊，單人時偷襲，團隊以外絞喉。戰鬥中：還擊，精英或生命力充足的目標身上沒有切割時從一個連擊點起使用切割（在最後三秒內於五個連擊點時續上），隊伍中擁有強化破甲 2/2 且沒有人使用破甲攻擊時在五個連擊點使用破甲，對即將死亡的目標使用兩點剔骨，否則在五個連擊點時使用剔骨，且超過五點後不再使用累積連擊點技能。累積連擊點技能取決於你已學會的技能：團隊以外使用鬼魅攻擊與出血，目標未面向你時使用背刺，否則使用邪惡攻擊。提醒：每把武器上的毒藥（若有攜帶，副手使用致命毒藥）、腳踢、菊花茶、對精英或兩個敵人且切割生效時使用劍刃亂舞與能量刺激、五個連擊點時使用冷血、單人受傷時使用閃避。消失、鑿擊、伺機待發、腎擊與種族技能列出但預設關閉；佯攻、疾跑、致盲、悶棍與站位由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Rogue: melee DPS, five-point finishers (Warcraft Tavern)"
L["Default.Era.Rogue.DPS.WarcraftTavern.Name"] = "盜賊：近戰 DPS，五連擊點終結技（Warcraft Tavern）"
-- en: "Warcraft Tavern's way: every finisher waits for five combo points so Relentless Strikes refunds it. Slice and Dice is used from its second rank (level 42) when missing or ending, otherwise Eviscerate; no low-point Slice, no near-death Eviscerate and no Expose Armor (a warrior's Sunder covers it). Same openers, builders and reminders as the recommended premade."
L["Default.Era.Rogue.DPS.WarcraftTavern.Description"] = "Warcraft Tavern 的打法：每個終結技都等到五個連擊點，讓無情打擊返還能量。切割從第二級（42 級）起，在缺少或即將結束時使用，否則使用剔骨；不使用低連擊點切割、不對瀕死目標使用剔骨，也不使用破甲（由戰士的破甲攻擊負責）。潛行起手、累積連擊點技能與提醒都與推薦的內建循環相同。"
-- en: "Rogue: Swords, swing-synced Sinister Strike (wowsims)"
L["Default.Era.Rogue.DPS.Wowsims.Name"] = "盜賊：劍類武器，配合揮擊的邪惡攻擊（wowsims）"
-- en: "The wowsims \"sweaty\" Combat order for Sword Specialization: Sinister Strike only right after a main-hand swing (2.0 seconds or more to the next one, set for a 2.6–2.8 speed sword; change it in a clone), unless energy is near full or the target is about to die, so the extra sword attack does not delay your swing. Eviscerate at five also waits for Slice and Dice, full energy or a dying target. Otherwise as the recommended premade."
L["Default.Era.Rogue.DPS.Wowsims.Description"] = "wowsims 針對劍類武器專精的「極限」戰鬥順序：邪惡攻擊只在主手揮擊後立即使用（距離下一次揮擊 2.0 秒以上，針對速度 2.6–2.8 的劍設定；可在複製的循環中修改），除非能量接近全滿或目標即將死亡，這樣額外的劍類攻擊就不會延遲你的揮擊。五個連擊點的剔骨也會等待切割、能量全滿或目標即將死亡。其餘與推薦的內建循環相同。"
-- en: "SoD Rogue: melee DPS"
L["Default.SoD.Rogue.DPS.Name"] = "盜賊：近戰 DPS（探索賽季）"
-- en: "Season of Discovery, levels 1–60 with runes as you engrave them; built from wowsims Phase 6, Icy Veins and Zockify Phase 8. From Stealth: Shadowstrike, Garrote in a group, Ambush for a Backstab build, Cheap Shot solo. On three or more enemies fighting you: Blunderbuss, Crimson Tempest, Fan of Knives first. Then Ambush on a Cutthroat proc, Saber Slash kept at three stacks, Poisoned Knife at four poison stacks, Slice and Dice from two points (renewed from four), Expose Armor duty when nobody Sunders or keeps Sebacious Poison up, a Carnage bleed (Crimson Tempest, else Rupture; none with Saber Slash), Envenom at five (Eviscerate until you engrave it), and a builder by glove rune: Mutilate, Saber Slash, Backstab, else Sinister Strike. Reminders: a temporary enchant on each weapon, Kick, Thistle Tea, Blade Flurry, Adrenaline Rush, Cold Blood and Evasion. Vanish for Master of Subtlety and Preparation are listed off because passive runes cannot be read."
L["Default.SoD.Rogue.DPS.Description"] = "探索賽季，1–60 級，符文會在你紋刻後納入使用；綜合 wowsims 第 6 階段、Icy Veins 與 Zockify 第 8 階段。潛行時：暗影打擊，隊伍中絞喉，背刺配置使用伏擊，單人時偷襲。三個以上敵人與你交戰時：先使用短槍、赤紅風暴、飛舞刀刃。接著割喉觸發時使用伏擊，維持三層刀劍斬擊，四層毒藥時使用塗毒小刀，從兩個連擊點起使用切割（四點起續上），沒有人使用破甲攻擊或維持皮脂腺毒時負責破甲，大屠殺的流血效果（赤紅風暴，否則割裂；有刀劍斬擊時不使用），五個連擊點時使用毒化（紋刻前用剔骨），以及依手部符文決定的累積連擊點技能：截肢、刀劍斬擊、背刺，否則邪惡攻擊。提醒：每把武器上的臨時附魔、腳踢、菊花茶、劍刃亂舞、能量刺激、冷血與閃避。為敏銳大師使用的消失與伺機待發列出但預設關閉，因為無法讀取被動符文。"
-- en: "SoD Rogue: melee DPS, Rupture for Carnage (Icy Veins)"
L["Default.SoD.Rogue.DPS.IcyVeins.Name"] = "盜賊：近戰 DPS，為大屠殺維持割裂（探索賽季，Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Icy Veins' Season of Discovery order: every finisher at five combo points, first Slice and Dice when missing or ending, then Rupture kept up for Carnage, then Envenom; Poisoned Knife only at five poison stacks; Blunderbuss or Fan of Knives on three enemies. Same openers, builders and reminders as the recommended SoD premade; Sebacious Poison duty stays with you."
L["Default.SoD.Rogue.DPS.IcyVeins.Description"] = "Icy Veins 的探索賽季順序：每個終結技都在五個連擊點時使用，首先在缺少或即將結束時使用切割，然後為大屠殺維持割裂，然後是毒化；塗毒小刀只在五層毒藥時使用；三個敵人時使用短槍或飛舞刀刃。潛行起手、累積連擊點技能與提醒都與推薦的探索賽季內建循環相同；維持皮脂腺毒由你自行處理。"
-- en: "SoD Rogue: melee DPS, lean Envenom (Zockify)"
L["Default.SoD.Rogue.DPS.Zockify.Name"] = "盜賊：近戰 DPS，精簡毒化（探索賽季，Zockify）"
-- en: "Zockify's lean Season of Discovery list: no bleeds and no Expose Armor. Poisoned Knife at four poison stacks, Slice and Dice when missing (from two points, four with Saber Slash), Envenom at five, then the glove-rune builder. The Vanish and Cold Blood burst stays with you."
L["Default.SoD.Rogue.DPS.Zockify.Description"] = "Zockify 的精簡探索賽季清單：不使用流血效果，也不使用破甲。四層毒藥時使用塗毒小刀，缺少時使用切割（兩個連擊點起，有刀劍斬擊時四點起），五個連擊點時使用毒化，然後是手部符文的累積連擊點技能。消失與冷血的爆發由你自行處理。"
-- en: "SoD Rogue: tank"
L["Default.SoD.Rogue.Tank.Name"] = "盜賊：坦克（探索賽季）"
-- en: "Season of Discovery tank, chosen when Tease is known (Just a Flesh Wound engraved); built from wowsims Phase 6, Icy Veins, Zockify and Warcraft Tavern. Riposte, Main Gauche on cooldown, Blade Dance from one combo point (renewed from three), Slice and Dice from three (renewed from four), Fan of Knives, Crimson Tempest and Blunderbuss on three or more enemies, Blunderbuss while Blade Dance is up, Eviscerate at five with both buffs up, Poisoned Knife at low energy, then Saber Slash, Mutilate or Sinister Strike. Reminders: Tease in a group when your target attacks someone else, Kick, Evasion below half health, Blade Flurry, Adrenaline Rush, Thistle Tea and weapon poisons. Shadowstep and Sebacious Poison duty stay with you."
L["Default.SoD.Rogue.Tank.Description"] = "探索賽季的坦克，學會戲弄時選用（已紋刻不過是點皮肉傷）；綜合 wowsims 第 6 階段、Icy Veins、Zockify 與 Warcraft Tavern。還擊，左右開弓冷卻結束即使用，從一個連擊點起使用劍刃之舞（三點起續上），從三點起使用切割（四點起續上），三個以上敵人時使用飛舞刀刃、赤紅風暴與短槍，劍刃之舞生效時使用短槍，兩個增益效果都生效時在五個連擊點使用剔骨，能量低時使用塗毒小刀，然後是刀劍斬擊、截肢或邪惡攻擊。提醒：隊伍中你的目標攻擊其他人時使用戲弄、腳踢、生命力低於一半時使用閃避、劍刃亂舞、能量刺激、菊花茶與武器毒藥。暗影閃現與維持皮脂腺毒由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Shaman: Enhancement"
L["Default.Era.Shaman.Enhancement.Name"] = "薩滿：增強"
-- en: "Levels 1–60, also on Hardcore and Self-Found realms, and every Shaman without a talent majority; built from Icy Veins, Wowhead and wowsims. Lightning Bolt pulls from range; Earth Shock interrupts. In raids only Stormstrike and Frost Shock (debuff slots). On three or more enemies fighting you, Fire Nova and Magma totems. Then Stormstrike, Earth Shock into the Stormstrike debuff or to finish, Flame Shock when it will run its course, Earth Shock while you have half your mana, and Lightning Bolt while out of reach. Reminders: Rockbiter solo and Windfury Weapon in dungeons, Lightning Shield, Strength of Earth, Searing, Windfury or Grace of Air, Mana Spring or Healing Stream, healing after a pull and in emergencies. Stoneclaw, Earthbind, totem twisting and racials are listed off; dispels, purges and cleansing totems stay with you."
L["Default.Era.Shaman.Enhancement.Description"] = "1–60 級，也適用於專家模式與獨行模式伺服器，也是所有天賦點數未集中於某一天賦樹的薩滿的循環；綜合 Icy Veins、Wowhead 與 wowsims。從遠處以閃電箭拉怪；以地震術中斷施法。團隊中只使用風暴打擊與冰霜震擊（減益效果欄位）。三個以上敵人與你交戰時，放下火焰新星圖騰與熔岩圖騰。接著是風暴打擊、風暴打擊的減益效果存在時或收尾時使用地震術、烈焰震擊能完整持續時使用烈焰震擊、法力至少一半時使用地震術，以及目標不在攻擊範圍內時使用閃電箭。提醒：單人時石化武器、地城中風怒武器、閃電之盾、大地之力圖騰、灼熱圖騰、風怒圖騰或風之優雅圖騰、法力之泉圖騰或治療之泉圖騰、拉怪後與緊急時的治療。石爪圖騰、地縛圖騰、圖騰輪替與種族技能列出但預設關閉；驅散、淨化術與清除圖騰由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Shaman: Enhancement, Flame Shock first (Warcraft Tavern)"
L["Default.Era.Shaman.Enhancement.WarcraftTavern.Name"] = "薩滿：增強，烈焰震擊優先（Warcraft Tavern）"
-- en: "Warcraft Tavern's Enhancement: Windfury Weapon as soon as you learn it, Stormstrike, Flame Shock before any direct shock, then Earth Shock while your threat is low, or Frost Shock in a group once it is high; Magma and Chain Lightning on packs. Same totems and reminders as the recommended premade."
L["Default.Era.Shaman.Enhancement.WarcraftTavern.Description"] = "Warcraft Tavern 的增強：一學會風怒武器就使用，風暴打擊，任何直接傷害震擊之前先使用烈焰震擊，然後在你的威脅值低時使用地震術，隊伍中威脅值變高後改用冰霜震擊；怪群時使用熔岩圖騰與閃電鏈。圖騰與提醒與推薦的內建循環相同。"
-- en: "Shaman: Elemental"
L["Default.Era.Shaman.Elemental.Name"] = "薩滿：元素"
-- en: "Elemental from level 10 (most points in Elemental); built from Icy Veins and Wowhead. Earth Shock interrupts and finishes a target about to die. While moving: Flame Shock, else Frost Shock. Solo with the target in melee: Earth Shock above 30% health, then melee. On three or more enemies: Fire Nova and Magma totems when you are in melee, and Chain Lightning. Chain Lightning under Elemental Mastery or Clearcasting, otherwise Lightning Bolt. Reminders: Lightning Shield, Rockbiter outside raids, Searing or Magma, Mana Spring or Healing Stream, Elemental Mastery with Chain Lightning ready, Nature's Swiftness and Healing Wave below 30%, healing after a pull. Dispels, purges and downranking stay with you."
L["Default.Era.Shaman.Elemental.Description"] = "從 10 級起的元素（大部分天賦點數在元素）；綜合 Icy Veins 與 Wowhead。以地震術中斷施法並收掉即將死亡的目標。移動時：烈焰震擊，否則冰霜震擊。單人且目標在近戰範圍內時：目標生命力高於 30% 時使用地震術，然後近戰。三個以上敵人時：你在近戰範圍內時放下火焰新星圖騰與熔岩圖騰，以及閃電鏈。元素專精或節能施法期間使用閃電鏈，否則使用閃電箭。提醒：閃電之盾、團隊以外使用石化武器、灼熱圖騰或熔岩圖騰、法力之泉圖騰或治療之泉圖騰、閃電鏈就緒時使用元素專精、低於 30% 時使用自然迅捷與治療波、拉怪後治療。驅散、淨化術與降級施法由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Shaman: Elemental, Chain Lightning on cooldown (wowsims)"
L["Default.Era.Shaman.Elemental.Wowsims.Name"] = "薩滿：元素，閃電鏈冷卻結束即施放（wowsims）"
-- en: "The wowsims Elemental list: Chain Lightning on cooldown even on one target, Earth Shock while Elemental Mastery is up, otherwise Lightning Bolt. Faster but much hungrier for mana than the recommended premade; same interrupt, totems and reminders."
L["Default.Era.Shaman.Elemental.Wowsims.Description"] = "wowsims 的元素清單：即使只有一個目標，閃電鏈冷卻結束即施放，元素專精生效時使用地震術，否則使用閃電箭。比推薦的內建循環更快，但耗魔多得多；中斷、圖騰與提醒相同。"
-- en: "Shaman: Restoration"
L["Default.Era.Shaman.Restoration.Name"] = "薩滿：恢復"
-- en: "Restoration from level 10 (most points in Restoration); built from Icy Veins and Wowhead. On your friendly target: Healing Wave under Nature's Swiftness, Nature's Swiftness below 30%, Lesser Healing Wave below 40%, Cure Poison or Cure Disease, Chain Heal when three group members near you are below 85%, otherwise Healing Wave below 90%. On an enemy it fights: Earth Shock interrupt, Chain Lightning on packs, Flame Shock, Lightning Bolt from range, melee. Reminders: Lightning Shield and Rockbiter solo, Mana Tide in a group, Mana Spring, Strength of Earth, Searing. Choosing whom to heal, downranking and Tremor or cleansing totems stay with you; keeping Healing Way on the tank is listed off."
L["Default.Era.Shaman.Restoration.Description"] = "從 10 級起的恢復（大部分天賦點數在恢復）；綜合 Icy Veins 與 Wowhead。對你的友方目標：自然迅捷生效時使用治療波，低於 30% 時使用自然迅捷，低於 40% 時使用次級治療波，消毒術或祛病術，附近有三名隊伍成員低於 85% 時使用治療鍊，否則低於 90% 時使用治療波。目標為敵人時則進行攻擊：地震術中斷、怪群時使用閃電鏈、烈焰震擊、從遠處使用閃電箭、近戰。提醒：單人時閃電之盾與石化武器、隊伍中法力之潮圖騰、法力之泉圖騰、大地之力圖騰、灼熱圖騰。要治療誰、降級施法以及戰慄圖騰或清除圖騰由你自行處理；在坦克身上維持治療之路列出但預設關閉。"
-- en: "Shaman: Restoration, Chain Heal first (Warcraft Tavern)"
L["Default.Era.Shaman.Restoration.WarcraftTavern.Name"] = "薩滿：恢復，治療鍊優先（Warcraft Tavern）"
-- en: "Warcraft Tavern's Restoration: Chain Heal is the heal for anyone below 90%, with Lesser Healing Wave for someone about to die; Healing Wave is only for an assigned tank healer with Healing Way (listed off). Same cures, damage on enemies and totem reminders as the recommended premade."
L["Default.Era.Shaman.Restoration.WarcraftTavern.Description"] = "Warcraft Tavern 的恢復：任何低於 90% 的人都以治療鍊治療，即將死亡的人則用次級治療波；治療波只用於擁有治療之路、被指派治療坦克的治療者（列出但預設關閉）。驅除、對敵人的傷害與圖騰提醒與推薦的內建循環相同。"
-- en: "SoD Shaman: Enhancement"
L["Default.SoD.Shaman.Enhancement.Name"] = "薩滿：增強（探索賽季）"
-- en: "Season of Discovery, levels 1–60 with runes as you engrave them, dual wield or two-hander, and every SoD Shaman no other premade fits; built from wowsims Phase 6, Icy Veins and Wowhead. Flame Shock pulls; Earth Shock interrupts. On three or more enemies: Magma, Fire Nova from a fire totem, Chain Lightning at four Maelstrom stacks, Flame Shock. Then Lava Burst at five Maelstrom stacks, Stormstrike, Lava Lash, Lightning Bolt at five stacks, Flame Shock when it will run, Earth Shock, Molten Blast, Lightning Bolt from range. Reminders: Windfury Weapon (Rockbiter before), Flametongue on the off hand with Lava Lash (else Windfury; an Icy Veins Windfury-both line is listed off), Water or Lightning Shield, Spirit of the Alpha, Feral Spirit, Shamanistic Rage below 65% mana, totems, Ancestral Guidance. Totemic Projection, dispels and purges stay with you."
L["Default.SoD.Shaman.Enhancement.Description"] = "探索賽季，1–60 級，符文會在你紋刻後納入使用，雙持或雙手武器皆可，也是沒有其他內建循環適用時所有探索賽季薩滿的預設循環；綜合 wowsims 第 6 階段、Icy Veins 與 Wowhead。以烈焰震擊拉怪；以地震術中斷施法。三個以上敵人時：熔岩圖騰、火焰新星（需有火焰圖騰）、四層氣漩武器時使用閃電鏈、烈焰震擊。接著五層氣漩武器時使用熔岩爆發、風暴打擊、熔岩暴擊、五層時使用閃電箭、烈焰震擊能完整持續時使用烈焰震擊、地震術、熔岩爆裂、從遠處使用閃電箭。提醒：風怒武器（之前用石化武器）、有熔岩暴擊時副手使用火舌武器（否則用風怒武器；Icy Veins 雙手都用風怒武器的步驟列出但預設關閉）、水之盾或閃電之盾、獸群首領之靈、野性之魂、法力低於 65% 時使用薩滿之怒、圖騰、先祖導引。圖騰投射、驅散與淨化術由你自行處理。"
-- en: "SoD Shaman: Elemental"
L["Default.SoD.Shaman.Elemental.Name"] = "薩滿：元素（探索賽季）"
-- en: "Season of Discovery Elemental from level 10 (most points in Elemental); built from wowsims Phase 6, Wowhead and Icy Veins. Earth Shock interrupts. While moving: Flame Shock, Earth Shock at eight Lightning Shield charges, Lava Burst or Chain Lightning on a Power Surge proc. On three or more enemies: Flame Shock, Chain Lightning, Fire Nova, Lava Burst, Earth Shock at eight charges, Magma. Then Lava Burst on Power Surge, Flame Shock kept up, Lava Burst while your Flame Shock lasts, Earth Shock at eight charges, Chain Lightning on two enemies, Lightning Bolt. Reminders: Flametongue for Burn, Lightning Shield, Earth Shield on yourself, Spirit of the Alpha, Feral Spirit, Shamanistic Rage, Elemental Mastery, totems. Trinkets, Totemic Projection, dispels and purges stay with you."
L["Default.SoD.Shaman.Elemental.Description"] = "探索賽季從 10 級起的元素（大部分天賦點數在元素）；綜合 wowsims 第 6 階段、Wowhead 與 Icy Veins。以地震術中斷施法。移動時：烈焰震擊、閃電之盾八層充能時使用地震術、能量激增觸發時使用熔岩爆發或閃電鏈。三個以上敵人時：烈焰震擊、閃電鏈、火焰新星、熔岩爆發、八層充能時使用地震術、熔岩圖騰。接著能量激增觸發時使用熔岩爆發、維持烈焰震擊、你的烈焰震擊持續期間使用熔岩爆發、八層充能時使用地震術、兩個敵人時使用閃電鏈、閃電箭。提醒：為了燃燒使用火舌武器、閃電之盾、對自己施放大地之盾、獸群首領之靈、野性之魂、薩滿之怒、元素專精、圖騰。飾品、圖騰投射、驅散與淨化術由你自行處理。"
-- en: "SoD Shaman: Restoration"
L["Default.SoD.Shaman.Restoration.Name"] = "薩滿：恢復（探索賽季）"
-- en: "Season of Discovery Restoration from level 10 (most points in Restoration); built from Icy Veins and Wowhead. On your friendly target: Riptide then Lesser Healing Wave below 40%, Cure Poison or Cure Disease, Healing Rain when three group members near you are below 85%, Chain Heal when two are (at once on a Power Surge proc), Riptide below 95% for Tidal Waves, Healing Wave below 90%. On an enemy it fights. Reminders: Water Shield (Lightning Shield before), Earth Shield on your friendly target or yourself, Shamanistic Rage, Mana Tide, Mana Spring and Strength of Earth. Choosing whom to heal and Tremor or cleansing totems stay with you."
L["Default.SoD.Shaman.Restoration.Description"] = "探索賽季從 10 級起的恢復（大部分天賦點數在恢復）；綜合 Icy Veins 與 Wowhead。對你的友方目標：低於 40% 時先使用激流再使用次級治療波，消毒術或祛病術，附近有三名隊伍成員低於 85% 時使用治癒之雨，兩名時使用治療鍊（能量激增觸發時立即使用），低於 95% 時使用激流以觸發治療之潮，低於 90% 時使用治療波。目標為敵人時則進行攻擊。提醒：水之盾（之前用閃電之盾）、對你的友方目標或自己施放大地之盾、薩滿之怒、法力之潮圖騰、法力之泉圖騰與大地之力圖騰。要治療誰以及戰慄圖騰或清除圖騰由你自行處理。"
-- en: "SoD Shaman: tank (Way of Earth)"
L["Default.SoD.Shaman.Tank.Name"] = "薩滿：坦克（探索賽季，大地之道）"
-- en: "Season of Discovery tank, chosen once you know Windfury Weapon but keep Rockbiter on your main hand, as Way of Earth needs; built from Icy Veins, Wowhead, wowsims and Warcraft Tavern. Flame Shock pulls. Earth Shock taunts a target in melee that is not attacking you, and interrupts. On two or more enemies: Molten Blast, Flame Shock, Chain Lightning at five Maelstrom stacks or on Power Surge, Fire Nova at five stacks. Then Flame Shock kept up, Lava Burst on Power Surge or while Flame Shock lasts, Stormstrike, Earth Shock, Lightning Bolt at five stacks, Molten Blast, Frost Shock. Reminders: Rockbiter, Lightning Shield, Spirit of the Alpha on yourself, Feral Spirit, Shamanistic Rage, Searing or Magma, and group totems."
L["Default.SoD.Shaman.Tank.Description"] = "探索賽季的坦克，在你學會風怒武器但主手仍保持石化武器（大地之道的需求）時選用；綜合 Icy Veins、Wowhead、wowsims 與 Warcraft Tavern。以烈焰震擊拉怪。以地震術嘲諷近戰範圍內沒有攻擊你的目標，並中斷施法。兩個以上敵人時：熔岩爆裂、烈焰震擊、五層氣漩武器或能量激增觸發時使用閃電鏈、五層時使用火焰新星。接著維持烈焰震擊、能量激增觸發時或烈焰震擊持續期間使用熔岩爆發、風暴打擊、地震術、五層時使用閃電箭、熔岩爆裂、冰霜震擊。提醒：石化武器、閃電之盾、對自己施放獸群首領之靈、野性之魂、薩滿之怒、灼熱圖騰或熔岩圖騰，以及隊伍圖騰。"
-- en: "Warlock: every tree"
L["Default.Era.Warlock.DPS.Name"] = "術士：所有天賦樹"
-- en: "Levels 1–60, every talent tree, also on Hardcore and Self-Found realms; built from Wowhead, Icy Veins, Warcraft Tavern and wowsims. Stops while you cast or channel and never tags a mob someone else is fighting while you are solo. Nightfall's Shadow Trance first; Shadowburn and Searing Pain to finish a group target; a solo target about to die gets Drain Soul (for a shard, or with Improved Drain Soul), Shadowburn or Conflagrate, then the wand, never new DoTs. While moving only instants. On three or more enemies: Hellfire when they are on you and you have half your health, otherwise Rain of Fire. One curse: in raids Curse of Shadow or the Elements when nobody has it, Doom on long elite fights, otherwise Agony. Immolate when it pays (Destruction, raids, or with 40% mana), Corruption, Siphon Life (in raids only on Shadow Vulnerability). Solo: Dark Pact, Life Tap when healthy, Drain Life when hurt, the wand. Shadow Bolt otherwise. Reminders: Demon Armor or Demon Skin, your pet (Voidwalker solo, Imp in a group, Succubus for Demonic Sacrifice), Fel Domination, Demonic Sacrifice, Amplify Curse, Voidwalker Sacrifice and a Healthstone when low, Health Funnel. Curse assignments, Curse of Recklessness on a fleeing mob, Fear, Banish, Soulstones and creating Healthstones stay with you."
L["Default.Era.Warlock.DPS.Description"] = "1–60 級，所有天賦樹，也適用於專家模式與獨行模式伺服器；綜合 Wowhead、Icy Veins、Warcraft Tavern 與 wowsims。你施法或引導時會等待，單人時絕不搶別人正在戰鬥的怪物。夜幕的暗影冥思優先；以暗影灼燒與灼熱之痛收掉隊伍目標；單人時即將死亡的目標會使用吸取靈魂（為了取得靈魂碎片，或擁有強化吸取靈魂時）、暗影灼燒或焚燒，然後是魔杖，絕不施放新的持續傷害效果。移動時只用瞬發法術。三個以上敵人時：敵人在你身邊且你的生命力至少一半時使用地獄烈焰，否則使用火焰之雨。一個詛咒：團隊中沒有人施放時使用暗影詛咒或元素詛咒，長時間的精英戰鬥使用厄運詛咒，否則使用痛苦詛咒。划算時使用獻祭（毀滅、團隊中，或法力 40% 以上），腐蝕術，生命虹吸（團隊中只在有暗影易傷時）。單人時：黑暗契約、健康時使用生命分流、受傷時使用吸取生命、魔杖。其他情況使用暗影箭。提醒：魔甲術或惡魔皮膚、你的惡魔（單人時虛空行者、隊伍中小鬼、為惡魔犧牲使用魅魔）、惡魔支配、惡魔犧牲、詛咒增幅、生命力低時使用虛空行者的犧牲與治療石、生命通道。詛咒分配、對逃跑的怪物使用魯莽詛咒、恐懼術、放逐術、靈魂石與製造治療石由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Warlock: drain tank (Warcraft Tavern)"
L["Default.Era.Warlock.DPS.WarcraftTavern.Name"] = "術士：吸血坦（Warcraft Tavern）"
-- en: "Warcraft Tavern's leveling style: the Imp, then the Succubus from level 20. Immolate, Siphon Life and Corruption, then solo Drain Life as the filler once you learn its fourth rank (the wand before), Life Tap whenever your health is nearly full and Dark Pact before your pet's mana is full. In raids every DoT the slots allow, then Shadow Bolt. Same finishers, curse and safety reminders as the recommended premade; fearing a second mob stays with you."
L["Default.Era.Warlock.DPS.WarcraftTavern.Description"] = "Warcraft Tavern 的升級打法：小鬼，20 級起改用魅魔。獻祭、生命虹吸與腐蝕術，然後單人時在學會第四級吸取生命後以它作為填充（之前用魔杖），生命力接近全滿時就使用生命分流，在寵物法力滿之前使用黑暗契約。團隊中施放欄位允許的所有持續傷害效果，然後使用暗影箭。收尾技能、詛咒與安全提醒與推薦的內建循環相同；恐懼第二隻怪物由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Warlock: curse and Corruption raids (Icy Veins)"
L["Default.Era.Warlock.DPS.IcyVeins.Name"] = "術士：團隊中只用詛咒與腐蝕術（Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Icy Veins' list for realms with the 16-debuff limit: in raids only your curse and Corruption, then Shadow Bolt, with no Immolate and no Siphon Life. Leveling and dungeons play as the recommended premade."
L["Default.Era.Warlock.DPS.IcyVeins.Description"] = "Icy Veins 針對有 16 個減益效果上限之伺服器的清單：團隊中只用你的詛咒與腐蝕術，然後是暗影箭，不使用獻祭與生命虹吸。升級與地城的打法與推薦的內建循環相同。"
-- en: "SoD Warlock: tank (Metamorphosis)"
L["Default.SoD.Warlock.Tank.Name"] = "術士：坦克（探索賽季，惡魔化身）"
-- en: "Season of Discovery tank, chosen once Metamorphosis is engraved; built from wowsims, Icy Veins, Wowhead and Warcraft Tavern. Shadow Cleave whenever Defender's Resolve is missing or ending, a Soul Fire! proc, Incinerate to keep its fire buff; on three or more enemies Shadow Cleave, Lake of Fire, Shadowflame and Hellfire. Then a curse (Agony, else Recklessness when nobody has it), Shadowflame (Immolate before you engrave it), Master Channeler Drain Life, Corruption, Siphon Life, Conflagrate for Backdraft, Soul Fire under Decimation below 35%, and Searing Pain as the threat filler. Reminders: Metamorphosis, Fel Armor, your pet, Immolation Aura, Demonic Grace, Vengeance when low, Menace when the target attacks someone else, Demonic Howl on packs, Amplify Curse, Life Tap for a pet low on mana. Infernal Armor stays with you."
L["Default.SoD.Warlock.Tank.Description"] = "探索賽季的坦克，已紋刻惡魔化身時選用；綜合 wowsims、Icy Veins、Wowhead 與 Warcraft Tavern。防衛者的決心缺少或即將結束時使用暗影順劈斬，靈魂之火！觸發，使用燒盡以維持其火焰增益效果；三個以上敵人時使用暗影順劈斬、火焰之湖、暗影之焰與地獄烈焰。接著施放一個詛咒（痛苦詛咒，否則在沒有人施放時用魯莽詛咒），暗影之焰（紋刻前用獻祭），引導大師的吸取生命，腐蝕術，生命虹吸，為了爆燃使用焚燒，低於 35% 時在屠虐期間使用靈魂之火，並以灼熱之痛作為威脅值填充。提醒：惡魔化身、魔化護甲、你的惡魔、獻祭光環、魔化恩典、生命力低時使用復仇、目標攻擊其他人時使用破膽威嚇、怪群時使用惡魔長嘯、詛咒增幅、寵物法力不足時使用生命分流。煉獄護甲由你自行處理。"
-- en: "SoD Warlock: Fire"
L["Default.SoD.Warlock.Fire.Name"] = "術士：火焰（探索賽季）"
-- en: "Season of Discovery Destruction, chosen once Chaos Bolt or Incinerate is engraved; built from wowsims Phase 6 and Wowhead. Shadowburn and Searing Pain to finish; instants while moving; Incinerate's buff, Lake of Fire and Hellfire on packs; a curse (Recklessness in a group when nobody has it, Doom on long elite fights, else Agony); Conflagrate only to keep Backdraft; Immolate and Incinerate's buff kept up; below 35% Soul Fire under Decimation instead of Chaos Bolt; Soul Fire! procs; Chaos Bolt; solo Master Channeler Drain Life and Life Tap; Incinerate (Shadow Bolt before you engrave it). Reminders: Fel Armor, the Imp, Amplify Curse and the safety reminders."
L["Default.SoD.Warlock.Fire.Description"] = "探索賽季的毀滅，已紋刻混沌箭或燒盡時選用；綜合 wowsims 第 6 階段與 Wowhead。以暗影灼燒與灼熱之痛收尾；移動時使用瞬發法術；怪群時使用燒盡的增益效果、火焰之湖與地獄烈焰；一個詛咒（隊伍中沒有人施放時用魯莽詛咒，長時間精英戰鬥用厄運詛咒，否則用痛苦詛咒）；焚燒只用來維持爆燃；維持獻祭與燒盡的增益效果；低於 35% 時在屠虐期間以靈魂之火取代混沌箭；靈魂之火！觸發；混沌箭；單人時引導大師的吸取生命與生命分流；燒盡（紋刻前用暗影箭）。提醒：魔化護甲、小鬼、詛咒增幅以及安全提醒。"
-- en: "SoD Warlock: Fire, Conflagrate on cooldown (Icy Veins)"
L["Default.SoD.Warlock.Fire.IcyVeins.Name"] = "術士：火焰，焚燒冷卻結束即使用（探索賽季，Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Icy Veins' and Warcraft Tavern's Season of Discovery Destruction: Immolate kept up, Conflagrate and Chaos Bolt on cooldown (Chaos Bolt also below 35%), Incinerate's buff, Soul Fire under Decimation below 35%, Incinerate filler; the damage curse only while moving, with Recklessness in a group when nobody has it."
L["Default.SoD.Warlock.Fire.IcyVeins.Description"] = "Icy Veins 與 Warcraft Tavern 的探索賽季毀滅：維持獻祭，焚燒與混沌箭冷卻結束即使用（低於 35% 時也使用混沌箭），燒盡的增益效果，低於 35% 時在屠虐期間使用靈魂之火，燒盡作為填充；傷害詛咒只在移動時使用，隊伍中沒有人施放魯莽詛咒時則用魯莽詛咒。"
-- en: "SoD Warlock: Shadow (Affliction, Felguard)"
L["Default.SoD.Warlock.Shadow.Name"] = "術士：暗影，痛苦與惡魔守衛（探索賽季）"
-- en: "Season of Discovery Affliction and Felguard builds, and every SoD Warlock no other premade fits; built from wowsims Phase 6, Wowhead and Icy Veins. Nightfall procs; Shadowburn or Drain Soul to finish a group target; a dying solo target gets Drain Soul, not DoTs; instants while moving; Lake of Fire and Hellfire on packs; a curse (Recklessness in a group when nobody has it, else Agony); Unstable Affliction, Master Channeler Drain Life, Shadowflame (Immolate before it), Corruption, Haunt, Siphon Life; Drain Soul below 20% once Haunt is engraved; solo sustain and the wand; Shadow Bolt. Reminders: Fel Armor, your pet (a Felguard once engraved), Life Tap for a pet low on mana, Amplify Curse and the safety reminders. Curse assignments and Shadow Bolt Volley packs stay with you."
L["Default.SoD.Warlock.Shadow.Description"] = "探索賽季的痛苦與惡魔守衛配置，也是沒有其他內建循環適用時所有探索賽季術士的預設循環；綜合 wowsims 第 6 階段、Wowhead 與 Icy Veins。夜幕觸發；以暗影灼燒或吸取靈魂收掉隊伍目標；單人時即將死亡的目標使用吸取靈魂而非持續傷害效果；移動時使用瞬發法術；怪群時使用火焰之湖與地獄烈焰；一個詛咒（隊伍中沒有人施放時用魯莽詛咒，否則用痛苦詛咒）；痛苦動盪、引導大師的吸取生命、暗影之焰（之前用獻祭）、腐蝕術、蝕魂術、生命虹吸；紋刻蝕魂術後低於 20% 時使用吸取靈魂；單人時的續航與魔杖；暗影箭。提醒：魔化護甲、你的惡魔（紋刻後為惡魔守衛）、寵物法力不足時使用生命分流、詛咒增幅以及安全提醒。詛咒分配與對怪群使用暗影箭雨由你自行處理。"
-- en: "SoD Warlock: Shadow, Drain Soul filler (wowsims)"
L["Default.SoD.Warlock.Shadow.Wowsims.Name"] = "術士：暗影，吸取靈魂填充（探索賽季，wowsims）"
-- en: "The wowsims Phase 6 Affliction list for a Soul Siphon build: Drain Soul is the filler at any health, and the next step shows as soon as it is due so you can clip the channel for it. Unstable Affliction and Shadowflame renewed with 7.5 seconds left, Agony and Corruption with 6, Master Channeler Drain Life, Haunt, Shadow Bolt only on a Shadow Trance proc, Siphon Life, Life Tap below 10% mana. Same reminders as the recommended SoD Shadow premade."
L["Default.SoD.Warlock.Shadow.Wowsims.Description"] = "wowsims 第 6 階段針對靈魂虹吸配置的痛苦清單：無論生命力多少，都以吸取靈魂作為填充，下一個步驟一到時就會顯示，讓你可以為它中斷引導。痛苦動盪與暗影之焰在剩下 7.5 秒時續上，痛苦詛咒與腐蝕術在剩下 6 秒時續上，引導大師的吸取生命，蝕魂術，暗影箭只在暗影冥思觸發時使用，生命虹吸，法力低於 10% 時使用生命分流。提醒與推薦的探索賽季暗影內建循環相同。"
-- en: "Warrior: melee DPS"
L["Default.Era.Warrior.DPS.Name"] = "戰士：近戰 DPS"
-- en: "Levels 1–60, Arms and Fury, and every warrior outside Defensive Stance, also on Hardcore and Self-Found realms; built from wowsims, Icy Veins and Wowhead. Charge to pull, Intercept a distant target, Whirlwind (Thunder Clap before you learn it) on three or more enemies fighting you, then Execute first below 20%, Sunder Armor to five on bosses without Expose Armor, Bloodthirst, Mortal Strike, Slam right after a swing with Improved Slam (set for a two-hander; change it in a clone), Whirlwind while keeping rage for your main strike, Overpower, Rend until your main strike is learned, Sunder Armor on healthy targets and Hamstring near the rage cap. Reminders: Battle Shout, Heroic Strike from 40 rage (20 while leveling), Cleave on packs, Bloodrage, Sweeping Strikes, Death Wish (bosses: their last 30 seconds), Recklessness with Death Wish, Pummel or Shield Bash. Intimidating Shout and Retaliation are listed off for Hardcore emergencies; stance dancing stays with you."
L["Default.Era.Warrior.DPS.Description"] = "1–60 級，武器與狂怒，也是所有不在防禦姿態的戰士的循環，也適用於專家模式與獨行模式伺服器；綜合 wowsims、Icy Veins 與 Wowhead。以衝鋒拉怪，對遠處目標使用攔截，三個以上敵人與你交戰時使用旋風斬（學會前用雷霆一擊），接著低於 20% 時優先使用斬殺，對沒有破甲的首領疊滿五層破甲攻擊，嗜血，致死打擊，擁有強化猛擊時在揮擊後立即使用猛擊（針對雙手武器設定；可在複製的循環中修改），保留主要打擊所需怒氣的同時使用旋風斬，壓制，學會主要打擊之前使用撕裂，對生命力充足的目標使用破甲攻擊，怒氣接近上限時使用斷筋。提醒：戰鬥怒吼、40 點怒氣起使用英勇打擊（升級期間為 20 點）、怪群時使用順劈斬、血性狂暴、橫掃攻擊、死亡之願（首領：最後 30 秒）、搭配死亡之願使用魯莽、拳擊或盾擊。破膽怒吼與反擊風暴列出但預設關閉，供專家模式緊急時使用；姿態切換由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Warrior: tank"
L["Default.Era.Warrior.Protection.Name"] = "戰士：坦克"
-- en: "Chosen whenever you are in Defensive Stance (Protection, Fury-Prot or a two-hander tank); built from Icy Veins and MaxDps. On four or more enemies: Demoralizing Shout and Battle Shout for threat. Then Revenge, Shield Slam, Bloodthirst, Sunder Armor to five, Demoralizing Shout on elites, Sunder Armor as the filler, and Rend before Shield Slam or Bloodthirst. Reminders: Battle Shout, Shield Block while the target hits you, Bloodrage, Heroic Strike and Cleave from 50 rage, Shield Bash, Last Stand. Taunt, Shield Wall and Death Wish are listed off; Battle Stance for Execute (the DPS premade takes over) and Challenging Shout stay with you."
L["Default.Era.Warrior.Protection.Description"] = "只要你處於防禦姿態就會選用（防護、狂怒防護或雙手武器坦克）；綜合 Icy Veins 與 MaxDps。四個以上敵人時：為了威脅值使用挫志怒吼與戰鬥怒吼。接著是復仇、盾牌猛擊、嗜血、疊滿五層破甲攻擊、對精英使用挫志怒吼、破甲攻擊作為填充，以及在學會盾牌猛擊或嗜血之前使用撕裂。提醒：戰鬥怒吼、目標正在攻擊你時使用盾牌格擋、血性狂暴、50 點怒氣起使用英勇打擊與順劈斬、盾擊、破釜沉舟。嘲諷、盾牆與死亡之願列出但預設關閉；為斬殺切換到戰鬥姿態（由傷害內建循環接手）與挑戰怒吼由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Warrior: tank, Battle Shout threat (Icy Veins)"
L["Default.Era.Warrior.Protection.IcyVeins.Name"] = "戰士：坦克，戰鬥怒吼威脅值（Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Icy Veins' \"sunderless\" tanking for groups where four or more players hear your shout (Phase 5 Battle Shout onward): Demoralizing Shout kept up, Revenge, Shield Slam or Bloodthirst, then Battle Shout as the threat filler instead of Sunder Armor. Same reminders as the recommended tank; go back to Sunder when focusing one target in a crowd."
L["Default.Era.Warrior.Protection.IcyVeins.Description"] = "Icy Veins 的「無破甲」坦克打法，適用於有四名以上玩家能受到你怒吼影響的隊伍（第 5 階段戰鬥怒吼之後）：維持挫志怒吼，復仇，盾牌猛擊或嗜血，然後以戰鬥怒吼取代破甲攻擊作為威脅值填充。提醒與推薦的坦克循環相同；在一群敵人中專注單一目標時改回破甲攻擊。"
-- en: "SoD Warrior: melee DPS"
L["Default.SoD.Warrior.DPS.Name"] = "戰士：近戰 DPS（探索賽季）"
-- en: "Season of Discovery, levels 1–60 with runes as you engrave them: two-hander, dual wield, Gladiator and leveling, and every SoD warrior outside Defensive Stance; built from wowsims Phase 6 and Wowhead Phase 7/8. Charge, Victory Rush, Intercept, Whirlwind (Thunder Clap before it) on two or more enemies, Slam at three Slammin' stacks, Rend kept up, Slam on Blood Surge, Bloodthirst, Mortal Strike, Shield Slam, Overpower; then Quick Strike when it is engraved (two-hander), otherwise Whirlwind, Raging Blow and Devastate (Sunder before it); Execute with 30 rage or on Sudden Death; Hamstring near the rage cap. Reminders: Battle and Commanding Shout, Heroic Strike from 50 rage (always while Consumed by Rage enrages you), Cleave, Bloodrage, Rampage, Death Wish, Recklessness, Sweeping Strikes, interrupts. Berserker Rage and the Taste for Blood Battle Stance dip are listed off."
L["Default.SoD.Warrior.DPS.Description"] = "探索賽季，1–60 級，符文會在你紋刻後納入使用：雙手武器、雙持、鬥士姿態與升級皆可，也是所有不在防禦姿態的探索賽季戰士的循環；綜合 wowsims 第 6 階段與 Wowhead 第 7/8 階段。衝鋒、勝利衝擊、攔截、兩個以上敵人時使用旋風斬（學會前用雷霆一擊）、三層猛烈一擊時使用猛擊、維持撕裂、鮮血澎湃時使用猛擊、嗜血、致死打擊、盾牌猛擊、壓制；然後已紋刻快速打擊時使用它（雙手武器），否則使用旋風斬、狂怒之擊與挫敗（學會前用破甲攻擊）；30 點怒氣或驟亡觸發時使用斬殺；怒氣接近上限時使用斷筋。提醒：戰鬥怒吼與命令之吼、50 點怒氣起使用英勇打擊（怒火攻心使你狂怒時一律使用）、順劈斬、血性狂暴、暴怒、死亡之願、魯莽、橫掃攻擊、中斷施法。狂暴之怒與為血腥體驗短暫切換到戰鬥姿態列出但預設關閉。"
-- en: "SoD Warrior: Battle Forecaster stance dance (Wowhead)"
L["Default.SoD.Warrior.DPS.Wowhead.Name"] = "戰士：戰鬥預報者姿態切換（探索賽季，Wowhead）"
-- en: "Wowhead's Phase 7/8 rotation for Soul of the Battle Forecaster or the Tier 1 six-piece (which Rotation Master cannot see): stance swaps to keep the forecast buffs up, Heroic Strike almost always, then Bloodthirst, Blood Surge Slam, Whirlwind, Raging Blow and Hamstring; no Rend and no Overpower. Check the swap timing in game before relying on it."
L["Default.SoD.Warrior.DPS.Wowhead.Description"] = "Wowhead 第 7/8 階段針對戰鬥預報者之魂或 T1 六件套裝的循環（Rotation Master 無法看到這些）：切換姿態以維持預報增益效果，幾乎總是使用英勇打擊，然後是嗜血、鮮血澎湃猛擊、旋風斬、狂怒之擊與斷筋；不使用撕裂與壓制。依賴它之前請先在遊戲中確認切換時機。"
-- en: "SoD Warrior: melee DPS (Icy Veins)"
L["Default.SoD.Warrior.DPS.IcyVeins.Name"] = "戰士：近戰 DPS（探索賽季，Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Icy Veins' Season of Discovery Fury and Arms pages: Execute near the top below 20% or on Sudden Death, Slam on Blood Surge, Bloodthirst or Mortal Strike, Whirlwind, Overpower, Raging Blow, then Quick Strike and Hamstring only above 60 rage; no Rend; Heroic Strike only above 80 rage. Same reminders as the recommended SoD premade."
L["Default.SoD.Warrior.DPS.IcyVeins.Description"] = "Icy Veins 的探索賽季狂怒與武器頁面：低於 20% 或驟亡觸發時以接近最高的優先順序使用斬殺，鮮血澎湃時使用猛擊，嗜血或致死打擊，旋風斬，壓制，狂怒之擊，然後只有在怒氣高於 60 時才使用快速打擊與斷筋；不使用撕裂；英勇打擊只在怒氣高於 80 時使用。提醒與推薦的探索賽季內建循環相同。"
-- en: "SoD Warrior: tank"
L["Default.SoD.Warrior.Tank.Name"] = "戰士：坦克（探索賽季）"
-- en: "Season of Discovery tank, chosen in Defensive Stance; built from Wowhead Phase 8 and wowsims. Charge; on two or more enemies Thunder Clap, Shockwave, Shield Slam, Revenge, Whirlwind and Devastate; then Shield Slam whenever Defender's Resolve is missing or ending, Revenge, Shield Slam, Shockwave, Execute, Whirlwind at five Gladiator's Cunning stacks, Devastate (Sunder before it), Demoralizing Shout and Thunder Clap on elites, Rend before Shield Slam. Reminders: Battle and Commanding Shout, Shield Block, Heroic Strike from 50 rage, Cleave from 55, Bloodrage, Rampage, Last Stand, interrupts. Taunt, Shield Wall, Death Wish, Recklessness and Retaliation are listed off; the Gladiator swap for Execute stays with you."
L["Default.SoD.Warrior.Tank.Description"] = "探索賽季的坦克，處於防禦姿態時選用；綜合 Wowhead 第 8 階段與 wowsims。衝鋒；兩個以上敵人時使用雷霆一擊、震懾波、盾牌猛擊、復仇、旋風斬與挫敗；接著防衛者的決心缺少或即將結束時使用盾牌猛擊，復仇，盾牌猛擊，震懾波，斬殺，五層鬥士的狡詐時使用旋風斬，挫敗（學會前用破甲攻擊），對精英使用挫志怒吼與雷霆一擊，學會盾牌猛擊之前使用撕裂。提醒：戰鬥怒吼與命令之吼、盾牌格擋、50 點怒氣起使用英勇打擊、55 點起使用順劈斬、血性狂暴、暴怒、破釜沉舟、中斷施法。嘲諷、盾牆、死亡之願、魯莽與反擊風暴列出但預設關閉；為斬殺切換鬥士姿態由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Death Knight: Blood (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.DeathKnight.Blood.Name"] = "死亡騎士：血魄（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "Recommended for Blood tanks, chosen once you know Blood Rites or Dark Command. Pulls from range with Outbreak, Icy Touch or Death Grip. Death Strike below half health, whenever Blood Shield is missing (from 80), and before all four Frost and Unholy runes sit full; Rune Strike near 90 runic power (Death Coil at 80 before you learn it); Outbreak, else Icy Touch and Plague Strike, for diseases, and Blood Boil to refresh them from 68; Soul Reaper under 35%; Heart Strike (Blood Strike before 60) on two Blood runes; Crimson Scourge on Death and Decay while diseases last, else Blood Boil; Blood Tap at eleven charges; then Death Strike, Heart Strike, Rune Strike and Horn of Winter. Three enemies on you: Death and Decay, a disease spread (Blood Boil with Roiling Blood, else Pestilence) and Blood Boil. Reminders: Blood Presence when you have none, Bone Shield, Horn of Winter, Mind Freeze, Rune Tap, Vampiric Blood, Icebound Fortitude, Empower Rune Weapon and Death Pact by your health, Dancing Rune Weapon on elites, Army of the Dead before a group boss. It cannot see incoming damage, so Anti-Magic Shell (off) and big defensives are yours."
L["Default.MoP.DeathKnight.Blood.Description"] = "推薦血魄坦克使用，學會血魄儀式或黑暗敕令時選用。從遠處以疫病爆發、冰結之觸或死亡之握拉怪。生命力低於一半、沒有血魄護盾時（80 級起），以及四個冰霜與穢邪符文全部充滿之前使用死亡打擊；符能接近 90 時使用符文打擊（學會前於 80 時用死亡纏繞）；以疫病爆發（否則冰結之觸與瘟疫打擊）施加疾病，68 級起以沸血術刷新疾病；低於 35% 時使用靈魂收割者；兩個血魄符文時使用碎心打擊（60 級前為血魄打擊）；疾病持續期間赤血災禍觸發時使用死亡凋零，否則使用沸血術；十一層充能時使用血魄轉化；然後是死亡打擊、碎心打擊、符文打擊與凜冬號角。三個敵人與你交戰時：死亡凋零、擴散疾病（有鮮血同化時用沸血術，否則用瘟疫同化）與沸血術。提醒：沒有領域時使用血魄領域、骸骨之盾、凜冬號角、心智冰封、依你的生命力使用符文轉化、血族之裔、冰錮堅韌、強力符文武器與死亡契約，對精英使用符文武器幻舞，隊伍首領戰前使用亡靈大軍。它無法看到即將承受的傷害，因此反魔法護罩（預設關閉）與大型防禦技能由你負責。"
-- en: "Death Knight: Blood, health-reactive (MoP, wowsims)"
L["Default.MoP.DeathKnight.Blood.Wowsims.Name"] = "死亡騎士：血魄，依生命力反應（潘達利亞之謎，wowsims）"
-- en: "An alternative to the recommended Blood premade for raid tanks with healers, off by default: enable it and disable that one, or raise its priority. Death Strike only below 70% health, when Blood Shield is missing or about to fade, or before the Frost and Unholy runes cap, instead of on every rune; a lone Blood rune goes to Heart Strike when the Frost and Unholy runes are more than a second away. It has no area-of-effect section, and the same reminders as the recommended one."
L["Default.MoP.DeathKnight.Blood.Wowsims.Description"] = "推薦血魄內建循環的替代方案，適合有治療者的團隊坦克，預設關閉：啟用它並停用推薦的循環，或提高它的優先順序。死亡打擊只在生命力低於 70%、血魄護盾缺少或即將消失，或冰霜與穢邪符文即將溢出前使用，而不是每有符文就使用；當冰霜與穢邪符文還要超過一秒才就緒時，單獨的血魄符文用於碎心打擊。它沒有範圍效果段落，提醒與推薦的循環相同。"
-- en: "Death Knight: Frost, two weapons (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.DeathKnight.FrostDualWield.Name"] = "死亡騎士：冰霜，雙持（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "Recommended for Frost with two one-handed weapons (Masterfrost); chosen once you know Howling Blast and your off hand reports a swing speed. Pulls with Outbreak or Howling Blast (Death Grip solo). Death Strike on Dark Succor or below 35% health, Blood Tap at eleven charges, diseases (Unholy Blight, Outbreak, Howling Blast, Plague Strike), Soul Reaper under 35%, Frost Strike on Killing Machine or above 89 runic power, Howling Blast on Rime or with both Frost or both Death runes ready, Obliterate on two Unholy runes below 77 runic power, Frost Strike above 76, Obliterate, Howling Blast, Plague Leech before diseases fade with Outbreak ready, Frost Strike at 40, Horn of Winter. Three enemies on you: a disease spread, Death and Decay and Howling Blast. Reminders: Frost Presence, Pillar of Frost, Raise Dead, Empower Rune Weapon with every rune down, Horn of Winter, Mind Freeze, Icebound Fortitude and Death Pact when low, Army of the Dead before a group boss."
L["Default.MoP.DeathKnight.FrostDualWield.Description"] = "推薦以兩把單手武器的冰霜使用（Masterfrost）；學會凜風衝擊且你的副手回報攻擊速度時選用。以疫病爆發或凜風衝擊拉怪（單人時用死亡之握）。黑暗救贖觸發或生命力低於 35% 時使用死亡打擊，十一層充能時使用血魄轉化，疾病（穢邪荒疫、疫病爆發、凜風衝擊、瘟疫打擊），低於 35% 時使用靈魂收割者，殺戮酷刑觸發或符能高於 89 時使用冰霜打擊，凝霜觸發或兩個冰霜符文或兩個死亡符文都就緒時使用凜風衝擊，符能低於 77 且有兩個穢邪符文時使用滅寂，高於 76 時使用冰霜打擊，滅寂，凜風衝擊，疾病即將消失且疫病爆發就緒時使用瘟疫汲取，40 時使用冰霜打擊，凜冬號角。三個敵人與你交戰時：擴散疾病、死亡凋零與凜風衝擊。提醒：冰霜領域、冰霜之柱、死者復生、所有符文都用完時使用強力符文武器、凜冬號角、心智冰封、生命力低時使用冰錮堅韌與死亡契約、隊伍首領戰前使用亡靈大軍。"
-- en: "Death Knight: Frost, two-hander (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.DeathKnight.Frost.Name"] = "死亡騎士：冰霜，雙手武器（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "Frost with a two-handed weapon, the usual leveling setup; chosen once you know Howling Blast whenever the two-weapon premade does not apply. Same opening, diseases, survival and AoE as the two-weapon premade, then Obliterate on Killing Machine, Frost Strike above 76 runic power, Howling Blast on Rime, Obliterate whenever a rune pair is full, Obliterate, Howling Blast, Plague Leech, Frost Strike at 40 and Horn of Winter. Before Obliterate (58) Death Strike spends your Unholy runes. Same reminders as the two-weapon premade."
L["Default.MoP.DeathKnight.Frost.Description"] = "雙手武器的冰霜，常見的升級配置；學會凜風衝擊且雙持內建循環不適用時選用。開場、疾病、生存與範圍傷害與雙持內建循環相同，接著殺戮酷刑觸發時使用滅寂，符能高於 76 時使用冰霜打擊，凝霜觸發時使用凜風衝擊，有一對符文充滿時使用滅寂，滅寂，凜風衝擊，瘟疫汲取，40 時使用冰霜打擊，以及凜冬號角。學會滅寂（58 級）之前，以死亡打擊消耗你的穢邪符文。提醒與雙持內建循環相同。"
-- en: "Death Knight: Unholy (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.DeathKnight.Unholy.Name"] = "死亡騎士：穢邪（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "Recommended for Unholy, and the premade for any Death Knight Blood and Frost do not claim, including one without a specialization. Pulls from range with Outbreak or Icy Touch (Death Grip solo). Death Strike on Dark Succor or below 35% health, diseases (Unholy Blight, Outbreak, Plague Strike, Icy Touch), Blood Tap at eleven charges, Soul Reaper under 35%, Dark Transformation at five Shadow Infusion stacks, Death Coil near the runic power cap, Death and Decay on a target that will live, Scourge Strike, Death Coil on Sudden Doom or at 40, Outbreak while Unholy Strength is up, Festering Strike (Blood Strike before you learn it), Plague Leech, Horn of Winter. Three enemies on you: a disease spread, Death and Decay, Blood Boil and Icy Touch on a Frost rune. Reminders: Unholy Presence, your ghoul, Summon Gargoyle under Bloodlust or on a long elite fight, Unholy Frenzy, Empower Rune Weapon, Horn of Winter, Mind Freeze, Icebound Fortitude and Death Pact when low, Army of the Dead before a group boss; Anti-Magic Shell is off."
L["Default.MoP.DeathKnight.Unholy.Description"] = "推薦穢邪使用，也是血魄與冰霜都不適用的死亡騎士（包括沒有專精者）的內建循環。從遠處以疫病爆發或冰結之觸拉怪（單人時用死亡之握）。黑暗救贖觸發或生命力低於 35% 時使用死亡打擊，疾病（穢邪荒疫、疫病爆發、瘟疫打擊、冰結之觸），十一層充能時使用血魄轉化，低於 35% 時使用靈魂收割者，五層闇能灌注時使用黑暗變形，符能接近上限時使用死亡纏繞，對會存活的目標使用死亡凋零，天譴打擊，厄運驟臨觸發或 40 時使用死亡纏繞，穢邪力量生效時使用疫病爆發，膿瘡潰擊（學會前用血魄打擊），瘟疫汲取，凜冬號角。三個敵人與你交戰時：擴散疾病、死亡凋零、沸血術，以及有冰霜符文時使用冰結之觸。提醒：穢邪領域、你的食屍鬼、嗜血術期間或長時間精英戰鬥時使用召喚石像鬼、邪惡狂熱、強力符文武器、凜冬號角、心智冰封、生命力低時使用冰錮堅韌與死亡契約、隊伍首領戰前使用亡靈大軍；反魔法護罩預設關閉。"
-- en: "Death Knight: Unholy, rune-cap pooling (MoP, wowsims)"
L["Default.MoP.DeathKnight.Unholy.Wowsims.Name"] = "死亡騎士：穢邪，符文溢出前蓄積（潘達利亞之謎，wowsims）"
-- en: "An alternative to the recommended Unholy premade, as the simulator, wowtbc.gg, Method and MaxDps play it; off by default: enable it and disable that one, or raise its priority. While Dark Transformation is down Death Coil goes to rebuilding Shadow Infusion, Scourge Strike comes first when both Unholy or both Death runes are ready, and Festering Strike first when both Blood and both Frost runes are; otherwise the same opening, diseases, AoE and reminders as the recommended one."
L["Default.MoP.DeathKnight.Unholy.Wowsims.Description"] = "推薦穢邪內建循環的替代方案，依照模擬器、wowtbc.gg、Method 與 MaxDps 的打法；預設關閉：啟用它並停用推薦的循環，或提高它的優先順序。黑暗變形未生效時，死亡纏繞用於重新累積闇能灌注，兩個穢邪符文或兩個死亡符文都就緒時優先使用天譴打擊，兩個血魄與兩個冰霜符文都就緒時優先使用膿瘡潰擊；其餘開場、疾病、範圍傷害與提醒與推薦的循環相同。"
-- en: "Druid: Before a specialization (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Druid.Unspecialized.Name"] = "德魯伊：選擇專精前（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "For levels 1 to 9, or any druid who has not chosen a specialization yet; the specialization premades take over once you pick one. In Cat Form it keeps Rake up, spends five combo points (or two on a dying target) on Ferocious Bite and builds with Mangle; in Bear Form it uses Mangle and Maul. Otherwise it pulls with Wrath, keeps Moonfire on targets that will last, casts Wrath (Moonfire while moving) and suggests Rejuvenation on yourself when you are below half health and alone. It stops while you cast, travel or have no enemy targeted."
L["Default.MoP.Druid.Unspecialized.Description"] = "適用於 1 至 9 級，或尚未選擇專精的任何德魯伊；選擇專精後由專精內建循環接手。獵豹形態下維持掃擊，將五個連擊點（對即將死亡的目標為兩個）用於兇猛撕咬，並以割碎累積；熊形態下使用割碎與槌擊。其他情況下以憤怒拉怪，對會存活較久的目標維持月火術，施放憤怒（移動時用月火術），並在你獨自一人且生命力低於一半時建議對自己施放回春術。你施法、在旅行中或沒有選取敵人時會停止建議。"
-- en: "Druid: Balance (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Druid.Balance.Name"] = "德魯伊：平衡（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "Recommended for Balance from level 10, after Wowhead's Phase 5 list and wowsims. Keeps Moonfire and Sunfire up and refreshes them inside the matching Eclipse, casts Starfall in Lunar Eclipse, Starsurge on Shooting Stars and on cooldown, Hurricane in Solar or Astral Storm in Lunar at five enemies, Starfire in and after Lunar and Wrath in and after Solar. Rotation Master cannot read Eclipse energy, so between Eclipses it keeps casting Starfire if Starfire was one of your last three casts, otherwise Wrath. Reminders: Mark of the Wild, Moonkin Form, Incarnation as an Eclipse starts and Celestial Alignment as one ends (on elites or long fights), Nature's Vigil, Force of Nature, Nature's Swiftness for Dream of Cenarius, Innervate, Solar Beam, Barkskin and Renewal when low. Wild Mushroom placement stays manual; the Detonate reminder is off by default. It stops while you cast, travel, are in Cat or Bear Form, or have no enemy targeted."
L["Default.MoP.Druid.Balance.Description"] = "推薦 10 級起的平衡使用，依據 Wowhead 第 5 階段清單與 wowsims。維持月火術與日炎術，並在對應的蝕星蔽月期間刷新它們，月蝕時施放星殞術，流星觸發時及冷卻結束時使用星湧術，五個敵人時在日蝕中使用颶風或在月蝕中使用星界風暴，月蝕期間及之後使用星火術，日蝕期間及之後使用憤怒。Rotation Master 無法讀取蝕星蔽月能量，因此在兩次蝕星蔽月之間，如果星火術是你最近三次施法之一就繼續施放星火術，否則施放憤怒。提醒：野性印記、梟獸形態、蝕星蔽月開始時使用化身、結束時使用星穹大連線（對精英或長時間戰鬥）、自然戒備、自然之力、為塞納留斯之夢使用自然迅捷、啟動、太陽光束、生命力低時使用樹皮術與復原。狂野蘑菇的擺放由你手動處理；引爆提醒預設關閉。你施法、在旅行中、處於獵豹或熊形態，或沒有選取敵人時會停止建議。"
-- en: "Druid: Feral (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Druid.Feral.Name"] = "德魯伊：野性戰鬥（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "Recommended for Feral from level 10, after wowsims and Wowhead's Phase 5 list. Puts you in Cat Form, opens from Prowl with Savage Roar and Ravage, keeps Savage Roar up, uses Predatory Swiftness for a Healing Touch at four or five combo points with Dream of Cenarius, Rip at five points (Ferocious Bite refreshes it below 25% health), Ferocious Bite at five points while Rip and Savage Roar both have six seconds left, Rake, Thrash on Clearcasting, Shred on Clearcasting or Berserk when the target is not attacking you (Rotation Master cannot tell whether you are behind it) and Mangle; Thrash and Swipe at four enemies. In Bear Form it gives a short tanking list. Reminders: Tiger's Fury under 35 energy, Berserk with it on elites or long fights, Incarnation, Force of Nature, Nature's Vigil, Skull Bash, Survival Instincts and Barkskin when low, Mark of the Wild. Bear- and Wrath-weaving, and Heart of the Wild, stay manual."
L["Default.MoP.Druid.Feral.Description"] = "推薦 10 級起的野性戰鬥使用，依據 wowsims 與 Wowhead 第 5 階段清單。讓你進入獵豹形態，從潛行以兇蠻咆哮與劫掠起手，維持兇蠻咆哮，有塞納留斯之夢時在四或五個連擊點利用猛獸迅捷施放治療之觸，五個連擊點時使用撕扯（目標生命力低於 25% 時由兇猛撕咬刷新），撕扯與兇蠻咆哮都還剩六秒時在五個連擊點使用兇猛撕咬，掃擊，節能施法時使用痛擊，目標沒有攻擊你時在節能施法或狂暴期間使用撕碎（Rotation Master 無法判斷你是否在目標背後），以及割碎；四個敵人時使用痛擊與揮擊。熊形態下會提供簡短的坦克清單。提醒：能量低於 35 時使用猛虎之怒、對精英或長時間戰鬥搭配它使用狂暴、化身、自然之力、自然戒備、碎顱猛擊、生命力低時使用求生本能與樹皮術、野性印記。熊形態穿插、憤怒穿插以及野性之心由你手動處理。"
-- en: "Druid: Feral, Bite only in execute (MoP, Icy Veins)"
L["Default.MoP.Druid.Feral.IcyVeins.Name"] = "德魯伊：野性戰鬥，只在斬殺階段使用撕咬（潘達利亞之謎，Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Icy Veins' Feral order (Wowhead's Bite rule agrees), an alternative to the recommended Feral premade: enable it and disable that one, or raise its priority. Same opener, Savage Roar, Healing Touch and AoE, but combo points above 25% target health go only to Rip and Savage Roar: Ferocious Bite only refreshes Rip in execute (or spends five points before you learn Rip). Rake refreshes at two seconds, Thrash only on Clearcasting, and Berserk waits for 90 energy with Tiger's Fury at least 15 seconds away."
L["Default.MoP.Druid.Feral.IcyVeins.Description"] = "Icy Veins 的野性戰鬥順序（Wowhead 的撕咬規則也一致），推薦野性戰鬥內建循環的替代方案：啟用它並停用推薦的循環，或提高它的優先順序。起手、兇蠻咆哮、治療之觸與範圍傷害相同，但目標生命力高於 25% 時，連擊點只用於撕扯與兇蠻咆哮：兇猛撕咬只在斬殺階段刷新撕扯（或在學會撕扯之前消耗五個連擊點）。掃擊在剩下兩秒時刷新，痛擊只在節能施法時使用，狂暴會等到能量 90 且猛虎之怒至少還要 15 秒時才使用。"
-- en: "Druid: Guardian (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Druid.Guardian.Name"] = "德魯伊：守護者（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "Recommended for Guardian tanks from level 10, after wowsims and Wowhead's Phase 5 list. Puts you in Bear Form, pulls with Faerie Fire from range or Mangle, keeps Weakened Blows up with Thrash and Weakened Armor with Faerie Fire on elites, uses a Dream of Cenarius Healing Touch when hurt, Mangle on cooldown, Thrash and Swipe at three enemies, then Lacerate, Thrash and Faerie Fire. In Cat Form (Heart of the Wild) it gives a short damage list. Reminders: Savage Defense whenever it is down, Enrage for rage, Frenzied Regeneration when low or rage-capped, Maul above 90 rage or on Tooth and Claw, Barkskin while the target attacks you, Survival Instincts when low, Berserk and Incarnation on two enemies or a boss, Force of Nature, Nature's Vigil, Cenarion Ward, Skull Bash, Mark of the Wild. Taunting and Might of Ursoc stay manual (both reminders are off by default)."
L["Default.MoP.Druid.Guardian.Description"] = "推薦 10 級起的守護者坦克使用，依據 wowsims 與 Wowhead 第 5 階段清單。讓你進入熊形態，從遠處以精靈之火或以割碎拉怪，以痛擊維持弱化攻擊，對精英以精靈之火維持弱化護甲，受傷時使用塞納留斯之夢的治療之觸，割碎冷卻結束即使用，三個敵人時使用痛擊與揮擊，然後是割裂、痛擊與精靈之火。獵豹形態下（野性之心）會提供簡短的傷害清單。提醒：兇蠻防禦未生效時就使用、狂怒以獲得怒氣、生命力低或怒氣溢出時使用狂暴恢復、怒氣高於 90 或銳齒利爪觸發時使用槌擊、目標攻擊你時使用樹皮術、生命力低時使用求生本能、兩個敵人或首領時使用狂暴與化身、自然之力、自然戒備、塞納里奧結界、碎顱猛擊、野性印記。嘲諷與厄索克之力由你手動處理（兩者的提醒都預設關閉）。"
-- en: "Druid: Restoration (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Druid.Restoration.Name"] = "德魯伊：恢復（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "Recommended for Restoration from level 10, after Wowhead's Phase 5 group healing. Heals your current friendly target, or you with no target; choosing whom to heal is up to you. Swiftmend on a target with your HoT when it is low, when Harmony has dropped, or into Wild Growth with Soul of the Forest; Wild Growth when three people nearby are hurt; instant Healing Touch on Nature's Swiftness; Regrowth on Clearcasting or a dying target; Rejuvenation; then Healing Touch and Nourish while standing still. An attackable target gets Moonfire and Wrath. Reminders: Lifebloom stacks and Ironbark on your focus (set the tank as focus), Wild Mushroom: Bloom on group damage, Force of Nature, Incarnation, Nature's Vigil, Nature's Swiftness, Innervate, Nature's Cure, Cenarion Ward, Barkskin, Mark of the Wild. Wild Mushroom placement, Tranquility and Genesis reminders are off by default."
L["Default.MoP.Druid.Restoration.Description"] = "推薦 10 級起的恢復使用，依據 Wowhead 第 5 階段隊伍治療。治療你目前的友方目標，沒有目標時則治療你自己；要治療誰由你決定。對帶有你持續治療效果的目標在其生命力低時、共生消失時，或有森林之魂時為了野性痊癒而使用迅癒；附近有三人受傷時使用野性痊癒；自然迅捷生效時使用瞬發治療之觸；節能施法或目標瀕死時使用癒合；回春術；然後站著不動時使用治療之觸與滋補術。可攻擊的目標會得到月火術與憤怒。提醒：對你的專注目標維持生命之花層數與鐵樹皮術（請將坦克設為專注目標）、隊伍受傷時使用狂野蘑菇:成熟、自然之力、化身、自然戒備、自然迅捷、啟動、自然療癒、塞納里奧結界、樹皮術、野性印記。狂野蘑菇擺放、寧靜與生生不息的提醒預設關閉。"
-- en: "Druid: Restoration, tank healing (MoP, Wowhead)"
L["Default.MoP.Druid.Restoration.Wowhead.Name"] = "德魯伊：恢復，坦克治療（潘達利亞之謎，Wowhead）"
-- en: "Wowhead's single-target tank-healing order, an alternative to the recommended Restoration premade for when you are assigned to the tank: enable it and disable that one, or raise its priority. Keep the tank targeted: it keeps three Lifeblooms and Rejuvenation on it, uses Regrowth for heavy damage, Nourish for light damage, Healing Touch once Lifebloom and Rejuvenation are rolling and the tank is below half, and Swiftmend to keep it topped up. Same reminders as the recommended premade."
L["Default.MoP.Druid.Restoration.Wowhead.Description"] = "Wowhead 的單一目標坦克治療順序，在你被指派治療坦克時作為推薦恢復內建循環的替代方案：啟用它並停用推薦的循環，或提高它的優先順序。請保持選取坦克：它會在坦克身上維持三層生命之花與回春術，承受大量傷害時使用癒合，傷害輕微時使用滋補術，生命之花與回春術持續且坦克低於一半時使用治療之觸，並以迅癒讓坦克保持滿血。提醒與推薦的內建循環相同。"
-- en: "Hunter: Beast Mastery (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Hunter.BeastMastery.Name"] = "獵人：野獸控制（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "Chosen automatically once you know Kill Command. Opens with Hunter's Mark and Kill Command, then: Kill Shot, Kill Command (held for a moment when Bestial Wrath is about to be ready), A Murder of Crows, Lynx Rush, Dire Beast and your tier-six shot when talented, Focus Fire at five Frenzy stacks (or four about to fall off) but not during Bestial Wrath, Serpent Sting on targets that will live, Cobra Shot to refresh it, Arcane Shot at 80 focus or during Bestial Wrath, then Cobra Shot (Steady Shot before 81). With two or more enemies fighting you it keeps Beast Cleave up with Multi-Shot, saves Kill Command for spare focus on big packs and suggests Explosive Trap from three. Reminders: pet out, revived and mended, Aspect of the Hawk or Iron Hawk, Counter Shot, Fervor, and Bestial Wrath, Rapid Fire, Stampede and racials when the fight is worth it (an elite, a dungeon or raid, or a target that will live). Trap placement, Misdirection, Feign Death and defensives stay with you; Exhilaration and Deterrence reminders are off by default."
L["Default.MoP.Hunter.BeastMastery.Description"] = "學會擊殺命令後自動選用。以獵人印記與擊殺命令開場，接著：擊殺射擊，擊殺命令（狂野怒火即將就緒時稍候片刻），黑鴉獵殺，山貓衝刺，有點天賦時使用凶暴野獸與你的第六層天賦射擊，五層狂亂（或四層即將消失）時使用專注射擊，但狂野怒火期間不用，對會存活較久的目標使用毒蛇釘刺，以眼鏡蛇射擊刷新它，集中值 80 或狂野怒火期間使用秘法射擊，然後是眼鏡蛇射擊（81 級前為穩固射擊）。兩個以上敵人與你交戰時，以多重射擊維持獸劈斬，面對大型怪群時只在集中值有餘時使用擊殺命令，三個起建議爆炸陷阱。提醒：寵物已召喚、復活並治療，雄鷹守護或鋼鷹守護，駁火反擊，熱情，以及值得時（精英、地城或團隊副本，或會存活較久的目標）使用狂野怒火、急速射擊、奔竄與種族技能。陷阱擺放、誤導、假死與防禦技能由你自行處理；心曠神怡與威懾的提醒預設關閉。"
-- en: "Hunter: Marksmanship (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Hunter.Marksmanship.Name"] = "獵人：射擊（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "Chosen automatically once you know Aimed Shot. Pre-casts Aimed Shot, then: Steady Shots in pairs to keep Steady Focus up (from 63), Chimera Shot, Serpent Sting on targets that will live, Aimed Shot whenever Fire! makes it instant, Kill Shot, your talents, and a hard-cast Aimed Shot while the target is above 80% health, under Rapid Fire or Bloodlust, at 85 focus or when Chimera Shot is a few seconds away. Arcane Shot only while you are moving; otherwise Steady Shot. Four or more enemies: Chimera Shot, instant Aimed Shot, Multi-Shot, Kill Shot, Explosive Trap. Same reminders as the other Hunter premades. If you prefer spending spare focus on Arcane Shot, use the Arcane Shot variant."
L["Default.MoP.Hunter.Marksmanship.Description"] = "學會瞄準射擊後自動選用。預先施放瞄準射擊，接著：成對施放穩固射擊以維持穩固集中（63 級起），奇美拉射擊，對會存活較久的目標使用毒蛇釘刺，射擊!使瞄準射擊變為瞬發時就使用，擊殺射擊，你的天賦，以及在目標生命力高於 80%、急速射擊或嗜血術期間、集中值 85 時，或奇美拉射擊再幾秒就就緒時讀條施放瞄準射擊。秘法射擊只在移動時使用；否則使用穩固射擊。四個以上敵人時：奇美拉射擊、瞬發瞄準射擊、多重射擊、擊殺射擊、爆炸陷阱。提醒與其他獵人內建循環相同。如果你偏好把多餘的集中值花在秘法射擊上，請使用秘法射擊版本。"
-- en: "Hunter: Marksmanship, Arcane Shot dump (MoP, Icy Veins)"
L["Default.MoP.Hunter.Marksmanship.IcyVeins.Name"] = "獵人：射擊，秘法射擊消耗（潘達利亞之謎，Icy Veins）"
-- en: "An alternative to the Marksmanship premade, as Icy Veins, Method, wowtbc.gg and Hekili play it: Aimed Shot is hard-cast only above 80% target health or under Rapid Fire or Bloodlust, and spare focus goes to Arcane Shot at 60 instead. Steady Focus is refreshed under 4 seconds; on four or more enemies Multi-Shot comes first. Off by default: enable it and disable the Marksmanship premade, or raise its priority."
L["Default.MoP.Hunter.Marksmanship.IcyVeins.Description"] = "射擊內建循環的替代方案，依照 Icy Veins、Method、wowtbc.gg 與 Hekili 的打法：只有在目標生命力高於 80% 或急速射擊、嗜血術期間才讀條施放瞄準射擊，多餘的集中值則改在 60 時用於秘法射擊。穩固集中在剩不到 4 秒時刷新；四個以上敵人時優先使用多重射擊。預設關閉：啟用它並停用射擊內建循環，或提高它的優先順序。"
-- en: "Hunter: Survival (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Hunter.Survival.Name"] = "獵人：生存（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "Chosen automatically once you know Explosive Shot. Opens with Hunter's Mark, Black Arrow and Explosive Shot, then: Explosive Shot on cooldown and on every Lock and Load, Kill Shot, Black Arrow on targets that will live, your talents, Serpent Sting kept up by Cobra Shot, Arcane Shot at 75 focus, with Thrill of the Hunt, or at 55 when Black Arrow is not coming up, then Cobra Shot (Steady Shot before 81). Two or more enemies: Multi-Shot first on Lock and Load with full focus, Explosive Shot up to five targets, Kill Shot, Black Arrow, Explosive Trap from three, Multi-Shot to spend. Same reminders as the other Hunter premades; traps for Lock and Load procs stay with you."
L["Default.MoP.Hunter.Survival.Description"] = "學會爆裂射擊後自動選用。以獵人印記、黑蝕箭與爆裂射擊開場，接著：爆裂射擊冷卻結束時及每次蓄勢待發時使用，擊殺射擊，對會存活較久的目標使用黑蝕箭，你的天賦，以眼鏡蛇射擊維持毒蛇釘刺，集中值 75、有獵殺快感時，或黑蝕箭不會很快就緒時在 55 使用秘法射擊，然後是眼鏡蛇射擊（81 級前為穩固射擊）。兩個以上敵人時：蓄勢待發且集中值全滿時優先使用多重射擊，爆裂射擊最多對五個目標，擊殺射擊，黑蝕箭，三個起使用爆炸陷阱，以多重射擊消耗集中值。提醒與其他獵人內建循環相同；為觸發蓄勢待發而放置陷阱由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Hunter: before a specialization (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Hunter.Unspecialized.Name"] = "獵人：選擇專精前（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "For levels 1 to 9 and any Hunter who has not chosen a specialization; the Beast Mastery, Marksmanship and Survival premades take over as soon as you know their signature shot. Pulls with Hunter's Mark and Arcane Shot, then Serpent Sting on targets that will live, Multi-Shot on three or more enemies, Arcane Shot, Steady Shot and Auto Shot. Reminds you to call, revive and mend your pet and to keep Aspect of the Hawk up."
L["Default.MoP.Hunter.Unspecialized.Description"] = "適用於 1 至 9 級以及尚未選擇專精的任何獵人；一旦你學會野獸控制、射擊與生存的招牌射擊，就由對應的內建循環接手。以獵人印記與秘法射擊拉怪，接著對會存活較久的目標使用毒蛇釘刺，三個以上敵人時使用多重射擊，秘法射擊、穩固射擊與自動射擊。會提醒你召喚、復活與治療寵物，並維持雄鷹守護。"
-- en: "Mage: Arcane (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Mage.Arcane.Name"] = "法師：秘法（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "Recommended for Arcane, from level 10 to 90 (selected once you know Arcane Blast). Arcane Blast builds four Arcane Charges; with four, an Arcane Missiles! proc is spent with Missiles, and without one Arcane Barrage comes out once your mana drops below 90%. Above 95% mana it keeps blasting, which is how the simulator plays it. Missiles is never left sitting on two procs, Barrage is cast before Alter Time snaps back, and with two or more enemies Barrage goes out every four charges; Cone of Cold and Arcane Explosion when five are close. Keeps your talented bomb up, and Fire Blast or Ice Lance while moving without Ice Floes. Reminders: Arcane Power and Alter Time at four charges with a proc, Frost Armor (Molten before 54), Arcane Brilliance, Counterspell, Mana Gem, Mirror Image, Ice Barrier, Ice Floes, Rune of Power or Invocation. Time Warp, Spellsteal and Presence of Mind are off; Rune of Power still needs placing by hand."
L["Default.MoP.Mage.Arcane.Description"] = "推薦秘法使用，適用於 10 至 90 級（學會秘法衝擊後選用）。以秘法衝擊累積四層秘法充能；四層時若有秘法飛彈!觸發就用秘法飛彈消耗，沒有觸發時則在法力降到 90% 以下後使用秘法彈幕。法力高於 95% 時會持續施放秘法衝擊，這也是模擬器的打法。秘法飛彈絕不會留著兩層觸發不用，時光倒轉回溯前會施放秘法彈幕，兩個以上敵人時每四層充能就施放秘法彈幕；五個敵人在近處時使用冰錐術與魔爆術。維持你的天賦炸彈，移動且沒有浮冰時使用火焰衝擊或冰霜長矛。提醒：四層充能且有觸發時使用秘法強化與時光倒轉、霜甲術（54 級前為炎甲術）、秘法光輝、法術反制、法力寶石、鏡像、寒冰護體、浮冰、力之符文或祈願。時間扭曲、法術竊取與氣定神閒預設關閉；力之符文仍需手動擺放。"
-- en: "Mage: Arcane, Barrage at four charges (MoP, Icy Veins)"
L["Default.MoP.Mage.Arcane.IcyVeins.Name"] = "法師：秘法，四層充能時使用秘法彈幕（潘達利亞之謎，Icy Veins）"
-- en: "The guides' Arcane rule (Icy Veins, Wowhead, Method, wowtbc.gg), an alternative to the recommended Arcane premade: at four Arcane Charges, Arcane Missiles if a proc is up, otherwise Arcane Barrage, whatever your mana; Missiles only at four charges. Everything else (Alter Time, bombs, AoE, moving, reminders) matches the recommended one, except that Arcane Power is suggested at four charges without waiting for a proc. Off by default: enable it and disable the recommended Arcane premade, or raise its priority."
L["Default.MoP.Mage.Arcane.IcyVeins.Description"] = "指南的秘法規則（Icy Veins、Wowhead、Method、wowtbc.gg），推薦秘法內建循環的替代方案：四層秘法充能時，若有觸發就使用秘法飛彈，否則不論法力多少都使用秘法彈幕；秘法飛彈只在四層充能時使用。其餘一切（時光倒轉、炸彈、範圍傷害、移動、提醒）與推薦的循環相同，只是秘法強化會在四層充能時建議，不等待觸發。預設關閉：啟用它並停用推薦的秘法內建循環，或提高它的優先順序。"
-- en: "Mage: Fire (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Mage.Fire.Name"] = "法師：火焰（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "Recommended for Fire, from level 10 to 90 (selected once you know Pyroblast). Opens with a hard Pyroblast, then Inferno Blast (Fire Blast before 24) turns Heating Up into a Pyroblast! proc, which is cast at once unless Combustion is about to come off cooldown; then it waits for the next Heating Up while you cast Fireball. Combustion lights right after a Pyroblast while Ignite and the Pyroblast burn are on the target; the addon cannot see how big Ignite is, so judge a weak one yourself. Keeps your talented bomb up, spreads with Inferno Blast when two or more enemies fight you, Cone of Cold and Arcane Explosion for five close by, Scorch on the move. Reminders: Molten Armor, Presence of Mind, Alter Time with both procs, Mana Gem, Arcane Brilliance, Counterspell, Mirror Image, Ice Barrier, Ice Floes, Invocation or Rune of Power. Dragon's Breath, Time Warp and Spellsteal are off."
L["Default.MoP.Mage.Fire.Description"] = "推薦火焰使用，適用於 10 至 90 級（學會炎爆術後選用）。以讀條炎爆術開場，接著以煉獄衝擊（24 級前為火焰衝擊）將升溫轉為炎爆術!觸發，並立即施放，除非燃火即將冷卻結束；然後在你施放火球術時等待下一次升溫。燃火會在炎爆術之後立即施放，此時目標身上有點燃與炎爆術的燃燒效果；插件無法看到點燃有多大，因此較弱的點燃請自行判斷。維持你的天賦炸彈，兩個以上敵人與你交戰時以煉獄衝擊擴散，附近有五個敵人時使用冰錐術與魔爆術，移動時使用灼燒。提醒：炎甲術、氣定神閒、兩種觸發都有時使用時光倒轉、法力寶石、秘法光輝、法術反制、鏡像、寒冰護體、浮冰、祈願或力之符文。龍之吐息、時間扭曲與法術竊取預設關閉。"
-- en: "Mage: Fire, hold Pyroblast! (MoP, Icy Veins)"
L["Default.MoP.Mage.Fire.IcyVeins.Name"] = "法師：火焰，保留炎爆術!（潘達利亞之謎，Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Icy Veins', Method's and wowtbc.gg's Fire play, an alternative to the recommended Fire premade: a Pyroblast! proc is held until a Heating Up joins it, then cast together with your Fireball, and spent alone only when it is about to expire. Everything else matches the recommended one. Off by default: enable it and disable the recommended Fire premade, or raise its priority."
L["Default.MoP.Mage.Fire.IcyVeins.Description"] = "Icy Veins、Method 與 wowtbc.gg 的火焰打法，推薦火焰內建循環的替代方案：炎爆術!觸發會保留到升溫也出現，再與你的火球術一起施放，只有在即將過期時才單獨消耗。其餘與推薦的循環相同。預設關閉：啟用它並停用推薦的火焰內建循環，或提高它的優先順序。"
-- en: "Mage: Frost (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Mage.Frost.Name"] = "法師：冰霜（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "Frost from level 10 to 90 (selected once you know Summon Water Elemental). Ice Lance at two Fingers of Frost, Frostfire Bolt on Brain Freeze, your talented bomb, Frozen Orb, Ice Lance on one Fingers of Frost, Frostbolt; from 87 a proc is held for Alter Time when it is less than 10 seconds away. With two or more enemies: Frozen Orb, Cone of Cold and Arcane Explosion when they are close, Blizzard when four stand still. Ice Lance and Fire Blast on the move without Ice Floes. Reminders: Water Elemental, Freeze on anything but a boss (place it yourself), Icy Veins timed with Alter Time, Alter Time at two Fingers of Frost in Icy Veins, Frost Armor (Molten before 54), Mana Gem, Arcane Brilliance, Counterspell, Mirror Image, Ice Barrier, Ice Floes, Invocation or Rune of Power. Cold Snap, Presence of Mind, Time Warp and Spellsteal are off."
L["Default.MoP.Mage.Frost.Description"] = "10 至 90 級的冰霜（學會召喚水元素後選用）。兩層冰霜之指時使用冰霜長矛，腦部凍結觸發時使用霜火箭，你的天賦炸彈，冰霜之球，一層冰霜之指時使用冰霜長矛，寒冰箭；87 級起，若時光倒轉再不到 10 秒就就緒，會保留觸發給它。兩個以上敵人時：冰霜之球，敵人在近處時使用冰錐術與魔爆術，四個敵人站著不動時使用暴風雪。移動且沒有浮冰時使用冰霜長矛與火焰衝擊。提醒：水元素、對首領以外的目標使用冰凍術（請自行擺放）、配合時光倒轉使用冰寒脈動、冰寒脈動期間兩層冰霜之指時使用時光倒轉、霜甲術（54 級前為炎甲術）、法力寶石、秘法光輝、法術反制、鏡像、寒冰護體、浮冰、祈願或力之符文。急速冷卻、氣定神閒、時間扭曲與法術竊取預設關閉。"
-- en: "Mage: before a specialization (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Mage.Unspecialized.Name"] = "法師：選擇專精前（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "For levels 1 to 9, and any Mage who has not chosen a specialization yet. Frostfire Bolt, Fire Blast to finish a target or on the move, Ice Lance on the move once learned, Arcane Explosion when three or more enemies are in melee range. Reminders: Frost Nova when a mob reaches you, Counterspell, and Molten Armor and Arcane Brilliance if you reach them. Choosing a specialization at 10 switches to that specialization's premade."
L["Default.MoP.Mage.Unspecialized.Description"] = "適用於 1 至 9 級，以及尚未選擇專精的任何法師。霜火箭，以火焰衝擊收尾或在移動時使用，學會後在移動時使用冰霜長矛，三個以上敵人在近戰範圍內時使用魔爆術。提醒：怪物接近你時使用冰霜新星、法術反制，以及學會後的炎甲術與秘法光輝。10 級選擇專精後會切換為該專精的內建循環。"
-- en: "Monk: Brewmaster (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Monk.Brewmaster.Name"] = "武僧：釀酒（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "Picked automatically once you know Stance of the Sturdy Ox. Keeps Shuffle up with Blackout Kick, uses Keg Smash whenever its Chi fits, Expel Harm when you are hurt (at once below 35%), Jab to spend energy, Tiger Palm for Tiger Power and as the free filler (Jab builds Chi before level 34), and Touch of Death when it is usable. From range out of combat: Chi Wave, Dizzying Haze, Clash or Keg Smash. On three or more enemies: Rushing Jade Wind, Breath of Fire and Spinning Crane Kick only while Shuffle has time left. Reminders: Sturdy Ox, Legacy of the Emperor, Purifying Brew on Heavy Stagger (Moderate when Shuffle is banked), Elusive Brew from six stacks, Guard with Power Guard, Chi Brew, Xuen, Fortifying Brew, Dampen Harm or Diffuse Magic when low, Spear Hand Strike. The Black Ox Statue reminder is off; Avert Harm, Zen Meditation and Provoke stay with you."
L["Default.MoP.Monk.Brewmaster.Description"] = "學會磐牛式後自動選用。以滅寂腿維持醉拳，真氣足夠容納時就使用酒罈破，受傷時使用斗轉星移（低於 35% 時立即使用），以刺擊消耗能量，使用虎掌以獲得虎威並作為免費填充（34 級前以刺擊累積真氣），可用時使用幽冥掌。戰鬥外從遠處：真氣波、微醺酒氣、天引躍擊或酒罈破。三個以上敵人時：飛玉疾風、火焰吐息，以及只在醉拳還有剩餘時間時使用鶴旋踢。提醒：磐牛式、御傳心法、醉仙大緩勁時使用清心絕釀（已累積醉拳時則在醉仙中緩勁時使用）、六層起使用飄渺絕釀、有提氣凝勁時使用護身氣勁、真氣絕釀、雪怒、石形絕釀、生命力低時使用卸勁訣或祛魔訣、天矛鎖喉手。玄牛雕像的提醒預設關閉；移傷氣勁、冥思禪功與嘲心嘯由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Monk: Brewmaster, damage first (MoP, wowsims)"
L["Default.MoP.Monk.Brewmaster.Offensive.Name"] = "武僧：釀酒，傷害優先（潘達利亞之謎，wowsims）"
-- en: "An alternative to the Brewmaster premade, off by default: enable it and disable that one, or raise its priority. Follows the simulator's damage-first list for a tank who outgears the content: Rushing Jade Wind before Keg Smash, Chi spent on Blackout Kick for damage, and no routine Purifying Brew or Guard (Purifying Brew only lights on the tier-15 Purifier proc). Elusive Brew, Chi Brew, Xuen and Fortifying Brew are still reminders."
L["Default.MoP.Monk.Brewmaster.Offensive.Description"] = "釀酒內建循環的替代方案，預設關閉：啟用它並停用釀酒內建循環，或提高它的優先順序。依照模擬器為裝備遠超內容的坦克提供的傷害優先清單：酒罈破之前使用飛玉疾風，真氣用於滅寂腿以造成傷害，不例行使用清心絕釀或護身氣勁（清心絕釀只在 T15 淨化者觸發時亮起）。飄渺絕釀、真氣絕釀、雪怒與石形絕釀仍會提醒。"
-- en: "Monk: Windwalker (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Monk.Windwalker.Name"] = "武僧：御風（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "Picked automatically once you know Fists of Fury. Touch of Death when usable, Tiger Palm to keep Tiger Power, Rising Sun Kick on cooldown, Chi Wave, Combo Breaker procs, Fists of Fury when you are standing still and its channel will not cap your energy, Jab when two Chi are missing (Expel Harm instead when hurt), Blackout Kick without starving the next Rising Sun Kick. On two or more enemies Rising Sun Kick keeps its debuff up and Spinning Crane Kick or Rushing Jade Wind joins from three. Reminders: Fierce Tiger, Legacy of the Emperor and of the White Tiger, Tigereye Brew at 19 stacks (15 with Chi to spend, 10 under Bloodlust or near the end of a fight), Energizing Brew at low energy, Chi Brew, Xuen, Storm, Earth, and Fire on two enemies (you cast it on the second one), Touch of Karma, defensives and Spear Hand Strike. Energy-to-cap checks are energy thresholds, so tune them to your haste."
L["Default.MoP.Monk.Windwalker.Description"] = "學會狂拳連打後自動選用。可用時使用幽冥掌，以虎掌維持虎威，翔陽腳冷卻結束即使用，真氣波，連段破觸發，你站著不動且引導不會使能量溢出時使用狂拳連打，缺少兩點真氣時使用刺擊（受傷時改用斗轉星移），在不影響下一次翔陽腳的前提下使用滅寂腿。兩個以上敵人時以翔陽腳維持其減益效果，三個起加入鶴旋踢或飛玉疾風。提醒：猛虎式、御傳心法與雪怒心法、19 層時使用虎眼絕釀（有真氣可消耗時為 15 層，嗜血術期間或戰鬥接近尾聲時為 10 層）、能量低時使用凝神絕釀、真氣絕釀、雪怒、兩個敵人時使用風、火、大地（對第二個敵人施放）、乾坤挪移、防禦技能與天矛鎖喉手。能量溢出檢查使用的是能量門檻，請依你的加速調整。"
-- en: "Monk: Windwalker, SimulationCraft 5.4.8 (MoP, Hekili and MaxDps)"
L["Default.MoP.Monk.Windwalker.Simc.Name"] = "武僧：御風，SimulationCraft 5.4.8（潘達利亞之謎，Hekili 與 MaxDps）"
-- en: "An alternative to the Windwalker premade, off by default: enable it and disable that one, or raise its priority. The original SimulationCraft list that the Hekili and MaxDps addons ship: Tiger Power refreshed at three seconds, Rising Sun Kick first while its debuff is missing, Fists of Fury saved for Tigereye Brew (active or 15 stacks), Tigereye Brew at 20 stacks or at 15 with Chi and both buffs up. On three or more enemies it spends on Spinning Crane Kick, uses Rising Sun Kick only at full Chi and pools energy below 60."
L["Default.MoP.Monk.Windwalker.Simc.Description"] = "御風內建循環的替代方案，預設關閉：啟用它並停用御風內建循環，或提高它的優先順序。Hekili 與 MaxDps 插件所附的原始 SimulationCraft 清單：虎威在剩三秒時刷新，翔陽腳的減益效果不在時優先使用翔陽腳，狂拳連打保留給虎眼絕釀（生效中或 15 層），20 層時或 15 層且有真氣並兩個增益效果都生效時使用虎眼絕釀。三個以上敵人時以鶴旋踢消耗，只在真氣全滿時使用翔陽腳，並在能量低於 60 時蓄積能量。"
-- en: "Monk: Mistweaver (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Monk.Mistweaver.Name"] = "武僧：織霧（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "Picked automatically once you know Soothing Mist. With a friendly target it heals that target: Renewing Mist on cooldown, Uplift when three or more nearby allies are hurt, Expel Harm and your Chi talent for Chi, Rushing Jade Wind or Spinning Crane Kick for a hurt group, Surging Mist on five Vital Mists, Soothing Mist when the target is below 80%, then Enveloping Mist and Surging Mist inside that channel. With an enemy target it fistweaves: Tiger Palm and Blackout Kick on Muscle Memory to keep Tiger Power and Serpent's Zeal, Blackout Kick when Chi is full, Surging Mist on five Vital Mists, Renewing Mist and Expel Harm for Chi, Jab. Reminders: Wise Serpent, Legacy of the Emperor, the Jade Serpent Statue in a group, Mana Tea in quiet moments, Thunder Focus Tea, Chi Brew, Life Cocoon on a friend below 35%, Xuen, Detox, defensives, Spear Hand Strike. You choose whom to heal; Revival (reminder off) and Healing Sphere stay with you."
L["Default.MoP.Monk.Mistweaver.Description"] = "學會舒和之霧後自動選用。有友方目標時治療該目標：回生迷霧冷卻結束即使用，附近有三名以上盟友受傷時使用振氣訣，以斗轉星移與你的真氣天賦獲得真氣，隊伍受傷時使用飛玉疾風或鶴旋踢，五層精活迷霧時使用回春迷霧，目標低於 80% 時使用舒和之霧，然後在該引導中使用迷霧繚繞與回春迷霧。有敵方目標時改以拳腳攻擊進行治療（拳織）：以虎掌與肌肉記憶觸發時的滅寂腿維持虎威與蛟龍之誠，真氣全滿時使用滅寂腿，五層精活迷霧時使用回春迷霧，以回生迷霧與斗轉星移獲得真氣，刺擊。提醒：靈蛟式、御傳心法、隊伍中的玉蛟雕像、空閒時使用法力茶、聚雷茶、真氣絕釀、對低於 35% 的友方使用氣繭護體、雪怒、化毒袪病、防禦技能、天矛鎖喉手。要治療誰由你選擇；五氣歸元（提醒預設關閉）與治療玉由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Monk: before a specialization (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Monk.Unspecialized.Name"] = "武僧：選擇專精前（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "For levels 1 to 9, or any monk who has not chosen a specialization; a specialization premade takes over as soon as you pick one. Keeps Fierce Tiger and Tiger Power up, spends two Chi on Blackout Kick, uses Expel Harm when you are hurt and Jab otherwise."
L["Default.MoP.Monk.Unspecialized.Description"] = "適用於 1 至 9 級，或尚未選擇專精的任何武僧；選擇專精後由專精內建循環接手。維持猛虎式與虎威，將兩點真氣用於滅寂腿，受傷時使用斗轉星移，否則使用刺擊。"
-- en: "Paladin: Retribution (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Paladin.Retribution.Name"] = "聖騎士：懲戒（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "Recommended for Retribution, from level 10 once you know Templar's Verdict. Keeps Inquisition up (cast at 3 Holy Power, refreshed in its last 3 seconds; from 81), spends Templar's Verdict at full Holy Power or on a free proc before generating more, then Hammer of Wrath, Crusader Strike, Judgment and Exorcism, and Templar's Verdict at 3 when nothing else is ready. In Avenging Wrath it spends at once and puts Judgment ahead of Crusader Strike. Two or more enemies on you switch to Divine Storm, with Hammer of the Righteous when four are close. Pulls from range with Judgment or Exorcism, and suggests Word of Glory when you are solo and in danger. Reminders: a seal when none is active (Seal of Truth), Blessing of Kings or Might, Rebuke, Avenging Wrath and Guardian of Ancient Kings with Inquisition up on elites, Holy Avenger in wings, Execution Sentence and Light's Hammer, and Divine Protection and Lay on Hands when low. Seal of Righteousness for packs and glyph choices stay with you."
L["Default.MoP.Paladin.Retribution.Description"] = "推薦懲戒使用，從 10 級學會聖殿騎士之裁決起。維持異端審問（3 點聖能時施放，在最後 3 秒內刷新；81 級起），聖能全滿或有免費觸發時先使用聖殿騎士之裁決再產生更多聖能，接著是憤怒之錘、十字軍聖擊、審判與驅邪術，其他技能都未就緒時在 3 點聖能使用聖殿騎士之裁決。復仇之怒期間會立即消耗聖能，並將審判排在十字軍聖擊之前。兩個以上敵人與你交戰時改用神性風暴，四個敵人在近處時加上公正之錘。從遠處以審判或驅邪術拉怪，並在你單人且陷入危險時建議榮耀聖言。提醒：沒有聖印時施放聖印（真理聖印）、王者祝福或力量祝福、責難、對精英在異端審問生效時使用復仇之怒與遠古諸王守護者、復仇之怒期間使用神聖復仇者、死刑宣判與聖光之錘，以及生命力低時使用聖佑術與聖療術。用於怪群的正義聖印與雕紋選擇由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Paladin: Retribution, Exorcism first (MoP, Warcraft Tavern)"
L["Default.MoP.Paladin.Retribution.WarcraftTavern.Name"] = "聖騎士：懲戒，驅邪術優先（潘達利亞之謎，Warcraft Tavern）"
-- en: "An alternative to the recommended Retribution premade, off by default: enable it and disable that one, or raise its priority. Exorcism on every cooldown and Art of War reset comes first; Inquisition is cast at any Holy Power when it is missing and refreshed at 3 in its last 20 seconds; then Crusader Strike, Judgment, Templar's Verdict and Hammer of Wrath (first in wings with Sanctified Wrath). Two or more enemies use Crusader Strike, Light's Hammer, Judgment, Divine Storm and Hammer of Wrath. Avenging Wrath and Guardian of Ancient Kings are suggested only on elites. The guide's Seal of Righteousness on any cleave is left to you."
L["Default.MoP.Paladin.Retribution.WarcraftTavern.Description"] = "推薦懲戒內建循環的替代方案，預設關閉：啟用它並停用推薦的循環，或提高它的優先順序。每次冷卻結束及戰爭藝術重置時優先使用驅邪術；異端審問不在時以任何聖能施放，並在最後 20 秒內以 3 點聖能刷新；然後是十字軍聖擊、審判、聖殿騎士之裁決與憤怒之錘（有聖化之怒時於復仇之怒期間優先使用）。兩個以上敵人時使用十字軍聖擊、聖光之錘、審判、神性風暴與憤怒之錘。只對精英建議復仇之怒與遠古諸王守護者。指南中只要有順劈就使用正義聖印的做法交由你處理。"
-- en: "Paladin: Protection (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Paladin.Protection.Name"] = "聖騎士：防護（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "Recommended for Protection, from level 10 once you know Avenger's Shield. Pulls with Avenger's Shield, then Avenger's Shield on a Grand Crusader proc, Avenger's Shield, Hammer of Wrath, Crusader Strike, Judgment, your level-90 talent, Consecration, Holy Wrath and Sacred Shield. Three or more enemies on you switch to Avenger's Shield, Consecration, Hammer of the Righteous, Judgment and Holy Wrath. Shield of the Righteous, Eternal Flame and Word of Glory are off the global cooldown, so they light beside the rotation: Shield of the Righteous whenever you can afford it, Eternal Flame on yourself when it is running out with 3 Holy Power and three Bastion of Glory stacks, Word of Glory below half health without that talent. Other reminders: Righteous Fury, Seal of Insight when no seal is active, blessings, Rebuke, Sacred Shield, Avenging Wrath and Holy Avenger while you are tanking, and Guardian of Ancient Kings, Ardent Defender, Divine Protection and Lay on Hands by your health. It cannot see incoming damage, so plan big defensives yourself."
L["Default.MoP.Paladin.Protection.Description"] = "推薦防護使用，從 10 級學會復仇之盾起。以復仇之盾拉怪，接著大十字軍觸發時使用復仇之盾、復仇之盾、憤怒之錘、十字軍聖擊、審判、你的 90 級天賦、奉獻、神聖憤怒與崇聖護盾。三個以上敵人與你交戰時改用復仇之盾、奉獻、公正之錘、審判與神聖憤怒。公正之盾、永恆之火與榮耀聖言不受共用冷卻影響，因此會在循環旁亮起：負擔得起時就使用公正之盾，3 點聖能且有三層榮耀壁壘時，在你自己的永恆之火即將結束時對自己施放，沒有該天賦時在生命力低於一半時使用榮耀聖言。其他提醒：正義之怒、沒有聖印時使用洞悉聖印、祝福、責難、崇聖護盾、坦怪時使用復仇之怒與神聖復仇者，以及依你的生命力使用遠古諸王守護者、忠誠防衛者、聖佑術與聖療術。它無法看到即將承受的傷害，因此大型防禦技能請自行規劃。"
-- en: "Paladin: Protection, pool Holy Power (MoP, wowsims)"
L["Default.MoP.Paladin.Protection.Wowsims.Name"] = "聖騎士：防護，蓄積聖能（潘達利亞之謎，wowsims）"
-- en: "An alternative to the recommended Protection premade, off by default: enable it and disable that one, or raise its priority. Follows the simulator's tank lists: Shield of the Righteous waits for full Holy Power unless you fall below 40% health or Divine Purpose makes it free; Eternal Flame just before it fades with more than two Bastion of Glory stacks; Sacred Shield kept up; Holy Avenger and Avenging Wrath on cooldown. Generators run Crusader Strike, Judgment, then Avenger's Shield, Holy Wrath, the level-90 talent and Hammer of Wrath, with the same three-enemy AoE order. Boss-timed defensives are yours."
L["Default.MoP.Paladin.Protection.Wowsims.Description"] = "推薦防護內建循環的替代方案，預設關閉：啟用它並停用推薦的循環，或提高它的優先順序。依照模擬器的坦克清單：公正之盾會等到聖能全滿，除非你的生命力低於 40% 或神聖意圖使它免費；有兩層以上榮耀壁壘時，在永恆之火即將消失前施放；維持崇聖護盾；神聖復仇者與復仇之怒冷卻結束即使用。產生聖能的技能依序為十字軍聖擊、審判，然後是復仇之盾、神聖憤怒、90 級天賦與憤怒之錘，三個敵人時的範圍傷害順序相同。配合首領時機的防禦技能由你負責。"
-- en: "Paladin: Holy healing (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Paladin.Holy.Name"] = "聖騎士：神聖治療（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "For Holy, from level 10 once you know Holy Shock. With a friend targeted it heals: at 3 Holy Power (or Divine Purpose) Light of Dawn when three people near you are hurt, else Eternal Flame on a target without it, else Word of Glory; Holy Shock on cooldown; Infusion of Light into Holy Radiance or Divine Light, three Selfless Healer stacks into Holy Radiance or Flash of Light; Flash of Light below 35%; Holy Radiance for a hurt group; Divine Light, then Holy Light to top off. With an enemy targeted it deals damage: Holy Shock, Judgment, Crusader Strike, Holy Prism, Execution Sentence, Hammer of Wrath, Denounce. Reminders: Seal of Insight when no seal is active, blessings, Rebuke, Beacon of Light and Sacred Shield on your focus (set the tank as focus), Divine Plea below 60% mana, Light's Hammer and your healing cooldowns when three people are below 70%, Lay on Hands on a dying target. Choosing whom to heal, dispels and mouseover healing stay with you."
L["Default.MoP.Paladin.Holy.Description"] = "適用於神聖，從 10 級學會神聖震擊起。選取友方時進行治療：3 點聖能（或神聖意圖）時，若你附近有三人受傷就使用黎明曙光，否則對沒有永恆之火的目標施放永恆之火，再否則使用榮耀聖言；神聖震擊冷卻結束即使用；聖光灌注用於神聖光輝或神聖之光，三層無私治療者用於神聖光輝或聖光閃現；低於 35% 時使用聖光閃現；隊伍受傷時使用神聖光輝；神聖之光，然後以聖光術補滿。選取敵人時造成傷害：神聖震擊、審判、十字軍聖擊、神聖稜石、死刑宣判、憤怒之錘、問罪。提醒：沒有聖印時使用洞悉聖印、祝福、責難、對你的專注目標施放聖光信標與崇聖護盾（請將坦克設為專注目標）、法力低於 60% 時使用神性祈求、三人低於 70% 時使用聖光之錘與你的治療冷卻技能、對瀕死目標使用聖療術。要治療誰、驅散與滑鼠指向治療由你自行處理。"
-- en: "Paladin: before a specialization (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Paladin.Unspecialized.Name"] = "聖騎士：選擇專精前（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "For levels 1 to 9, and any paladin who has not chosen a specialization yet; a specialization's premade takes over as soon as you pick one. Pulls from range with Judgment, then Crusader Strike and Judgment, with Hammer of Justice when you are solo and below half health and Word of Glory below 40%. Reminders: a seal when none is active, Blessing of Kings, Rebuke, and Flash of Light out of combat when you are hurt."
L["Default.MoP.Paladin.Unspecialized.Description"] = "適用於 1 至 9 級，以及尚未選擇專精的任何聖騎士；選擇專精後由該專精的內建循環接手。從遠處以審判拉怪，接著是十字軍聖擊與審判，單人且生命力低於一半時使用制裁之錘，低於 40% 時使用榮耀聖言。提醒：沒有聖印時施放聖印、王者祝福、責難，以及戰鬥外受傷時使用聖光閃現。"
-- en: "Priest: Discipline (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Priest.Discipline.Name"] = "牧師：戒律（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "Discipline healing from level 10 to 90, chosen while you know Penance. Target a friend to heal them: Power Word: Shield when they are low, before the pull and about every 12 seconds for Rapture; Flash Heal on Surge of Light; Penance; Flash Heal when they are very low; Binding Heal when you are both hurt; Prayer of Mending; Prayer of Healing and your tier-6 talent when three allies are hurt; Greater Heal; Renew while moving; Heal to top up. Under Spirit Shell it suggests Prayer of Healing or Greater Heal. Target an enemy to heal through Atonement: Penance, Power Word: Solace or Holy Fire, your tier-6 talent on packs, Shadow Word: Pain when solo, Smite. Reminders: Inner Fire, Fortitude, Archangel at five Evangelism, Inner Focus, Pain Suppression on a dying target, Shadowfiend or Mindbender for mana, Power Infusion, Desperate Prayer. Left to you: whom to heal, Spirit Shell timing (a reminder you can switch on), Power Word: Barrier, Void Shift and Grace stacks on the tank."
L["Default.MoP.Priest.Discipline.Description"] = "10 至 90 級的戒律治療，學會懺悟時選用。選取友方以治療他們：目標生命力低時、拉怪前以及約每 12 秒為了狂喜使用真言術:盾；光之澎湃觸發時使用快速治療；懺悟；目標生命力極低時使用快速治療；你們兩人都受傷時使用束縛治療；癒合禱言；三名盟友受傷時使用治療禱言與你的第六層天賦；強效治療術；移動時使用恢復；以治療術補滿。精神護罩期間會建議治療禱言或強效治療術。選取敵人以透過贖罪進行治療：懺悟、真言術:慰或神聖之火、怪群時使用你的第六層天賦、單人時使用暗言術:痛、懲擊。提醒：心靈之火、真言術:韌、五層佈道時使用大天使、心靈專注、對瀕死目標使用痛苦鎮壓、為法力使用暗影惡魔或屈心魔、注入能量、絕望禱言。由你自行處理：要治療誰、精神護罩的時機（可以開啟的提醒）、真言術:壁、虛無轉移，以及坦克身上的恩典層數。"
-- en: "Priest: Holy (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Priest.Holy.Name"] = "牧師：神聖（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "Holy healing from level 10 to 90, chosen while you know Holy Word: Chastise. Target a friend to heal them: Holy Word: Serenity in Chakra: Serenity; Power Word: Shield only when they are about to die; Flash Heal on Surge of Light; Prayer of Mending; Flash Heal when very low; Binding Heal when you are both hurt; in a group with three allies hurt, Circle of Healing, Holy Word: Sanctuary in Chakra: Sanctuary, your tier-6 talent and Prayer of Healing; Renew; Greater Heal when low or at two Serendipity; Heal. Target an enemy to deal damage: Holy Word: Chastise, Power Word: Solace or Holy Fire, Shadow Word: Pain when solo, your tier-6 talent on packs, Smite. An empty chakra is filled for you (Sanctuary in a raid, Serenity in a party, Chastise solo) and never swapped. Reminders: Inner Fire, Fortitude, Guardian Spirit on a dying target, Divine Hymn when five allies are badly hurt, Shadowfiend or Mindbender for mana, Power Infusion, Desperate Prayer. Left to you: whom to heal, placing Holy Word: Sanctuary, Lightwell and Void Shift."
L["Default.MoP.Priest.Holy.Description"] = "10 至 90 級的神聖治療，學會聖言術:譴時選用。選取友方以治療他們：脈輪運轉:平靜時使用聖言術:寧；只有在目標即將死亡時才使用真言術:盾；光之澎湃觸發時使用快速治療；癒合禱言；生命力極低時使用快速治療；你們兩人都受傷時使用束縛治療；隊伍中三名盟友受傷時，使用治療之環、脈輪運轉:庇護時使用聖言術:庇、你的第六層天賦與治療禱言；恢復；生命力低或兩層機緣回復時使用強效治療術；治療術。選取敵人以造成傷害：聖言術:譴、真言術:慰或神聖之火、單人時使用暗言術:痛、怪群時使用你的第六層天賦、懲擊。空的脈輪會自動替你補上（團隊中為庇護、小隊中為平靜、單人時為譴責），且絕不會切換。提醒：心靈之火、真言術:韌、對瀕死目標使用守護聖靈、五名盟友傷勢嚴重時使用神聖禮頌、為法力使用暗影惡魔或屈心魔、注入能量、絕望禱言。由你自行處理：要治療誰、聖言術:庇的擺放、光束泉與虛無轉移。"
-- en: "Priest: Holy, emergency heals last (MoP, Icy Veins)"
L["Default.MoP.Priest.Holy.IcyVeins.Name"] = "牧師：神聖，緊急治療最後（潘達利亞之謎，Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Off by default. Icy Veins' Holy order, picked by your chakra. In Chakra: Sanctuary: Holy Word: Sanctuary when three allies are hurt, Renew, Circle of Healing, Prayer of Mending, Prayer of Healing, then Binding Heal and Flash Heal only in emergencies. Otherwise: Renew, Holy Word: Serenity, Prayer of Mending, Greater Heal, Heal, Binding Heal, Flash Heal, Power Word: Shield last, and Flash Heal as the filler before you learn Heal. Same switch, reminders and damage list as the recommended Holy premade; enable it and disable that one to use it."
L["Default.MoP.Priest.Holy.IcyVeins.Description"] = "預設關閉。Icy Veins 的神聖順序，依你的脈輪而定。脈輪運轉:庇護時：三名盟友受傷時使用聖言術:庇、恢復、治療之環、癒合禱言、治療禱言，然後只有在緊急時才使用束縛治療與快速治療。其他情況：恢復、聖言術:寧、癒合禱言、強效治療術、治療術、束縛治療、快速治療、最後是真言術:盾，學會治療術之前以快速治療作為填充。切換、提醒與傷害清單與推薦的神聖內建循環相同；要使用它，請啟用它並停用推薦的循環。"
-- en: "Priest: Shadow (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Priest.Shadow.Name"] = "牧師：暗影（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "Shadow damage from level 10 to 90, chosen while you know Mind Flay. Opens with Mind Spike, Mind Blast or your DoTs. Devouring Plague at three Shadow Orbs (when Mind Blast is ready or still six seconds away), Mind Blast, Shadow Word: Death below 20% health, Mind Flay while your Devouring Plague is up if you took Solace and Insanity, Shadow Word: Pain and Vampiric Touch refreshed near the end on a target that will live, Mind Spike on Surge of Darkness, Halo, Cascade or Divine Star at their best range, then Mind Flay. A Mind Flay is cut short for Mind Blast or Shadow Word: Death; other channels are never interrupted. While moving it suggests instants only. On five or more enemies: your tier-6 talent, DoTs on your target and Mind Sear. Reminders: Shadowform, Inner Fire, Fortitude, Silence on interruptible casts, Shadowfiend or Mindbender and Power Infusion on long fights, Vampiric Embrace, Desperate Prayer and Dispersion when low. Left to you: DoTs on other targets and where Mind Sear lands."
L["Default.MoP.Priest.Shadow.Description"] = "10 至 90 級的暗影傷害，學會精神鞭笞時選用。以心靈鑽刺、心靈震爆或你的持續傷害效果開場。三顆暗影寶珠時使用噬靈瘟疫（心靈震爆已就緒或還要六秒時），心靈震爆，目標生命力低於 20% 時使用暗言術:死，若你點了慰藉與瘋狂，在你的噬靈瘟疫生效期間使用精神鞭笞，對會存活的目標在接近結束時刷新暗言術:痛與吸血之觸，黑暗奔騰觸發時使用心靈鑽刺，在最佳距離使用輝環、神聖箭矢或神性之星，然後是精神鞭笞。精神鞭笞會為了心靈震爆或暗言術:死而提早中斷；其他引導絕不中斷。移動時只建議瞬發法術。五個以上敵人時：你的第六層天賦、對你的目標施放持續傷害效果以及心靈烙印。提醒：暗影形態、心靈之火、真言術:韌、對可中斷的施法使用沉默、長時間戰鬥時使用暗影惡魔或屈心魔與注入能量、吸血鬼的擁抱、生命力低時使用絕望禱言與影散。由你自行處理：對其他目標施放持續傷害效果以及心靈烙印的落點。"
-- en: "Priest: Shadow, no Insanity priority (MoP, Warcraft Tavern)"
L["Default.MoP.Priest.Shadow.WarcraftTavern.Name"] = "牧師：暗影，不優先瘋狂（潘達利亞之謎，Warcraft Tavern）"
-- en: "Off by default. Warcraft Tavern's Shadow order: Devouring Plague at three Shadow Orbs, Shadow Word: Death below 20%, Mind Blast, Vampiric Touch, Shadow Word: Pain, Mind Spike on Surge of Darkness, your tier-6 talent, Mind Flay. Unlike the recommended Shadow premade it never raises Mind Flay under Devouring Plague and does not hold Devouring Plague for Mind Blast. Same opener, movement, pack and reminder steps; enable it and disable the recommended one to use it."
L["Default.MoP.Priest.Shadow.WarcraftTavern.Description"] = "預設關閉。Warcraft Tavern 的暗影順序：三顆暗影寶珠時使用噬靈瘟疫，低於 20% 時使用暗言術:死，心靈震爆，吸血之觸，暗言術:痛，黑暗奔騰觸發時使用心靈鑽刺，你的第六層天賦，精神鞭笞。與推薦的暗影內建循環不同，它絕不會在噬靈瘟疫期間提高精神鞭笞的優先順序，也不會為了心靈震爆保留噬靈瘟疫。起手、移動、怪群與提醒步驟相同；要使用它，請啟用它並停用推薦的循環。"
-- en: "Priest: Unspecialized (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Priest.Unspecialized.Name"] = "牧師：未選擇專精（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "For levels 1 to 9, or any priest who has not chosen a specialization yet. On an enemy: Shadow Word: Pain when it will live long enough, then Smite. On a friend: Flash Heal when they are low, otherwise Power Word: Shield. Reminders: Inner Fire, and a shield on yourself when you are solo and hurt. Choosing a specialization at 10 switches to its own premade."
L["Default.MoP.Priest.Unspecialized.Description"] = "適用於 1 至 9 級，或尚未選擇專精的任何牧師。對敵人：目標會存活夠久時使用暗言術:痛，然後是懲擊。對友方：目標生命力低時使用快速治療，否則使用真言術:盾。提醒：心靈之火，以及單人受傷時對自己施放護盾。10 級選擇專精後會切換為該專精自己的內建循環。"
-- en: "Rogue: Assassination (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Rogue.Assassination.Name"] = "盜賊：刺殺（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "Recommended for Assassination, from level 10 to 90 (wowsims and Wowhead for Phase 5, with Icy Veins' leveling steps). Opens from Stealth with Cheap Shot when solo, otherwise Mutilate (Dispatch on Blindside, with a dagger). Keeps Slice and Dice up (Envenom refreshes it from level 60) and Rupture on the target, spends five points on Envenom while Rupture lasts and four points to keep the Envenom buff rolling when you do not have Anticipation, then Marked for Death, Dispatch below 35% or on Blindside (it needs a dagger in the main hand), and Mutilate. Against four or more enemies fighting you: Slice and Dice, Crimson Tempest at seven, Rupture, Envenom and Fan of Knives; tabbing Rupture onto other targets is up to you. Solo it adds Recuperate and a Kidney Shot when you are low. Reminders: poisons, Kick, Vendetta on long fights, Shadow Blades with Vendetta, Vanish and Preparation inside Vendetta, Shadowstep from range, Evasion solo. Left to you: Tricks of the Trade and Expose Armor (listed but off), Feint, Sprint and positioning."
L["Default.MoP.Rogue.Assassination.Description"] = "推薦刺殺使用，適用於 10 至 90 級（第 5 階段依據 wowsims 與 Wowhead，升級步驟依據 Icy Veins）。單人時從潛行以偷襲起手，否則用截肢（洞悉要害觸發時用抹殺，需要匕首）。維持切割（60 級起由毒化刷新）與目標身上的割裂，割裂持續期間將五個連擊點用於毒化，沒有預知時以四個連擊點維持毒化增益效果，然後是死亡標記、低於 35% 或洞悉要害觸發時使用抹殺（主手需要匕首），以及截肢。四個以上敵人與你交戰時：切割、七個敵人時使用赤紅風暴、割裂、毒化與飛舞刀刃；切換目標施放割裂由你決定。單人時加入養精蓄銳，以及生命力低時使用腎擊。提醒：毒藥、腳踢、長時間戰鬥時使用宿怨、搭配宿怨使用暗影之刃、宿怨期間使用消失與準備、從遠處使用暗影閃現、單人時使用閃避。由你自行處理：偷天換日與破甲（列出但預設關閉）、佯攻、疾跑與站位。"
-- en: "Rogue: Assassination, Envenom at five (MoP, Icy Veins)"
L["Default.MoP.Rogue.Assassination.IcyVeins.Name"] = "盜賊：刺殺，五連擊點毒化（潘達利亞之謎，Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Off by default. The Icy Veins and Method order: Vanish on cooldown for a stealthed Mutilate, Vendetta on cooldown when the fight is long enough, Envenom only at five points, Rupture kept up, Dispatch below 35% or on Blindside, Mutilate. Four to eight enemies: Fan of Knives with Rupture at three points or more; nine or more: Fan of Knives and Envenom only. The recommended Assassination premade follows the newer Phase 5 advice instead; to use this one, enable it and disable the recommended one."
L["Default.MoP.Rogue.Assassination.IcyVeins.Description"] = "預設關閉。Icy Veins 與 Method 的順序：消失冷卻結束即使用以施放潛行中的截肢，戰鬥夠長時宿怨冷卻結束即使用，毒化只在五個連擊點時使用，維持割裂，低於 35% 或洞悉要害觸發時使用抹殺，截肢。四到八個敵人：飛舞刀刃，三個連擊點以上時使用割裂；九個以上：只用飛舞刀刃與毒化。推薦的刺殺內建循環改為遵循較新的第 5 階段建議；要使用這個，請啟用它並停用推薦的循環。"
-- en: "Rogue: Combat (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Rogue.Combat.Name"] = "盜賊：戰鬥（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "Recommended for Combat, from level 10 to 90 (Wowhead and wowsims for Phase 5). Since the Siege of Orgrimmar patch Sinister Strike costs 50 energy, so Revealing Strike is the builder and Sinister Strike is used only under Bloodlust or Heroism with Adrenaline Rush (and before level 20). Opens with Cheap Shot solo, otherwise Ambush. Keeps Slice and Dice up from two points and Revealing Strike on the target, spends five points only while Revealing Strike is up (Slice and Dice, Rupture on a long single-target fight without Blade Flurry, Eviscerate) and waits for energy at five. Against eight or more enemies: Slice and Dice, Crimson Tempest and Fan of Knives. Solo it adds Recuperate and Kidney Shot. Reminders: poisons, Kick, Blade Flurry on against two or more enemies and off again, Adrenaline Rush at low energy with Shadow Blades, Killing Spree, Vanish and Preparation for Ambush in Deep Insight, Shadowstep, Evasion solo. Left to you: Tricks of the Trade and Expose Armor (listed but off), Feint and positioning behind the target for Ambush."
L["Default.MoP.Rogue.Combat.Description"] = "推薦戰鬥使用，適用於 10 至 90 級（第 5 階段依據 Wowhead 與 wowsims）。自圍攻奧格瑪版本更新起，邪惡攻擊需要 50 點能量，因此以揭底之擊作為累積連擊點技能，邪惡攻擊只在嗜血術或英勇氣概搭配能量刺激期間（以及 20 級前）使用。單人時以偷襲起手，否則用伏擊。從兩個連擊點起維持切割，並維持目標身上的揭底之擊，只在揭底之擊生效時消耗五個連擊點（切割、沒有劍刃亂舞的長時間單一目標戰鬥使用割裂、剔骨），五個連擊點時等待能量。八個以上敵人時：切割、赤紅風暴與飛舞刀刃。單人時加入養精蓄銳與腎擊。提醒：毒藥、腳踢、面對兩個以上敵人時開啟劍刃亂舞並在之後關閉、能量低時搭配暗影之刃使用能量刺激、狂舞殘殺、深度洞察期間為伏擊使用消失與準備、暗影閃現、單人時使用閃避。由你自行處理：偷天換日與破甲（列出但預設關閉）、佯攻，以及為伏擊站在目標背後。"
-- en: "Rogue: Combat, Sinister Strike builder (MoP, Icy Veins)"
L["Default.MoP.Rogue.Combat.IcyVeins.Name"] = "盜賊：戰鬥，邪惡攻擊累積（潘達利亞之謎，Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Off by default, and superseded for Phase 5. The Icy Veins, Warcraft Tavern, Method and wowtbc.gg order from before the Siege of Orgrimmar patch: Slice and Dice, Revealing Strike kept up, five-point Rupture on a long single-target fight and Eviscerate, with Sinister Strike as the builder. Same reminders and pack play as the recommended Combat premade. Choose it only if you follow those guides; enable it and disable the recommended one."
L["Default.MoP.Rogue.Combat.IcyVeins.Description"] = "預設關閉，且在第 5 階段已被取代。圍攻奧格瑪版本更新之前 Icy Veins、Warcraft Tavern、Method 與 wowtbc.gg 的順序：切割、維持揭底之擊、長時間單一目標戰鬥使用五連擊點割裂與剔骨，並以邪惡攻擊作為累積連擊點技能。提醒與怪群打法與推薦的戰鬥內建循環相同。只有在你遵循這些指南時才選擇它；請啟用它並停用推薦的循環。"
-- en: "Rogue: Combat with Anticipation (MoP, Hekili)"
L["Default.MoP.Rogue.Combat.Hekili.Name"] = "盜賊：戰鬥搭配預知（潘達利亞之謎，Hekili）"
-- en: "Off by default. The Hekili MoP order for Combat with Anticipation: Revealing Strike is the only builder, even under Bloodlust; finishers wait for Deep Insight, four Anticipation charges or Shadow Blades coming back, then Slice and Dice, Rupture on one or two long-lived targets, Crimson Tempest at seven enemies and Eviscerate; Slice and Dice is refreshed early at 11 Bandit's Guile stacks; Fan of Knives from four enemies. It applies only with Anticipation talented. Enable it and disable the recommended Combat premade to use it."
L["Default.MoP.Rogue.Combat.Hekili.Description"] = "預設關閉。Hekili 的潘達利亞之謎戰鬥搭配預知順序：揭底之擊是唯一的累積連擊點技能，即使在嗜血術期間也是；終結技會等待深度洞察、四層預知充能或暗影之刃即將回來，然後是切割、對一到兩個長壽目標使用割裂、七個敵人時使用赤紅風暴，以及剔骨；切割在 11 層強盜之詐時提早刷新；四個敵人起使用飛舞刀刃。只在點了預知天賦時適用。要使用它，請啟用它並停用推薦的戰鬥內建循環。"
-- en: "Rogue: Subtlety (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Rogue.Subtlety.Name"] = "盜賊：敏銳（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "Recommended for Subtlety with Shadow Focus, from level 10 to 90 (wowsims and Wowhead for Phase 5). In Stealth or Shadow Dance: Premeditation, Slice and Dice before the pull, finishers at five points, Ambush, Garrote. Outside: Slice and Dice; at five points Slice and Dice and Rupture when they are about to drop, Eviscerate while both last; Marked for Death; Hemorrhage to keep its bleed; Backstab when the target is not attacking you, otherwise Hemorrhage. Against three or more enemies: Slice and Dice, Crimson Tempest, Eviscerate and Fan of Knives. Solo it adds Recuperate and Kidney Shot. Reminders: poisons, Kick, Shadow Dance at 75 energy with Slice and Dice and Rupture up, Vanish when Find Weakness is ending, Preparation, Shadow Blades outside Dance and Stealth, Shadowstep, Evasion solo. Left to you: standing behind the target (RM cannot see facing), Tricks of the Trade and Expose Armor (listed but off)."
L["Default.MoP.Rogue.Subtlety.Description"] = "推薦點了暗影專注的敏銳使用，適用於 10 至 90 級（第 5 階段依據 wowsims 與 Wowhead）。潛行或暗影之舞期間：預謀、拉怪前使用切割、五個連擊點時使用終結技、伏擊、絞喉。其他情況：切割；五個連擊點時，切割與割裂即將消失就續上，兩者都持續時使用剔骨；死亡標記；以出血維持其流血效果；目標沒有攻擊你時使用背刺，否則使用出血。三個以上敵人時：切割、赤紅風暴、剔骨與飛舞刀刃。單人時加入養精蓄銳與腎擊。提醒：毒藥、腳踢、能量 75 且切割與割裂都生效時使用暗影之舞、找尋弱點即將結束時使用消失、準備、暗影之舞與潛行以外使用暗影之刃、暗影閃現、單人時使用閃避。由你自行處理：站在目標背後（RM 無法看到面向）、偷天換日與破甲（列出但預設關閉）。"
-- en: "Rogue: Subtlety, Subterfuge (MoP, Warcraft Tavern)"
L["Default.MoP.Rogue.Subtlety.WarcraftTavern.Name"] = "盜賊：敏銳，欺敵（潘達利亞之謎，Warcraft Tavern）"
-- en: "Chosen automatically instead of the Shadow Focus premade when your tier-1 talent is Subterfuge (Warcraft Tavern's build). Premeditation and Slice and Dice before the pull; in Stealth, Shadow Dance or the Subterfuge linger, finishers at five points and then Ambush as often as it lands. Two or three enemies: keep Rupture up and spend five points on Crimson Tempest instead of Eviscerate; four or more add Fan of Knives. One target: Slice and Dice, Rupture, Eviscerate, Hemorrhage for its bleed, Backstab from behind, else Hemorrhage. Shadow Dance and Vanish are reminders at 60 energy with Slice and Dice up; timing them to trinket procs, as Tavern suggests, is up to you."
L["Default.MoP.Rogue.Subtlety.WarcraftTavern.Description"] = "當你的第一層天賦是欺敵時（Warcraft Tavern 的配置），會自動取代暗影專注內建循環而選用。拉怪前使用預謀與切割；潛行、暗影之舞或欺敵延續期間，五個連擊點時使用終結技，然後盡可能多次使用伏擊。兩到三個敵人：維持割裂，並將五個連擊點用於赤紅風暴而非剔骨；四個以上再加入飛舞刀刃。單一目標：切割、割裂、剔骨、以出血維持其流血效果、在背後使用背刺，否則使用出血。暗影之舞與消失會在能量 60 且切割生效時提醒；依 Tavern 的建議配合飾品觸發時機使用則由你決定。"
-- en: "Rogue: Unspecialized (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Rogue.Unspecialized.Name"] = "盜賊：未選擇專精（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "For levels 1 to 9, or a rogue who has not chosen a specialization yet; each specialization's premade takes over once you pick one. Opens from Stealth with Cheap Shot when solo, Ambush or Sinister Strike; suggests Stealth out of combat; Slice and Dice from two points, Recuperate and Kidney Shot when solo and hurt, Eviscerate at four points (two when the target is about to die), Sinister Strike. Reminders: poisons once learned, Kick, Evasion solo."
L["Default.MoP.Rogue.Unspecialized.Description"] = "適用於 1 至 9 級，或尚未選擇專精的盜賊；選擇專精後由各專精的內建循環接手。單人時從潛行以偷襲、伏擊或邪惡攻擊起手；戰鬥外建議潛行；從兩個連擊點起使用切割，單人受傷時使用養精蓄銳與腎擊，四個連擊點時使用剔骨（目標即將死亡時為兩個），邪惡攻擊。提醒：學會後的毒藥、腳踢、單人時使用閃避。"
-- en: "Shaman: Elemental (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Shaman.Elemental.Name"] = "薩滿：元素（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "Recommended for Elemental from level 10, chosen whenever you know Thunderstorm. Wowhead's order: a Lightning Bolt to open (Lava Burst with Unleashed Fury), Unleash Elements with Unleashed Fury, Flame Shock when it is missing or about to run out on a target that will live, Lava Burst into Flame Shock (and on every Lava Surge), Elemental Blast, Earth Shock at six Lightning Shield charges while Flame Shock has 6 seconds left, Chain Lightning on two enemies, Lightning Bolt. Four or more enemies on you: Magma in melee, free Lava Bursts, Lava Beam in Ascendance, Chain Lightning. While moving it shows only instants. Reminders: Lightning Shield, Flametongue, Searing Totem, Fire Elemental on elites and bosses, Elemental Mastery, Ascendance after a Lava Burst, Ancestral Swiftness, Stormlash and Bloodlust in a group, Wind Shear, Thunderstorm for mana, Shamanistic Rage and Astral Shift when low. Earthquake and Earth Elemental are listed but off. Left to you: Spiritwalker's Grace, Flame Shock on extra targets and where to stand."
L["Default.MoP.Shaman.Elemental.Description"] = "推薦 10 級起的元素使用，學會雷霆風暴時選用。Wowhead 的順序：以閃電箭開場（有狂怒釋放時用熔岩爆發），有狂怒釋放時使用釋放元素能量，對會存活的目標在烈焰震擊缺少或即將結束時使用烈焰震擊，對有烈焰震擊的目標使用熔岩爆發（每次熔岩奔騰也使用），元素衝擊，閃電之盾六層充能且烈焰震擊還剩 6 秒時使用大地震擊，兩個敵人時使用閃電鏈，閃電箭。四個以上敵人與你交戰時：近戰時使用熔岩圖騰、免費的熔岩爆發、卓越術期間使用熔岩光束、閃電鏈。移動時只顯示瞬發法術。提醒：閃電之盾、火舌武器、灼熱圖騰、對精英與首領使用火元素圖騰、精通元素、熔岩爆發後使用卓越術、先祖迅捷、隊伍中使用風暴鞭笞圖騰與嗜血術、削風術、為法力使用雷霆風暴、生命力低時使用薩滿之怒與星界轉移。地震術與土元素圖騰列出但預設關閉。由你自行處理：靈行者之賜、對其他目標施放烈焰震擊以及站位。"
-- en: "Shaman: Enhancement (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Shaman.Enhancement.Name"] = "薩滿：增強（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "Recommended for Enhancement from level 10, chosen whenever you know Lava Lash. Wowhead's order: Unleash Elements while running in, then Unleash Elements with Unleashed Fury, Elemental Blast and Lightning Bolt at five Maelstrom Weapon (or woven at three when your next swing is over a second away), Stormblast in Ascendance, Stormstrike (Primal Strike before 26), Lava Lash, Flame Shock under Unleash Flame, Unleash Elements, Earth Shock. Two or more enemies on you: Chain Lightning instead of Lightning Bolt, Lava Lash to spread Flame Shock, Fire Nova from four, Magma from six. Reminders: Lightning Shield, Windfury on the main hand and Flametongue on the off hand, Searing Totem, Fire Elemental, Feral Spirit, Ascendance after Stormstrike, Elemental Mastery, Ancestral Swiftness, Stormlash and Bloodlust in a group, Wind Shear, Shamanistic Rage and Astral Shift when low. Earth Elemental is listed but off."
L["Default.MoP.Shaman.Enhancement.Description"] = "推薦 10 級起的增強使用，學會熔岩暴擊時選用。Wowhead 的順序：衝向目標時使用釋放元素能量，接著有狂怒釋放時使用釋放元素能量，五層氣漩武器時使用元素衝擊與閃電箭（或在下一次揮擊還要超過一秒時於三層穿插施放），卓越術期間使用風暴衝擊，風暴打擊（26 級前為原始之擊），熔岩暴擊，釋放火舌能量期間使用烈焰震擊，釋放元素能量，大地震擊。兩個以上敵人與你交戰時：以閃電鏈取代閃電箭，以熔岩暴擊擴散烈焰震擊，四個起使用火焰新星，六個起使用熔岩圖騰。提醒：閃電之盾、主手風怒武器與副手火舌武器、灼熱圖騰、火元素圖騰、野性之魂、風暴打擊後使用卓越術、精通元素、先祖迅捷、隊伍中使用風暴鞭笞圖騰與嗜血術、削風術、生命力低時使用薩滿之怒與星界轉移。土元素圖騰列出但預設關閉。"
-- en: "Shaman: Enhancement, weave every stack (MoP, wowsims)"
L["Default.MoP.Shaman.Enhancement.Wowsims.Name"] = "薩滿：增強，每層都穿插施放（潘達利亞之謎，wowsims）"
-- en: "Off by default; same switch as the recommended Enhancement premade, so enable it and disable that one to use it. The simulator's list for players who time casts between swings: Lightning Bolt, Elemental Blast or Chain Lightning on any number of Maelstrom Weapon stacks whenever the cast finishes before your next main-hand swing, Unleash Elements also whenever Flame Shock is missing, and Earth Shock only below two stacks. Reminders as the recommended premade."
L["Default.MoP.Shaman.Enhancement.Wowsims.Description"] = "預設關閉；與推薦的增強內建循環使用相同的切換條件，因此要使用它，請啟用它並停用推薦的循環。模擬器為會在揮擊之間抓時機施法的玩家提供的清單：只要施法能在下一次主手揮擊前完成，不論有幾層氣漩武器都使用閃電箭、元素衝擊或閃電鏈，烈焰震擊缺少時也使用釋放元素能量，大地震擊只在少於兩層時使用。提醒與推薦的內建循環相同。"
-- en: "Shaman: Enhancement, Lava Lash first (MoP, Icy Veins)"
L["Default.MoP.Shaman.Enhancement.IcyVeins.Name"] = "薩滿：增強，熔岩暴擊優先（潘達利亞之謎，Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Off by default; same switch as the recommended Enhancement premade, so enable it and disable that one to use it. Icy Veins' order: Stormstrike, then Lava Lash before spending Maelstrom Weapon, Lightning Bolt at five stacks or from three when it lands before your next swing, Unleash Elements then Flame Shock, Earth Shock. On four or more enemies it spreads Flame Shock with Lava Lash and uses Fire Nova; Chain Lightning replaces Lightning Bolt on packs. Shamanistic Rage is suggested on cooldown in combat; other reminders as the recommended premade."
L["Default.MoP.Shaman.Enhancement.IcyVeins.Description"] = "預設關閉；與推薦的增強內建循環使用相同的切換條件，因此要使用它，請啟用它並停用推薦的循環。Icy Veins 的順序：風暴打擊，然後在消耗氣漩武器之前使用熔岩暴擊，五層時使用閃電箭，或在下一次揮擊前能命中時從三層起使用，釋放元素能量然後烈焰震擊，大地震擊。四個以上敵人時以熔岩暴擊擴散烈焰震擊並使用火焰新星；怪群時以閃電鏈取代閃電箭。戰鬥中薩滿之怒冷卻結束即建議使用；其他提醒與推薦的內建循環相同。"
-- en: "Shaman: Restoration (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Shaman.Restoration.Name"] = "薩滿：恢復（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "Recommended for Restoration from level 10, chosen whenever you know Riptide. Heals your friendly target (Rotation Master cannot pick who to heal): Greater Healing Wave under Ancestral Swiftness, Healing Surge below 35%, Purify Spirit on Magic or Curses, Unleash Elements then Healing Rain when three allies nearby are hurt, Riptide, Chain Heal for group damage, Greater Healing Wave below 60%, Healing Wave below 90%. With an attackable target it deals damage instead (Flame Shock, Lava Burst, Elemental Blast, Lightning Bolt). Reminders: Water Shield, Earthliving, Earth Shield on your focus, Healing Stream when someone is hurt, Mana Tide, Healing Tide for heavy group damage, Elemental Mastery or Ancestral Guidance, Ancestral Swiftness on a low target, Spiritwalker's Grace while moving, Bloodlust, Wind Shear. Ascendance and Spirit Link Totem are listed but off: use them when your raid assigns them."
L["Default.MoP.Shaman.Restoration.Description"] = "推薦 10 級起的恢復使用，學會激流時選用。治療你的友方目標（Rotation Master 無法選擇要治療誰）：先祖迅捷生效時使用強效治療波，低於 35% 時使用洶湧治療，有魔法或詛咒效果時使用淨化靈魂，附近有三名盟友受傷時先使用釋放元素能量再使用治癒之雨，激流，隊伍受傷時使用治療鍊，低於 60% 時使用強效治療波，低於 90% 時使用治療波。選取可攻擊的目標時改為造成傷害（烈焰震擊、熔岩爆發、元素衝擊、閃電箭）。提醒：水之盾、大地生命武器、對你的專注目標施放大地之盾、有人受傷時使用治療之泉圖騰、法力之潮圖騰、隊伍承受大量傷害時使用療癒之潮圖騰、精通元素或先祖導引、對生命力低的目標使用先祖迅捷、移動時使用靈行者之賜、嗜血術、削風術。卓越術與靈魂連結圖騰列出但預設關閉：在你的團隊指派時使用它們。"
-- en: "Shaman: Restoration, health ladder (MoP, Hekili)"
L["Default.MoP.Shaman.Restoration.Hekili.Name"] = "薩滿：恢復，生命力階梯（潘達利亞之謎，Hekili）"
-- en: "Off by default; same switch as the recommended Restoration premade, so enable it and disable that one to use it. Hekili's list keeps Earth Shield and Riptide on your target and Healing Stream and Healing Rain going whenever they are down, then heals by the average health of your group within 40 yards: Chain Heal below 80%, Healing Wave on a target below 70%, Greater Healing Wave below 60%, Healing Surge below 40%, with Healing Tide, Ancestral Guidance and Mana Tide on the same ladder. An attackable target gets damage plus Earth Shock."
L["Default.MoP.Shaman.Restoration.Hekili.Description"] = "預設關閉；與推薦的恢復內建循環使用相同的切換條件，因此要使用它，請啟用它並停用推薦的循環。Hekili 的清單會在你的目標身上維持大地之盾與激流，治療之泉圖騰與治癒之雨一不在就重新施放，然後依 40 碼內隊伍的平均生命力進行治療：低於 80% 時使用治療鍊，目標低於 70% 時使用治療波，低於 60% 時使用強效治療波，低於 40% 時使用洶湧治療，療癒之潮圖騰、先祖導引與法力之潮圖騰也在同一階梯上。選取可攻擊的目標時會造成傷害並使用大地震擊。"
-- en: "Shaman: Unspecialized (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Shaman.Unspecialized.Name"] = "薩滿：未選擇專精（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "For levels 1 to 9, and any Shaman who has not chosen a specialization yet; every specialization premade takes over once you pick one. Lightning Bolt to pull from range, Healing Surge when you are low and alone, Primal Strike, Earth Shock, and Lightning Bolt while out of melee range. Keeps Lightning Shield up."
L["Default.MoP.Shaman.Unspecialized.Description"] = "適用於 1 至 9 級，以及尚未選擇專精的任何薩滿；選擇專精後由各專精的內建循環接手。從遠處以閃電箭拉怪，你獨自一人且生命力低時使用洶湧治療，原始之擊，大地震擊，不在近戰範圍時使用閃電箭。維持閃電之盾。"
-- en: "Warlock: Affliction (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Warlock.Affliction.Name"] = "術士：痛苦（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "Recommended for Affliction from level 10 to 90 (chosen while Unstable Affliction is known). Pre-casts Haunt or Unstable Affliction, opens a fresh elite with Soulburn and Soul Swap, keeps Agony, Corruption and Unstable Affliction up (refreshing them early while Dark Soul: Misery is up), casts Haunt whenever it runs low and you have two shards (or in Dark Soul), channels Drain Soul for a shard when Haunt is ending and you have none, Drain Soul below 20%, otherwise Malefic Grasp (Shadow Bolt before 42). Seed of Corruption on three or more enemies (with Soulburn on six). Moving: instants and Fel Flame. Reminders: your pet, Dark Intent, Curse of the Elements in a group, Dark Soul, Doomguard or Infernal, Grimoire of Service or Sacrifice, Life Tap, defensives. Left to you: spreading DoTs to other targets and Soul Swap moves between them."
L["Default.MoP.Warlock.Affliction.Description"] = "推薦 10 至 90 級的痛苦使用（學會痛苦動盪時選用）。預先施放蝕魂術或痛苦動盪，對新的精英目標以靈魂炙燃與靈魂調換開場，維持痛苦、腐蝕術與痛苦動盪（黑闇之魂:悲慘期間提早刷新），蝕魂術即將結束且你有兩片靈魂裂片時（或黑闇之魂期間）施放蝕魂術，蝕魂術即將結束且你沒有靈魂裂片時引導吸取靈魂以獲得裂片，低於 20% 時使用吸取靈魂，否則使用惡毒之握（42 級前為暗影箭）。三個以上敵人時使用腐蝕種子（六個時搭配靈魂炙燃）。移動時：瞬發法術與魔化烈焰。提醒：你的惡魔、黑暗意圖、隊伍中使用元素詛咒、黑闇之魂、末日守衛或煉獄火、服侍魔典或犧牲魔典、生命分流、防禦技能。由你自行處理：將持續傷害效果擴散到其他目標，以及在目標之間使用靈魂調換。"
-- en: "Warlock: Affliction, pool Haunt (MoP, Warcraft Tavern)"
L["Default.MoP.Warlock.Affliction.WarcraftTavern.Name"] = "術士：痛苦，保留蝕魂術（潘達利亞之謎，Warcraft Tavern）"
-- en: "Off by default. Warcraft Tavern's and Method's shard policy: the same DoT upkeep as the recommended Affliction premade, but Haunt is saved for four shards or Dark Soul: Misery, and below 20% Soulburn and Soul Swap refresh every DoT whenever you have a shard. Enable it and disable the recommended Affliction premade to use it."
L["Default.MoP.Warlock.Affliction.WarcraftTavern.Description"] = "預設關閉。Warcraft Tavern 與 Method 的靈魂裂片策略：持續傷害效果維持方式與推薦的痛苦內建循環相同，但蝕魂術保留到四片靈魂裂片或黑闇之魂:悲慘期間，且低於 20% 時，只要你有靈魂裂片，就以靈魂炙燃與靈魂調換刷新所有持續傷害效果。要使用它，請啟用它並停用推薦的痛苦內建循環。"
-- en: "Warlock: Demonology (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Warlock.Demonology.Name"] = "術士：惡魔學識（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "Recommended for Demonology from level 10 to 90 (chosen while Metamorphosis is known). In caster form: Corruption, Hand of Gul'dan by charges, a second Hand of Gul'dan into Metamorphosis when a one-stack Shadowflame is about to drop, Metamorphosis with Dark Soul: Knowledge (or near full fury), Soul Fire at two Molten Core stacks or below 25%, Hellfire on four or more enemies, Shadow Bolt. In Metamorphosis: Doom, Touch of Chaos to keep Corruption up, Soul Fire on Molten Core, Immolation Aura or Void Ray on packs, Touch of Chaos, and a cue to leave it when Dark Soul is down and fury is at 300 or less. Reminders: Felguard (or Wrathguard), Dark Intent, Dark Soul, Imp Swarm, Grimoire: Felguard, Doomguard or Infernal, Life Tap, Health Funnel solo. Left to you: Felstorm (pet autocast) and Demonic Leap."
L["Default.MoP.Warlock.Demonology.Description"] = "推薦 10 至 90 級的惡魔學識使用（學會惡魔化身時選用）。施法者形態下：腐蝕術，依充能使用古爾丹之手，一層的暗影之焰即將消失時再施放一次古爾丹之手然後進入惡魔化身，搭配黑闇之魂:知識（或惡魔之怒接近全滿時）使用惡魔化身，兩層熔火之心或低於 25% 時使用靈魂之火，四個以上敵人時使用地獄烈焰，暗影箭。惡魔化身期間：末日，以混沌之觸維持腐蝕術，熔火之心觸發時使用靈魂之火，怪群時使用獻祭光環或虛無射線，混沌之觸，並在黑闇之魂未生效且惡魔之怒在 300 以下時提示你退出。提醒：惡魔守衛（或憤怒守衛）、黑暗意圖、黑闇之魂、小鬼群、魔典:惡魔守衛、末日守衛或煉獄火、生命分流、單人時使用生命通道。由你自行處理：惡魔風暴（寵物自動施放）與惡魔飛躍。"
-- en: "Warlock: Demonology, pool Molten Core (MoP, guides)"
L["Default.MoP.Warlock.Demonology.Guide.Name"] = "術士：惡魔學識，保留熔火之心（潘達利亞之謎，指南）"
-- en: "Off by default. The guide consensus (Method, wowtbc.gg, Warcraft Tavern, Wowhead): the recommended Demonology premade, except that in caster form Metamorphosis waits for 900 fury or Dark Soul and Soul Fire is only cast at eight Molten Core stacks or below 25%, so the stacks are spent in demon form. Enable it and disable the recommended Demonology premade to use it."
L["Default.MoP.Warlock.Demonology.Guide.Description"] = "預設關閉。指南的共識（Method、wowtbc.gg、Warcraft Tavern、Wowhead）：與推薦的惡魔學識內建循環相同，只是施法者形態下惡魔化身會等到 900 點惡魔之怒或黑闇之魂，而靈魂之火只在八層熔火之心或低於 25% 時施放，讓層數在惡魔形態下消耗。要使用它，請啟用它並停用推薦的惡魔學識內建循環。"
-- en: "Warlock: Destruction (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Warlock.Destruction.Name"] = "術士：毀滅（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "For Destruction from level 10 to 90 (chosen while Conflagrate is known). Pre-casts Incinerate, keeps Immolate up, never sits on two Conflagrate charges, spends embers on Chaos Bolt (Shadowburn below 20%) at 3.5 embers or in Dark Soul: Instability, uses Backdraft on Incinerate, and fills with Incinerate; a dying target gets Shadowburn. On three or more enemies: Rain of Fire and Fire and Brimstone on four, then Immolate, Conflagrate and Incinerate, and a cue to switch Fire and Brimstone off when your embers run out. Moving: Shadowburn, Conflagrate, Fel Flame. Reminders: your pet or Grimoire of Sacrifice, Flames of Xoroth, Dark Intent, Dark Soul, Havoc on two or more enemies (cast it on the second target yourself), Doomguard or Infernal, Ember Tap and defensives."
L["Default.MoP.Warlock.Destruction.Description"] = "適用於 10 至 90 級的毀滅（學會焚燒時選用）。預先施放燒盡，維持獻祭，絕不讓焚燒停在兩層充能，在 3.5 燃火餘燼或黑闇之魂:易變期間將餘燼用於混沌箭（低於 20% 時用暗影灼燒），以燒盡消耗爆燃，並以燒盡填充；即將死亡的目標使用暗影灼燒。三個以上敵人時：火焰之雨，四個時使用硫磺與火焰，然後是獻祭、焚燒與燒盡，並在你的餘燼用完時提示關閉硫磺與火焰。移動時：暗影灼燒、焚燒、魔化烈焰。提醒：你的惡魔或犧牲魔典、克索諾斯之焰、黑暗意圖、黑闇之魂、兩個以上敵人時使用浩劫（請自行對第二個目標施放）、末日守衛或煉獄火、餘燼分流與防禦技能。"
-- en: "Warlock: Unspecialized (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Warlock.Unspecialized.Name"] = "術士：未選擇專精（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "For a Warlock without a specialization (levels 1 to 9, or later before you choose one). Corruption to pull and kept up, Drain Life below half health, Shadow Bolt. Reminders: the Voidwalker when solo (the Imp in a group), and a Healthstone between pulls."
L["Default.MoP.Warlock.Unspecialized.Description"] = "適用於沒有專精的術士（1 至 9 級，或之後尚未選擇專精前）。以腐蝕術拉怪並維持，生命力低於一半時使用吸取生命，暗影箭。提醒：單人時使用虛無行者（隊伍中使用小鬼），以及兩次拉怪之間使用治療石。"
-- en: "Warrior: Arms (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Warrior.Arms.Name"] = "戰士：武器（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "Recommended for Arms from level 10 to 90, picked in the Arms specialization. Charges to open, and again for rage when you step away. Colossus Smash whenever it is missing or about to end, Mortal Strike, Storm Bolt in the Smash window, Dragon Roar and Bladestorm outside it. Below 20% health: Execute in the window, at 100 rage or to keep Sudden Execute, Overpower on Taste for Blood. Otherwise Slam in the window, Overpower at four stacks, Slam at 100 rage, Overpower, Slam. Two or more enemies fighting you add Sweeping Strikes, Thunder Clap for Deep Wounds, Bladestorm and Dragon Roar. Victory Rush below 70% health; Battle Shout for rage. Reminders: a shout when none is up, Battle Stance, Berserker Rage, Recklessness, Avatar and Bloodbath with Colossus Smash on long fights, Skull Banner, Heroic Strike or Cleave with spare rage, Heroic Leap in the window, Pummel, Die by the Sword and Enraged Regeneration when low. Shattering Throw is listed but off. Left to you: canceling Bladestorm, stance dancing and positioning."
L["Default.MoP.Warrior.Arms.Description"] = "推薦 10 至 90 級的武器使用，在武器專精中選用。以衝鋒開場，離開目標時再次衝鋒以獲得怒氣。巨像碎擊缺少或即將結束時使用巨像碎擊，致死打擊，巨像碎擊期間使用暴風怒擲，巨像碎擊期間以外使用龍吼與劍刃風暴。目標生命力低於 20% 時：巨像碎擊期間、100 點怒氣時或為了維持就地處決時使用斬殺，血腥體驗觸發時使用壓制。其他情況：巨像碎擊期間使用猛擊，四層血腥體驗時使用壓制，100 點怒氣時使用猛擊，壓制，猛擊。兩個以上敵人與你交戰時加入橫掃攻擊、為了重傷使用雷霆一擊、劍刃風暴與龍吼。生命力低於 70% 時使用勝利衝擊；為了怒氣使用戰鬥怒吼。提醒：沒有怒吼時施放怒吼、戰鬥姿態、狂暴之怒、長時間戰鬥時搭配巨像碎擊使用魯莽、化身與浴血、骷髏戰旗、怒氣有餘時使用英勇打擊或順劈斬、巨像碎擊期間使用英勇躍擊、拳擊、生命力低時使用劍下亡魂與狂怒恢復。碎甲投擲列出但預設關閉。由你自行處理：取消劍刃風暴、姿態切換與站位。"
-- en: "Warrior: Arms, pool for Colossus Smash (MoP, Icy Veins)"
L["Default.MoP.Warrior.Arms.IcyVeins.Name"] = "戰士：武器，為巨像碎擊蓄積怒氣（潘達利亞之謎，Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Off by default. The Icy Veins and Wowhead Arms order: outside the Colossus Smash window it uses Overpower and Slams only above 80 rage, banking rage for the window instead of Slamming as filler. In the window: Mortal Strike, Slam, Overpower, Heroic Throw. Below 20% health: Colossus Smash, Mortal Strike, Execute, Overpower, Dragon Roar. Sweeping Strikes on two enemies, a Thunder Clap pack list on three or more. Heroic Strike or Cleave only near the rage cap. Same reminders as the recommended Arms premade. Enable it and disable that one to use it."
L["Default.MoP.Warrior.Arms.IcyVeins.Description"] = "預設關閉。Icy Veins 與 Wowhead 的武器順序：巨像碎擊期間以外，只使用壓制，並只在怒氣高於 80 時使用猛擊，把怒氣留到巨像碎擊期間，而不是以猛擊作為填充。巨像碎擊期間：致死打擊、猛擊、壓制、英勇投擲。目標生命力低於 20% 時：巨像碎擊、致死打擊、斬殺、壓制、龍吼。兩個敵人時使用橫掃攻擊，三個以上時使用以雷霆一擊為主的怪群清單。英勇打擊或順劈斬只在怒氣接近上限時使用。提醒與推薦的武器內建循環相同。要使用它，請啟用它並停用推薦的循環。"
-- en: "Warrior: Fury (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Warrior.Fury.Name"] = "戰士：狂怒（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "Recommended for Fury from level 10 to 90, picked in the Fury specialization. Charges to open and for rage. Colossus Smash once two Raging Blow charges are banked (one with Recklessness), Raging Blow as the window closes, Bloodthirst, Colossus Smash, Storm Bolt, Dragon Roar outside the window, Execute here with Single-Minded Fury (one-handers), Bladestorm while Bloodthirst cools, with Titan's Grip (two-handers) one more Raging Blow outside the window, Execute, Wild Strike on Bloodsurge, Raging Blow keeping a charge for the next window, Wild Strike, Heroic Throw, Battle Shout for rage. Two or more enemies fighting you add Bladestorm, Dragon Roar, Whirlwind for Meat Cleaver and cleaving Raging Blows. Reminders: a shout when none is up, Battle Stance, Berserker Rage for Enrage, Recklessness, Avatar and Bloodbath with Colossus Smash on long fights, Skull Banner, Heroic Strike or Cleave with spare rage, Heroic Leap, Pummel and defensives when low. Left to you: canceling Bladestorm."
L["Default.MoP.Warrior.Fury.Description"] = "推薦 10 至 90 級的狂怒使用，在狂怒專精中選用。以衝鋒開場並用來獲得怒氣。累積兩層狂怒之擊充能後（魯莽期間為一層）使用巨像碎擊，巨像碎擊即將結束時使用狂怒之擊，嗜血，巨像碎擊，暴風怒擲，巨像碎擊期間以外使用龍吼，使用一心狂怒（單手武器）時在此使用斬殺，嗜血冷卻時使用劍刃風暴，使用泰坦之握（雙手武器）時在巨像碎擊期間以外再使用一次狂怒之擊，斬殺，熱血沸騰觸發時使用狂野打擊，保留一層充能給下一次巨像碎擊的狂怒之擊，狂野打擊，英勇投擲，為了怒氣使用戰鬥怒吼。兩個以上敵人與你交戰時加入劍刃風暴、龍吼、為了削骨斬肉使用旋風斬，以及順劈的狂怒之擊。提醒：沒有怒吼時施放怒吼、戰鬥姿態、為了狂怒使用狂暴之怒、長時間戰鬥時搭配巨像碎擊使用魯莽、化身與浴血、骷髏戰旗、怒氣有餘時使用英勇打擊或順劈斬、英勇躍擊、拳擊，以及生命力低時使用防禦技能。由你自行處理：取消劍刃風暴。"
-- en: "Warrior: Fury, cooldowns in Colossus Smash (MoP, Icy Veins)"
L["Default.MoP.Warrior.Fury.IcyVeins.Name"] = "戰士：狂怒，巨像碎擊期間使用冷卻技能（潘達利亞之謎，Icy Veins）"
-- en: "Off by default. Icy Veins' Fury order spends Bladestorm or Dragon Roar first inside the Colossus Smash window, and puts Execute ahead of Bloodthirst below 20% health. Outside the window: Colossus Smash, Bloodthirst, Raging Blow only at two charges, Wild Strike on Bloodsurge, shout, Wild Strike. Four or more enemies: Bloodthirst for Enrage, Whirlwind to three Meat Cleaver stacks, Raging Blow. Heroic Strike or Cleave only near the rage cap. Same reminders as the recommended Fury premade. Enable it and disable that one to use it."
L["Default.MoP.Warrior.Fury.IcyVeins.Description"] = "預設關閉。Icy Veins 的狂怒順序會在巨像碎擊期間優先使用劍刃風暴或龍吼，並在目標生命力低於 20% 時將斬殺排在嗜血之前。巨像碎擊期間以外：巨像碎擊、嗜血、只在兩層充能時使用狂怒之擊、熱血沸騰觸發時使用狂野打擊、怒吼、狂野打擊。四個以上敵人時：為了狂怒使用嗜血、以旋風斬疊到三層削骨斬肉、狂怒之擊。英勇打擊或順劈斬只在怒氣接近上限時使用。提醒與推薦的狂怒內建循環相同。要使用它，請啟用它並停用推薦的循環。"
-- en: "Warrior: Protection (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Warrior.Protection.Name"] = "戰士：防護（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "Tanking from level 10 to 90, picked while you know Shield Slam. Charge or Heroic Throw to pull. Devastate to keep three Weakened Armor on elites and bosses, Dragon Roar, Bladestorm, Shockwave on three enemies and Thunder Clap on cooldown on three or more. Then Revenge for the last rage of a Shield Block, Shield Slam, Revenge on Hold the Line, Devastate for Deep Wounds, Victory Rush below 60% health, Revenge, Thunder Clap for Weakened Blows, Execute, Storm Bolt, a shout for rage and Devastate (Sunder Armor before 26). Reminders: Defensive Stance, a shout when none is up, Shield Block whenever it is down, Shield Barrier when hurt with rage to spare, Heroic Strike or Cleave on Ultimatum, Incite or near the cap, Demoralizing Shout, Berserker Rage, Enraged Regeneration, Last Stand and Shield Wall when low, your offensive cooldowns, Pummel. Taunt and Heroic Leap are listed but off. Left to you: whom to taunt, and Block versus Barrier against magic."
L["Default.MoP.Warrior.Protection.Description"] = "10 至 90 級的坦克，學會盾牌猛擊時選用。以衝鋒或英勇投擲拉怪。對精英與首領以挫敗維持三層弱化護甲，龍吼，劍刃風暴，三個敵人時使用震懾波，三個以上時雷霆一擊冷卻結束即使用。接著在盾牌格擋的最後階段以復仇消耗怒氣，盾牌猛擊，堅守陣線觸發時使用復仇，為了重傷使用挫敗，生命力低於 60% 時使用勝利衝擊，復仇，為了弱化攻擊使用雷霆一擊，斬殺，暴風怒擲，為了怒氣使用怒吼，以及挫敗（26 級前為破甲攻擊）。提醒：防禦姿態、沒有怒吼時施放怒吼、盾牌格擋未生效時就使用、受傷且怒氣有餘時使用盾牌屏障、最終通牒、激動觸發或怒氣接近上限時使用英勇打擊或順劈斬、挫志怒吼、狂暴之怒、生命力低時使用狂怒恢復、破釜沉舟與盾牆、你的攻擊性冷卻技能、拳擊。嘲諷與英勇躍擊列出但預設關閉。由你自行處理：要嘲諷誰，以及面對魔法時選擇盾牌格擋或盾牌屏障。"
-- en: "Warrior: Unspecialized (MoP)"
L["Default.MoP.Warrior.Unspecialized.Name"] = "戰士：未選擇專精（潘達利亞之謎）"
-- en: "For levels 1 to 9, or until you choose a specialization. Charge to pull, Victory Rush, Execute and Heroic Strike when you have 30 rage; reminds you to be in Battle Stance if you are in no stance."
L["Default.MoP.Warrior.Unspecialized.Description"] = "適用於 1 至 9 級，或直到你選擇專精為止。以衝鋒拉怪，勝利衝擊，斬殺，以及有 30 點怒氣時使用英勇打擊；若你沒有處於任何姿態，會提醒你進入戰鬥姿態。"
-- en: "Silent"
L["Silent"] = "靜默"
-- en: "Set Pieces"
L["Set Pieces"] = "套裝件數"
-- en: "Weapon Imbue"
L["Weapon Imbue"] = "武器灌注"
-- en: "Assisted Combat Suggestion"
L["Assisted Combat Suggestion"] = "戰鬥助手建議"
-- en: "Assisted Combat {{!is|is not}} suggesting a spell"
L["Assisted Combat {{!is|is not}} suggesting a spell"] = "戰鬥助手{{!正在|沒有}}建議法術"
-- en: "Assisted Combat {{!suggests|does not suggest}} %s"
L["Assisted Combat {{!suggests|does not suggest}} %s"] = "戰鬥助手{{!建議|不建議}}%s"
-- en: "Matches when Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggests this spell as the next cast. An override counts as its base spell, and the base spell as its override. With no spell chosen, matches whenever Assisted Combat suggests anything."
L["Matches when Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggests this spell as the next cast. An override counts as its base spell, and the base spell as its override. With no spell chosen, matches whenever Assisted Combat suggests anything."] = "當暴雪的戰鬥助手建議以此法術作為下一個施放的法術時符合。覆蓋法術視同其基礎法術，基礎法術也視同其覆蓋法術。未選擇法術時，只要戰鬥助手有任何建議就符合。"
-- en: "Assisted Combat exists on Retail (and is declared on Forever). Where the game does not offer it, for this character or specialization, or the suggestion cannot be read, this condition is unavailable rather than false, including under NOT."
L["Assisted Combat exists on Retail (and is declared on Forever). Where the game does not offer it, for this character or specialization, or the suggestion cannot be read, this condition is unavailable rather than false, including under NOT."] = "戰鬥助手存在於正式版（並在永久中宣告）。若遊戲未為此角色或專精提供該功能，或無法讀取建議，此條件為無法使用而非假，在 NOT 下同樣如此。"
-- en: "Blizzard's suggestion"
L["Blizzard's suggestion"] = "暴雪的建議"
-- en: "Recommends the spell Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggests"
L["Recommends the spell Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggests"] = "建議施放暴雪戰鬥助手所提示的法術"
-- en: "Recommends whatever spell Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggests next, read each time the rotation is evaluated. It highlights that spell's button and shows in the preview like a spell step, and is held to the same requirements: known, usable, off cooldown and in range. When nothing is suggested, the suggested spell is not on your bars, or Assisted Combat is unavailable (anywhere but Retail, or a specialization without it), the step is skipped. Rotation list only."
L["Recommends whatever spell Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggests next, read each time the rotation is evaluated. It highlights that spell's button and shows in the preview like a spell step, and is held to the same requirements: known, usable, off cooldown and in range. When nothing is suggested, the suggested spell is not on your bars, or Assisted Combat is unavailable (anywhere but Retail, or a specialization without it), the step is skipped. Rotation list only."] = "建議施放暴雪戰鬥助手接下來提示的任何法術，每次評估循環時讀取。它會醒目提示該法術的按鈕，並像法術步驟一樣顯示在預覽中，且須符合相同的要求：已學會、可用、不在冷卻中且在範圍內。當沒有任何提示、提示的法術不在你的快捷列上，或戰鬥助手無法使用（正式版以外的任何版本，或沒有該功能的專精）時，會略過此步驟。僅限循環清單。"
-- en: "the number of ranks in %s"
L["the number of ranks in %s"] = "%s的等級數"
-- en: "1 of the spells Blizzard can suggest isn't on your action bars, so the card skips it."
L["1 of the spells Blizzard can suggest isn't on your action bars, so the card skips it."] = "暴雪可能建議的法術中有 1 個不在你的動作列上，因此該卡片會跳過它。"
-- en: "%d of the spells Blizzard can suggest aren't on your action bars, so the card skips them."
L["%d of the spells Blizzard can suggest aren't on your action bars, so the card skips them."] = "暴雪可能建議的法術中有 %d 個不在你的動作列上，因此該卡片會跳過它們。"
-- en: "%s, and %d more"
L["%s, and %d more"] = "%s 以及另外 %d 個"
-- en: "Not on your action bars: %s."
L["Not on your action bars: %s."] = "不在你的動作列上：%s。"
-- en: "Rotation Master highlights an action by lighting the button that holds it, so it can't highlight these. The card still works for every suggestion that is on your bars: it skips one only when it is suggested, and the next step is used instead. Put these on an action bar to use them."
L["Rotation Master highlights an action by lighting the button that holds it, so it can't highlight these. The card still works for every suggestion that is on your bars: it skips one only when it is suggested, and the next step is used instead. Put these on an action bar to use them."] = "Rotation Master 透過點亮持有該動作的按鈕來高亮動作，因此無法高亮這些法術。對於動作列上有的建議，該卡片仍然有效：只有當建議的是這些法術時才會跳過，並改用下一步。把它們放到動作列上即可使用。"
-- en: "Absolute health target (negative means deficit) or percentage fraction."
L["Absolute health target (negative means deficit) or percentage fraction."] = "絕對生命力目標（負數表示損失量）或百分比小數。"
-- en: "All original results, preserving nil positions and return count."
L["All original results, preserving nil positions and return count."] = "所有原始結果，保留 nil 的位置與傳回值數量。"
-- en: "Apply the legacy integer or canonical numeric-string spelling test. Numbers use floor equality; strings must equal the spelling obtained after numeric conversion and floor. Other types return false. This is not a finite-number validator."
L["Apply the legacy integer or canonical numeric-string spelling test. Numbers use floor equality; strings must equal the spelling obtained after numeric conversion and floor. Other types return false. This is not a finite-number validator."] = "執行舊版的整數或標準數字字串拼寫測試。數字使用無條件捨去後的相等比較；字串必須等於經數字轉換並無條件捨去後得到的拼寫。其他型別傳回 false。這不是有限數字的驗證器。"
-- en: "Arguments forwarded unchanged to the observed function."
L["Arguments forwarded unchanged to the observed function."] = "原樣轉送給被觀測函式的參數。"
-- en: "Arguments forwarded unchanged; types, identity, arity and nil positions distinguish cache entries."
L["Arguments forwarded unchanged; types, identity, arity and nil positions distinguish cache entries."] = "原樣轉送的參數；型別、身分、參數數量與 nil 位置用於區分快取項目。"
-- en: "Availability or query-validation reason for a nil level observation."
L["Availability or query-validation reason for a nil level observation."] = "等級觀測為 nil 時的可用性或查詢驗證原因。"
-- en: "Availability or query-validation reason for a nil level."
L["Availability or query-validation reason for a nil level."] = "等級為 nil 時的可用性或查詢驗證原因。"
-- en: "Availability or query-validation reason when no current state can be read."
L["Availability or query-validation reason when no current state can be read."] = "無法讀取目前狀態時的可用性或查詢驗證原因。"
-- en: "Availability or query-validation reason when the whole observation is unavailable."
L["Availability or query-validation reason when the whole observation is unavailable."] = "整個觀測無法使用時的可用性或查詢驗證原因。"
-- en: "Availability or validation reason for a nil result."
L["Availability or validation reason for a nil result."] = "結果為 nil 時的可用性或驗證原因。"
-- en: "Availability or validation reason when the record is nil."
L["Availability or validation reason when the record is nil."] = "記錄為 nil 時的可用性或驗證原因。"
-- en: "Availability or validation reason when the result is nil."
L["Availability or validation reason when the result is nil."] = "結果為 nil 時的可用性或驗證原因。"
-- en: "Availability reason for a nil result."
L["Availability reason for a nil result."] = "結果為 nil 時的可用性原因。"
-- en: "Availability reason when resolution fails; nil on success."
L["Availability reason when resolution fails; nil on success."] = "解析失敗時的可用性原因；成功時為 nil。"
-- en: "Cache an observation after it returns a non-nil value; retry observations whose entire return tuple is nil. Uses the same exact argument keys as getCached."
L["Cache an observation after it returns a non-nil value; retry observations whose entire return tuple is nil. Uses the same exact argument keys as getCached."] = "在觀測傳回非 nil 值後將其快取；對整個傳回元組都為 nil 的觀測會重試。使用與 getCached 完全相同的參數鍵。"
-- en: "Calculate a checked health-history rate using an explicit finite window and clock. Preserve ordered weighting, per-row live canonical rounding, skipped streams, array holes, fractional keys and final visited ages. A fixed 4096-unit budget covers visited rows and accumulation bins across both streams; excess or invalid consumed arithmetic returns unavailable, never a partial estimate or clamp. This new API has its own source identity; historical trend functions remain unchanged."
L["Calculate a checked health-history rate using an explicit finite window and clock. Preserve ordered weighting, per-row live canonical rounding, skipped streams, array holes, fractional keys and final visited ages. A fixed 4096-unit budget covers visited rows and accumulation bins across both streams; excess or invalid consumed arithmetic returns unavailable, never a partial estimate or clamp. This new API has its own source identity; historical trend functions remain unchanged."] = "使用明確的有限時間區間與時鐘，計算經過檢查的生命力歷史速率。保留有序加權、逐列即時標準捨入、被略過的資料流、陣列空洞、小數鍵以及最終存取時的時長。固定的 4096 單位預算涵蓋兩個資料流中被存取的列與累加區間；超出預算或無效的已消耗運算會傳回無法使用，絕不傳回部分估算或截斷值。這個新 API 有其自己的原始碼身分；歷史趨勢函式保持不變。"
-- en: "Call an observation once per cache and exact argument tuple, including nil results. Pass the evaluation cache to share observations within a recommendation cycle; nil cache calls directly."
L["Call an observation once per cache and exact argument tuple, including nil results. Pass the evaluation cache to share observations within a recommendation cycle; nil cache calls directly."] = "對每個快取與完全相同的參數元組只呼叫一次觀測，包括 nil 結果。傳入評估快取可在一個建議週期內共用觀測；快取為 nil 時直接呼叫。"
-- en: "Callback invoked after changing the selected unit."
L["Callback invoked after changing the selected unit."] = "變更所選單位後呼叫的回呼。"
-- en: "Callback receiving the committed spell value."
L["Callback receiving the committed spell value."] = "接收已提交法術值的回呼。"
-- en: "Caller-owned evaluation observation cache; nil queries afresh."
L["Caller-owned evaluation observation cache; nil queries afresh."] = "由呼叫端擁有的評估觀測快取；為 nil 時重新查詢。"
-- en: "Capability or clock observation availability reason."
L["Capability or clock observation availability reason."] = "功能或時鐘觀測的可用性原因。"
-- en: "Capability or observation availability reason for a nil class."
L["Capability or observation availability reason for a nil class."] = "職業為 nil 時的功能或觀測可用性原因。"
-- en: "Check whether a spell can be recommended now, allowing a spell whose remaining cooldown ends with the current global cooldown. On Retail and Forever, where cooldown times are secret in combat, readiness comes from the never-secret isEnabled, isActive and isOnGCD flags instead. This checks cooldown readiness only; it does not check learned status, range or resource usability. Pass evaluation time from evalStart or GetTime()."
L["Check whether a spell can be recommended now, allowing a spell whose remaining cooldown ends with the current global cooldown. On Retail and Forever, where cooldown times are secret in combat, readiness comes from the never-secret isEnabled, isActive and isOnGCD flags instead. This checks cooldown readiness only; it does not check learned status, range or resource usability. Pass evaluation time from evalStart or GetTime()."] = "檢查某個法術現在能否被建議，允許剩餘冷卻時間隨目前共用冷卻一同結束的法術。在正式版與永久中，戰鬥中的冷卻時間是機密值，因此改為依據永不為機密的 isEnabled、isActive 與 isOnGCD 旗標判斷是否就緒。此函式只檢查冷卻是否就緒；不檢查是否已學會、距離或資源是否足夠。請傳入來自 evalStart 或 GetTime() 的評估時間。"
-- en: "Check whether a table has a non-nil value at a key. A stored false value still counts as present; this does not scan table values."
L["Check whether a table has a non-nil value at a key. A stored false value still counts as present; this does not scan table values."] = "檢查表格中某個鍵是否有非 nil 的值。儲存的 false 值仍算作存在；這不會掃描表格中的值。"
-- en: "Checkbox widget with boolean value and callback methods."
L["Checkbox widget with boolean value and callback methods."] = "帶有布林值與回呼方法的核取方塊元件。"
-- en: "Choose the supplied player value only for the literal player unit token; every other unit selects the nonplayer value. Selected false and nil values are preserved."
L["Choose the supplied player value only for the literal player unit token; every other unit selects the nonplayer value. Selected false and nil values are preserved."] = "僅當單位代碼為字面上的 player 時才選擇所提供的玩家值；其他所有單位都會選擇非玩家值。選中的 false 與 nil 值會被保留。"
-- en: "Classification, validation or availability reason for a nil result."
L["Classification, validation or availability reason for a nil result."] = "結果為 nil 時的分類、驗證或可用性原因。"
-- en: "Classify a numeric item as a glyph for the requested class, using guarded native item metadata. Class is optional and defaults to the readable player class. This establishes item classification only, not equipped status or an item-to-glyph-spell ID mapping."
L["Classify a numeric item as a glyph for the requested class, using guarded native item metadata. Class is optional and defaults to the readable player class. This establishes item classification only, not equipped status or an item-to-glyph-spell ID mapping."] = "使用受保護的原生物品中繼資料，將一個數字物品歸類為所請求職業的雕紋。職業是選擇性的，預設為可讀取的玩家職業。這只確定物品分類，不確定裝備狀態，也不提供物品到雕紋法術 ID 的對應。"
-- en: "Client-family, query-validation or required-observation availability reason for a nil result."
L["Client-family, query-validation or required-observation availability reason for a nil result."] = "結果為 nil 時的用戶端系列、查詢驗證或所需觀測的可用性原因。"
-- en: "Client-policy, capability, call or observation availability reason for a nil form."
L["Client-policy, capability, call or observation availability reason for a nil form."] = "形態為 nil 時的用戶端政策、功能、呼叫或觀測可用性原因。"
-- en: "Client-policy, capability, call or observation availability reason for a nil record."
L["Client-policy, capability, call or observation availability reason for a nil record."] = "記錄為 nil 時的用戶端政策、功能、呼叫或觀測可用性原因。"
-- en: "Client-policy, native-call or required membership availability reason for a nil record."
L["Client-policy, native-call or required membership availability reason for a nil record."] = "記錄為 nil 時的用戶端政策、原生呼叫或所需成員身分的可用性原因。"
-- en: "Closed kind: runner, resist or immune."
L["Closed kind: runner, resist or immune."] = "封閉的種類：runner、resist 或 immune。"
-- en: "Closed scalar kind: current or maximum."
L["Closed scalar kind: current or maximum."] = "封閉的純量種類：current 或 maximum。"
-- en: "Collect table keys and sort them by their associated values using Lua less-than comparison. This sorts values rather than key names; equal values have no guaranteed key order."
L["Collect table keys and sort them by their associated values using Lua less-than comparison. This sorts values rather than key names; equal values have no guaranteed key order."] = "收集表格的鍵，並使用 Lua 的小於比較依其對應的值排序。這是依值排序而不是依鍵名排序；值相等時鍵的順序不確定。"
-- en: "Combat-policy, capability, observation or scan-budget reason for a nil count."
L["Combat-policy, capability, observation or scan-budget reason for a nil count."] = "計數為 nil 時的戰鬥政策、功能、觀測或掃描預算原因。"
-- en: "Combined signed weighted rate from the original formula; malformed or nonfinite inputs retain the legacy error/numeric behavior."
L["Combined signed weighted rate from the original formula; malformed or nonfinite inputs retain the legacy error/numeric behavior."] = "來自原始公式的帶正負號加權合併速率；格式錯誤或非有限的輸入保留舊版的錯誤/數值行為。"
-- en: "Compare the selected unit creature ID with one existing saved creature-type key. Resolve the fixed key-to-ID identity in one private executable mapper; gameplay matching does not depend on the mutable localized UI caption map. Share complete native observations within the supplied evaluation-pass cache by actual observer, receiver and unit, including absence and unavailable reasons. Known absence or a known different ID returns false; an unavailable required observation returns nil with a reason. No longterm state or caption mutation is added."
L["Compare the selected unit creature ID with one existing saved creature-type key. Resolve the fixed key-to-ID identity in one private executable mapper; gameplay matching does not depend on the mutable localized UI caption map. Share complete native observations within the supplied evaluation-pass cache by actual observer, receiver and unit, including absence and unavailable reasons. Known absence or a known different ID returns false; an unavailable required observation returns nil with a reason. No longterm state or caption mutation is added."] = "將所選單位的生物 ID 與一個現有的已儲存生物類型鍵進行比較。在一個私有的可執行對應器中解析固定的鍵到 ID 的對應；遊戲中的比對不依賴可變的在地化介面標題對應。在所提供的評估輪次快取中，依實際的觀測者、接收者與單位共用完整的原生觀測，包括不存在與無法使用的原因。已知不存在或已知 ID 不同時傳回 false；所需觀測無法使用時傳回 nil 及原因。不會新增長期狀態或修改標題。"
-- en: "Compare two exact unit tokens using UnitIsUnit after checking only the first token with UnitExists. A readable absent first unit returns false without comparing. Required missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations return nil with a reason. No second existence query, GUID lookup or inferred identity is added."
L["Compare two exact unit tokens using UnitIsUnit after checking only the first token with UnitExists. A readable absent first unit returns false without comparing. Required missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations return nil with a reason. No second existence query, GUID lookup or inferred identity is added."] = "只用 UnitExists 檢查第一個單位代碼後，使用 UnitIsUnit 比較兩個確切的單位代碼。若第一個單位可讀且不存在，則不進行比較直接傳回 false。所需的觀測缺少、失敗、受限或格式錯誤時傳回 nil 及原因。不會額外進行第二次存在性查詢、GUID 查詢或推斷身分。"
-- en: "Compare two values using an RM operator identifier: LESSTHAN, LESSTHANOREQUALS, GREATERTHAN, GREATERTHANOREQUALS, EQUALS, NOTEQUALS or DIVISIBLE. Invalid operators warn and return nil; operands must support the selected Lua operation."
L["Compare two values using an RM operator identifier: LESSTHAN, LESSTHANOREQUALS, GREATERTHAN, GREATERTHANOREQUALS, EQUALS, NOTEQUALS or DIVISIBLE. Invalid operators warn and return nil; operands must support the selected Lua operation."] = "使用 RM 運算子識別碼比較兩個值：LESSTHAN、LESSTHANOREQUALS、GREATERTHAN、GREATERTHANOREQUALS、EQUALS、NOTEQUALS 或 DIVISIBLE。無效的運算子會發出警告並傳回 nil；運算元必須支援所選的 Lua 運算。"
-- en: "Comparison operator key, such as EQUALS or LESSTHAN."
L["Comparison operator key, such as EQUALS or LESSTHAN."] = "比較運算子鍵，例如 EQUALS 或 LESSTHAN。"
-- en: "Comparison result, or nil for an unknown operator."
L["Comparison result, or nil for an unknown operator."] = "比較結果；運算子未知時為 nil。"
-- en: "Comparison text retaining named Boolean alternative markup."
L["Comparison text retaining named Boolean alternative markup."] = "保留命名布林備選標記的比較文字。"
-- en: "Complete matching class count, including zero, or nil when unavailable."
L["Complete matching class count, including zero, or nil when unavailable."] = "符合職業的完整計數（包括零）；無法使用時為 nil。"
-- en: "Complete nonnegative observed count including zero, or nil when unavailable."
L["Complete nonnegative observed count including zero, or nil when unavailable."] = "完整的非負觀測計數（包括零）；無法使用時為 nil。"
-- en: "Condition container supporting SetLayout, AddChild, SetUserData, SetWidth and DoLayout."
L["Condition container supporting SetLayout, AddChild, SetUserData, SetWidth and DoLayout."] = "支援 SetLayout、AddChild、SetUserData、SetWidth 與 DoLayout 的條件容器。"
-- en: "Condition value record containing spell, ranked and disabled fields; updated in place."
L["Condition value record containing spell, ranked and disabled fields; updated in place."] = "包含 spell、ranked 與 disabled 欄位的條件值記錄；會被原地更新。"
-- en: "Condition value record updated when a unit is chosen."
L["Condition value record updated when a unit is chosen."] = "選擇單位時會被更新的條件值記錄。"
-- en: "Configured unit selector; add it with parent:AddChild(widget)."
L["Configured unit selector; add it with parent:AddChild(widget)."] = "已設定的單位選擇器；使用 parent:AddChild(widget) 新增它。"
-- en: "Copy a table using tostring of each original key as the destination key. Values retain their original identities. Colliding stringified keys overwrite each other in unspecified pairs traversal order."
L["Copy a table using tostring of each original key as the destination key. Values retain their original identities. Colliding stringified keys overwrite each other in unspecified pairs traversal order."] = "複製一個表格，以每個原始鍵的 tostring 結果作為目標鍵。值保留其原始身分。字串化後相互衝突的鍵會依未指定的 pairs 走訪順序相互覆蓋。"
-- en: "Count all entries visited by pairs, including false values and sparse numeric or nonnumeric keys. A nil table has length zero."
L["Count all entries visited by pairs, including false values and sparse numeric or nonnumeric keys. A nil table has length zero."] = "統計 pairs 走訪到的所有項目，包括 false 值以及稀疏的數字鍵或非數字鍵。nil 表格的長度為零。"
-- en: "Count matching class tokens in the current fixed roster. Read group membership first; when requested, raid membership selects raid1 through raid40 without a separate player fact. Solo and party paths read player first, then party1 through party4 when grouped. A complete known roster returns a count, including zero; any required unavailable fact returns nil with a reason. Complete observations share the evaluation-pass cache; no player class persists across passes. Archived raw callbacks retain their original load-time class separately."
L["Count matching class tokens in the current fixed roster. Read group membership first; when requested, raid membership selects raid1 through raid40 without a separate player fact. Solo and party paths read player first, then party1 through party4 when grouped. A complete known roster returns a count, including zero; any required unavailable fact returns nil with a reason. Complete observations share the evaluation-pass cache; no player class persists across passes. Archived raw callbacks retain their original load-time class separately."] = "統計目前固定名單中符合的職業代碼。先讀取隊伍成員身分；在要求時，團隊成員身分會選擇 raid1 到 raid40，而不另外讀取玩家資訊。單人與隊伍路徑會先讀取 player，組隊時再讀取 party1 到 party4。完整且已知的名單會傳回計數（包括零）；任何所需資訊無法使用時傳回 nil 及原因。完整的觀測共用評估輪次快取；玩家職業不會跨輪次保留。已封存的原始回呼會另外保留其原有的載入時職業。"
-- en: "Count only GUID-keyed units already in the observed membership snapshot. Verify current token identity before using the published threat observer; known absent or reused tokens are excluded without adding replacements. Complete identity and threat observations share only the supplied evaluation cache, while membership is traversed fresh. Known nonenemy or optional nil threat is not counted; required unreadable, malformed or failed facts make the entire result unavailable. This does not enumerate a complete roster, apply a range filter or modify tracked records."
L["Count only GUID-keyed units already in the observed membership snapshot. Verify current token identity before using the published threat observer; known absent or reused tokens are excluded without adding replacements. Complete identity and threat observations share only the supplied evaluation cache, while membership is traversed fresh. Known nonenemy or optional nil threat is not counted; required unreadable, malformed or failed facts make the entire result unavailable. This does not enumerate a complete roster, apply a range filter or modify tracked records."] = "只統計已在觀測成員快照中、以 GUID 為鍵的單位。在使用已發布的威脅值觀測器之前，會先驗證目前代碼的身分；已知不存在或被重複使用的代碼會被排除，且不會新增替代者。完整的身分與威脅值觀測只共用所提供的評估快取，而成員身分會重新走訪。已知的非敵人或選擇性的 nil 威脅值不計入；所需資訊無法讀取、格式錯誤或失敗時，整個結果為無法使用。這不會列舉完整的名單、套用距離篩選或修改被追蹤的記錄。"
-- en: "Create a condition field container with RM-owned List, Table and responsive spell-field layouts. It accepts registered native condition widgets; add children with AddChild and attach the group to the callback parent."
L["Create a condition field container with RM-owned List, Table and responsive spell-field layouts. It accepts registered native condition widgets; add children with AddChild and attach the group to the callback parent."] = "建立一個條件欄位容器，使用 RM 自有的 List、Table 與自適應法術欄位版面。它接受已註冊的原生條件元件；使用 AddChild 新增子項目，並將該群組附加到回呼的父層。"
-- en: "Create a configured unit selector bound to a condition value record. Returns the widget for the caller to add to the condition callback parent."
L["Create a configured unit selector bound to a condition value record. Returns the widget for the caller to add to the condition callback parent."] = "建立一個綁定到條件值記錄的已設定單位選擇器。傳回該元件，由呼叫端將其新增到條件回呼的父層。"
-- en: "Create a native boolean condition control. Configure SetLabel, SetValue, SetDisabled and OnValueChanged; add it with parent:AddChild(widget)."
L["Create a native boolean condition control. Configure SetLabel, SetValue, SetDisabled and OnValueChanged; add it with parent:AddChild(widget)."] = "建立一個原生的布林條件控制項。設定 SetLabel、SetValue、SetDisabled 與 OnValueChanged；使用 parent:AddChild(widget) 新增它。"
-- en: "Create a native button using the shared condition widget lifecycle and workbench theme. SetText, SetDisabled and SetCallback configure its label and interaction; OnClick receives the mouse button. Add it to the callback parent with parent:AddChild(widget)."
L["Create a native button using the shared condition widget lifecycle and workbench theme. SetText, SetDisabled and SetCallback configure its label and interaction; OnClick receives the mouse button. Add it to the callback parent with parent:AddChild(widget)."] = "使用共用的條件元件生命週期與工作台主題建立一個原生按鈕。SetText、SetDisabled 與 SetCallback 用於設定其標籤與互動；OnClick 會收到所按的滑鼠按鍵。將其使用 parent:AddChild(widget) 新增到回呼的父層。"
-- en: "Create a native condition selector. SetList accepts key-to-label or key-to-entry maps; SetValue selects a key and OnValueChanged reports changes. Add it with parent:AddChild(widget)."
L["Create a native condition selector. SetList accepts key-to-label or key-to-entry maps; SetValue selects a key and OnValueChanged reports changes. Add it with parent:AddChild(widget)."] = "建立一個原生的條件選擇器。SetList 接受鍵到標籤或鍵到項目的對應；SetValue 選擇一個鍵，OnValueChanged 回報變化。使用 parent:AddChild(widget) 新增它。"
-- en: "Create a native image control using the condition widget lifecycle. SetImage and SetImageSize choose the texture; SetText optionally adds a caption. OnClick, OnEnter and OnLeave use the shared callback contract. Add the control to the callback parent with parent:AddChild(widget)."
L["Create a native image control using the condition widget lifecycle. SetImage and SetImageSize choose the texture; SetText optionally adds a caption. OnClick, OnEnter and OnLeave use the shared callback contract. Add the control to the callback parent with parent:AddChild(widget)."] = "使用條件元件生命週期建立一個原生圖像控制項。SetImage 與 SetImageSize 用於選擇材質；SetText 可選擇性地新增說明文字。OnClick、OnEnter 與 OnLeave 使用共用的回呼約定。將該控制項使用 parent:AddChild(widget) 新增到回呼的父層。"
-- en: "Create a native numeric condition input with a slider and typed numeric field. Configure SetSliderValues, SetValue, SetIsPercent and SetCallback; OnValueChanged reports committed values. Add it with parent:AddChild(widget)."
L["Create a native numeric condition input with a slider and typed numeric field. Configure SetSliderValues, SetValue, SetIsPercent and SetCallback; OnValueChanged reports committed values. Add it with parent:AddChild(widget)."] = "建立一個帶有滑桿與數字輸入框的原生數值條件輸入控制項。設定 SetSliderValues、SetValue、SetIsPercent 與 SetCallback；OnValueChanged 回報已提交的值。使用 parent:AddChild(widget) 新增它。"
-- en: "Create a native position pad using the shared directional controls. OnOffsetChanged reports horizontal and vertical direction, whether Center was pressed, and the increment (one, or ten with Shift). SetDisabled controls interaction; add the pad to the callback parent with parent:AddChild(widget)."
L["Create a native position pad using the shared directional controls. OnOffsetChanged reports horizontal and vertical direction, whether Center was pressed, and the increment (one, or ten with Shift). SetDisabled controls interaction; add the pad to the callback parent with parent:AddChild(widget)."] = "使用共用的方向控制項建立一個原生位置面板。OnOffsetChanged 回報水平與垂直方向、是否按下了「置中」，以及增量（一，或按住 Shift 時為十）。SetDisabled 控制互動；將該面板使用 parent:AddChild(widget) 新增到回呼的父層。"
-- en: "Create a native text input using the condition widget contract. SetLabel, SetText, SetDisabled and SetCallback configure it; OnEnterPressed commits text. Add it to the callback parent with parent:AddChild(widget)."
L["Create a native text input using the condition widget contract. SetLabel, SetText, SetDisabled and SetCallback configure it; OnEnterPressed commits text. Add it to the callback parent with parent:AddChild(widget)."] = "使用條件元件約定建立一個原生文字輸入框。SetLabel、SetText、SetDisabled 與 SetCallback 用於設定它；OnEnterPressed 提交文字。使用 parent:AddChild(widget) 將其新增到回呼的父層。"
-- en: "Create a shallow filtered copy despite the historical deepcopy name. Nested values retain their original identities and the source metatable is not copied. By default exclude keys listed among except values; invert true includes only listed keys. Nil input returns nil."
L["Create a shallow filtered copy despite the historical deepcopy name. Nested values retain their original identities and the source metatable is not copied. By default exclude keys listed among except values; invert true includes only listed keys. Nil input returns nil."] = "儘管歷史上名為 deepcopy，它建立的是一個經過篩選的淺層複本。巢狀的值保留其原始身分，且不會複製來源表格的中繼表格。預設排除 except 值中列出的鍵；invert 為 true 時只包含列出的鍵。輸入為 nil 時傳回 nil。"
-- en: "Create a spell input with suggestions, validation and spell-link support for custom condition widgets. The update callback owns saving a chosen value; add the returned widget to the callback parent."
L["Create a spell input with suggestions, validation and spell-link support for custom condition widgets. The update callback owns saving a chosen value; add the returned widget to the callback parent."] = "為自訂條件元件建立一個帶有建議、驗證與法術連結支援的法術輸入框。更新回呼負責儲存所選的值；將傳回的元件新增到回呼的父層。"
-- en: "Create a transient named condition summary. Use {name} for scalar values and {{positive|negative}} for predicate alternatives; prefix a primary alternative with !. Escape literal double braces as {{{{ and }}}}. Values are inserted literally without parsing their percent signs, links, colors or braces. Typed predicate values participate in primary selection. Templates, values and rendered text are bounded; malformed input renders a localized unavailable summary. This changes presentation only and runs no condition observations."
L["Create a transient named condition summary. Use {name} for scalar values and {{positive|negative}} for predicate alternatives; prefix a primary alternative with !. Escape literal double braces as {{{{ and }}}}. Values are inserted literally without parsing their percent signs, links, colors or braces. Typed predicate values participate in primary selection. Templates, values and rendered text are bounded; malformed input renders a localized unavailable summary. This changes presentation only and runs no condition observations."] = "建立一個暫時的具名條件摘要。純量值使用 {name}，判斷的正反兩種措辭使用 {{positive|negative}}；在主要措辭前加上 ! 前綴。字面的雙大括號請跳脫為 {{{{ 和 }}}}。值會依字面插入，不解析其中的百分號、連結、顏色或大括號。具型別的判斷值會參與主要措辭的選擇。範本、值與繪製後的文字都有長度上限；格式錯誤的輸入會繪製為在地化的「無法使用」摘要。這只改變呈現方式，不會執行任何條件觀測。"
-- en: "Create a typed comparison predicate for a named condition phrase. Positive wording uses the original captured operator map and negative wording uses the current negated operator map. A primary predicate takes precedence over qualifiers; only the first eligible predicate negates. Unknown operators use the existing operator placeholder. This formats wording without comparing values or evaluating a condition."
L["Create a typed comparison predicate for a named condition phrase. Positive wording uses the original captured operator map and negative wording uses the current negated operator map. A primary predicate takes precedence over qualifiers; only the first eligible predicate negates. Unknown operators use the existing operator placeholder. This formats wording without comparing values or evaluating a condition."] = "為具名條件短語建立一個具型別的比較判斷。肯定措辭使用原先擷取的運算子對應，否定措辭使用目前反轉後的運算子對應。主要判斷優先於限定詞；只有第一個符合條件的判斷會被反轉。未知運算子使用現有的運算子預留位置。這只格式化措辭，不比較值也不評估條件。"
-- en: "Create an iterator over a sorted snapshot of table keys. Default ordering compares keys; a custom order callback receives the original table and two keys. Values are read from the original table when each key is yielded. The legacy iterator ends when the next captured key is nil or false."
L["Create an iterator over a sorted snapshot of table keys. Default ordering compares keys; a custom order callback receives the original table and two keys. Values are read from the original table when each key is yielded. The legacy iterator ends when the next captured key is nil or false."] = "建立一個走訪表格鍵排序快照的迭代器。預設依鍵排序；自訂排序回呼會收到原始表格與兩個鍵。每次產出一個鍵時，值從原始表格中讀取。當下一個擷取的鍵為 nil 或 false 時，舊版迭代器結束。"
-- en: "Create native wrapping text that measures its height from its width and font. SetText, SetFont or SetFontObject configure its contents. Add it to the callback parent with parent:AddChild(widget) so layout can track its measured height."
L["Create native wrapping text that measures its height from its width and font. SetText, SetFont or SetFontObject configure its contents. Add it to the callback parent with parent:AddChild(widget) so layout can track its measured height."] = "建立原生的自動換行文字，根據其寬度與字型測量高度。SetText、SetFont 或 SetFontObject 用於設定其內容。將其使用 parent:AddChild(widget) 新增到回呼的父層，以便版面能夠追蹤其測得的高度。"
-- en: "Create native wrapping text with optional leading image and pointer callbacks. SetImage and SetImageSize configure the image; OnEnter, OnLeave and OnClick use the condition callback contract. Add it to the callback parent with parent:AddChild(widget); callbacks expire when its lease is released."
L["Create native wrapping text with optional leading image and pointer callbacks. SetImage and SetImageSize configure the image; OnEnter, OnLeave and OnClick use the condition callback contract. Add it to the callback parent with parent:AddChild(widget); callbacks expire when its lease is released."] = "建立原生的自動換行文字，可選擇帶有前置圖像與指標回呼。SetImage 與 SetImageSize 用於設定圖像；OnEnter、OnLeave 與 OnClick 使用條件回呼約定。將其使用 parent:AddChild(widget) 新增到回呼的父層；其租用被釋放時回呼會失效。"
-- en: "Current evaluation time in seconds from GetTime(), normally evalStart."
L["Current evaluation time in seconds from GetTime(), normally evalStart."] = "目前評估時間，單位為秒，取自 GetTime()，通常為 evalStart。"
-- en: "Current positive visibility distance in yards; nil when unavailable."
L["Current positive visibility distance in yards; nil when unavailable."] = "目前的正可見距離，單位為碼；無法使用時為 nil。"
-- en: "Current unit token whose distance from the player should be observed."
L["Current unit token whose distance from the player should be observed."] = "要觀測其與玩家距離的目前單位代碼。"
-- en: "Damage/heals arrays of time/value rows; only selected streams are consumed."
L["Damage/heals arrays of time/value rows; only selected streams are consumed."] = "由時間/數值列組成的傷害/治療陣列；只會使用所選的資料流。"
-- en: "Decimal places, default zero; negative values round to tens or larger powers of ten."
L["Decimal places, default zero; negative values round to tens or larger powers of ten."] = "小數位數，預設為零；負值會捨入到十或更大的十的冪。"
-- en: "Dense array of keys sorted by associated value."
L["Dense array of keys sorted by associated value."] = "依對應值排序的鍵的密集陣列。"
-- en: "Dense array of nonempty text fields."
L["Dense array of nonempty text fields."] = "非空文字欄位的密集陣列。"
-- en: "Destination array modified in place."
L["Destination array modified in place."] = "被原地修改的目標陣列。"
-- en: "Display lookup table."
L["Display lookup table."] = "顯示查詢表。"
-- en: "Estimate signed health change from weighted damage and healing history. Damage contributes a negative rate and healing a positive rate. Read the live profile window when no window is supplied, use the live clock and legacy rounding service, and preserve the existing weighting and rounded-age calculation. This helper does not validate or sanitize history, clamp timestamps, or guarantee finite results."
L["Estimate signed health change from weighted damage and healing history. Damage contributes a negative rate and healing a positive rate. Read the live profile window when no window is supplied, use the live clock and legacy rounding service, and preserve the existing weighting and rounded-age calculation. This helper does not validate or sanitize history, clamp timestamps, or guarantee finite results."] = "根據加權的傷害與治療歷史估算帶正負號的生命力變化。傷害貢獻負速率，治療貢獻正速率。未提供時間區間時讀取即時設定檔中的時間區間，使用即時時鐘與舊版捨入服務，並保留現有的加權與捨入後時長計算。此輔助函式不會驗證或清理歷史，不會截斷時間戳記，也不保證結果有限。"
-- en: "Estimate time until selected health. Cache complete native identity and lazy scalar observations per evaluation pass, while provider, history, window, clock and forecast stay live. Exact target equality returns zero before history work. Preserve deliberate no-estimate false and initialized-zero results for zero or opposite rates; required invalid facts, overflow or 4096-unit work exhaustion are unavailable. Never mutate history or invent a partial estimate."
L["Estimate time until selected health. Cache complete native identity and lazy scalar observations per evaluation pass, while provider, history, window, clock and forecast stay live. Exact target equality returns zero before history work. Preserve deliberate no-estimate false and initialized-zero results for zero or opposite rates; required invalid facts, overflow or 4096-unit work exhaustion are unavailable. Never mutate history or invent a partial estimate."] = "估算距離達到所選生命力的時間。每個評估輪次快取完整的原生身分與惰性純量觀測，而提供者、歷史、時間區間、時鐘與預測保持即時。目標完全相等時，會在處理歷史之前傳回零。對於零速率或反向速率，保留刻意設計的「無估算」false 結果與初始化的零結果；所需資訊無效、溢位或 4096 單位工作量耗盡時為無法使用。絕不修改歷史或捏造部分估算。"
-- en: "Evaluation cache, or nil to bypass caching."
L["Evaluation cache, or nil to bypass caching."] = "評估快取；為 nil 時略過快取。"
-- en: "Evaluation-pass cache for complete unit observations; nil observes directly. Different selected keys reuse the same unit snapshot."
L["Evaluation-pass cache for complete unit observations; nil observes directly. Different selected keys reuse the same unit snapshot."] = "用於完整單位觀測的評估輪次快取；為 nil 時直接觀測。不同的所選鍵會重複使用同一個單位快照。"
-- en: "Evaluation-pass cache, or nil for fresh observations."
L["Evaluation-pass cache, or nil for fresh observations."] = "評估輪次快取；為 nil 時重新觀測。"
-- en: "Evaluation-pass cache, or nil to observe identity directly. Resource mapping is resolved live on each invocation."
L["Evaluation-pass cache, or nil to observe identity directly. Resource mapping is resolved live on each invocation."] = "評估輪次快取；為 nil 時直接觀測身分。資源對應在每次呼叫時即時解析。"
-- en: "Evaluation-pass cache, or nil to observe identity directly. Successful player class observations may use the existing longterm identity cache; resource mapping remains live."
L["Evaluation-pass cache, or nil to observe identity directly. Successful player class observations may use the existing longterm identity cache; resource mapping remains live."] = "評估輪次快取；為 nil 時直接觀測身分。成功的玩家職業觀測可以使用現有的長期身分快取；資源對應保持即時。"
-- en: "Evaluation-pass native observation cache; nil queries afresh."
L["Evaluation-pass native observation cache; nil queries afresh."] = "評估輪次的原生觀測快取；為 nil 時重新查詢。"
-- en: "Evaluation-pass presence cache only; name, level and provider history remain fresh."
L["Evaluation-pass presence cache only; name, level and provider history remain fresh."] = "僅為評估輪次的存在性快取；名稱、等級與提供者歷史保持即時。"
-- en: "Exact helper-owned player, party1..party4 or raid1..raid40 token."
L["Exact helper-owned player, party1..party4 or raid1..raid40 token."] = "由輔助函式擁有的確切代碼：player、party1..party4 或 raid1..raid40。"
-- en: "Exact integral native rune slot from 1 through 6."
L["Exact integral native rune slot from 1 through 6."] = "確切的整數原生符文欄位，範圍為 1 到 6。"
-- en: "Exact nonempty unit token to observe."
