L["One rounded numeric result from the original formula."] = "來自原始公式的一個捨入後的數字結果。"
-- en: "Optional collection of key values selecting entries; its own keys are ignored."
L["Optional collection of key values selecting entries; its own keys are ignored."] = "選擇性的鍵值集合，用於選擇項目；其自身的鍵會被忽略。"
