-- en: "RM comparison operator identifier; missing labels use the operator placeholder."
L["RM comparison operator identifier; missing labels use the operator placeholder."] = "RM 比較運算子識別碼；缺少的標籤使用運算子預留位置。"
-- en: "RM operator identifier."
