-- en: "Range record with applicable and, when applicable, inRange; nil when unavailable."
L["Range record with applicable and, when applicable, inRange; nil when unavailable."] = "距離記錄，包含 applicable，適用時還包含 inRange；無法使用時為 nil。"
-- en: "Read a fresh protected UnitClass player observation for rotation ownership. Consume only the readable nonempty class filename from return two. No existence, level, vehicle, family or combat-policy read is added, and no result persists across calls. Core ownership still validates the class token and character key separately; overridden context providers retain their complete original path."
L["Read a fresh protected UnitClass player observation for rotation ownership. Consume only the readable nonempty class filename from return two. No existence, level, vehicle, family or combat-policy read is added, and no result persists across calls. Core ownership still validates the class token and character key separately; overridden context providers retain their complete original path."] = "為循環擁有權讀取一次全新的受保護 UnitClass 玩家觀測。只使用第二個傳回值中可讀的非空職業檔名。不會新增存在性、等級、載具、用戶端系列或戰鬥政策的讀取，結果也不會跨呼叫保留。核心擁有權仍會分別驗證職業代碼與角色鍵；被覆蓋的情境提供者保留其完整的原有路徑。"
-- en: "Read a fresh protected zero-argument GetTime for rune cooldown arithmetic. Require a readable finite number. This observation is deliberately uncached; callers preserve the original clock-before-scan order and require its value only when a matching rune needs timing. No evaluation-start substitution or inferred time is supplied."
L["Read a fresh protected zero-argument GetTime for rune cooldown arithmetic. Require a readable finite number. This observation is deliberately uncached; callers preserve the original clock-before-scan order and require its value only when a matching rune needs timing. No evaluation-start substitution or inferred time is supplied."] = "為符文冷卻運算讀取一次全新的受保護無參數 GetTime。要求結果可讀且為有限數字。此觀測刻意不快取；呼叫端保留原有的「先讀時鐘再掃描」順序，並且只在有相符的符文需要計時時才要求其值。不會以評估開始時間替代或推斷時間。"
-- en: "Read a lazy health scalar after a separate identity gate. Kind current uses exact UnitHealth(unit); maximum uses exact UnitHealthMax(unit). Probe- and restricted-policy clients accept readable finite nonnegative numbers including zero. No repeated existence/GUID call or alternate tuple fallback is added."
L["Read a lazy health scalar after a separate identity gate. Kind current uses exact UnitHealth(unit); maximum uses exact UnitHealthMax(unit). Probe- and restricted-policy clients accept readable finite nonnegative numbers including zero. No repeated existence/GUID call or alternate tuple fallback is added."] = "在另外的身分檢查之後讀取惰性的生命力純量。current 種類使用確切的 UnitHealth(unit)；maximum 使用確切的 UnitHealthMax(unit)。探測或受限政策用戶端接受可讀的有限非負數字（包括零）。不會重複呼叫存在性/GUID 查詢，也不會改用其他元組。"
-- en: "Read a normalized charge record: currentCharges, maxCharges, cooldownStartTime, cooldownDuration, chargeModRate and isActive. Unsupported spells or restricted client data return nil with a reason."
L["Read a normalized charge record: currentCharges, maxCharges, cooldownStartTime, cooldownDuration, chargeModRate and isActive. Unsupported spells or restricted client data return nil with a reason."] = "讀取標準化的充能記錄：currentCharges、maxCharges、cooldownStartTime、cooldownDuration、chargeModRate 與 isActive。不受支援的法術或受限的用戶端資料會傳回 nil 及原因。"
-- en: "Read a specified unit membership in the player party or raid. True raidOnly queries only UnitInRaid; otherwise a true UnitInParty result short-circuits, false proceeds to UnitInRaid, and unknown remains unavailable. Readable nil raid index means false; integer raid index1..40 means true. Names are passed unchanged to native APIs; native name-query acceptance requires client qualification."
L["Read a specified unit membership in the player party or raid. True raidOnly queries only UnitInRaid; otherwise a true UnitInParty result short-circuits, false proceeds to UnitInRaid, and unknown remains unavailable. Readable nil raid index means false; integer raid index1..40 means true. Names are passed unchanged to native APIs; native name-query acceptance requires client qualification."] = "讀取指定單位是否屬於玩家的隊伍或團隊。raidOnly 為 true 時只查詢 UnitInRaid；否則 UnitInParty 結果為 true 時直接傳回，為 false 時繼續查詢 UnitInRaid，未知時維持為無法使用。可讀的 nil 團隊索引表示 false；整數團隊索引 1..40 表示 true。名稱會原樣傳給原生 API；原生 API 是否接受名稱查詢需視用戶端而定。"
-- en: "Read and normalize a spell cooldown across supported clients. The returned record contains startTime, duration, isEnabled and modRate. The timestamps and duration already describe expiration in GetTime() seconds; do not divide them by modRate. When the client hides the times (Retail and Forever in combat) the record is nil with reason restricted-value, followed by the never-secret isEnabled, isActive and isOnGCD flags when they can be read."
L["Read and normalize a spell cooldown across supported clients. The returned record contains startTime, duration, isEnabled and modRate. The timestamps and duration already describe expiration in GetTime() seconds; do not divide them by modRate. When the client hides the times (Retail and Forever in combat) the record is nil with reason restricted-value, followed by the never-secret isEnabled, isActive and isOnGCD flags when they can be read."] = "讀取各支援用戶端的法術冷卻並將其正規化。傳回的記錄包含 startTime、duration、isEnabled 與 modRate。時間戳記與持續時間已經以 GetTime() 秒數描述到期時間；不要再除以 modRate。當用戶端隱藏時間時（正式版與永久的戰鬥中），記錄為 nil，原因為 restricted-value，在可以讀取時其後會附上永不為機密的 isEnabled、isActive 與 isOnGCD 旗標。"
-- en: "Read normalized native item classification metadata. The record contains canonical itemID, classID and subClassID, plus equipLoc, the non-localized INVTYPE_* equip location token, when it is readable and nonempty; it does not require loaded item display text. Missing, failed, malformed or restricted metadata returns nil with a reason."
L["Read normalized native item classification metadata. The record contains canonical itemID, classID and subClassID, plus equipLoc, the non-localized INVTYPE_* equip location token, when it is readable and nonempty; it does not require loaded item display text. Missing, failed, malformed or restricted metadata returns nil with a reason."] = "讀取正規化的原生物品分類中繼資料。記錄包含正規的 itemID、classID 與 subClassID，以及在可讀且非空時的 equipLoc（未在地化的 INVTYPE_* 裝備位置標記）；不要求物品顯示文字已載入。中繼資料缺少、失敗、格式錯誤或受限時傳回 nil 及原因。"
-- en: "Read one documented active loss-of-control row by its native index and requested subject kind. Type queries require only the readable control type string; school queries require only the readable finite nonnegative integer school mask. Optional timing is returned as a finite timeRemaining or an explicit per-field reason, so an unrelated subject does not require a usable timer. Missing rows are unavailable snapshot observations. No display fields, inferred deadline, duration sum, maximum or native alias fallback is used."
L["Read one documented active loss-of-control row by its native index and requested subject kind. Type queries require only the readable control type string; school queries require only the readable finite nonnegative integer school mask. Optional timing is returned as a finite timeRemaining or an explicit per-field reason, so an unrelated subject does not require a usable timer. Missing rows are unavailable snapshot observations. No display fields, inferred deadline, duration sum, maximum or native alias fallback is used."] = "依原生索引與所請求的主題種類，讀取一條有說明文件的活躍失去控制記錄列。type 查詢只需要可讀的控制類型字串；school 查詢只需要可讀的有限非負整數法術類型遮罩。選擇性的計時以有限的 timeRemaining 或逐欄位的明確原因傳回，因此不相關的主題不需要可用的計時器。缺少的列是無法使用的快照觀測。不會使用顯示欄位、推斷的截止時間、持續時間總和、最大值或原生別名備用方案。"
-- en: "Read one explicitly selected point-resource quantity with an exact two-argument UnitPower or UnitPowerMax query. The selector is required; no primary-resource inference or actor remapping occurs. Preserve finite signed, fractional and zero quantities without clamping. Missing, failed, restricted or nonfinite data remains unavailable. Current and maximum are separate observations so callers can share current snapshots while requesting maximum lazily."
L["Read one explicitly selected point-resource quantity with an exact two-argument UnitPower or UnitPowerMax query. The selector is required; no primary-resource inference or actor remapping occurs. Preserve finite signed, fractional and zero quantities without clamping. Missing, failed, restricted or nonfinite data remains unavailable. Current and maximum are separate observations so callers can share current snapshots while requesting maximum lazily."] = "使用確切的雙參數 UnitPower 或 UnitPowerMax 查詢，讀取一個明確選擇的點數資源數量。選擇器為必要；不會推斷主要資源或重新對應角色。保留有限的帶正負號、小數與零數量，不進行截斷。缺少、失敗、受限或非有限的資料維持為無法使用。目前值與最大值是分開的觀測，因此呼叫端可以共用目前值快照，同時依需要延遲請求最大值。"
-- en: "Read one protected GetRuneCooldown tuple for an exact native slot. Normalize ready, start and duration independently: ready requires a readable Boolean, while each time requires a readable finite number and preserves signed, fractional and zero values. Every unavailable field carries its own reason. A successful empty tuple yields a partial record; missing capability, policy or native-call failure yields nil. Never infer ready from timing or timing from ready. Cache this complete record at the caller to share one observation between rune-count and cooldown predicates."
L["Read one protected GetRuneCooldown tuple for an exact native slot. Normalize ready, start and duration independently: ready requires a readable Boolean, while each time requires a readable finite number and preserves signed, fractional and zero values. Every unavailable field carries its own reason. A successful empty tuple yields a partial record; missing capability, policy or native-call failure yields nil. Never infer ready from timing or timing from ready. Cache this complete record at the caller to share one observation between rune-count and cooldown predicates."] = "為一個確切的原生欄位讀取一次受保護的 GetRuneCooldown 元組。分別標準化 ready、start 與 duration：ready 需要可讀的布林值，而每個時間值需要可讀的有限數字，並保留帶正負號、小數與零值。每個無法使用的欄位都附帶其自己的原因。成功傳回空元組時會產生部分記錄；缺少功能、政策或原生呼叫失敗時傳回 nil。絕不從計時推斷 ready，也不從 ready 推斷計時。請在呼叫端快取這份完整記錄，以便在符文計數與冷卻判斷之間共用一次觀測。"
-- en: "Read optional MobInfo2 historical observations on probe- and restricted-policy clients. Cache only exact selected-unit presence; UnitName result one, UnitLevel result one and the three-argument MI2_GetMobData(name,level,unit) dot call stay fresh each invocation. Known absent units and successful unrecorded nil or omitted history remain distinct from unavailable native/provider facts. Preserve readable runner scalar truthiness, school signs and missing-Hits default one. Positive resistance ratios must be finite; complete immunity consumes finite Hits while partial immunity needs only its negative school observation. Never infer native resistance or borrow old records."
L["Read optional MobInfo2 historical observations on probe- and restricted-policy clients. Cache only exact selected-unit presence; UnitName result one, UnitLevel result one and the three-argument MI2_GetMobData(name,level,unit) dot call stay fresh each invocation. Known absent units and successful unrecorded nil or omitted history remain distinct from unavailable native/provider facts. Preserve readable runner scalar truthiness, school signs and missing-Hits default one. Positive resistance ratios must be finite; complete immunity consumes finite Hits while partial immunity needs only its negative school observation. Never infer native resistance or borrow old records."] = "在探測或受限政策用戶端上讀取選擇性的 MobInfo2 歷史觀測。只快取確切的所選單位存在性；UnitName 的第一個結果、UnitLevel 的第一個結果以及三參數的 MI2_GetMobData(name,level,unit) 點號呼叫每次都會重新取得。已知不存在的單位，以及成功傳回的未記錄的 nil 或省略的歷史，與無法使用的原生/提供者資訊保持區分。保留可讀的 runner 純量真值、法術類型正負號以及缺少 Hits 時預設為一。正的抗性比例必須有限；完全免疫會使用有限的 Hits，而部分免疫只需要其負值的法術類型觀測。絕不推斷原生抗性或借用舊記錄。"
-- en: "Read optional RealMobHealth using its exact one-argument dot call. Absent nil/false namespace returns an empty record. Normalize current and maximum independently: nil/false fields permit native fallback, numeric zero remains present. Malformed, failed, restricted, negative or nonfinite consumed provider facts are unavailable. No provider or stale fallback cache is used."
L["Read optional RealMobHealth using its exact one-argument dot call. Absent nil/false namespace returns an empty record. Normalize current and maximum independently: nil/false fields permit native fallback, numeric zero remains present. Malformed, failed, restricted, negative or nonfinite consumed provider facts are unavailable. No provider or stale fallback cache is used."] = "使用確切的單參數點號呼叫讀取選擇性的 RealMobHealth。命名空間不存在（nil/false）時傳回空記錄。分別標準化目前值與最大值：nil/false 欄位允許改用原生值，數字零仍視為存在。所使用的提供者資訊格式錯誤、失敗、受限、為負或非有限時為無法使用。不使用提供者或過期的備用快取。"
-- en: "Read public group membership on identified client families. Unknown clients are unsupported. True raidOnly checks IsInRaid; false or nil checks IsInGroup using its native default group category. A readable false result stays false. Missing, failed, malformed or restricted observations return nil with a reason."
L["Read public group membership on identified client families. Unknown clients are unsupported. True raidOnly checks IsInRaid; false or nil checks IsInGroup using its native default group category. A readable false result stays false. Missing, failed, malformed or restricted observations return nil with a reason."] = "在已識別的用戶端系列上讀取公開的隊伍成員身分。未知用戶端不受支援。raidOnly 為 true 時檢查 IsInRaid；為 false 或 nil 時使用原生預設的隊伍類別檢查 IsInGroup。可讀的 false 結果維持為 false。缺少、失敗、格式錯誤或受限的觀測會傳回 nil 及原因。"
-- en: "Read public roster identity on identified client families. Input routing is limited to player, party1 through party4 and raid1 through raid40. Call UnitExists with that exact one-argument token first; known false returns false without querying class. For a present unit, consume only UnitClass return two as a readable nonempty class filename string, without a class enum restriction. Missing, failed, malformed or restricted required facts return nil with a reason."
L["Read public roster identity on identified client families. Input routing is limited to player, party1 through party4 and raid1 through raid40. Call UnitExists with that exact one-argument token first; known false returns false without querying class. For a present unit, consume only UnitClass return two as a readable nonempty class filename string, without a class enum restriction. Missing, failed, malformed or restricted required facts return nil with a reason."] = "在已識別的用戶端系列上讀取公開的名單身分。輸入路由僅限 player、party1 到 party4，以及 raid1 到 raid40。先以該確切的單參數代碼呼叫 UnitExists；已知為 false 時直接傳回 false，不查詢職業。對於存在的單位，只使用 UnitClass 的第二個傳回值作為可讀的非空職業檔名字串，不限制職業列舉。所需資訊缺少、失敗、格式錯誤或受限時傳回 nil 及原因。"
-- en: "Read spell-specific range for a unit using the appropriate client API or spell-book slot. A spell without a range restriction returns applicable=false; otherwise applicable=true and inRange records whether the unit is in range. Unknown or inaccessible observations return nil with a reason."
L["Read spell-specific range for a unit using the appropriate client API or spell-book slot. A spell without a range restriction returns applicable=false; otherwise applicable=true and inRange records whether the unit is in range. Unknown or inaccessible observations return nil with a reason."] = "使用適當的用戶端 API 或法術書欄位，讀取某個單位針對特定法術的距離。沒有距離限制的法術傳回 applicable=false；否則 applicable=true，inRange 記錄該單位是否在距離內。未知或無法存取的觀測會傳回 nil 及原因。"
-- en: "Read the current positive nameplate visibility distance using the supported CVar API. This limits a Distance Count query; it does not prove that all nearby units have been observed. Missing, malformed, restricted or failed observations return nil with a reason."
L["Read the current positive nameplate visibility distance using the supported CVar API. This limits a Distance Count query; it does not prove that all nearby units have been observed. Missing, malformed, restricted or failed observations return nil with a reason."] = "使用受支援的 CVar API 讀取目前正的名條可見距離。這會限制「距離內計數」查詢；它不能證明所有附近的單位都已被觀測到。缺少、格式錯誤、受限或失敗的觀測會傳回 nil 及原因。"
-- en: "Read the documented active loss-of-control count with a protected zero-argument dot call. Require a readable finite nonnegative integer. Zero is a complete empty scan and does not require a row API. RM limits a scan to 256 rows and returns unavailable beyond that resource budget; this is not a declared native maximum. Required missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations remain unavailable."
L["Read the documented active loss-of-control count with a protected zero-argument dot call. Require a readable finite nonnegative integer. Zero is a complete empty scan and does not require a row API. RM limits a scan to 256 rows and returns unavailable beyond that resource budget; this is not a declared native maximum. Required missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations remain unavailable."] = "使用受保護的無參數點號呼叫，讀取有說明文件的活躍失去控制數量。要求結果可讀且為有限的非負整數。零表示一次完整的空掃描，不需要列 API。RM 將掃描限制為 256 列，超出該資源預算時傳回無法使用；這並不是原生宣告的最大值。所需觀測缺少、失敗、受限或格式錯誤時維持為無法使用。"
-- en: "Read the player auto-repeat state for a spell such as Shoot or Auto Shot. This is distinct from a current or queued cast. Modern clients receive the exact spell ID; a legacy query resolves the player spell-book slot first. Restricted client policies, unreadable results and unavailable book slots return nil with a reason. This observes state and never starts or stops a spell."
L["Read the player auto-repeat state for a spell such as Shoot or Auto Shot. This is distinct from a current or queued cast. Modern clients receive the exact spell ID; a legacy query resolves the player spell-book slot first. Restricted client policies, unreadable results and unavailable book slots return nil with a reason. This observes state and never starts or stops a spell."] = "讀取玩家某個法術（例如射擊或自動射擊）的自動重複狀態。這與目前或佇列中的施法不同。現代用戶端會收到確切的法術 ID；舊版查詢會先解析玩家的法術書欄位。受限的用戶端政策、無法讀取的結果以及無法使用的法術書欄位會傳回 nil 及原因。這只觀測狀態，從不開始或停止法術。"
-- en: "Read the public LibRangeCheck interval for a unit. A successful upper bound is inclusive; a positive failed lower bound is strict. A zero lower floor is synthetic. Neither bound is an exact distance, and a missing upper bound is not proof that the unit is outside every radius. Unavailable, malformed, restricted or failed observations return nil with a reason."
L["Read the public LibRangeCheck interval for a unit. A successful upper bound is inclusive; a positive failed lower bound is strict. A zero lower floor is synthetic. Neither bound is an exact distance, and a missing upper bound is not proof that the unit is outside every radius. Unavailable, malformed, restricted or failed observations return nil with a reason."] = "讀取某個單位的公開 LibRangeCheck 距離區間。成功的上限是包含的；正的失敗下限是嚴格的。零下限是合成的。兩個邊界都不是精確距離，缺少上限也不能證明該單位在所有半徑之外。無法使用、格式錯誤、受限或失敗的觀測會傳回 nil 及原因。"
-- en: "Readability authority for consumed values."
L["Readability authority for consumed values."] = "所使用值的可讀性判定依據。"
-- en: "Readable canonical item classification record (itemID, classID, subClassID and optional equipLoc), or nil when unavailable."
L["Readable canonical item classification record (itemID, classID, subClassID and optional equipLoc), or nil when unavailable."] = "可讀的正規物品分類記錄（itemID、classID、subClassID 與選用的 equipLoc），無法使用時為 nil。"
-- en: "Readable canonical itemID/classID/subClassID record when the item is a glyph for the requested class; nil for invalid or unavailable metadata."
L["Readable canonical itemID/classID/subClassID record when the item is a glyph for the requested class; nil for invalid or unavailable metadata."] = "當物品是所請求職業的雕紋時，傳回可讀的標準 itemID/classID/subClassID 記錄；中繼資料無效或無法使用時為 nil。"
-- en: "Readable charge record, or nil when unavailable."
L["Readable charge record, or nil when unavailable."] = "可讀的充能記錄；無法使用時為 nil。"
-- en: "Readable consumed metadata string, false for a known absent unit, or nil when required data is unavailable."
L["Readable consumed metadata string, false for a known absent unit, or nil when required data is unavailable."] = "可讀的所使用中繼資料字串；已知單位不存在時為 false，所需資料無法使用時為 nil。"
-- en: "Readable cooldown record, or nil when unavailable."
L["Readable cooldown record, or nil when unavailable."] = "可讀的冷卻記錄；無法使用時為 nil。"
-- en: "Readable current state, or nil when unavailable."
L["Readable current state, or nil when unavailable."] = "可讀的目前狀態；無法使用時為 nil。"
-- en: "Readable finite current-form observation, including zero for the current unshifted comparison; nil when unavailable."
L["Readable finite current-form observation, including zero for the current unshifted comparison; nil when unavailable."] = "可讀的有限目前形態觀測，包括與目前未變形狀態比較時的零；無法使用時為 nil。"
-- en: "Readable finite positive integral rune type, or nil when unavailable."
L["Readable finite positive integral rune type, or nil when unavailable."] = "可讀的有限正整數符文類型；無法使用時為 nil。"
-- en: "Readable interval with optional minimum and maximum bounds in yards. At least one bound is present; nil when unavailable."
L["Readable interval with optional minimum and maximum bounds in yards. At least one bound is present; nil when unavailable."] = "可讀的區間，帶有選擇性的最小與最大邊界（碼）。至少存在一個邊界；無法使用時為 nil。"
-- en: "Readable nonempty selected unit token, passed unchanged as the single argument to existence and creature metadata queries."
L["Readable nonempty selected unit token, passed unchanged as the single argument to existence and creature metadata queries."] = "可讀的非空所選單位代碼，作為單一參數原樣傳給存在性與生物中繼資料查詢。"
-- en: "Readable nonempty unit token or native-recognized name, passed unchanged."
L["Readable nonempty unit token or native-recognized name, passed unchanged."] = "可讀的非空單位代碼或原生可辨識的名稱，原樣傳遞。"
-- en: "Readable nonempty unit token to match, unchanged in the native observation."
L["Readable nonempty unit token to match, unchanged in the native observation."] = "要比對的可讀非空單位代碼，在原生觀測中保持不變。"
-- en: "Readable nonempty unit token, passed unchanged as the single native argument."
L["Readable nonempty unit token, passed unchanged as the single native argument."] = "可讀的非空單位代碼，作為單一原生參數原樣傳遞。"
-- en: "Readable record with Boolean exists and the requested class filename when present; nil when required data is unavailable."
L["Readable record with Boolean exists and the requested class filename when present; nil when required data is unavailable."] = "可讀記錄，包含布林值 exists，存在時還包含所請求的職業檔名；所需資料無法使用時為 nil。"
-- en: "Readable selected flag or nil when required data is unavailable."
L["Readable selected flag or nil when required data is unavailable."] = "可讀的所選標記；所需資料無法使用時為 nil。"
-- en: "Readable selected flag, false for a known absent unit, or nil when a required observation is unavailable."
L["Readable selected flag, false for a known absent unit, or nil when a required observation is unavailable."] = "可讀的所選標記；已知單位不存在時為 false，所需觀測無法使用時為 nil。"
-- en: "Readable unit equality, false for a known absent first unit, or nil when required observations are unavailable."
L["Readable unit equality, false for a known absent first unit, or nil when required observations are unavailable."] = "可讀的單位相等結果；已知第一個單位不存在時為 false，所需觀測無法使用時為 nil。"
-- en: "Record with exists=false, or exists=true and finite value; nil when unavailable."
L["Record with exists=false, or exists=true and finite value; nil when unavailable."] = "記錄為 exists=false，或 exists=true 並帶有有限的 value；無法使用時為 nil。"
-- en: "Record with exists=false; recorded=false for known no history; or runner, ratio, or immune with hits/hitsReason. Nil means a required observation is unavailable."
L["Record with exists=false; recorded=false for known no history; or runner, ratio, or immune with hits/hitsReason. Nil means a required observation is unavailable."] = "記錄為 exists=false；已知沒有歷史時為 recorded=false；或者為 runner、ratio 或 immune，並帶有 hits/hitsReason。nil 表示所需觀測無法使用。"
-- en: "Record with inInstance and, when inside, instanceType or instanceTypeReason; nil when membership is unavailable."
L["Record with inInstance and, when inside, instanceType or instanceTypeReason; nil when membership is unavailable."] = "記錄包含 inInstance，在副本內時還包含 instanceType 或 instanceTypeReason；成員值無法使用時為 nil。"
-- en: "Reference input kind, such as Spec_EditBox, used for spell suggestions."
L["Reference input kind, such as Spec_EditBox, used for spell suggestions."] = "用於法術建議的參照輸入種類，例如 Spec_EditBox。"
-- en: "Remove entries in place, preserving only keys listed among except values by default. With invert true, remove listed keys and retain unlisted keys. Without an exception list, the default removes every entry and invert true retains every entry. Nil input does nothing."
L["Remove entries in place, preserving only keys listed among except values by default. With invert true, remove listed keys and retain unlisted keys. Without an exception list, the default removes every entry and invert true retains every entry. Nil input does nothing."] = "原地移除項目，預設只保留 except 值中列出的鍵。invert 為 true 時，移除列出的鍵並保留未列出的鍵。沒有例外清單時，預設會移除所有項目，而 invert 為 true 時會保留所有項目。輸入為 nil 時不執行任何操作。"
-- en: "Remove leading and trailing Lua-pattern whitespace from a string."
L["Remove leading and trailing Lua-pattern whitespace from a string."] = "移除字串開頭與結尾符合 Lua 模式的空白字元。"
-- en: "Resolve a readable raw unit level for condition evaluation. Known absence returns false; unavailable observations return nil with a reason. Cache observations within the supplied evaluation pass. Only valid player levels are retained between passes until a skill, profile or level refresh."
L["Resolve a readable raw unit level for condition evaluation. Known absence returns false; unavailable observations return nil with a reason. Cache observations within the supplied evaluation pass. Only valid player levels are retained between passes until a skill, profile or level refresh."] = "為條件評估解析可讀的原始單位等級。已知不存在時傳回 false；觀測無法使用時傳回 nil 及原因。在所提供的評估輪次內快取觀測。只有有效的玩家等級會在輪次之間保留，直到技能、設定檔或等級更新。"
-- en: "Resolve an exact cast-recipient name against the current bounded party or raid roster, then observe membership through a unit token. Missing, ambiguous or changing roster data remains unavailable; never reads the selected target or retains state across casts."
L["Resolve an exact cast-recipient name against the current bounded party or raid roster, then observe membership through a unit token. Missing, ambiguous or changing roster data remains unavailable; never reads the selected target or retains state across casts."] = "將確切的施法對象名稱與目前有限的隊伍或團隊名單進行比對，然後透過單位代碼觀測其成員身分。名單資料缺少、含義不明確或正在變化時維持為無法使用；絕不讀取所選目標，也不在施法之間保留狀態。"
-- en: "Resolve point resources using the original live class mapping and identity cache, with an explicit TBC player ComboPoints-fallback transport policy. A player fallback matching the readable raw Enum.PowerType table and ComboPoints value captured at module load selects target-combo; explicit class-map entries, other actors and other families retain power. Replaced, inherited or unprovable fallback provenance retains power. This versioned policy does not claim native UnitPower is broken or equivalent. Known unit absence returns false; unavailable required observations return nil with a reason. No current or maximum quantity is queried here."
L["Resolve point resources using the original live class mapping and identity cache, with an explicit TBC player ComboPoints-fallback transport policy. A player fallback matching the readable raw Enum.PowerType table and ComboPoints value captured at module load selects target-combo; explicit class-map entries, other actors and other families retain power. Replaced, inherited or unprovable fallback provenance retains power. This versioned policy does not claim native UnitPower is broken or equivalent. Known unit absence returns false; unavailable required observations return nil with a reason. No current or maximum quantity is queried here."] = "使用原有的即時職業對應與身分快取解析點數資源，並採用明確的 TBC 玩家 ComboPoints 備用傳輸政策。若玩家備用與模組載入時擷取的可讀原始 Enum.PowerType 表格與 ComboPoints 值相符，則選擇 target-combo；明確的職業對應項目、其他角色與其他用戶端系列保留 power。被取代、繼承或無法證明來源的備用保留 power。此帶版本的政策並不聲稱原生 UnitPower 有問題或與之等效。已知單位不存在時傳回 false；所需觀測無法使用時傳回 nil 及原因。此處不查詢目前值或最大值。"
-- en: "Resolve the selected unit point-resource selector using the live class-to-resource map and ComboPoints fallback. Known absence returns false; unavailable required identity or selector data returns nil with a reason. Share complete identity observations within the evaluation pass. Only successful player class observations persist in the current longterm cache, tied to the native UnitClass identity; existence is refreshed each pass. This selects a resource without reading its current or maximum quantity."
L["Resolve the selected unit point-resource selector using the live class-to-resource map and ComboPoints fallback. Known absence returns false; unavailable required identity or selector data returns nil with a reason. Share complete identity observations within the evaluation pass. Only successful player class observations persist in the current longterm cache, tied to the native UnitClass identity; existence is refreshed each pass. This selects a resource without reading its current or maximum quantity."] = "使用即時的職業到資源對應與 ComboPoints 備用，解析所選單位的點數資源選擇器。已知不存在時傳回 false；所需的身分或選擇器資料無法使用時傳回 nil 及原因。在評估輪次內共用完整的身分觀測。只有成功的玩家職業觀測會保留在目前的長期快取中，並與原生 UnitClass 身分綁定；存在性在每個輪次都會更新。這只選擇資源，不讀取其目前值或最大值。"
-- en: "Resolve the spell identifier stored by a condition. With exact rank enabled the supplied ID is retained; otherwise ranked Classic clients resolve the currently known rank through the spell catalog. Returns nil and an availability reason if resolution cannot be completed."
L["Resolve the spell identifier stored by a condition. With exact rank enabled the supplied ID is retained; otherwise ranked Classic clients resolve the currently known rank through the spell catalog. Returns nil and an availability reason if resolution cannot be completed."] = "解析條件中儲存的法術識別碼。啟用精確等級時會保留所提供的 ID；否則在有等級的經典版用戶端上，會透過法術目錄解析目前已知的等級。無法完成解析時傳回 nil 與可用性原因。"
