L["Return a present value unchanged, or a red display placeholder for nil. Use for readable condition labels, not as a boolean fallback."] = "原樣傳回存在的值；為 nil 時傳回紅色的顯示預留位置。用於可讀的條件標籤，而不是作為布林值的備用。"
