L["Run the historical health-snapshot trend formula using the live profile history window, clock and legacy rounding service. Preserve its maximum-health transitions, early stop at full or zero health, weighting, errors and return counts. An empty array, or snapshots that record no weighted change, return only zero rather than a 0/0 result; this is the legacy algorithm rather than a validated forecast."] = "使用即時設定檔的歷史時間區間、時鐘與舊版捨入服務，執行歷史生命力快照的趨勢公式。保留其最大生命力的過渡、在滿血或零血時提前停止、加權、錯誤與傳回值數量。空陣列或未記錄任何加權變化的快照只傳回零，而不是 0/0 的結果；這是舊版演算法，而不是經過驗證的預測。"
