-- en: "Value compared with each table value using Lua equality."
L["Value compared with each table value using Lua equality."] = "使用 Lua 相等比較與表格中每個值進行比較的值。"
-- en: "Value passed to the original arithmetic formula."
L["Value passed to the original arithmetic formula."] = "傳給原始算術公式的值。"
-- en: "Value record field to edit; defaults to unit."
L["Value record field to edit; defaults to unit."] = "要編輯的值記錄欄位；預設為 unit。"
-- en: "Value returned for every other unit."
L["Value returned for every other unit."] = "對其他所有單位傳回的值。"
-- en: "Value returned when unit is player."
L["Value returned when unit is player."] = "單位為 player 時傳回的值。"
-- en: "Value to display; false is preserved."
L["Value to display; false is preserved."] = "要顯示的值；false 會被保留。"
-- en: "Visit entries in both tables and compare each value with the indexed value in the other table using Lua equality. Normal indexing and equality metamethods apply; nested contents are not compared recursively."
L["Visit entries in both tables and compare each value with the indexed value in the other table using Lua equality. Normal indexing and equality metamethods apply; nested contents are not compared recursively."] = "走訪兩個表格中的項目，並使用 Lua 相等比較將每個值與另一個表格中相應索引的值進行比較。一般的索引與相等中繼方法都會生效；巢狀內容不會被遞迴比較。"
-- en: "Weighted health-snapshot change from the original total/count formula; zero for falsy input or when no weighted change was recorded."
L["Weighted health-snapshot change from the original total/count formula; zero for falsy input or when no weighted change was recorded."] = "依原始的總和/計數公式計算的生命力快照加權變化；輸入為假值或未記錄任何加權變化時為零。"
-- en: "Weighting window in seconds; nil or false uses the current profile damage_history setting."
L["Weighting window in seconds; nil or false uses the current profile damage_history setting."] = "加權時間區間，單位為秒；為 nil 或 false 時使用目前設定檔的 damage_history 設定。"
-- en: "Whether the original floor-equality or exact numeric-spelling predicate matches."
L["Whether the original floor-equality or exact numeric-spelling predicate matches."] = "原有的無條件捨去相等或精確數字拼寫判斷是否相符。"
-- en: "Whether the text begins with the exact prefix."
L["Whether the text begins with the exact prefix."] = "文字是否以該確切前綴開頭。"
-- en: "Whether the text ends with the exact suffix."
L["Whether the text ends with the exact suffix."] = "文字是否以該確切後綴結尾。"
-- en: "With restricted-value only: isActive, true while a cooldown (its own or the global one) is running."
L["With restricted-value only: isActive, true while a cooldown (its own or the global one) is running."] = "僅限 restricted-value：isActive，在冷卻（其自身冷卻或共用冷卻）進行中時為 true。"
-- en: "With restricted-value only: isEnabled, false while the cooldown is on hold."
L["With restricted-value only: isEnabled, false while the cooldown is on hold."] = "僅限 restricted-value：isEnabled，冷卻處於暫停時為 false。"
-- en: "With restricted-value only: isOnGCD, true when the running cooldown is the global cooldown; may be nil."
L["With restricted-value only: isOnGCD, true when the running cooldown is the global cooldown; may be nil."] = "僅限 restricted-value：isOnGCD，當進行中的冷卻是共用冷卻時為 true；可能為 nil。"
-- en: "Work-limit, data or arithmetic availability reason for nil rate/age."
L["Work-limit, data or arithmetic availability reason for nil rate/age."] = "速率/時長為 nil 時的工作量上限、資料或運算可用性原因。"
-- en: "Wrap text at whitespace boundaries near a target column count. Long words are retained intact."
L["Wrap text at whitespace boundaries near a target column count. Long words are retained intact."] = "在接近目標欄數的空白邊界處對文字換行。長單字會保持完整。"
-- en: "mana selects the explicit live Mana enum; current reads and forwards the actual UnitPowerType identity, including Mana zero."
L["mana selects the explicit live Mana enum; current reads and forwards the actual UnitPowerType identity, including Mana zero."] = "mana 選擇明確的即時 Mana 列舉；current 讀取並轉送實際的 UnitPowerType 身分，包括值為零的 Mana。"
-- en: "noheals selects damage only; nodmg selects healing only; other readable values select both."
L["noheals selects damage only; nodmg selects healing only; other readable values select both."] = "noheals 只選擇傷害；nodmg 只選擇治療；其他可讀的值會同時選擇兩者。"
